#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01_DESCRIPTION_BEGINNING01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01_DESCRIPTION_BEGINNING01"
msgid "Welcome, hunters!"
msgstr "Vítejte, myslivci!"

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01_DESCRIPTION_BEGINNING02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01_DESCRIPTION_BEGINNING02"
msgid ""
"Every year, Hearth & Hunt celebrates the best hunting community in the "
"world."
msgstr ""
"Hearth & Hunt každoročně oslavuje nejlepší loveckou komunitu na světě."

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01_DESCRIPTION_BEGINNING03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01_DESCRIPTION_BEGINNING03"
msgid ""
"We're proud of your dedication to leave lasting positive impact anywhere you"
" go."
msgstr ""
"Jsme hrdí na vaši snahu zanechat po sobě všude, kam přijdete, trvalý "
"pozitivní vliv."

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01_DESCRIPTION_BEGINNING04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01_DESCRIPTION_BEGINNING04"
msgid "But for now, we just want you to enjoy yourself. You deserve it!"
msgstr "Teď si ale hlavně užijte oslavu. Zasloužíte si ji!"

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01_DESCRIPTION_BEGINNING05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01_DESCRIPTION_BEGINNING05"
msgid ""
"Go pick any assignment that catches your eye, and see you in the field!"
msgstr "Vyberte si jakýkoli úkol, který vás zaujme, a uvidíme se v terénu!"

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01_DESCRIPTION_END01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01_DESCRIPTION_END01"
msgid "And that's it for this year's Hearth & Hunt celebration!"
msgstr "A to je pro letošní oslavu Hearth & Hunt vše!"

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01_DESCRIPTION_END02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01_DESCRIPTION_END02"
msgid ""
"You've proven yourself to be a capable bunch, as expected. We're proud to "
"have all of you with us!"
msgstr ""
"Dokázali jste, co všechno zvládnete. Jsme rádi, že jste součástí Hearth & "
"Hunt!"

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01_DESCRIPTION_END03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01_DESCRIPTION_END03"
msgid ""
"We're looking forward to hear more of your hunting stories in the coming "
"weeks."
msgstr "Těšíme se na další vaše lovecké příběhy v nadcházejících týdnech."

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01_DESCRIPTION_END04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01_DESCRIPTION_END04"
msgid "Enjoy your success, and see you next year!"
msgstr "Užijte si svůj úspěch a uvidíme se příští rok!"

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01_NAME"
msgid "Hearth & Hunt annual celebration!"
msgstr "Každoroční oslava Hearth & Hunt!"

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION01_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION01_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"At Hearth & Hunt, we look out for animals with lower fitness to harvest them"
" and improve local populations."
msgstr ""
"V Hearth & Hunt se obvykle zaměřujeme na zvěř s nižší genetickou kvalitou, "
"abychom zlepšovali místní populace."

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION01_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION01_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"But here, we'd like you to hunt for higher-fitness big game, the result of "
"your hard work."
msgstr ""
"Tentokrát však chceme, abyste lovili velkou zvěř s vysokou genetickou "
"kvalitou. Je výsledkem vaší dosavadní péče."

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION01_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION01_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid "Go get them, hunters!"
msgstr "Tak do toho, lovci!"

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION01_NAME"
msgid "The game is big"
msgstr "Teď jde o velkou zvěř"

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION02_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION02_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"Hunting used to be a way to survive. Now, it's a recreational activity."
msgstr "Lov býval otázkou přežití. Dnes je pro mnohé koníčkem."

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION02_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION02_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid "But for Hearth & Hunt members, it's still the way to live."
msgstr "Pro členy Hearth & Hunt je však stále způsobem života."

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION02_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION02_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"Predators are similar. They have no other way to live but to hunt. So who "
"will prevail?"
msgstr "Šelmy loví také proto, aby přežily. Kdo tedy bude úspěšnější?"

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION02_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION02_NAME"
msgid "Hunter of hunters"
msgstr "Lovec lovců"

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION03_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION03_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid "Small game doesn't mean little trouble."
msgstr "Drobná zvěř neznamená snadný lov."

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION03_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION03_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid "Some of the smallest animals are also some of the most elusive."
msgstr "Některá drobná zvířata patří k nejobtížněji pozorovatelným."

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION03_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION03_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"So hunting them is never a sure thing. You'll have to be as patient and as "
"precise as with any other game."
msgstr ""
"Jejich lov není nikdy jistý. Potřebujete stejnou trpělivost a přesnost jako "
"při lovu jakékoli jiné zvěře."

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION03_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION03_NAME"
msgid "Cute and fast"
msgstr "Roztomilé a rychlé"

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION04_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION04_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"Fowl-hunting is special. For many, it's the favorite type of group hunt."
msgstr ""
"Lov pernaté zvěře má své kouzlo. Pro mnohé je nejoblíbenější podobou "
"společného lovu."

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION04_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION04_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Many species have their own sets of rules. But something that unites them "
"all is the opportunity to use shotguns."
msgstr ""
"Pro každý druh platí jiná pravidla. Při lovu pernaté zvěře však často můžete"
" využít brokovnici."

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION04_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION04_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"There's a reason why so many in Hearth & Hunt have special affinity for "
"them!"
msgstr "Není divu, že k tomuto lovu má tolik členů Hearth & Hunt blízko!"

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION04_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION04_NAME"
msgid "Wing it"
msgstr "Na křídlech"

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION05_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION05_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"This is the most dangerous part of the Hearth & Hunt annual celebration."
msgstr "Tohle je nejnebezpečnější část výroční oslavy Hearth & Hunt."

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION05_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION05_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"In most cases, animals prefer to flee when they feel danger. But some will "
"not let you disturb their calm."
msgstr ""
"Zvěř při nebezpečí obvykle prchá. Některá zvířata se však vyrušit nenechají "
"a postaví se vám."

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION05_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION05_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid "So approach them carefully, or you'll become their prey."
msgstr "Přibližujte se opatrně, jinak se můžete stát jejich kořistí."

#. Key:	KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION05_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_EXPEDITION01MISSION05_NAME"
msgid "Hold the line"
msgstr "Ustát útok"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01CUSTOM_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01CUSTOM_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Let’s try out this brand new weapon and try to get some hares!"
msgstr "Vyzkoušejte novou zbraň při lovu zajíců!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01CUSTOM_MISSION01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01CUSTOM_MISSION01_NAME"
msgid "Precision on ears"
msgstr "Přesně na ušáky"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01CUSTOM_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01CUSTOM_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Harvest 3 Snowshoe hares shot with the Strasser RS 700-22 rifle."
msgstr "Ulovte a zpracujte tři zajíce měnivé kulovnicí Strasser RS 700-22."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01CUSTOM_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01CUSTOM_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Enjoy this custom-made reticle, created with the help of the Way of the "
"Hunter community! Why not try it out on local mule deer?"
msgstr ""
"Vyzkoušejte záměrnou osnovu vytvořenou ve spolupráci s komunitou Way of the "
"Hunter. Co ji otestovat při lovu zdejších jelenců ušatých?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01CUSTOM_MISSION02_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01CUSTOM_MISSION02_NAME"
msgid "Clear sight on the muley"
msgstr "Jelenec ušatý na mušce"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01CUSTOM_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01CUSTOM_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Harvest a Rocky Mountain mule deer."
msgstr "Ulovte a zpracujte jelence ušatého."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission01 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Wild turkeys are appearing on city streets. Help reduce and strengthen their"
" population so that they find a new home here in New Laurentia."
msgstr ""
"Divocí krocani se objevují i v ulicích měst. Pomozte snížit jejich počet a "
"současně zlepšit kvalitu místní populace, aby se jim v New Laurentia dařilo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for translators" : "Incorrect word \"waddle\"
#. changed to \"wattle\""
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission01 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION01_NAME"
msgid "Wattle bearers"
msgstr "Krocani ve městě"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION01_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission01 objective01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION01_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest 2 male Wild turkeys. Their Fitness must be "
"{maxFitness}|displayAs(percent) or lower."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte 2 samce krocana divokého. Jejich genetická kvalita musí "
"být nejvýše {maxFitness}|displayAs(percent)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION01_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission01 objective02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION01_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid ""
"Harvest 2 female Wild turkeys. Their Fitness must be "
"{maxFitness}|displayAs(percent) or lower."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte 2 samice krocana divokého. Jejich genetická kvalita musí "
"být nejvýše {maxFitness}|displayAs(percent)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION01_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for translators" : "Incorrect word \"waddle\"
#. changed to \"wattle\""
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission01 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION01_READABLE"
msgid ""
"For the past few years, folks have been seeing wild turkeys on city streets. And who can blame these wattle bearers for migrating? Nobody likes living as game on hunting grounds. Nobody likes getting their feet wet when the water level rises during spring. This is when turkeys are supposed to mate!\n"
"\n"
"There's just one problem. Where turkeys go, predators go. And nobody likes bumping into predators on city streets! This is why we have to transport hundreds of turkeys to hunting reserves. And if we don't want them to go back to the city, they need to feel at home on the reserve.\n"
"\n"
"Participate in a reduction culling program! Make the wild turkey population stronger, but keep their numbers in check so that there's enough space for every gobbler and hen. Believe me, people don't want turkeys mating on their lawns or roosting in the trees behind their houses.\n"
"\n"
"New Laurentia Wildlife Service"
msgstr ""
"V posledních letech se divocí krocani objevují i v ulicích měst. Kdo by se jim divil, že hledají nové místo? Na lovišti jim hrozí odstřel a při jarních záplavách jim voda zaplavuje stanoviště právě v době páření.\n"
"\n"
"Má to ale háček. Za krocany se do města mohou stáhnout i šelmy a ty na ulici potkat nechcete. Stovky krocanů proto musíme přemístit do loveckých rezervací. Aby se nevraceli, musí tam mít vhodné podmínky.\n"
"\n"
"Zapojte se do redukčního lovu. Zlepšujte kvalitu populace krocana divokého, ale držte její početnost pod kontrolou, aby měly prostor krůty i krocani. Nikdo nechce, aby se pářili na zahradě nebo nocovali na stromech za domem.\n"
"\n"
"New Laurentia Wildlife Service"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION02_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission02 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION02_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Snowshoe hares are yet to bounce back to the numbers normal for their "
"population cycle. Harvest healthy individuals to prove the cycle has "
"recovered."
msgstr ""
"Populace zajíců měnivých se ještě nevrátila k obvyklému stavu. Ulovte zdravé"
" jedince, abyste doložili, že se její přirozený cyklus obnovuje."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION02_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission02 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION02_NAME"
msgid "Cycle of life"
msgstr "Koloběh života"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION02_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission02 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION02_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest 3 Snowshoe hares. Each animal must weigh {minMass}|displayAs(mass) "
"or more."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte 3 zajíce měnivé. Každý musí vážit alespoň "
"{minMass}|displayAs(mass)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION02_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission02 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION02_READABLE"
msgid ""
"Life is full of cycles. There's a cycle for animal species as well.\n"
"\n"
"It takes snowshoe hare populations 7 to 11 years to grow, decline, then recover. Hunters here in New Laurentia have observed and noted this cycle over the years. But this particular recovery is taking too long.\n"
"\n"
"I don't want to get into speculation over whether this is because there's too little snow in winter when hares change the color of their fur, or if something else is going on. I just want it to get back to normal. Improve their populations and show that they're recovering.\n"
"\n"
"New Laurentia Trappers Association"
msgstr ""
"Život se odehrává v cyklech. Platí to i pro početnost zvěře.\n"
"\n"
"Populace zajíce měnivého během sedmi až jedenácti let vzroste, klesne a znovu se obnoví. Lovci v New Laurentia tento cyklus sledují už dlouho, ale současný návrat zajíců trvá nezvykle dlouho.\n"
"\n"
"Nechci spekulovat, jestli za to může nedostatek zimního sněhu v době, kdy zajíci mění barvu srsti, nebo něco jiného. Chci jen, aby se jejich početnost vrátila k obvyklému stavu. Pomozte zlepšit stav populace a doložte, že se zotavuje.\n"
"\n"
"New Laurentia Trappers Association"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION03_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission03 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION03_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"The Mule deer and the White-tail deer. One species has a white tail "
"underside, the other has it white on top. See the difference for yourself."
msgstr ""
"Jelenec ušatý a jelenec běloocasý: jeden má bílou svrchní stranu ocasu, "
"druhý spodní. Poznáte rozdíl?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION03_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission03 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION03_NAME"
msgid "Which one has a white butt?"
msgstr "Který z nich má bílý zadek?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION03_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission03 objective01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION03_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest a Mule deer. Its Trophy rating must be "
"{minStar}|displayAs(ratingStars)."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte jelence ušatého. Hodnocení jeho trofeje musí být "
"{minStar}|displayAs(ratingStars)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION03_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission03 objective02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION03_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid ""
"Harvest a White-tailed deer. Its Trophy rating must be "
"{minStar}|displayAs(ratingStars)."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte jelence běloocasého. Hodnocení jeho trofeje musí být "
"{minStar}|displayAs(ratingStars)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION03_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission03 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION03_READABLE"
msgid ""
"Muleys and white-tails.\n"
"\n"
"One has bifurcated antlers—they continuously fork in two directions as they grow. The other's face is mostly brown. One has large ears. The other has a white belly. And most importantly, one of them has a white butt.\n"
"\n"
"You may be stalking an animal, not sure which species it is unless you have a fancy gadget on you. So harvest the best specimens, study them, and you'll learn the difference.\n"
"\n"
"Jackie's Owner"
msgstr ""
"Jelenec ušatý a jelenec běloocasý.\n"
"\n"
"Jednomu se paroží při růstu pravidelně větví do dvou směrů, druhý má převážně hnědý obličej. Jeden má velké uši, druhý bílé břicho. A hlavně: jeden má nápadně bílý zadek.\n"
"\n"
"Když se ke zvěři šouláte bez pomoci moderní techniky, nemusíte druh hned poznat. Ulovte kvalitní jedince, prohlédněte si je a rozdíly si zapamatujte.\n"
"\n"
"Majitelka podniku Jackie's"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION04_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission04 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION04_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Prove that hunters can harvest waterfowls without companions in New "
"Laurentia."
msgstr ""
"Dokažte, že v New Laurentia dokážete ulovit vodní ptactvo i bez pomoci "
"loveckého psa."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION04_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission04 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION04_NAME"
msgid "Hunting solo"
msgstr "Lov bez psa"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION04_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission04 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION04_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest 5 Mallards without using your Dog companion. Each bird must weigh "
"{minMass}|displayAs(mass) or more."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte 5 kachen divokých bez pomoci psa. Každá musí vážit "
"alespoň {minMass}|displayAs(mass)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION04_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission04 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION04_READABLE"
msgid ""
"Hunters exaggerate. Not only about the size of their harvests, but also about what is essential for each hunt. Sure, hunting without a weapon would be tricky. But you can hunt waterfowls without a dog.\n"
"\n"
"New Laurentia isn't as challenging as some other territories. There are no fast-moving rivers, no overly strong winds, and barely any hazardous sticks and logs. You can almost always retrieve the harvest yourself, you don't even need a boat.\n"
"\n"
"There's nothing wrong with bringing a companion along, but they need an occasional break, too. Give them a well-earned rest and score a harvest that makes you proud with no need to exaggerate.\n"
"\n"
"Foxhound HTSF Unit"
msgstr ""
"Lovci rádi přehánějí. Nejen velikost úlovku, ale i to, bez čeho se prý při lovu neobejdou. Bez zbraně by to bylo obtížné. Vodní ptactvo však lze lovit i bez psa.\n"
"\n"
"New Laurentia není tak náročná jako jiná území. Nemá prudké řeky ani mimořádně silný vítr a ve vodě je málo nebezpečných větví a kmenů. Uloveného ptáka si obvykle můžete vyzvednout sami, často i bez člunu.\n"
"\n"
"Na loveckém psovi není nic špatného, ale i on si zaslouží občas odpočinout. Nechte ho tentokrát doma a přineste úlovek, na který budete pyšní i bez přikrášlování.\n"
"\n"
"Foxhound HTSF Unit"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION05_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission05 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION05_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Wolverines are so elusive that even spotting one is a challenge. Bring a "
"tripod, then harvest one animal."
msgstr ""
"Rosomáka je obtížné byť jen spatřit. Vezměte si trojnožkový posed a pokuste "
"se jednoho ulovit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION05_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission05 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION05_NAME"
msgid "Superhero of the wilderness"
msgstr "Superhrdina z divočiny"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION05_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission05 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION05_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Harvest a Wolverine using a tripod stand."
msgstr "Ulovte a zpracujte rosomáka z trojnožkového posedu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION05_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission05 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION05_READABLE"
msgid ""
"Wolverines are a rare sight. They're so elusive that even out here, far from civilization, you can't observe them easily. So what do you do? Well, elevation helps! When you're looking down from above, they're less likely to notice you, and more likely to mind their own, often ferocious, business.\n"
"\n"
"I'm not going to pretend you'll see one fighting off a bear or a wolf. But to me, wolverines are still superheroes. Wandering around independently, standing up for themselves and others, and clearing up the leftovers that other predators leave behind. I'm sure you'll learn to love them too, once you've seen more of them in their element.\n"
"\n"
"Wolverine Fan Club"
msgstr ""
"Rosomáka spatříte jen zřídka. Je plachý a těžko se pozoruje i daleko od civilizace. Co s tím? Pomůže vyvýšené stanoviště. Při pohledu shora vás spíš přehlédne a bude se dál věnovat svým, často divokým záležitostem.\n"
"\n"
"Nebudu vám tvrdit, že ho uvidíte zahnat medvěda nebo vlka. Pro mě je ale rosomák hrdinou divočiny: putuje krajinou sám, umí se bránit a zužitkuje zbytky kořisti jiných šelem. Až ho uvidíte v jeho prostředí, možná si ho oblíbíte také.\n"
"\n"
"Wolverine Fan Club"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION06_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission06 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION06_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Find a luring scent suitable for predators and use it when hunting for a "
"Grizzly bear."
msgstr ""
"Pořiďte si pachové lákadlo vhodné pro šelmy a použijte je při lovu medvěda "
"grizzlyho."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION06_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission06 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION06_NAME"
msgid "Lure in"
msgstr "Přilákat medvěda"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION06_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission06 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION06_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Harvest a male Grizzly bear using a luring scent."
msgstr "Ulovte a zpracujte samce medvěda grizzly pomocí pachového lákadla."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION06_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission06 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION06_READABLE"
msgid ""
"It may be hard to believe, but grizzly bears used to be endangered. As North America evolved over the 20th century, they somehow adapted and are now in a better shape, even though the road to full recovery is still going to take long.\n"
"\n"
"Bears never become complacent, and hunting one is always a challenge. We're glad there's a decent approved lure that won't turn this challenge into child's play. Might as well try it out, huh?\n"
"\n"
"Grizzly Hunting Society"
msgstr ""
"Možná vás překvapí, že populace grizzlyho bývaly ohrožené. Během změn, kterými Severní Amerika ve 20. století prošla, se medvědi dokázali přizpůsobit. Dnes se jim vede lépe, i když k úplnému zotavení mají stále daleko.\n"
"\n"
"Grizzly nikdy nepřestane být ostražitý a jeho lov je vždy náročný. Máme proto radost, že existuje schválené pachové lákadlo, které výzvu usnadní, ale nezmění ji v dětskou hru. Co ho vyzkoušet?\n"
"\n"
"Grizzly Hunting Society"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION07_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission07 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION07_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Wild boars have become way too dangerous in the areas around New Laurentia. "
"Help gather data so new measures can be taken."
msgstr ""
"Prasata divoká v okolí New Laurentia začínají být nebezpečná. Pomozte o nich"
" shromáždit údaje, aby bylo možné přijmout vhodná opatření."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION07_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission07 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION07_NAME"
msgid "Super pigs"
msgstr "Superprasata"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION07_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission07 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION07_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Call a Wild boar with its Fitness at {minFitness}|displayAs(percent) or "
"more. Make sure it reacts and wait until it is "
"{maxCallDistance}|displayAs(distance) away from you or closer."
msgstr ""
"Pomocí vábničky přilákejte prase divoké s genetickou kvalitou alespoň "
"{minFitness}|displayAs(percent). Ujistěte se, že zareagovalo, a počkejte, až"
" se přiblíží na {maxCallDistance}|displayAs(distance) nebo méně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION07_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission07 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION07_READABLE"
msgid ""
"When local landowners introduced wild boars to the area, they kept telling us the population wouldn't grow. They wouldn't survive the winter, they said. But hogs adapt. Hogs evolve. Hogs tunnel deep into the half-frozen ground with their tusks and get through the winter.\n"
"\n"
"New Laurentia has thus far escaped the menace known as the \"super pig\", crossbreeds of wild and domesticated hogs that prove just how close they are to humans. These intelligent, elusive, murderous brutes decimate turkey nests, murder young fawns, raid farms, devastate crops and contaminate streams. And, of course, they've been known to attack humans.\n"
"\n"
"If we don't keep the hogs in check, they'll spread beyond the hunting reserves and move into populated areas too. They're a ticking timebomb that might eventually produce a new influenza transmissible to the average Joe. Before that happens, we need to gather more data. Then we can introduce effective population control.\n"
"\n"
"HOG Society"
msgstr ""
"Když místní vlastníci pozemků vysadili v oblasti divoká prasata, tvrdili, že se nerozmnoží. Prý nepřežijí zimu. Jenže černá zvěř se umí přizpůsobit. Rypákem a kly se dostane i do částečně zmrzlé půdy a zimu přečká.\n"
"\n"
"New Laurentia zatím unikla takzvaným „superprasatům“, křížencům prasat divokých a domácích. Tato chytrá a těžko polapitelná zvířata ničí hnízda krocanů, zabíjejí mláďata jelenovitých, vnikají na farmy, poškozují úrodu a znečišťují vodní toky. Mohou napadnout i člověka.\n"
"\n"
"Pokud jejich početnost neudržíme pod kontrolou, rozšíří se z loveckých rezervací do obydlených oblastí. Mohou také přispět ke vzniku nové chřipky přenosné na lidi. Nejdřív musíme získat více údajů; teprve potom lze zavést účinná opatření.\n"
"\n"
"HOG Society"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION08_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission08 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION08_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Ptarmigan populations are in the healthiest state they've been in years. "
"Help monitor their progress by gathering an average female and male "
"specimen."
msgstr ""
"Populacím bělokura se daří nejlépe za mnoho let. Pomozte ověřit jejich stav "
"ulovením samce a samice s požadovanou genetickou kvalitou."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION08_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission08 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION08_NAME"
msgid "Quail country"
msgstr "Kraj bělokurů"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION08_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission08 objective01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION08_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest a female White-tailed ptarmigan with its Fitness at "
"{minFitness}|displayAs(percent) or higher."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte samici bělokura běloocasého s genetickou kvalitou alespoň"
" {minFitness}|displayAs(percent)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION08_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission08 objective02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION08_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid ""
"Harvest a male White-tailed ptarmigan with its Fitness at "
"{minFitness}|displayAs(percent) or higher."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte samce bělokura běloocasého s genetickou kvalitou alespoň "
"{minFitness}|displayAs(percent)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION08_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission08 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION08_READABLE"
msgid ""
"Just for a change, I have some promising news for you.\n"
"\n"
"Ptarmigan populations have been holding strong, and even rebounding. New Laurentia is no exception, thanks to the recent habitat enhancements and other conservation practices. There's the occasional case of tourists shooting grouse without a permit—they're fined, of course. Other than that, quail country is in the best state it's been since records began.\n"
"\n"
"To confirm that things are going fine this season as well, we're asking you to gather a single average specimen of each sex.\n"
"\n"
"Quail Watchdogs"
msgstr ""
"Pro změnu pro vás mám dobrou zprávu.\n"
"\n"
"Populace bělokurů jsou stabilní a místy znovu rostou. New Laurentia není výjimkou, také díky péči o jejich stanoviště a dalším ochranářským opatřením. Občas sice nějaký turista zastřelí kuraka bez povolení a dostane pokutu, jinak se jim ale daří nejlépe od začátku sledování.\n"
"\n"
"Abychom potvrdili, že příznivý vývoj pokračuje i letos, potřebujeme po jednom běžném jedinci od každého pohlaví.\n"
"\n"
"Quail Watchdogs"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION09_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission09 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION09_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Now that enough time has passed since the implementation of measures to "
"strengthen the local population following the bovine tuberculosis outbreak, "
"you can harvest elk that have grown into amazing trophies."
msgstr ""
"Od zavedení opatření na obnovu místní populace po výskytu bovinní "
"tuberkulózy už uplynulo dost času. Wapiti mezitím dospěli v jedince s "
"cennými trofejemi, které nyní můžete ulovit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION09_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission09 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION09_NAME"
msgid "Fifteen stars"
msgstr "Patnáct hvězd"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION09_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission09 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION09_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest 3 Elk with their Trophy ratings at {minStar}|displayAs(ratingStars)."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte 3 wapiti. Hodnocení trofeje každého z nich musí být "
"{minStar}|displayAs(ratingStars)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION09_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission09 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION09_READABLE"
msgid ""
"Last year, we faced a serious dilemma—a series of reports of bovine tuberculosis cases among the local elk population. Worst of all, the reports came in spring, when a lot of cows were months pregnant, and harvesting pregnant cows is taboo in First Nations culture. It was a tricky one, requiring extensive and complex negotiations, but we managed to come to a satisfactory agreement.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks to our efforts, this year you should have an easier time harvesting top-notch elk trophies. Let's see how well you can do!\n"
"\n"
"New Laurentia Wildlife Service"
msgstr ""
"Loni jsme řešili vážné dilema: v místní populaci wapiti se objevila bovinní tuberkulóza. Zprávy přišly na jaře, kdy už byla řada laní několik měsíců březí. Lov březích laní je přitom v kultuře původních obyvatel tabu. Po dlouhém vyjednávání se nám podařilo najít přijatelné řešení.\n"
"\n"
"Díky společnému úsilí byste letos měli mít lepší příležitost k lovu trofejových wapiti. Ukažte, co dovedete!\n"
"\n"
"New Laurentia Wildlife Service"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION10_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission10 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION10_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Help local researchers check up on how the famous New Laurentia bison herds "
"are doing."
msgstr ""
"Pomozte místním výzkumníkům zjistit, jak se daří známým stádům bizonů v New "
"Laurentia."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION10_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission10 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION10_NAME"
msgid "Bison bank"
msgstr "Genová banka bizonů"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION10_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission10 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION10_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest a male Bison with its Fitness at {minFitness}|displayAs(percent) or "
"higher."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte samce bizona s genetickou kvalitou alespoň "
"{minFitness}|displayAs(percent)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION10_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission10 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION10_READABLE"
msgid ""
"The pride of New Laurentia—our wood bison herds! They live in their native range and they've been disease-free for years straight. This is all thanks to our ongoing management, as well as collaborating with the local university researchers who are building a bison genome bank to deepen population gene pools.\n"
"\n"
"We regularly commission bison harvests to check on their progress, while also making sure there are no signs of brucellosis or tuberculosis in the population. And let me tell you, for a hunter, the bonus is always well worth the effort!\n"
"\n"
"New Laurentia Wildlife Service"
msgstr ""
"Pýchou New Laurentia jsou naše stáda bizonů lesních! Žijí ve svém původním areálu a už řadu let se u nich nevyskytla žádná nemoc. Je to výsledek soustavné péče o jejich populaci i spolupráce s místní univerzitou. Výzkumníci vytvářejí genovou banku bizonů, která pomůže rozšířit genetickou rozmanitost populace.\n"
"\n"
"Pravidelně zadáváme odstřel vybraných bizonů, abychom mohli sledovat zdravotní stav stád a ověřit, že se v populaci neobjevila brucelóza ani tuberkulóza. Pro lovce za to máme zajímavou odměnu!\n"
"\n"
"New Laurentia Wildlife Service"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION11_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission11 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION11_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"A local taxidermist is running a promo campaign for its popular diorama "
"featuring a grizzly bear and a wood bison. Order one and get some money "
"back."
msgstr ""
"Místní preparátor nabízí akci na dioráma s medvědem grizzlym a bizonem "
"lesním. Objednejte si je a část ceny dostanete zpět."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION11_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission11 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION11_NAME"
msgid "Iconic pairing"
msgstr "Slavná dvojice"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION11_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission11 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION11_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Create a taxidermy diorama with a Grizzly bear and a Wood Bison."
msgstr "Vytvořte preparátorské dioráma s medvědem grizzlym a bizonem lesním."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION11_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission11 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION11_READABLE"
msgid ""
"Are you short on money? Is it keeping you from treating yourself to a nice taxidermy piece? No worries! We're running a special campaign right now. Order our iconic taxidermy diorama with a grizzly bear and a wood bison and receive a cash prize to spend on your next taxidermy!\n"
"\n"
"Technically, we aren't stopping you from spending the money on something else... But as long as it keeps circulating in our hard-pressed local economy, it's all good!\n"
"\n"
"Christine's Taxidermies"
msgstr ""
"Nemáte peněz nazbyt, ale rádi byste si pořídili pěkný preparát? Právě pro vás máme speciální nabídku. Objednejte si naše dioráma s medvědem grizzlym a bizonem lesním a získáte příspěvek na příští preparaci.\n"
"\n"
"Samozřejmě vám nebudeme bránit utratit odměnu jinak. Hlavně když peníze zůstanou v místní ekonomice, která to teď potřebuje!\n"
"\n"
"Christine's Taxidermies"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION12_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission12 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION12_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Harvest a moose ethically to educate the hunters who don't use the right "
"ammunition and who make moose suffer more than they should."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte losa šetrně a ukažte ostatním lovcům, proč záleží na správně zvoleném"
" střelivu. Nevhodné střelivo může zvěři způsobit zbytečné utrpení."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION12_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission12 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION12_NAME"
msgid "MooseNews"
msgstr "MooseNews"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION12_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission12 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION12_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest a Moose. Shoot it only once using the .338 Lapua Magnum caliber."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte losa jediným výstřelem ze zbraně ráže .338 Lapua Magnum."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION12_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission12 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION12_READABLE"
msgid ""
"I'm running MooseNews, a nationwide newsletter that covers, guess what, all the latest news about moose. As a wildlife management veteran, I can't just stand by while moose populations are suffering under the current administration. Thankfully, I also know which strings to pull to get reliable info and force those doggers to do their damn jobs.\n"
"\n"
"Moose have it tough. Our wetlands are in a dire state. Diseases and parasites aren't going to go away. Mating seasons are shorter because temperatures are higher. How do I know? Well, I talk to my friends among the First Nations locals. They tell me that moose harvested in the fall used to be stinky, meaning they were ready to mate, but now they aren't. People can barely come across any calves at all in some areas!\n"
"\n"
"I know we can't resolve all these issues in one sweep, I get that. But one problem I see around the country is hunters failing to do basic research. They pick ammunition that isn't powerful enough for moose, shoot them, fail to harvest, and just make them suffer for no reason. Add an artificially overblown harvesting plan to the mix, and we have a dumb cycle of violence and decline on our hands!\n"
"\n"
"New Laurentia is the only place where my soul feels at ease. It's far from perfect, but at least the management is reasonable. Maybe you Hearth & Hunt folks can educate others on how it should be done?\n"
"\n"
"Ministry of Natural Resources, Alumni"
msgstr ""
"Vydávám MooseNews, celostátní zpravodaj o všem, co se děje kolem losů. Po letech práce s volně žijící zvěří nemůžu jen přihlížet tomu, jak se populacím losů při současném způsobu péče nedaří. Naštěstí vím, na koho se obrátit pro spolehlivé informace a jak přimět odpovědné lidi, aby konečně dělali svou práci.\n"
"\n"
"Losi to nemají lehké. Mokřady jsou ve špatném stavu, nemoci a paraziti nemizí a kvůli vyšším teplotám se zkracuje období říje. Jak to vím? Mluvím s přáteli z místních komunit původních obyvatel. Říkají mi, že losi ulovení na podzim dřív silně páchli, protože byli v říji. Teď už to tak nebývá. V některých oblastech lidé skoro nevídají ani losí mláďata.\n"
"\n"
"Všechny problémy najednou nevyřešíme. Jeden však vídám po celé zemi: lovci si nezjistí ani základní informace. Zvolí příliš slabé střelivo, losa postřelí a nedohledají. Zvěř pak zbytečně trpí. Přidejte nadsazené plány odstřelu a máme před sebou koloběh utrpení a úbytku populace.\n"
"\n"
"V New Laurentia se mi dýchá nejlépe. Není dokonalá, ale ke zvěři tu přistupují rozumně. Mohli byste vy z Hearth & Hunt ostatním ukázat, jak se to má dělat?\n"
"\n"
"Ministry of Natural Resources, Alumni"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION13_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission13 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION13_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Dall sheep are having a hard time replicating their numbers. You are "
"encouraged to challenge yourself the next time you want to harvest one and "
"give the sheep a better chance of surviving."
msgstr ""
"Populace ovce aljašské se obtížně obnovuje. Při příštím lovu si stanovte "
"náročnější podmínky a dejte zvěři větší šanci uniknout."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION13_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission13 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION13_NAME"
msgid "Weather extremes"
msgstr "Extrémy počasí"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION13_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission13 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION13_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest a Dall sheep. Shoot it only once from "
"{minShotDistance}|displayAs(distance) or more with the Primacy Vision Unity "
"scope attached."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte ovci aljašskou jediným výstřelem ze vzdálenosti alespoň "
"{minShotDistance}|displayAs(distance). Použijte puškohled Primacy Vision "
"Unity."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION13_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission13 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION13_READABLE"
msgid ""
"There's nothing wrong with populations going up and down. What concerns me about the recent drop in Dall sheep numbers is the degree and scale of the decline.\n"
"\n"
"We checked harvest numbers, and it's definitely not over-hunting. We checked water and food sources, and while they could be better, that wasn't the cause of the problem. Then we checked the weather data. Turns out it's been getting more extreme in both directions, meaning harsher winters and hotter summers. In winter, the mountains are covered in deeper snow for longer. Sheep are proficient rock climbers, but when there's too much snow, they can't keep going up so they make their way back downhill—and that's where predators get to them.\n"
"\n"
"When they're higher up, sheep can get away from predators just fine. But they can't outrun bullets! So for now, we're encouraging hunters to give the sheep a better chance by setting a challenge for themselves.\n"
"\n"
"The William Healey Hunting Society"
msgstr ""
"Početní stavy zvěře přirozeně kolísají. Nedávný pokles populace ovcí aljašských mě však znepokojuje svým rozsahem.\n"
"\n"
"Prověřili jsme počty úlovků a nadměrný lov můžeme vyloučit. Zdroje vody a potravy nejsou ideální, ale příčinou také nejsou. Rozhodující jsou údaje o počasí: zimy jsou tu drsnější a léta teplejší. Hory v zimě pokrývá hlubší sníh po delší dobu. Ovce jsou zdatní lezci, ale příliš hluboký sníh je zažene níž do hor, kde na ně číhají predátoři.\n"
"\n"
"Ve vyšších polohách jim ovce snadno uniknou. Kulce ale neutečou. Proto lovce vybízíme, aby si stanovili náročnější podmínky a dali ovcím větší šanci.\n"
"\n"
"Lovecká společnost Williama Healeye"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION14_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission14 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION14_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Ridicule the prankster who put a high-visibility jacket on a mule deer by "
"showing how to properly harvest deer at night."
msgstr ""
"Ukažte vtipálkovi, který oblékl jelence ušatého do reflexní bundy, jak se "
"správně loví v noci."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION14_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission14 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION14_NAME"
msgid "Zip up"
msgstr "Zapněte zip"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION14_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission14 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION14_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest a Mule deer. Shoot it between "
"{timeFrom}|displayAs(timeShort)-{timeTo}|displayAs(timeShort), with a night "
"vision scope attached."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte jelence ušatého mezi {timeFrom}|displayAs(timeShort) a "
"{timeTo}|displayAs(timeShort). Použijte puškohled pro noční vidění."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION14_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission14 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION14_READABLE"
msgid ""
"Pranksters have gone too far!\n"
"\n"
"We have a recent eyewitness report of a mule deer wearing a zipped-up high-visibility work jacket. Now, we know deer are supersmart, but they aren't smart enough to get a job! Obviously, it was somebody bipedal who put it on the poor creature. Thankfully, the animal didn't appear to be injured when the jacket was removed by Wildlife Service specialists, and local hospitals haven't reported any patients injured by wildlife recently.\n"
"\n"
"But just because we got lucky this time doesn't mean we can let this slide. And you can't deal with pranksters just by making more rules, you need to set proper examples of good behavior, with a healthy dose of ridicule. We're launching a campaign to make the prankster look like an insecure amateur who can't hunt deer at night. Would you like to participate?\n"
"\n"
"Hearth & Hunt, Department of Public Relations"
msgstr ""
"Vtipálci zašli moc daleko!\n"
"\n"
"Očitý svědek nedávno viděl jelence ušatého v zapnuté reflexní pracovní bundě. Jelenci jsou chytří, ale práci si ještě najít neumějí. Tu bundu mu musel obléct člověk. Pracovníci Wildlife Service ji naštěstí sundali a zvíře zřejmě nebylo zraněné. Ani místní nemocnice v poslední době nehlásily zranění způsobená zvěří.\n"
"\n"
"Tentokrát to dopadlo dobře, ale přehlížet to nemůžeme. Na podobné hloupé žerty nestačí vydat další pravidla. Musíme předvést správné chování a viníka trochu zesměšnit. Spouštíme kampaň, která z něj udělá amatéra, jenž neumí lovit jelence v noci. Přidáte se?\n"
"\n"
"Hearth & Hunt, Department of Public Relations"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION15_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission15 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION15_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Challenge yourself and experience how habitat encroachment forces Pronghorns"
" to adapt their migratory routes."
msgstr ""
"Zjistěte při lovu, jak zásahy člověka do prostředí nutí vidlorohy měnit "
"migrační trasy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION15_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission15 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION15_NAME"
msgid "Artificial route"
msgstr "Změněná migrační trasa"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION15_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission15 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION15_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest a Pronghorn. Its Fitness must be {minFitness}|displayAs(percent) or "
"higher. Shoot it only once to the heart from "
"{minShotDistance}|displayAs(distance) or more."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte vidloroha amerického s genetickou kvalitou alespoň "
"{minFitness}|displayAs(percent). Zasáhněte jej jedinou ranou do srdce ze "
"vzdálenosti alespoň {minShotDistance}|displayAs(distance)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION15_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 LevelMission15 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01LEVELMISSION15_READABLE"
msgid ""
"Pronghorns are incredibly fast.\n"
"\n"
"There are some animals that are quicker off the mark when startled, but none can maintain their fastest sprints for as long as a pronghorn. So, if you spook one or botch your shot, you're probably out of luck.\n"
"\n"
"Pronghorns are already facing too many environmental challenges. Their long migratory routes are often blocked by highways that are busy night and day, by cutting-edge solar farms or by something as rudimentary as a barbed wire fence.\n"
"\n"
"Now, imagine you're the pronghorn: you'll have to deal with your own set of artificial constraints to pull this one off.\n"
"\n"
"Black Lyre Hunting Club"
msgstr ""
"Vidloroh americký je neuvěřitelně rychlý.\n"
"\n"
"Některá zvířata po vyrušení vystartují rychleji, ale tak dlouho jako vidloroh vysoké tempo neudrží. Když ho vyplašíte nebo pokazíte zásah, druhou šanci už nejspíš nedostanete.\n"
"\n"
"Vidlorohům přitom cestování komplikuje už tak dost překážek. Dlouhé migrační trasy jim kříží rušné silnice, solární elektrárny i obyčejné ploty z ostnatého drátu.\n"
"\n"
"Představte si, že jste vidloroh. V tomto úkolu také budete muset překonat uměle stanovená omezení.\n"
"\n"
"Black Lyre Hunting Club"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION00_INTRO_VO01_L01_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Introduction cut-scene to the level. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission00 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION00_INTRO_VO01_L01_REGINA"
msgid "Congratulations on joining Hearth & Hunt!"
msgstr "Vítejte v Hearth & Hunt!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION00_INTRO_VO01_L02_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission00 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION00_INTRO_VO01_L02_REGINA"
msgid ""
"Your journey begins in New Laurentia, where dense forests meet rolling hills"
" and serene rivers."
msgstr ""
"Vaše cesta začíná v New Laurentia, krajině hustých lesů, zvlněných kopců a "
"poklidných řek."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION00_INTRO_VO01_L03_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission00 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION00_INTRO_VO01_L03_REGINA"
msgid ""
"This territory is home to a rich web of life, taking in everything from the "
"majestic moose to the tiniest of hares."
msgstr ""
"Žije tu pestrá škála živočichů, od majestátního losa až po drobné zajíce."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION00_INTRO_VO01_L04_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission00 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION00_INTRO_VO01_L04_REGINA"
msgid "By joining Hearth & Hunt, you'll become part of a legacy."
msgstr "Jako člen Hearth & Hunt se stáváte součástí naší dlouhé tradice."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION00_INTRO_VO01_L05_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission00 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION00_INTRO_VO01_L05_REGINA"
msgid "Now it's your turn to carry on our tradition."
msgstr "Teď je na vás, abyste v ní pokračovali."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01_1 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Hearth & Hunt, the new company you've been hired by, has a special "
"tradition! You have to harvest a mule deer to create a taxidermy piece. It "
"isn't the worst tradition for a hunting company!"
msgstr ""
"Společnost Hearth & Hunt, která vás právě přijala, má zvláštní tradici: "
"každý nový zaměstnanec musí ulovit jelence ušatého a nechat si z něj "
"zhotovit preparát. Na loveckou společnost to vlastně není tak podivný zvyk."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01_1 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_NAME"
msgid "For the hearth"
msgstr "Pro krb"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Angel is calling on a phone to the player for
#. the first time. He is trying to be polite, but he is also a little bit
#. annoyed. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01_1 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"Good morning... You must be our new... Community & Conservation Liaison "
"Officer!"
msgstr ""
"Dobré ráno... Vy budete náš nový... styčný pracovník pro komunitu a ochranu "
"přírody!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01_1 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"Well, that is a mouthful. I'll have to come up with something more "
"succinct..."
msgstr "Pěkně dlouhý název. Budu muset vymyslet něco stručnějšího..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "changed after 19.2. 2026"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01_1 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_ANGEL"
msgid "I'm Angel Hearth, your Hearth & Hunt coordinator."
msgstr "Jsem Angel Hearth, váš koordinátor Hearth & Hunt."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01_1 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_ANGEL"
msgid "You may be tempted to call me your \"guardian angel\"..."
msgstr "Možná vás napadne říkat mi „anděl strážný“..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01_1 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_ANGEL"
msgid "But please don't."
msgstr "Ale prosím ne."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01_1 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"Your first task is actually part of a tradition around here! Every new hire "
"at Hearth & Hunt has to harvest a mule deer."
msgstr ""
"Váš první úkol patří k místní tradici. Každý nový zaměstnanec Hearth & Hunt "
"musí ulovit jelence ušatého."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01_1 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"The tradition might seem a little... old-school, especially if you're here "
"to handle paperwork, for example. But who am I to question traditions?"
msgstr ""
"Možná vám ten zvyk připadá trochu... staromódní, zvlášť když jste tu třeba "
"kvůli kancelářské práci. Ale kdo jsem já, abych zpochybňoval tradice?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01_1 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_ANGEL"
msgid "Let's get you to work!"
msgstr "Tak se do toho pusťte!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01_1 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"Remember that you can always check your employee encyclopedia whenever you "
"need any pointers."
msgstr ""
"Kdykoli budete potřebovat radu, podívejte se do zaměstnanecké encyklopedie."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01_1 Dialogue01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_ANGEL"
msgid "Courtesy of Hearth & Hunt."
msgstr "Tu pro vás připravila Hearth & Hunt."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01_1 Dialogue01
#. objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_1_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest a male Mule deer near your Lodge. Choose to taxidermy it when "
"harvesting."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte samce jelence ušatého poblíž své lovecké chaty. Při zpracování úlovku"
" zvolte preparaci."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01_2 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Just like Hearth & Hunt is made up of two connected families, the tradition "
"of hunting the mule deer is made up of two parts as well. The second part is"
" to create a taxidermy piece in your Lodge!"
msgstr ""
"Stejně jako Hearth & Hunt tvoří dvě propojené rodiny, má i tradice lovu "
"jelence ušatého dvě části. Tou druhou je vytvořit preparát a vystavit ho ve "
"své lovecké chatě!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01_2 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_NAME"
msgid "For the hunt"
msgstr "Na lov"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Angel calls the player after they harvested
#. the mule deer. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01_2 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"You've got the mule deer! Nice work. Now, the final step of the tradition is"
" to turn it into a taxidermy piece."
msgstr ""
"Jelence ušatého už máte! Výborně. Teď zbývá poslední část tradice: nechat z "
"něj zhotovit preparát."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "\"my mother dear\" is a little bit ironic"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01_2 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"The tradition is in honor of our founder, Genevieve Hearth, my dear mother. "
"She's a firm believer in the idea that your mule deer will bring you luck on"
" your journey with our company."
msgstr ""
"Tradice vzdává hold naší zakladatelce Genevieve Hearth, mé drahé matce. "
"Pevně věří, že vám preparát jelence ušatého přinese štěstí při práci pro "
"naši společnost."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01_2 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_ANGEL"
msgid "This isn't even the weirdest tradition in the Hearth-Hunt family..."
msgstr "To není ani ta nejpodivnější tradice v rodině Hearth-Hunt..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L01_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "added after recording"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L01_ANGEL"
msgid "I’d suggest getting acquainted with your nearest surroundings as well."
msgstr "Doporučuji seznámit se i se svým nejbližším okolím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L02_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "added after recording"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L02_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"Some people prefer to just look things up online, but I enjoy a more hands-"
"on approach."
msgstr ""
"Někteří si všechno raději vyhledají na internetu, já ale dávám přednost "
"práci s mapami."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L03_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "added after recording"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L03_ANGEL"
msgid "There’s no better way than diving into local maps and studying them,"
msgstr "Začít můžete třeba tím, že si pořádně prostudujete místní mapy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L04_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "added after recording"
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "getting more passionate when talking about
#. the maps"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L04_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"until your eyes hurt from examining every detail and you feel like you know "
"the place without ever having visited it."
msgstr ""
"Prohlížejte každý detail, až vás z toho budou bolet oči a budete mít pocit, "
"že krajinu znáte, i když jste v ní ještě nebyli."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L05_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "added after recording"
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "slightly embarassed by his previous passion,
#. tries to play it off"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L05_ANGEL"
msgid "Or maybe that’s just me."
msgstr "Možná to tak mám jen já."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO03_L01_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "added after recording"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO03_L01_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"While you’re in your lodge, remember that you can access the Shop to buy new"
" gear."
msgstr ""
"Až budete ve své lovecké chatě, můžete si v obchodě koupit nové vybavení."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO03_L02_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "added after recording"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO03_L02_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"After that, you can swap equipment in the Storage. It’s mobile, too, so you "
"can reach it from the trunk of your vehicle while you’re on the road."
msgstr ""
"Pak si ve skladu můžete vybrat vybavení. Dostanete se k němu i z kufru auta,"
" když jste na cestách."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO03_L03_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "added after recording"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO03_L03_ANGEL"
msgid "So don’t call me to bring you anything if you forget it."
msgstr "Tak mi nevolejte, abych vám vozil něco, co jste zapomněli."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO03_L04_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "added after recording"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO03_L04_ANGEL"
msgid "Just get it yourself."
msgstr "Prostě si to vyzvedněte sami."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO03_L05_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "added after recording"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "asks incredulously"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO03_L05_ANGEL"
msgid "Where is it?"
msgstr "Kde ten sklad najdete?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO03_L06_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "added after recording"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "whispers it, because he breaks the 4th wall"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE00_VO03_L06_ANGEL"
msgid "Just open the menu while near the Lodge."
msgstr "Stačí otevřít nabídku poblíž lovecké chaty."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01_2 Dialogue01
#. objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Place a male Mule deer in a diorama with a mid-sized herbivore in your "
"lodge."
msgstr ""
"Ve své lovecké chatě umístěte preparát samce jelence ušatého do diorámatu se"
" středně velkým býložravcem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_2_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid "Take a look at your surroundings at a Map board in the Lodge."
msgstr "Prohlédněte si mapu okolí na tabuli v lovecké chatě."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_COOKBOOK_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 Readable cookbook"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_COOKBOOK_READABLE"
msgid ""
"\"The Hunt & Hearth Cookbook: Wild Game Recipes for the Family Table\"\n"
"\n"
"A collection of time-honored recipes celebrating the connections between hunting, family, and food. Inspired by generations of tradition, this cookbook offers practical techniques, flavorful wild game dishes, and heartwarming meals to share. Whether you're an experienced hunter or just starting out, these recipes bring the best of the wild to your table."
msgstr ""
"„The Hunt & Hearth Cookbook: Wild Game Recipes for the Family Table“\n"
"\n"
"Sbírka osvědčených receptů, které spojují lov, rodinu a společné stolování. Tato kuchařka vychází z tradic předávaných po generace a nabízí praktické kuchařské postupy i chutné pokrmy ze zvěřiny, které potěší celou rodinu. Ať už máte s lovem bohaté zkušenosti, nebo teprve začínáte, s těmito recepty přinesete na stůl to nejlepší z přírody."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_DEPARTMENTS_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 Readable departments"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_DEPARTMENTS_READABLE"
msgid ""
"Hearth & Hunt departments\n"
"\n"
"Custom Rifles and Shotguns\n"
"— High-quality, handcrafted firearms tailored to individual specifications.\n"
"\n"
"Hunting Gear and Accessories\n"
"— Clothing, footwear, and specialized gear designed for the modern hunter.\n"
"\n"
"Outdoor Cooking and Recipes\n"
"— Cookbooks featuring wild game recipes.\n"
"— Cooking tools like portable grills, knives, and campfire accessories.\n"
"— Wild game spice blends and seasonings.\n"
"\n"
"Hunting Adventures and Guided Trips\n"
"— Offering curated hunting experiences in scenic locations.\n"
"— Guided trips, both local and international, for new and seasoned hunters.\n"
"\n"
"Hunting Education and Workshops\n"
"— In-person workshops covering hunting, wildlife tracking, and firearms safety.\n"
"\n"
"Wildlife Conservation Initiatives\n"
"— Partnerships with conservation groups to preserve wildlife habitats and promote ethical hunting practices.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Missing departments to be expanded:\n"
"— Wildlife photography\n"
"— Dog training\n"
"— Bow hunting expertise"
msgstr ""
"Oddělení Hearth & Hunt\n"
"\n"
"Pušky a brokovnice na zakázku\n"
"— Vysoce kvalitní, ručně vyráběné zbraně podle požadavků zákazníka.\n"
"\n"
"Lovecké potřeby a příslušenství\n"
"— Oblečení, obuv a specializované vybavení pro moderního lovce.\n"
"\n"
"Vaření v přírodě a recepty\n"
"— Kuchařky s recepty ze zvěřiny.\n"
"— Potřeby pro vaření, například přenosné grily, nože a vybavení pro vaření na ohni.\n"
"— Koření a směsi koření na zvěřinu.\n"
"\n"
"Lovecké výpravy s průvodcem\n"
"— Organizované lovecké zážitky v malebném prostředí.\n"
"— Tuzemské i zahraniční výpravy s průvodcem pro začínající i zkušené lovce.\n"
"\n"
"Myslivecké vzdělávání a praktické kurzy\n"
"— Prezenční kurzy lovu, stopování zvěře a bezpečného zacházení se zbraněmi.\n"
"\n"
"Iniciativy na ochranu přírody\n"
"— Spolupráce s ochranářskými organizacemi na zachování stanovišť zvěře a podpoře etického lovu.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Oblasti, které je třeba doplnit a rozvíjet:\n"
"— Fotografování zvěře\n"
"— Výcvik psů\n"
"— Výuka lovu lukem"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"You've been tasked with getting to know the locals and helping them with "
"their current issues, such as habitat enhancement and promotion. You'll also"
" need to recruit one new Hearth & Hunt member in order to be officially "
"recognized for your work."
msgstr ""
"Seznamte se s místními lidmi a pomozte jim se zlepšováním prostředí zvěře i "
"propagací rezervace. Aby byla vaše práce oficiálně uznána, musíte také "
"získat pro Hearth & Hunt jednoho nového člena."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_GOSSIP_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 Readable gossip"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_GOSSIP_READABLE"
msgid ""
"MUSHROOM HUNTERS' DAILY\n"
"\n"
"Heya, it's your favorite local gossip column! And what are the latest whispers whispering? It's something to do with the Hearth-Hunt family. We've heard there are serious tensions in the family because the illustrious Genevieve is writing... get this... a MEMOIR! From her tragic beginnings as an abandoned child, through raising her four children single-handedly, to the big hookup with the Hunt family. Now we've heard that this is causing such a feud in the family that some of the members have stopped talking to each other!\n"
"\n"
"Keep following our column to keep track of what others are too scared to share!\n"
"\n"
"XOXO, your courageous mushroom hunters"
msgstr ""
"DENÍK HOUBAŘŮ\n"
"\n"
"Ahoj, tady je váš oblíbený místní sloupek drbů! A co se teď šušká? Něco o rodině Hearth-Hunt. Prý v ní panuje pořádné napětí, protože proslulá Genevieve píše... a teď se podržte... MEMOÁRY! Od smutného dětství opuštěného dítěte přes výchovu čtyř dětí, na kterou byla sama, až po spojení s rodinou Hunt. Slyšeli jsme, že to vyvolalo takové rozbroje, že spolu někteří členové rodiny přestali mluvit!\n"
"\n"
"Čtěte náš sloupek dál a dozvíte se i to, o čem se ostatní bojí promluvit!\n"
"\n"
"Pusu a objetí posílají vaši odvážní houbaři"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_HEARTH_HUNT_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 Readable Hearth &
#. Hunt"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_HEARTH_HUNT_READABLE"
msgid ""
"Genevieve (Jean) Hearth, the founder of Hearth & Hunt, was an orphan with a dream of building a large, close-knit family. She would often write stories about a future family she had never met—ranging from fantastical tales where she was swept away by elves to a world without injustice, to more grounded stories based on the reality of her life. Whenever she came across neglected or mistreated children, she was instinctively driven to protect them. She grew into the strong, compassionate person she had always craved as a child—a defender of those without a voice.\n"
"\n"
"Eventually, she was adopted by an older couple who had no children of their own. Her adoptive father introduced her to hunting, a passion she quickly grew to love. She cherished the time spent hunting with him and handling the meat alongside her adoptive mother. For Genevieve, these hunts were not just about the pursuit, but about immersion in nature, dog training, creating new recipes, and true family bonding.\n"
"\n"
"Her father was also a talented craftsman, specializing in custom rifle and shotgun designs. Genevieve recognized the dormant potential: she launched a website to showcase her father's work, and collaborated with her mother on a cookbook. She believed their talents deserved to be shared with the world.\n"
"\n"
"Without realizing it, Genevieve had started a business—Hearth, a company dedicated to everything hunting-related. Gradually, talented people with similar passions sought her out, including her husband-to-be, Jonathan Hunt. They had already raised four children each by the time they married, and together they officially founded Hearth & Hunt, and just like their joint venture, their love is still going strong."
msgstr ""
"Genevieve (Jean) Hearth, zakladatelka Hearth & Hunt, vyrůstala jako sirotek a snila o velké, soudržné rodině. Často psala příběhy o rodině, kterou jednou chtěla mít: od fantastických vyprávění, v nichž ji elfové odnesli do světa bez nespravedlnosti, až po realističtější příběhy vycházející z jejího vlastního života. Kdykoli potkala zanedbávané nebo týrané děti, instinktivně je chtěla chránit. Vyrostla z ní silná a soucitná žena, kterou sama jako dítě potřebovala mít po svém boku — zastánkyně těch, jejichž hlas není slyšet.\n"
"\n"
"Nakonec ji adoptovali starší manželé, kteří neměli vlastní děti. Adoptivní otec ji přivedl k lovu, který si rychle zamilovala. Ráda s ním chodila na lov a s adoptivní matkou pak zpracovávala zvěřinu. Lov pro ni znamenal také pobyt v přírodě, výcvik psů, vymýšlení nových receptů a upevňování rodinných vazeb.\n"
"\n"
"Její otec byl také nadaný řemeslník, který se specializoval na návrhy pušek a brokovnic na zakázku. Genevieve v jeho práci rozpoznala dosud nevyužitý potenciál. Vytvořila web, kde ji představila, a s matkou se pustila do kuchařky. Věřila, že by o jejich nadání měl vědět i zbytek světa.\n"
"\n"
"Aniž si to uvědomovala, založila podnik Hearth, který se věnoval všemu kolem lovu. Postupně ji vyhledávali nadaní lidé s podobnými zájmy, mezi nimi i její budoucí manžel Jonathan Hunt. V době svatby už každý z nich vychoval čtyři děti. Společně pak oficiálně založili Hearth & Hunt. Jejich láska je stejně pevná jako jejich společný podnik."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 Dialogue01 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_NAME"
msgid "Angel on your shoulder"
msgstr "Angel po tvém boku"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Angel calls the player after they finish
#. harvesting and taxiderming a mule deer."
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_ANGEL"
msgid "Now that you're done with the tradition..."
msgstr "Když už máte tradici za sebou..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_ANGEL"
msgid "Let's get to your actual job."
msgstr "Pojďme k vaší skutečné práci."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "\"New Laurentia\" is a fake name of the
#. Country they are in"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_ANGEL"
msgid "Which is, to get acquainted with the locals in New Laurentia."
msgstr "Nejdřív se seznamte s lidmi z New Laurentia."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_ANGEL"
msgid "You can find files about them in your new lodge."
msgstr "V lovecké chatě o nich najdete složky."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"It's better to read about them first, before you meet them. They each have "
"their quirks."
msgstr ""
"Je lepší si o nich nejdříve přečíst, než se s nimi setkáte. Každý z nich má "
"své zvláštnosti."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Check out the Hearth & Hunt files on the locals."
msgstr "Prostudujte si složky Hearth & Hunt o místních obyvatelích."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L01_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Player went through files of associates in
#. the area they are supposed to help. Angel is talking about them. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L01_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"We already have two associates in the area. Regina Harper and her husband "
"Patrick Harper."
msgstr ""
"V oblasti už máme dva spolupracovníky: Reginu Harper a jejího manžela "
"Patricka Harpera."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L02_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L02_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"Regina needs help with habitat enhancement, and Patrick could use a hand "
"with promoting New Laurentia."
msgstr ""
"Regina potřebuje pomoc s péčí o prostředí zvěře a Patrick s propagací New "
"Laurentia."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L03_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L03_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"You'll also need to recruit a potential new member, a phenomenal dog "
"trainer."
msgstr "Také musíte získat novou členku, vynikající cvičitelku psů."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L04_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L04_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"Hearth & Hunt currently has significant gaps in that area. We're hoping that"
" she'll eventually help us develop a whole department dedicated to training "
"hunting dogs."
msgstr ""
"V téhle oblasti máme zatím mezery. Doufáme, že nám časem pomůže vybudovat "
"celé oddělení pro výcvik loveckých psů."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L05_1_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "added after recording"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L05_1_ANGEL"
msgid "And there's also Mikael Anderson…"
msgstr "A je tu také Mikael Anderson…"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L05_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L05_ANGEL"
msgid "Did you come across an extra file about me?"
msgstr "Byla tam ještě nějaká složka o mně?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L06_1_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "added after recording"
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "hesitating how to describe him, they don't
#. have the best relationship"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L06_1_ANGEL"
msgid "He’s…"
msgstr "On je…"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L06_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L06_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"And it was scribbled on? Hmm. You could say that your predecessor wasn't "
"very fond of me."
msgstr ""
"A byla počmáraná? Hmm. Dalo by se říct, že mě váš předchůdce neměl moc v "
"lásce."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L07_1_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "added after recording"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L07_1_ANGEL"
msgid "Efficient."
msgstr "Efektivní."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L07_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L07_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"I look forward to building a more... collaborative relationship with you."
msgstr "Doufám, že s vámi vybuduji o něco... vstřícnější pracovní vztah."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L08_1_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "added after recording"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L08_1_ANGEL"
msgid "And about to leave."
msgstr "A chystá se odejít."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L09_1_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "added after recording"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L09_1_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"Leave for another Hearth & Hunt reserve, so gather as much pointers about "
"New Laurentia from him while you can."
msgstr ""
"Odchází do jiné rezervace Hearth & Hunt. Dokud je tady, zkuste se od něj o "
"New Laurentia dozvědět co nejvíc."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L10_1_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "added after recording"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "says it more to himself"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L10_1_ANGEL"
msgid "If you can get him to talk."
msgstr "Pokud ho přimějete mluvit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 objective 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid "Meet Juniper, a dog trainer."
msgstr "Seznamte se s Juniper, cvičitelkou psů."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 objective 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03"
msgid "Meet Patrick Harper and find out about ways to promote New Laurentia."
msgstr ""
"Seznamte se s Patrickem Harperem a zjistěte, jak propagovat New Laurentia."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory00 Mission01 objective 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE04"
msgid "Meet Regina Harper, who needs help with habitat enhancement."
msgstr ""
"Seznamte se s Reginou Harper, která potřebuje pomoc s vylepšením biotopu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE05"
msgid ""
"Meet Mikael Anderson, your Hearth & Hunt predecessor, who will show you the "
"ropes."
msgstr ""
"Seznamte se s Mikaelem Andersonem, svým předchůdcem v Hearth & Hunt. "
"Vysvětlí vám základy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Juniper, a dog trainer Hearth & Hunt is hoping to recruit, isn't very open "
"to the idea. She likes her solitude and prefers to partner with silent "
"companions. She's giving you an opportunity to show her your hunting dog's "
"skills, this could be an opportunity to strike up a conversation."
msgstr ""
"Juniper, cvičitelka psů, o kterou má Hearth & Hunt zájem, se k nabídce práce"
" staví zdrženlivě. Má ráda samotu a dává přednost tichým společníkům. "
"Nabídla vám však možnost předvést, co umí váš lovecký pes. Třeba se při tom "
"dáte do řeči."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_NAME"
msgid "Heterochromia Iridum"
msgstr "Heterochromia Iridum"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Juniper was asleep in a chair and player
#. walked-up to her."
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_JUNIPER"
msgid "Sheesh! You scared the life out of me!"
msgstr "Páni! Málem jsem strachy umřela!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_JUNIPER"
msgid "My dog always barks at strangers. How did you get past her?"
msgstr ""
"Moje fena na cizí lidi vždycky štěká. Jak se ti podařilo projít kolem ní?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_PLAYER_A"
msgid "I guess she sensed my dread about my new job and spared me."
msgstr "Asi vycítila, jaký mám strach z nové práce, a slitovala se nade mnou."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_JUNIPER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_JUNIPER_A"
msgid ""
"Oh, I know that feeling. It's exactly how I feel when I start training a new"
" dog and everything seems hopeless."
msgstr ""
"Oh, znám ten pocit. Přesně tak se cítím, když začnu cvičit nového psa a vše "
"se zdá beznadějné."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_PLAYER_B"
msgid ""
"My dog daydreams too, mostly about math. Two squirrels per tree, fifty "
"thousand trees... that's a hundred thousand squirrels..."
msgstr ""
"Můj pes se taky rád zasní. Většinou počítá: dvě veverky na strom, padesát "
"tisíc stromů... To je sto tisíc veverek..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_JUNIPER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_JUNIPER_B"
msgid "You seem to know a lot about what's on your dog's mind."
msgstr "Ty snad víš, co se tvému psovi honí hlavou."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_PLAYER_C"
msgid ""
"Well, it could be one of several topics: a medical issue, hearing loss, "
"cognitive decline like Alzheimer's, or arthritis."
msgstr ""
"Příčinou mohou být zdravotní potíže, ztráta sluchu, úbytek poznávacích "
"schopností podobný Alzheimerově chorobě nebo artritida."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_JUNIPER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_JUNIPER_C"
msgid ""
"Whoa, slow down, or I'll wind up taking her to the vet and spending hundreds"
" on all kinds of tests."
msgstr ""
"Počkej, brzdi. Ještě ji kvůli tomu vezmu k veterináři a utratím celé jmění "
"za vyšetření."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_JUNIPER"
msgid "I'm Juniper, by the way. I train dogs for a living."
msgstr "Mimochodem, já jsem Juniper. Živím se výcvikem psů."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Juniper yawns at the beginning of this line"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_JUNIPER"
msgid "Sorry, I didn't get much sleep last night."
msgstr "Promiň, minulou noc jsem skoro nespala."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "\"Speak\" is said as a command to the dog. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_JUNIPER"
msgid "And this is Bug. Bug, speak!"
msgstr "A tohle je Bug. Bug, dej hlas!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_BUG
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_BUG"
msgid "(barks)"
msgstr "(štěká)"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_JUNIPER"
msgid "Are you the new Hearth & Hunt rep? Nice to meet you."
msgstr "Ty jsi nový člověk z Hearth & Hunt? Těší mě."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_PLAYER"
msgid "My name's {playerCharacterName} and this is {dog}."
msgstr "Jmenuji se {playerCharacterName} a toto je {dog}."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_JUNIPER"
msgid "I've already received an e-mail with a job offer."
msgstr "Už mi přišel e-mail s nabídkou práce."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"But I'd rather work on my own. They shouldn't have sent you all the way out "
"here..."
msgstr "Raději ale pracuju sama. Neměli tě sem posílat takovou dálku..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_PLAYER_A"
msgid ""
"They thought you'd be less likely to slam the door on someone with my... "
"winning personality."
msgstr ""
"Asi si říkali, že někomu s mým... neodolatelným šarmem dveře před nosem "
"nezabouchneš."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_JUNIPER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_JUNIPER_A"
msgid ""
"Well, that's true. I'm a bit of a people pleaser, so I do have trouble "
"rejecting someone face to face."
msgstr ""
"To je pravda. Nerada lidi zklamávám, takže se mi špatně odmítá z očí do očí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Working solo has its perks. Especially with a companion around."
msgstr "Práce o samotě má své výhody. Zvlášť když ti společnost dělá pes."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_JUNIPER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_JUNIPER_B"
msgid ""
"Exactly! Unlike coworkers, dogs can be trained not to steal your food. "
"Still..."
msgstr ""
"Přesně! Na rozdíl od kolegů se pes dá naučit, aby ti nekradl jídlo. Ale "
"přece jen..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 21"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_PLAYER_C"
msgid "Sure, the emails were a mistake. Sending me? Slightly less of one."
msgstr ""
"Jasně, ty e-maily byly chyba. Ale poslat mě? To už taková chyba nebyla."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_JUNIPER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 22"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_JUNIPER_C"
msgid "I admit, it feels nice to be wanted."
msgstr "Přiznávám, že je příjemné, když o mě někdo stojí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 23"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"Why do I get the feeling I'm not going to be able to get rid of you so "
"easily?"
msgstr "Proč mám pocit, že se tě tak snadno nezbavím?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 24"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_PLAYER"
msgid "Because you won't!"
msgstr "Protože se mě nezbavíš!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 25"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_PLAYER"
msgid "How did you become a dog trainer? What's your training style?"
msgstr "Jak ses dostala k výcviku psů? A jak s nimi pracuješ?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "She is friendly, but shy. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 26"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"I hate talking about myself. Or talking in general. Dogs are silent "
"companions."
msgstr ""
"Nerada mluvím o sobě. Vlastně nerada mluvím vůbec. Psi jsou tiší společníci."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_BUG
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 27"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_BUG"
msgid "(barks)"
msgstr "(štěká)"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 28"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_JUNIPER"
msgid "Most of the time..."
msgstr "Většinu času..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 29"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_JUNIPER"
msgid "I feel like you're just wasting your time with me."
msgstr "Mám pocit, že se mnou jen ztrácíš čas."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 30"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Don't flatter yourself, I waste my time on much worse things."
msgstr "Nepřeceňuj se. Časem plýtvám i na mnohem horší věci."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_JUNIPER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 31"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_JUNIPER_A"
msgid "I'm not sure if that makes me feel any better, but... Thanks anyway."
msgstr "Nevím, jestli mě to uklidnilo, ale... i tak díky."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 32"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_PLAYER_B"
msgid ""
"Don't worry. As an extrovert, getting introverts to talk is my specialty."
msgstr "Neboj. Jako extrovert umím introverty rozmluvit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_JUNIPER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 33"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_JUNIPER_B"
msgid ""
"I'm not even an introvert. Is there a category for only speaking to animals?"
msgstr ""
"Nejsem ani introvertka. Existuje označení pro někoho, kdo mluví jen se "
"zvířaty?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Order" : "this is a joke to the dialogue option called:
#. Panda\nMap01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 34"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Well, you're speaking to a panda person right now."
msgstr "Teď zrovna mluvíš s člověkem, který se cítí jako panda."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_JUNIPER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 35"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_JUNIPER_B"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Jak to myslíš?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 36"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_PLAYER_B"
msgid "*waves hand to ignore it.*"
msgstr "*Mávne rukou, ať to nechá být.*"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 37"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_PLAYER_C"
msgid "You don't hate talking. You hate being misunderstood."
msgstr "Nemáš problém mluvit. Vadí ti, když ti lidé nerozumějí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_JUNIPER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 38"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_JUNIPER_C"
msgid "I'm not so sure."
msgstr "Tím si nejsem tak jistá."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "She gets more excited now"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 39"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_JUNIPER"
msgid "Look, I always feel more talkative when it's about dogs."
msgstr "Podívej, vždycky se cítím upovídanější, když jde o psy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L40_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 40"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L40_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"As a fellow foxhound owner, how about you show me your dog's skills and then"
" we can chat some more?"
msgstr ""
"Taky máš foxhounda. Nechceš mi ukázat, co tvůj pes umí? Pak si můžeme ještě "
"popovídat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L41_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 41"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L41_PLAYER_A"
msgid "His greatest skill is selective hearing. It's truly remarkable."
msgstr ""
"Jeho největší dovedností je selektivní sluch. Je to opravdu pozoruhodné."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L42_JUNIPER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 42"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L42_JUNIPER_A"
msgid "Well, it's your job to find out how to motivate him better."
msgstr "No a ty musíš přijít na to, jak ho lépe motivovat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L43_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 43"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L43_PLAYER_B"
msgid "{dog} is ready to be in the spotlight!"
msgstr "{dog} je připraven být v centru pozornosti!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L44_JUNIPER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 44"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L44_JUNIPER_B"
msgid "Dogs deserve all the spotlight."
msgstr "Psi si zaslouží veškerou pozornost."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L45_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 45"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L45_PLAYER_C"
msgid "Bring it on!"
msgstr "Tak do toho!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L46_JUNIPER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 46"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L46_JUNIPER_C"
msgid ""
"I was hoping you'd give up, but I suppose that's probably not going to "
"happen."
msgstr "Doufala jsem, že to vzdáš, ale to se asi nestane."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L47_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 47"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L47_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"Let's start off easy, how about showing off some tracking skills? That's "
"what foxhounds are for, after all."
msgstr "Začneme něčím lehkým. Ukaž, jak tvůj foxhound zvládá dosled."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L01_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L01_PLAYER"
msgid "Since you're a dog trainer, could you help me out with this..."
msgstr "Když se vyznáš ve výcviku psů, poradila bys mi s něčím?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L02_PLAYER_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for translators" : "Bonding is a stat for the dog,
#. that can increase during the play time. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L02_PLAYER_OP1"
msgid "How do I improve my bond with my dog?"
msgstr "Jak si se svým psem vybuduju lepší vztah?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L03_JUNIPER_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L03_JUNIPER_OP1"
msgid ""
"It's simple. Bring him along on your hunts and eventually the dog will learn"
" to trust you."
msgstr "Jednoduše. Ber ho s sebou na lov a časem ti začne důvěřovat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L04_PLAYER_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L04_PLAYER_OP2"
msgid "{dog} is still losing track of scents, how do I improve his ability?"
msgstr "{dog} při dosledu pořád ztrácí stopu. Jak se může zlepšit?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L05_JUNIPER_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L05_JUNIPER_OP2"
msgid ""
"Blood tracking is a difficult skill to learn, but scent hounds have a great "
"aptitude for it. It's not just about following the track, you have to think "
"about all the variables that dogs can distinguish with their nose."
msgstr ""
"Dosled po barvě není snadný, ale honiči pro něj mají vlohy. Nestačí jen "
"sledovat stopu. Musíš brát v úvahu všechno, co pes dokáže vyčichat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L06_JUNIPER_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L06_JUNIPER_OP2"
msgid ""
"Does the blood come from a vital organ? The larger the splatter, the easier "
"it is to follow."
msgstr ""
"Pochází barva ze zásahu životně důležitého orgánu? Čím víc barvy zvěř "
"zanechá, tím snáz pes sleduje její stopu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L07_JUNIPER_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L07_JUNIPER_OP2"
msgid ""
"When was the animal shot? The fresher the blood, the easier it is to catch "
"the scent."
msgstr ""
"Kdy byla zvěř postřelena? Čím čerstvější je barva, tím snáz pes zachytí "
"pach."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L08_JUNIPER_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L08_JUNIPER_OP2"
msgid ""
"Eventually, you'll train your dog to be able to track even a badly shot "
"deer, losing the minimum amount of blood, running for a long distance, that "
"was shot days before. Just keep on hunting with him."
msgstr ""
"Časem tvůj pes zvládne vystopovat i zvěř, která po špatném zásahu krvácí jen"
" málo a odběhne daleko. Dokáže se držet i několik dní staré stopy. Hlavně ho"
" ber dál na lov."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L09_JUNIPER_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L09_JUNIPER_OP2"
msgid ""
"It's best if you start training him with blood that's from a vital organ, "
"where the animal's body isn't too far away."
msgstr ""
"Začni s barvenou stopou po zásahu životně důležitého orgánu, kde je kus od "
"nástřelu jen kousek."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L10_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L10_PLAYER"
msgid "I'd better get going."
msgstr "Raději už půjdu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Have your Dog companion successfully find and follow the blood trail of any "
"shot White-tailed deer."
msgstr ""
"Nechte psa najít a sledovat barvenou stopu postřeleného jelence běloocasého."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission01 objective 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid ""
"Harvest a male White-tailed deer with your Dog companion active at the time "
"of the shot."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte samce jelence běloocasého. Pes musí být při výstřelu "
"vaším aktivním společníkem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Juniper is getting ready for a national competition for blood-tracking dogs,"
" so she's prepared an artificial blood track to train her dog, Bug. But she "
"thinks it's too easy for her dog, and also encourages you to train on a real"
" hunt. She shares her secret technique and tells you it's easier to train "
"dogs at night."
msgstr ""
"Juniper se připravuje na celostátní soutěž v dosledu po barvě. Pro Bug "
"připravila umělou barvenou stopu, ta je však pro fenu příliš snadná. Radí "
"vám trénovat při skutečném lovu a svěřuje vám svůj tip: v noci se psům snáze"
" soustředí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for translators" : "Joke on the song \"who let the
#. dogs out\""
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_NAME"
msgid "Who let the bloodhounds out?"
msgstr "Kdo pustil psy ven?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Player returns to Juniper after finishing her
#. task. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"I watched you with Bug! I thought you seemed to be doing okay with the blood"
" tracking, but what did you think?"
msgstr ""
"S Bug jsme tě pozorovaly! Myslím, že ti dosled po barvě docela šel. Jak se "
"ti to zdálo?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Well, I love having an audience for my slow descent into incompetence."
msgstr ""
"No, miluju, když někdo sleduje, jak postupně odhaluju svou neschopnost."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_JUNIPER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_JUNIPER_A"
msgid ""
"That's a bit harsh, your dog's a great tracker! And getting that shot was no"
" easy task."
msgstr ""
"Nesuď se tak přísně. Tvůj pes je výborný stopař a ten zásah taky nebyl "
"snadný."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_JUNIPER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_JUNIPER_A"
msgid ""
"Don't be so hard on yourself, there are plenty of people in this world "
"who'll be glad to do that for you."
msgstr ""
"Nesuď se tak přísně. Na světě je spousta lidí, kteří to za tebe rádi "
"udělají."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_PLAYER_A"
msgid "That's advice you could do with taking on board yourself."
msgstr "Tu radu by sis měla vzít k srdci i ty."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_JUNIPER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_JUNIPER_A"
msgid "I know. So let's make a deal to both be nicer to ourselves."
msgstr "Já vím. Domluvíme se, že na sebe budeme mírnější?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Deal."
msgstr "Platí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Easy peasy. But the deer wasn't very endeered."
msgstr "Hračka. Jen jelen z toho asi nejásal."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_JUNIPER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_JUNIPER_B"
msgid "Seriously? Do you have more jokes like that up your sleeve?"
msgstr "To vážně? Máš v zásobě ještě další takové vtípky?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Oh, you have no ideer how many!"
msgstr "Ani netušíš, kolik jich mám na parohu!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_JUNIPER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_JUNIPER_B"
msgid "I guess I walked into that one..."
msgstr "Na to jsem ti pěkně nahrála..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_PLAYER_C"
msgid "{dog} has some training to do in the future."
msgstr "{dog} bude muset ještě hodně trénovat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_JUNIPER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_JUNIPER_C"
msgid ""
"That you do, but now you can also ask me for tips on how to improve. I see "
"great potential in your dog. Also in you as a dog trainer."
msgstr ""
"To ano. Kdykoli se mě můžeš zeptat, jak se zlepšit. Tvůj pes má velký "
"potenciál. A ty jako psovod taky."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_PLAYER"
msgid "I have to ask. Do you both have heterochromia?"
msgstr "Musím se zeptat. Máte obě heterochromii?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"You may be surprised to hear it, but no, I don't wear contact lenses just to"
" match Bug."
msgstr ""
"Možná tě to překvapí, ale nenosím barevné kontaktní čočky jen proto, abych "
"vypadala jako Bug."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_PLAYER_A"
msgid ""
"I could see some people doing that. It would become like a calling card. "
"Would make for a pretty cool logo, actually."
msgstr ""
"Někteří lidé by to klidně udělali. Bylo by to tvoje poznávací znamení. "
"Vlastně i dobrý motiv na logo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_JUNIPER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_JUNIPER_A"
msgid "Okay, that does sound like a cool logo."
msgstr "Dobře, to zní jako skvělé logo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_PLAYER_B"
msgid "I'd probably do it if that was my dog."
msgstr "S takovým psem by mě to asi taky napadlo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_JUNIPER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_JUNIPER_B"
msgid ""
"You'd have to prepare yourself for a lot of annoying questions about "
"heterochromia."
msgstr "Pak by tě ale čekala spousta otravných dotazů ohledně heterochromie."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_PLAYER_C"
msgid "I've never seen a foxhound with heterochromia."
msgstr "Foxhounda s heterochromií vidím poprvé."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_JUNIPER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 21"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_JUNIPER_C"
msgid ""
"I've only seen huskies, oh, and border collies too. But when I saw her, I "
"knew she was meant to be mine."
msgstr ""
"Zatím jsem ji viděla jen u huskyů a border kolií. Ale když jsem uviděla Bug,"
" bylo mi jasné, že patří ke mně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 22"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"I first met her as a puppy at an adoption center I volunteer at from time to"
" time. And, from time to time, I adopt a dog... or two."
msgstr ""
"Poprvé jsem ji potkala jako štěně v útulku, kde občas vypomáhám jako "
"dobrovolnice. A občas si odtamtud adoptuju psa... nebo dva."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 23"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_PLAYER"
msgid "Our company's also looking to adopt... a new employee."
msgstr "Naše firma by taky ráda někoho adoptovala... nového zaměstnance."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 24"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_JUNIPER"
msgid "(laughs)"
msgstr "(smích)"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 25"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_JUNIPER"
msgid "You should read some books on the art of subtle manipulation."
msgstr "Měl by sis přečíst něco o umění nenápadné manipulace."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 26"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"But I'm okay with having a little chat now! You've broken through the "
"barriers of my introversion."
msgstr ""
"Teď už mi ale povídání nevadí. Podařilo se ti prolomit mou uzavřenost."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 27"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "How did you react when you first saw her?"
msgstr "Jak jsi reagovala, když jsi Bug poprvé uviděla?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_JUNIPER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 28"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_JUNIPER_OP01"
msgid "I think I screamed, and maybe... I even cried a little bit."
msgstr "Myslím, že jsem vykřikla a možná... jsem si i trochu poplakala."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_JUNIPER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 29"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_JUNIPER_OP01"
msgid "It's embarrassing."
msgstr "Je to trapné."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_PLAYER_OP01_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 30"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_PLAYER_OP01_A"
msgid "Yeah, that is a bit embarrassing."
msgstr "Jo, to je trochu trapné."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_JUNIPER_OP01_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 31"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_JUNIPER_OP01_A"
msgid "Hey! Don't be mean, I cry easily."
msgstr "Hej! Nesměj se mi, snadno se rozbrečím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_PLAYER_OP01_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 32"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_PLAYER_OP01_A"
msgid "You sure do."
msgstr "To teda."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_PLAYER_OP01_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 33"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_PLAYER_OP01_B"
msgid "I cried too, when I first met my dog. Those tiny pink paws!"
msgstr ""
"Při prvním setkání s mým psem mi taky tekly slzy. Ty maličké růžové tlapky!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_JUNIPER_OP01_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 34"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_JUNIPER_OP01_B"
msgid ""
"Always glad to meet a fellow crier. The world doesn't always understand us."
msgstr ""
"Vždycky ráda potkám někoho, kdo se taky snadno rozpláče. Svět nám ne vždycky"
" rozumí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_PLAYER_OP01_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 35"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_PLAYER_OP01_C"
msgid "It's only embarrassing if you allow it to be."
msgstr "Je to trapné, jen pokud to tak sama bereš."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_JUNIPER_OP01_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 36"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_JUNIPER_OP01_C"
msgid "Then I guess I shouldn't be embarrassed?"
msgstr "Takže se za to nemusím stydět?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_JUNIPER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 37"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_JUNIPER_OP01"
msgid ""
"That wasn't the last time I cried because of her. She had parvo, almost died"
" as a puppy."
msgstr ""
"Nebylo to naposledy, co jsem kvůli ní brečela. Měla parvovirózu a jako štěně"
" málem umřela."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_JUNIPER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 38"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_JUNIPER_OP01"
msgid "But she's four years old now, and she doesn't make me cry anymore."
msgstr "Ale teď jsou jí čtyři roky a už mě nerozbrečí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_JUNIPER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 39"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_JUNIPER_OP01"
msgid "So long as I don't imagine her suddenly dying."
msgstr "Pokud si nepředstavuji, že náhle umírá."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L40_PLAYER_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 40"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L40_PLAYER_OP02"
msgid "How many dogs do you have?"
msgstr "Kolik máš psů?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L41_JUNIPER_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 41"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L41_JUNIPER_OP02"
msgid "I have eight dogs. Currently. Like, I own them."
msgstr "Mám osm psů. Tedy momentálně osm vlastních."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L42_JUNIPER_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 42"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L42_JUNIPER_OP02"
msgid ""
"But there are always more dogs round my house. Some I just find and foster "
"until someone adopts them, some are currently undergoing training."
msgstr ""
"U mě doma bývá ještě víc psů. Některé najdu a dočasně se o ně starám, než je"
" někdo adoptuje. Jiní jsou u mě právě na výcviku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L43_PLAYER_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 43"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L43_PLAYER_OP02"
msgid "So, how many dogs are there at your house right now?"
msgstr "Kolik psů je tedy právě u tebe doma?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L44_JUNIPER_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 44"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L44_JUNIPER_OP02"
msgid "That's... a secret."
msgstr "To je... tajemství."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L45_PLAYER_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 45"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L45_PLAYER_OP03"
msgid "Why the name Bug?"
msgstr "Proč zrovna jméno Bug?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L46_JUNIPER_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 46"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L46_JUNIPER_OP03"
msgid ""
"Because she's a cuddle bug. She would always lie on my neck as a puppy."
msgstr "Protože se hrozně ráda mazlí. Jako štěně mi pořád ležela na krku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L47_JUNIPER_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 47"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L47_JUNIPER_OP03"
msgid ""
"But I had to train her not to do that so she doesn't accidentally suffocate "
"me."
msgstr "Musela jsem ji to ale odnaučit, aby mě náhodou neudusila."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L48_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 48"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L48_PLAYER"
msgid "You can ask questions too, you know."
msgstr "Víš, že se taky můžeš ptát?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L49_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 49"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L49_JUNIPER"
msgid "How about your dog? How long have you two been a team?"
msgstr "A co tvůj pes? Jak dlouho jste vy dva tým?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L50_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 50"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L50_PLAYER_A"
msgid "We have more of a victim and bully dynamic. And I'm the victim."
msgstr "U nás je to spíš vztah tyrana a oběti. Oběť jsem já."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L51_JUNIPER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 51"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L51_JUNIPER_A"
msgid "If you're the victim, that just means your dog doesn't respect you."
msgstr "Jestli jsi oběť, znamená to, že tě tvůj pes nerespektuje."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L52_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 52"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L52_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Well, I do feel like we're partners in crime."
msgstr "No, spíš jsme parťáci v lumpárnách."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L53_JUNIPER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 53"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L53_JUNIPER_B"
msgid "Aren't you more like buddy detectives, following the blood trail?"
msgstr "Nejste spíš dvojice detektivů, když spolu sledujete barvenou stopu?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L54_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 54"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L54_PLAYER_C"
msgid ""
"He responds to tone, not words. Intelligence: average. Loyalty: "
"inconveniently absolute. Still, more useful than most humans."
msgstr ""
"Reaguje na tón hlasu, ne na slova. Inteligence: průměrná. Věrnost: naprostá,"
" až je to někdy na obtíž. I tak je užitečnější než většina lidí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L55_JUNIPER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 55"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L55_JUNIPER_C"
msgid ""
"I don't think it's his intelligence that's average. More like your skills as"
" a handler."
msgstr ""
"Nemyslím, že má tvůj pes průměrnou inteligenci. Spíš budeš průměrný psovod."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L56_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 56"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L56_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"As I was observing you with your dog, I figured your blood-tracking skills "
"could use some improvement."
msgstr ""
"Když jsem vás dva pozorovala, řekla jsem si, že se v dosledu po barvě ještě "
"můžete zlepšit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L57_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 57"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L57_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"Bug's one of the best in the region, so I'm planning to enter a blood-"
"tracking competition soon."
msgstr ""
"Bug patří k nejlepším psům v kraji, a tak ji chci brzy přihlásit do soutěže "
"v dosledu po barvě."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L58_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 58"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L58_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"I prepared a testing ground for her a while ago, but it was too easy for "
"her. It has to be a real hunt."
msgstr ""
"Připravila jsem jí zkušební stopu, ale byla pro ni moc snadná. Potřebuje "
"skutečný lov."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L59_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 59"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L59_JUNIPER"
msgid "I think you should train on a real hunt too."
msgstr "Myslím, že i tobě prospěje trénink při skutečném lovu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L60_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 60"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L60_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid ""
"How do you prepare the tracking grounds for testing blood-tracking skills?"
msgstr "Jak připravuješ zkušební barvenou stopu?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L61_JUNIPER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 61"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L61_JUNIPER_OP01"
msgid ""
"The competition track is usually a mile long, with three 90-degree turns, in"
" areas with plenty of game, so I tried to copy that into \"my testing "
"ground\"."
msgstr ""
"Soutěžní barvená stopa obvykle měří asi 1,6 km, třikrát se stáčí v pravém "
"úhlu a vede územím s dostatkem zvěře. Tak jsem připravila i svou zkušební "
"stopu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L62_JUNIPER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 62"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L62_JUNIPER_OP01"
msgid ""
"I set up a track through an area with plenty of game. It's about a mile "
"long, with three 90-degree turns."
msgstr ""
"Vedu ji územím s dostatkem zvěře. Měří asi míli a třikrát se stáčí v pravém "
"úhlu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L63_JUNIPER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 63"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L63_JUNIPER_OP01"
msgid ""
"I leave it for at least 20 hours, and then start at a natural spot like a "
"deer trail."
msgstr ""
"Nechám ji alespoň dvacet hodin zestárnout. Začíná na přirozeném místě, třeba"
" na ochozu zvěře."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L64_JUNIPER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 64"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L64_JUNIPER_OP01"
msgid ""
"I'll drip or dab blood every foot, avoiding snow. I use up to 10 ounces of "
"frozen deer blood."
msgstr ""
"Přibližně každých třicet centimetrů kápnu nebo otisknu trochu barvy. Vyhýbám"
" se sněhu a spotřebuju až 300 ml zmrazené jelení krve."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L65_PLAYER_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 65"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L65_PLAYER_OP02"
msgid "Do you have any juicy gossip from the competitions?"
msgstr "Máš nějaké šťavnaté drby ze soutěží?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L66_JUNIPER_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 66"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L66_JUNIPER_OP02"
msgid ""
"I usually keep to myself and my dogs during competitions, but you know. Some"
" handlers get accused of sabotaging other people's dogs, you get a few "
"heartwarming underdog moments, there are suspicions of \"performance "
"enhancing\" techniques. The usual stuff."
msgstr ""
"Na soutěžích se většinou držím stranou jen se svými psy. Ale znáš to: občas "
"někdo obviní psovoda ze sabotáže, jindy překvapí outsider nebo se šušká o "
"nekalém vylepšování výkonu. Zkrátka běžná soutěž."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L67_PLAYER_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 67"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L67_PLAYER_OP02"
msgid "Sure... The usual stuff."
msgstr "Jasně... Obvyklé věci."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L68_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 68"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L68_PLAYER"
msgid "Do you really think that's usual?"
msgstr "Opravdu si myslíš, že je to obvyklé?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L69_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 69"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L69_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"When I was starting out, it was much easier to let Bug track blood at night."
msgstr "Když jsem začínala, Bug zvládala dosled po barvě v noci mnohem lépe."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L70_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 70"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L70_JUNIPER"
msgid "Fewer distractions, and somehow the dark felt like it helped."
msgstr "Bylo méně rušivých podnětů a zdálo se, že jí tma pomáhá."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L71_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 71"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L71_JUNIPER"
msgid "You could say it's my secret training technique."
msgstr "Dalo by se říct, že je to moje tajná tréninková technika."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Shoot and harvest an Elk between "
"{timeFrom}|displayAs(timeShort)-{timeTo}|displayAs(timeShort) with your Dog "
"companion active at the time of the shot."
msgstr ""
"Zastřelte a zpracujte wapitiho mezi {timeFrom}|displayAs(timeShort) a "
"{timeTo}|displayAs(timeShort). Pes musí být při výstřelu vaším aktivním "
"společníkem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission02 objective 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid ""
"Don't hit the Elk in its vitals (the heart or lungs) so that your Dog "
"companion can learn how to follow a longer blood trail."
msgstr ""
"Nezasáhněte wapitiho do životně důležitých orgánů, tedy srdce ani plic. Pes "
"se tak naučí sledovat delší barvenou stopu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Juniper challenged you to harvest more Wolverines than her. She said she'd "
"join Hearth & Hunt if you manage to beat her. It's just a friendly "
"competition with the best dog trainer around... No pressure!"
msgstr ""
"Juniper vás vyzvala, abyste ulovili víc rosomáků než ona. Pokud vyhrajete, "
"přidá se k Hearth & Hunt. Jen přátelská soutěž s nejlepší cvičitelkou psů v "
"okolí... Žádný tlak!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_NAME"
msgid "Friendly competition"
msgstr "Přátelská soutěž"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Juniper is sitting in a chair, just woken up
#. from a nap."
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"Taking a nap while the sun gently brushes your skin. It doesn't get much "
"better than this."
msgstr "Dřímat na slunci, které tě příjemně hřeje. Co víc si přát?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_JUNIPER"
msgid "So, now that you're back, how was your night hunting trip?"
msgstr "Takže, teď, když jsi zpátky, jaký byl tvůj noční lov?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_PLAYER_A"
msgid ""
"One thing's clear, {dog} will definitely NOT be participating in any blood "
"tracking competitions any time soon."
msgstr ""
"Jedno je jisté: {dog} se soutěže v dosledu po barvě jen tak nezúčastní."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Unless we're aiming for the consolation prize."
msgstr "Pokud necílíme na cenu útěchy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_JUNIPER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_JUNIPER_A"
msgid "Was it really that bad, huh? Well, patience is always a virtue."
msgstr "Bylo to opravdu tak zlé, co? No, trpělivost je vždycky ctnost."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PLAYER_B"
msgid ""
"You know what they say about a dog only being as good as their handler."
msgstr "Znáš to rčení, že pes je jen tak dobrý jako jeho psovod."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_PLAYER_B"
msgid "I'm afraid that might be the case here."
msgstr "Obávám se, že to tak může být i zde."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_JUNIPER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_JUNIPER_B"
msgid ""
"Don't be too harsh on yourself, working with dogs requires a lot of patience"
" and self-discipline."
msgstr ""
"Nesuď se tak přísně. Práce se psy vyžaduje spoustu trpělivosti a sebekázně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_PLAYER_C"
msgid "More data, fewer distractions. Darkness simplifies things."
msgstr "Více dat, méně rušivých podnětů. Tma všechno zjednodušuje."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_JUNIPER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_JUNIPER_C"
msgid "I told you! My secret techniques always work."
msgstr "Řekla jsem ti to! Moje tajné techniky vždy fungují."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_PLAYER"
msgid "How do you get any better when you've reached your level?"
msgstr "Jak se dál zlepšuješ, když už toho tolik umíš?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"If I can be totally honest with you, it feels like I've already mastered it "
"with Bug. I figure it's time to move on to something else."
msgstr ""
"Upřímně? Mám pocit, že s Bug už jsme dosled zvládly. Asi je čas pustit se do"
" něčeho dalšího."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_JUNIPER"
msgid "Or am I bigging myself up too much?"
msgstr "Nebo se moc vytahuju?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_PLAYER_A"
msgid "No. Being humble is overrated."
msgstr "Ne. Skromnost se přeceňuje."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_JUNIPER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_JUNIPER_A"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure about this Hearth & Hunt gig, I reckon life coaching may be "
"more up your alley."
msgstr ""
"S tou prací v Hearth & Hunt si nejsem jistá. Možná ti víc sedne práce "
"životního kouče."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_PLAYER_B"
msgid "You're a true dog whisperer, believe in yourself."
msgstr "Jsi opravdová psí našeptávačka. Věř si."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_JUNIPER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_JUNIPER_B"
msgid "I will! Thank you. It means a lot coming from you."
msgstr "Budu. Díky. Od tebe pro mě ta slova hodně znamenají."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_PLAYER_C"
msgid ""
"You're experienced and accomplished. Your self-confidence is more than "
"justified."
msgstr "Máš zkušenosti a výsledky. Tvoje sebevědomí je oprávněné."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_JUNIPER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_JUNIPER_C"
msgid "Can I cast you in the role of my inner voice?"
msgstr "Mohla bych si tě najmout jako svůj vnitřní hlas?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Juniper is opening up and being vulnerable. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"I haven't told anyone else about this yet, but I'm planning on training Bug "
"to be a service dog."
msgstr ""
"Ještě jsem to nikomu neřekla, ale chci Bug vycvičit jako asistenčního psa."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 21"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_PLAYER"
msgid "If only there was a company that could help you out..."
msgstr "Kdyby tu byla firma, která by ti pomohla..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 22"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"I can't believe I'm saying this, but I am actually considering it. Having "
"steady clientele and all that..."
msgstr ""
"Nemůžu uvěřit, že to říkám, ale vážně o tom uvažuju. Stálá klientela a "
"tak..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 23"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_JUNIPER"
msgid "You're starting to get under my skin, you know?"
msgstr "Začínáš se mi dostávat pod kůži, víš?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 24"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_PLAYER"
msgid ""
"I've been reading those books about subtle manipulation you recommended."
msgstr ""
"V poslední době čtu ty knihy o nenápadné manipulaci, které jsi mi "
"doporučila."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 25"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_JUNIPER"
msgid "(laughs)"
msgstr "(smích)"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 26"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "What kind of service dog would you train Bug to be?"
msgstr "Jakého asistenčního psa chceš z Bug vycvičit?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_JUNIPER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 27"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_JUNIPER_OP01"
msgid ""
"Well, there are different kinds of service dogs. There are mobility "
"assistance service dogs who help retrieve items and open doors, or medical "
"alert dogs."
msgstr ""
"Existují různé druhy asistenčních psů. Někteří pomáhají lidem s omezenou "
"pohyblivostí, třeba přinášejí předměty nebo otevírají dveře. Jiní upozorňují"
" na zdravotní potíže."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_JUNIPER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 28"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_JUNIPER_OP01"
msgid ""
"Did you know you can train a dog to recognize allergens in foods? And of "
"course you can train service dogs to help with psychiatric issues."
msgstr ""
"Víš, že můžeš psa vycvičit k rozpoznávání alergenů v potravinách? A "
"asistenční psi mohou pomáhat i lidem s psychickými potížemi."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 29"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "Right. So you haven't decided yet."
msgstr "Aha. Takže ses ještě nerozhodla."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_JUNIPER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 30"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_JUNIPER_OP01"
msgid "It's... personal."
msgstr "Je to... osobní."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 31"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_PLAYER"
msgid "So what else can I do to convince you?"
msgstr "Čím dalším tě ještě můžu přesvědčit?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 32"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_JUNIPER"
msgid "Beat me in a friendly competition and I'll sign away my soul."
msgstr "Poraz mě v přátelské soutěži a já upíšu svou duši."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 33"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"If you manage to harvest more wolverines than me, I'll join Hearth & Hunt."
msgstr "Jestli ulovíš víc rosomáků než já, přidám se k Hearth & Hunt."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 34"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_PLAYER"
msgid ""
"Just a friendly competition with the best dog trainer around? Bring it on!"
msgstr "Přátelská soutěž s nejlepší cvičitelkou psů široko daleko? Beru!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Shoot and harvest 3 Wolverines."
msgstr "Zastřelte a zpracujte tři rosomáky."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L01_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L01_JUNIPER"
msgid "Congratulations are in order!"
msgstr "Gratulace jsou na místě!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L02_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L02_JUNIPER"
msgid "I guess it's time for me to step out of my comfort bubble."
msgstr "Asi je čas opustit bezpečí své ulity."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L03_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L03_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"Next time you visit, bring a Hearth & Hunt contract. I'll happily sign it."
msgstr "Až přijdeš příště, přines smlouvu od Hearth & Hunt. Ráda ji podepíšu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Bug is lost! Or... maybe she's not, and Juniper is just panicking. A lone "
"Dall sheep was reportedly inexpertly shot by a hunter, but he couldn't find "
"the carcass. According to Juniper, that's probably not true, and the hunter "
"likely missed entirely. Now it's up to you to track and harvest the sheep, "
"as it keeps returning to areas with little food and water."
msgstr ""
"Bug se ztratila! Nebo možná ne a Juniper jen panikaří. Jeden lovec prý "
"špatně zasáhl osamělou ovci aljašskou, ale tělo nenašel. Juniper si myslí, "
"že ji nejspíš úplně minul. Ovce se stále vrací do oblasti, kde má málo "
"potravy a vody. Vystopujte ji a ulovte."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for translators" : "Parasomnias are disruptive
#. behaviors or events that affect your sleep."
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_NAME"
msgid "Parasomnias"
msgstr "Parasomnie"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Player returns to Juniper after finishing her
#. task. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"Oh hey! Are you here to claim my soul? I mean, to recruit me for Hearth & "
"Hunt."
msgstr ""
"Ahoj! Jdeš si vyzvednout moji duši? Tedy... získat mě pro Hearth & Hunt?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER"
msgid "That's right. Where's Bug?"
msgstr "Přesně tak. Kde je Bug?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"Bug's on an assignment nearby. There's a Dall sheep living way too far away "
"from the others, and there aren't enough good sources of food for it."
msgstr ""
"Bug plní poblíž úkol. Jedna ovce aljašská žije příliš daleko od stáda a nemá"
" tam dost potravy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"A hunter was tasked with harvesting the Dall sheep, but it got away. He told"
" me he'd hit it, but somehow I doubt it..."
msgstr ""
"Jeden lovec ji měl ulovit, ale unikla mu. Tvrdil, že ji zasáhl, jenže tomu "
"moc nevěřím…"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"Bug couldn't get a good track going, and the blood she did manage to find "
"was from a different animal."
msgstr ""
"Bug nedokázala zachytit pořádnou stopu a barva, kterou našla, patřila jinému"
" zvířeti."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"I'm following Bug on her locator. Which reminds me, I haven't checked on her"
" in a while."
msgstr ""
"Bug sleduju pomocí lokátoru. Vlastně jsem ji už nějakou dobu nekontrolovala."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "She clearly starts panicking during the last
#. sentence. Before the word \"panic\" she takes a deep breath. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"Oh. No problem. The signal's just gone down for a moment. There's no need "
"for me to... panic."
msgstr "Aha. To nic. Signál jen na chvíli vypadl. Není důvod... panikařit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER_A"
msgid "You may not feel like panicking. But I do."
msgstr "Tobě se možná ještě nechce panikařit. Mně ano."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Where else are we going to find a dog matching your heterochromia?"
msgstr "Kde bychom našli dalšího psa s očima, které ladí s tvýma?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_JUNIPER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_JUNIPER_A"
msgid "This isn't the time for jokes."
msgstr "Tohle není čas na vtipy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_PLAYER_B"
msgid ""
"No problem, okaaay. It definitely wouldn't mean we were panicking if we went"
" to check on her, right?"
msgstr ""
"Jistě, všechno v pořádku. Když ji půjdeme zkontrolovat, ještě to přece "
"neznamená, že panikaříme, že?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_JUNIPER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_JUNIPER_B"
msgid ""
"Exactly. No problem. Just a brisk walk down there. With occasional bursts of"
" sprinting."
msgstr ""
"Přesně tak. Jen se tam svižně projdeme. A občas poběžíme ze všech sil."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_PLAYER_C"
msgid ""
"The GPS signal could be acting up, but, well... it's not unusual for dogs to"
" get hurt."
msgstr "Může jen vypadávat signál GPS, ale... psi se také občas zraní."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_JUNIPER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_JUNIPER_C"
msgid "You are just vocalizing my worst fears."
msgstr "Teď říkáš přesně to, čeho se nejvíc bojím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_BUG
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_BUG"
msgid "(barks)"
msgstr "(štěká)"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_JUNIPER"
msgid "Bug!"
msgstr "Bug!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_JUNIPER"
msgid "There you are, where have you been? And where's your collar?"
msgstr "Bug! Tady jsi! Kde ses toulala? A kde máš obojek?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Maybe she just got sick of the constant monitoring."
msgstr "Možná už měla neustálého sledování dost."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_JUNIPER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_JUNIPER_A"
msgid "Don't pretend like you don't constantly monitor your dog."
msgstr "Nedělej, že svého psa pořád nekontroluješ."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_PLAYER_B"
msgid ""
"Hopefully she hasn't joined a dog gang. I've heard there's a really wild one"
" out there."
msgstr ""
"Snad se nepřidala k nějaké psí partě. Prý se tu potuluje jedna pořádně "
"divoká."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_JUNIPER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 21"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_JUNIPER_B"
msgid "I guess I shouldn't worry so much, and learn to trust her more."
msgstr "Asi bych se o ni neměla tolik bát. Musím jí víc věřit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 22"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_PLAYER_C"
msgid "Collars often get stuck, you're lucky she didn't get stuck with it."
msgstr "Obojky se často o něco zachytí. Ještě že s ním někde neuvízla i ona."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_JUNIPER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 23"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_JUNIPER_C"
msgid "You're right. I never got this worried about any other dog."
msgstr "Máš pravdu. O žádného jiného psa jsem ještě neměla takový strach."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_JUNIPER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 24"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_JUNIPER_C"
msgid "I guess she's what you'd call my soul dog."
msgstr "Asi je to moje spřízněná psí duše."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 25"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"But she's been on the go for a few hours and needs a rest. Would you mind "
"tracking that Dall sheep for me? I'll send you the location where the hunter"
" claims he last saw it."
msgstr ""
"Bug je ale už několik hodin na nohou a potřebuje si odpočinout. Můžeš za mě "
"tu ovci aljašskou vystopovat? Pošlu ti polohu místa, kde ji lovec údajně "
"viděl naposledy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Locate and harvest the lone Dall sheep."
msgstr "Najděte a ulovte osamělou ovci aljašskou."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L01_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Player returns to Juniper after finishing her
#. task. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L01_JUNIPER"
msgid "So, where do I sign?"
msgstr "Takže, kde se mám podepsat?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L02_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L02_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Here. And now I never have to see you again!"
msgstr "Tady. A teď už tě nikdy nemusím vidět!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L03_JUNIPER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L03_JUNIPER_A"
msgid "Hey! You'll come crawling back when you need help with your dog."
msgstr "Jen počkej, až budeš potřebovat pomoct se svým psem. Hned se vrátíš."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L04_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L04_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Right here. Welcome to the Hearth & Hunt family!"
msgstr "Podepiš se tady. Vítej v rodině Hearth & Hunt!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L05_JUNIPER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L05_JUNIPER_B"
msgid ""
"Oh no, is the Hearth & Hunt one of those companies that refer to themselves "
"as a \"family\"?"
msgstr ""
"Ale ne. Hearth & Hunt je jedna z těch firem, které si říkají „rodina“?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L06_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L06_PLAYER_B"
msgid ""
"Technically, it is a family. Hearth after the mother, Hunt after the father,"
" and all of their kids are involved."
msgstr ""
"Vlastně to rodina je. Hearth má firma po matce, Hunt po otci a pracují v ní "
"všechny jejich děti."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L07_JUNIPER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L07_JUNIPER_B"
msgid "Really? Then maybe I'll gain something more than just new clients."
msgstr "Opravdu? Pak možná získám víc než jen nové klienty."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L08_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L08_PLAYER_C"
msgid "I'll have to streamline this process for the next recruit."
msgstr "U příštího nováčka budu muset nábor trochu zjednodušit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L09_JUNIPER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L09_JUNIPER_C"
msgid "Maybe the next recruit won't be as headstrong as me. Good luck."
msgstr "Třeba další nováček nebude tak tvrdohlavý jako já. Hodně štěstí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L10_JUNIPER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L10_JUNIPER"
msgid ""
"I'm glad I joined. I already have a few new contacts and a full schedule. "
"Feel free to drop by if you find time in your busy schedule."
msgstr ""
"Jsem ráda, že jsem se přidala. Už mám nové kontakty a plný kalendář. Až "
"budeš mít chvilku, zastav se."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L11_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L11_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "What kind of service dog would Bug be?"
msgstr "Jakého asistenčního psa chceš z Bug vycvičit?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L12_JUNIPER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "She is shy here, revealing something intimate
#. about herself. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L12_JUNIPER_OP01"
msgid "I would train her for... me."
msgstr "Cvičila bych ji pro... sebe."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L13_JUNIPER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L13_JUNIPER_OP01"
msgid "I have trouble with sleeping."
msgstr "Mám potíže se spaním."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L14_JUNIPER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L14_JUNIPER_OP01"
msgid "Aaand that's a euphemism for debilitating sleep paralysis."
msgstr ""
"Tedy... „potíže“ jsou slabé slovo. Trápí mě ochromující spánková paralýza."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L15_PLAYER_OP01_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L15_PLAYER_OP01_OP01"
msgid "How will Bug be able to help you with that?"
msgstr "Jak ti s tím Bug může pomoct?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L16_JUNIPER_OP01_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L16_JUNIPER_OP01_OP01"
msgid ""
"She's already helping. I probably start to breathe rapidly, and she senses "
"it."
msgstr "Už mi pomáhá. Asi začnu rychle dýchat a ona to pozná."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L17_JUNIPER_OP01_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L17_JUNIPER_OP01_OP01"
msgid "She usually comes to me and tries to wake me up."
msgstr "Většinou ke mně přijde a snaží se mě probudit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L18_JUNIPER_OP01_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L18_JUNIPER_OP01_OP01"
msgid "But I need her to be more forceful when she does that."
msgstr "Jen potřebuju, aby mě budila důrazněji."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L19_PLAYER_OP01_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L19_PLAYER_OP01_OP01"
msgid "How will you train her, when you're, you know, asleep?"
msgstr "Jak ji budeš trénovat, když budeš, víš, spát?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L20_JUNIPER_OP01_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L20_JUNIPER_OP01_OP01"
msgid ""
"(laughs) Yeah, that would be tough. I won't train her on myself, obviously. "
"I'll need the help of another sleeping human, or someone pretending to be "
"asleep."
msgstr ""
"(smích) To by bylo těžké. Na sobě ji samozřejmě cvičit nebudu. Potřebuju "
"někoho jiného, kdo bude spát nebo to bude předstírat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L21_PLAYER_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 21"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L21_PLAYER_OP01_OP02"
msgid "What is sleep paralysis?"
msgstr "Co je spánková paralýza?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L22_JUNIPER_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 22"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L22_JUNIPER_OP01_OP02"
msgid ""
"It's exactly what it sounds like, paralysis during sleep. It usually happens"
" when you're waking up or falling asleep. You're fully conscious, but you're"
" in full-body paralysis."
msgstr ""
"Je to stav, kdy při usínání nebo probouzení nemůžeš pohnout tělem, i když si"
" všechno uvědomuješ."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L23_JUNIPER_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 23"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L23_JUNIPER_OP01_OP02"
msgid ""
"And add some hallucinations to make it more fun. Usually some creepy "
"creature lurking in the corner of the room, or sitting on your chest."
msgstr ""
"A aby to bylo ještě zábavnější, můžeš mít halucinace. Třeba že v koutě číhá "
"nějaká příšera nebo ti sedí na hrudi."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L24_JUNIPER_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 24"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L24_JUNIPER_OP01_OP02"
msgid ""
"It might be genetic, or caused by sleep deprivation, or stress. But who "
"knows, really?"
msgstr ""
"Může to souviset s dědičností, nedostatkem spánku nebo stresem. Ale kdo ví?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L25_PLAYER_OP01_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 25"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L25_PLAYER_OP01_OP03"
msgid "Do you have some kind of recurring sleep paralysis \"demon\"?"
msgstr "Zjevuje se ti při spánkové paralýze nějaký stále stejný „démon“?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L26_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 26"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L26_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03"
msgid "I... don't like to talk about him."
msgstr "Já... o něm nerada mluvím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L27_PLAYER_OP01_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 27"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L27_PLAYER_OP01_OP03"
msgid "Not talking about something scary just makes it stronger."
msgstr "Když o něčem děsivém nemluvíš, jen tomu dáváš větší moc."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L28_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 28"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L28_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03"
msgid "Or just triggers unnecessary anxiety."
msgstr "Nebo si tím jen zbytečně přidělám úzkost."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L29_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 29"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L29_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03"
msgid "But alright, I'll tell you about him."
msgstr "Ale dobře, povím ti o něm."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L30_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "it is a joke but she wants to make the player
#. scared"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 30"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L30_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03"
msgid ""
"Just a warning. When I talk about him to other people, he visits them at "
"night."
msgstr "Ale varuju tě: když o něm někomu povím, v noci ho navštíví."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L31_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 31"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L31_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03"
msgid "Are you sure you still want to hear about him?"
msgstr "Pořád o něm chceš slyšet?"

#. Key:
#. KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L32_PLAYER_OP01_OP03_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 32"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L32_PLAYER_OP01_OP03_OP01"
msgid "Yes. I doubt he'll be \"visiting\" me."
msgstr "Ano. Pochybuju, že mě „navštíví“."

#. Key:
#. KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L33_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 33"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L33_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03_OP01"
msgid "Don't say I didn't warn you!"
msgstr "Neříkej, že jsem tě nevarovala!"

#. Key:
#. KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L34_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 34"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L34_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03_OP01"
msgid ""
"I fall asleep pretty quickly. After some time, I feel like I'm wide awake, "
"but I'm dreaming."
msgstr ""
"Usnu poměrně rychle. Po chvíli mám pocit, že jsem úplně vzhůru, ale pořád "
"sním."

#. Key:
#. KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L35_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 35"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L35_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03_OP01"
msgid "And I can't move. No matter how much I try."
msgstr "A nemůžu se pohnout, ať se snažím sebevíc."

#. Key:
#. KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L36_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 36"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L36_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03_OP01"
msgid ""
"Then I hear breathing. And not the calm breathing of a dog sleeping without "
"a worry in its head, no."
msgstr ""
"Pak uslyším dech. Jenže to není klidné oddychování psa, který bezstarostně "
"spí."

#. Key:
#. KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L37_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 37"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L37_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03_OP01"
msgid ""
"It's raspy, heavy breathing that's getting closer. And sometimes that's it. "
"If I'm lucky."
msgstr ""
"Je to těžké, chraplavé dýchání, které se pořád přibližuje. Někdy tím všechno"
" skončí. Pokud mám štěstí."

#. Key:
#. KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L38_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 38"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L38_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03_OP01"
msgid ""
"Other times it whistles. Just a stupid tune that would sound silly in any "
"other situation."
msgstr "Jindy si píská. Nějakou hloupou melodii, která by jindy zněla směšně."

#. Key:
#. KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L39_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 39"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L39_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03_OP01"
msgid ""
"And in the worst ones, he gets closer and sits on my chest. He's pleading "
"with me to lend him my teeth. He's begging, but he isn't going to wait for "
"permission."
msgstr ""
"V nejhorších snech přijde až ke mně a sedne si mi na hruď. Prosí, abych mu "
"půjčila své zuby. Žadoní, ale na svolení čekat nebude."

#. Key:
#. KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L40_PLAYER_OP01_OP03_OP01_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 40"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L40_PLAYER_OP01_OP03_OP01_A"
msgid "That doesn't sound as bad as I thought it would be."
msgstr "To zní míň hrozně, než by člověk čekal."

#. Key:
#. KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L41_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03_OP01_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 41"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L41_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03_OP01_A"
msgid ""
"Check out the tough guy over here. Or is it just that you want to sound "
"tough?"
msgstr "No vida, máme tu drsňáka. Nebo se tak jen snažíš znít?"

#. Key:
#. KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L42_PLAYER_OP01_OP03_OP01_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 42"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L42_PLAYER_OP01_OP03_OP01_B"
msgid "Consider me scared."
msgstr "Tak teď už mám strach."

#. Key:
#. KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L43_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03_OP01_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 43"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L43_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03_OP01_B"
msgid "See? I warned you!"
msgstr "Vidíš? Varovala jsem tě!"

#. Key:
#. KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L44_PLAYER_OP01_OP03_OP01_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 44"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L44_PLAYER_OP01_OP03_OP01_C"
msgid ""
"Nightmares about teeth are common. They may signify anxiety about your "
"perception of yourself, or your vitality."
msgstr ""
"Sny o zubech jsou běžné. Někdy souvisejí s obavami o vlastní zdraví nebo o "
"to, jak se vidíš."

#. Key:
#. KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L45_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03_OP01_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 45"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L45_JUNIPER_OP01_OP03_OP01_C"
msgid "Okay, calm down Freud. My teeth are pretty healthy."
msgstr "Klid, Freude. Moje zuby jsou v pořádku."

#. Key:
#. KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L46_PLAYER_OP01_OP03_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 46"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L46_PLAYER_OP01_OP03_OP02"
msgid "No, I have enough monsters of my own to deal with."
msgstr "Ne, vlastních příšer mám dost."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L47_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 47"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L47_PLAYER"
msgid "Suddenly I'm glad I just have normal post-apocalyptic nightmares."
msgstr ""
"Najednou mi moje obyčejné postapokalyptické noční můry připadají docela "
"snesitelné."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L48_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue02 line 48"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L48_PLAYER"
msgid "Take care, Juniper."
msgstr "Opatruj se, Juniper."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L01_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Angel calls to player after they manage to
#. recruit Juniper to Hearth & Hunt. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue03 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L01_ANGEL"
msgid "Have you recruited Juniper Crane, the dog trainer?"
msgstr "Podařilo se vám získat cvičitelku psů Juniper Crane?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L02_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue03 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L02_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"Finally. She took forever to decide. She also ignored all my e-mails. How "
"did you manage to persuade her?"
msgstr ""
"Konečně. Rozhodovala se věčnost a všechny moje e-maily ignorovala. Jak se "
"vám ji podařilo přesvědčit?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L03_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue03 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L03_ANGEL"
msgid "You know what? I don't care. You don't have to answer that."
msgstr "Vlastně mi to neříkejte. Odpovídat nemusíte."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L01_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "he is genuinely trying to think what he
#. forgot of"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue04 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L01_ANGEL"
msgid "You can help the others now. And... I forgot something, what was it?"
msgstr "Teď můžete pomoct ostatním. A... na něco jsem zapomněl. Na co?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L02_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "he doesn't say it like he means it"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue04 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L02_ANGEL"
msgid "Oh! Good job."
msgstr "Aha! Dobrá práce."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO05_L01_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "After player finishes tasks from all the
#. NPCs, Angel calls them. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory01 Mission04 Dialogue05 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY01_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO05_L01_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"Seems like you're done with New Laurentia, so what are you waiting for? My "
"sister, Pandora Hearth, is already impatiently awaiting your arrival at "
"Kilimaya Reserve."
msgstr ""
"Zdá se, že v New Laurentia už máte všechno hotové. Na co čekáte? Moje sestra"
" Pandora Hearth vás už netrpělivě očekává v Kilimaya Reserve."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Patrick Harper has been a member of Hearth & Hunt for a long time, and he's "
"a huge fan. He wants to participate in a competition for members, but he "
"doesn't have time with all the promotions he's planning for New Laurentia. "
"He's relying on you to take on the assignment on scopes."
msgstr ""
"Patrick Harper je dlouholetý nadšený člen Hearth & Hunt. Rád by se zúčastnil"
" členské soutěže, ale má plné ruce práce s propagací New Laurentia. Úkol "
"zaměřený na mířidla proto přenechává vám."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_NAME"
msgid "Crystal clarity"
msgstr "Jasný obraz"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for translators" : "Joke on \"galaxies\" you get on
#. TikTok Live. "
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Patrick is working on his phone when the
#. player meets him. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_PATRICK"
msgid "\"You should try to get more galaxies.\" Hmmm."
msgstr "\"Měl byste se pokusit získat více galaxií.\" Hmmm."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "Lexa is supposed to be Alexa. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"I don't get this app. Lexa, what's a \"galaxy\" if it isn't a system of "
"stars...?"
msgstr ""
"Nerozumím této aplikaci. Lexo, co je to \"galaxie\", když to není soustava "
"hvězd...?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_PLAYER"
msgid "Do you need a hand?"
msgstr "Nepotřebujete pomoct?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PATRICK"
msgid "Oh my stars, you startled me there for a moment, buddy."
msgstr "U všech hvězd, z tebe jsem se na chvíli pořádně lekl!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"I'm trying to set up a livestream, to welcome a new Hearth & Hunt "
"representative, and I asked my grandchild to write me instructions, but I "
"don't understand it at all."
msgstr ""
"Snažím se připravit živé vysílání na přivítání nového zástupce Hearth & "
"Hunt. Vnouče mi sepsalo návod, ale já se v něm vůbec nevyznám."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during VO"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"Look at this: a list of forbidden words. \"Ew\"? Why is \"ew\" forbidden? Is"
" it an abbreviation of something nasty?"
msgstr ""
"Podívej se na tohle: seznam zakázaných slov. „Fuj“? Proč je „fuj“ zakázané? "
"Je to zkratka něčeho sprostého?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Aren't you a little too old to be dealing with all this?"
msgstr "Nejste už na tohle všechno trochu starý?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PATRICK_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PATRICK_A"
msgid "I'm not too old, I'm at my peak! Just like my granddaughter Susan."
msgstr ""
"Nejsem příliš starý, jsem na vrcholu sil! Stejně jako moje vnučka Susan."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Your Lexa is about to have a busy day."
msgstr "Vaše Lexa bude mít rušný den."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PATRICK_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PATRICK_B"
msgid "You can bet the farm on that!"
msgstr "Na to se můžeš spolehnout!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_PLAYER_C"
msgid ""
"It can be read as an expression of disgust and it may be treated as "
"bullying."
msgstr "Může to vyjadřovat znechucení a někdo to může považovat za šikanu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_PATRICK_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_PATRICK_C"
msgid "Well, butter my biscuit! Seems I have a lot to learn."
msgstr "No vida! Ještě se mám co učit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"Still, I'll need to figure this out before the Hearth & Hunt rep gets here."
msgstr "Přesto to musím vyřešit, než se sem dostane zástupce Hearth & Hunt."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_PLAYER"
msgid "What if... I'm the rep?"
msgstr "Co když... právě já zastupuju Hearth & Hunt?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_PATRICK"
msgid "Well, I'll be darned. I've gone and made a fool of myself, haven't I?"
msgstr "No to mě podrž. Právě jsem ze sebe udělal pěkného hlupáka, co?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Patrick has a roaring laughter. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_PATRICK"
msgid "I'm Patrick Harper, the local warden. Some call me the \"Mayor\"! Hahah."
msgstr ""
"Jsem Patrick Harper, místní správce rezervace. Někteří mi říkají „starosta“!"
" Haha."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_PATRICK"
msgid "I've been looking forward to this meeting! As you can probably tell..."
msgstr "Na naše setkání jsem se těšil! To asi poznáš..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_PATRICK"
msgid "So, you're here to help me with the promotion of New Laurentia?"
msgstr "Takže mi máš pomoct s propagací New Laurentia?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_PATRICK"
msgid "You guys work fast! I only sent the request last week."
msgstr ""
"Vy v Hearth & Hunt pracujete rychle! Žádost jsem poslal teprve minulý týden."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"That's what I like about smaller companies. It feels like I belong to "
"something."
msgstr "To se mi na menších firmách líbí. Mám pocit, že k něčemu patřím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 21"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"Or maybe you came so fast because I'm already a \"golden member\" on the "
"forum?"
msgstr ""
"Nebo jsi možná tady tak rychle, protože už jsem „zlatým členem“ na fóru?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 22"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_PLAYER_A"
msgid "I don't even know what that means."
msgstr "Ani nevím, co to znamená."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_PATRICK_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 23"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_PATRICK_A"
msgid ""
"Well, I'm not sure either, but you can get a different frame for your avatar"
" in the forums when you comment a lot."
msgstr ""
"Taky přesně nevím. Když ale na fóru hodně přispíváš, dostaneš jiný rámeček k"
" profilovému obrázku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_PATRICK_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 24"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_PATRICK_A"
msgid "I thought it carried some weight, but probably not..."
msgstr "Myslel jsem, že to má nějakou váhu, ale asi ne..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 25"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Oh yes! Golden members are our TOP priority!"
msgstr "Ach ano! Zlatí členové jsou naší NEJVYŠŠÍ prioritou!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_PATRICK_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Malachi is pronounced as MAL-uh-kye"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 26"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_PATRICK_B"
msgid ""
"I knew it! And Malachi was laughing at me for trying to reach the gold!"
msgstr "Já to věděl! A Malachi se mi smál, že usiluju o zlaté členství!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 27"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_PLAYER_C"
msgid "I don't prioritize my time based on arbitrary digital badges."
msgstr "Neurčuju, komu věnovat čas, podle nějakých digitálních odznaků."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_PATRICK_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 28"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_PATRICK_C"
msgid ""
"Well, that's good! Means you value every Hearth & Hunt member the same."
msgstr ""
"No to je dobrý! Znamená to, že si každého člena Hearth & Hunt vážíš stejně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_PATRICK_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 29"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_PATRICK_C"
msgid "But it also means I lost my bet with Malachi..."
msgstr "Ale také to znamená, že jsem prohrál sázku s Malachim..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 30"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"I'm a huge Hearth & Hunt supporter. Hunters should connect and communicate "
"more."
msgstr ""
"Jsem velkým příznivcem Hearth & Hunt. Myslivci by se měli více propojovat a "
"komunikovat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 31"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"To get to the point, which isn't my strongest suit, hahaha, I need help with"
" promoting the reserve. Not a lot of hunters come by, for some reason."
msgstr ""
"Přejdu k věci — i když stručnost není moje silná stránka, haha. Potřebuju "
"pomoc s propagací rezervace. Z nějakého důvodu sem moc lovců nejezdí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 32"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"My friend Malachi, who I met thanks to Hearth & Hunt, suggested I ask for "
"help and... here you are!"
msgstr ""
"Přítel Malachi, kterého znám díky Hearth & Hunt, mi poradil, ať požádám o "
"pomoc. A teď jsi tady!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 33"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"There's this monthly forum contest and buddy, we have to win it for New "
"Laurentia."
msgstr ""
"Na fóru každý měsíc pořádají soutěž. A my ji pro New Laurentia musíme "
"vyhrát!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 34"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"The grand prix award is huge. The promo, the money, the gear. We could use "
"it all, but mainly the promo!"
msgstr ""
"Hlavní cena je skvělá: reklama, peníze a vybavení. Všechno by se hodilo, "
"hlavně ta reklama!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 35"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"The forum lists three specific scopes to use and send feedback. Sounds easy "
"enough."
msgstr ""
"Na fóru chtějí vyzkoušet tři konkrétní mířidla a poslat hodnocení. To zní "
"jednoduše."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "TykTyk as in Tiktok"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 36"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"This one's all yours, buddy! I have to set up a TykTyk account for New "
"Laurentia. It's gonna be a wild night!"
msgstr ""
"Tohle je celé tvoje, kamaráde! Musím si založit účet TykTyk pro New "
"Laurentia. Bude to divoká noc!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Harvest an animal using a bow sight."
msgstr "Ulovte a zpracujte zvíře s použitím zaměřovače na luku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 objective 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid "Harvest an animal using a crossbow sight."
msgstr "Ulovte a zpracujte zvíře s použitím zaměřovače na kuši."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission01 objective 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03"
msgid "Harvest an animal with a bolt-action rifle without using a scope."
msgstr "Ulovte a zpracujte zvíře opakovací kulovnicí bez puškohledu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Patrick is still knee-deep in creating videos for New Laurentia. It sounds "
"like he's having problems with Regina, but doesn't want to talk about it. "
"For this video, he wants to make Wild turkeys the main stars, he just needs "
"you to get them closer."
msgstr ""
"Patrick má pořád plné ruce práce s videi o New Laurentia. Zdá se, že si s "
"Reginou zrovna nerozumí, ale mluvit o tom nechce. Hlavními hvězdami nového "
"videa mají být krocani. Potřebuje jen, abyste je přilákali ke kameře."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_NAME"
msgid "Talk turkey to me"
msgstr "Krocaní řeči"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Patrick is making a video, as if he is trying
#. to make a \"vlog intro\". "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"What's up, guys? Welcome back to \"In Nature With Patrick,\" this time I'll "
"show you some hidden gems of New Laurentia!"
msgstr ""
"Ahoj všichni! Vítejte u dalšího dílu „In Nature With Patrick“. Dnes vám "
"ukážu skrytá zákoutí New Laurentia!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "takes the phone away, unhappy with the result"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PATRICK"
msgid "Not good, not good... Something's missing..."
msgstr "Ne, to není ono... Něco tomu chybí..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"Hey, buddy! You hear what I'm cooking here? I need some constructive "
"feedback."
msgstr "Ahoj! Slyšíš ten úvod? Potřebuju konstruktivní připomínky."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER_A"
msgid ""
"Honestly? Don't change a thing. Bizarre intros are all the rage these days."
msgstr "Upřímně? Nic neměňte. Ujeté úvody teď frčí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_PATRICK_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_PATRICK_A"
msgid ""
"Bizarre? That's not really the vibe I was going for, but if you say so..."
msgstr "Ujeté? O to jsem zrovna neusiloval, ale když myslíš..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Maybe a little bit less energy?"
msgstr "Možná trochu ubrat na nadšení?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_PATRICK_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_PATRICK_B"
msgid ""
"You're right. I need to \"chill\" a little bit, right? I thought making "
"videos would be easier."
msgstr ""
"Máš pravdu. Měl bych trochu zvolnit, co? Myslel jsem, že natáčení videí bude"
" snazší."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER_C"
msgid "\"In Nature With Patrick\" is a terrible name."
msgstr "„In Nature With Patrick“ je příšerný název."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_PATRICK_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_PATRICK_C"
msgid "I knew it! The name just doesn't have the right zhuzh."
msgstr "Já to věděl! Tomu názvu prostě chybí šťáva."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"I saw your scope feedback, thanks for that. See, this thing is keeping me "
"busy."
msgstr ""
"Viděl jsem tvoje hodnocení mířidel, díky. Víš, s natáčením mám teď plné ruce"
" práce."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"But now I know the basics of editing video and syncing it to the audio. I "
"feel pretty proud of myself, I have to say."
msgstr ""
"Ale už umím video sestříhat a sladit se zvukem. Musím říct, že jsem na sebe "
"docela hrdý."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"I'll have to persuade Malachi to set up an account for the Kilimaya Reserve "
"too."
msgstr "Ještě přemluvím Malachiho, aby založil účet i pro Kilimaya Reserve."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_PATRICK"
msgid "Have you... met my wife yet?"
msgstr "Ty už... znáš moji ženu?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "After his signature laughter he just sighs
#. emptily. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"How was she doing? Oh, never mind. I live with her, I should know, right? "
"Hahaha."
msgstr ""
"Jak se měla? Ale co se ptám, vždyť s ní bydlím. To bych měl vědět, ne? Haha."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "How did you two meet?"
msgstr "Jak jste se s Reginou poznali?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_PATRICK_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_PATRICK_OP01"
msgid "Ohohoo, you want to hear some ancient history? Where can I start..."
msgstr "Oho! Chceš slyšet dávnou historii? Kde jen začít..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_PATRICK_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_PATRICK_OP01"
msgid ""
"The year was 1973. We'd both volunteered at an animal rescue service when "
"the Alderwyn Forests caught fire. Just young volunteers, risking our lives."
msgstr ""
"Psal se rok 1973. Oba jsme pracovali jako dobrovolníci u záchranné služby "
"pro zvířata, když v Alderwyn Forests vypukl požár. Byli jsme mladí a "
"riskovali život."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_PATRICK_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_PATRICK_OP01"
msgid ""
"If you asked her, she'd remember the incident differently. Funny things, "
"memories, ain't they?"
msgstr ""
"Když se zeptáš jí, bude to vyprávět jinak. Paměť je zvláštní věc, viď?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_PATRICK_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_PATRICK_OP01"
msgid ""
"We were sitting in a helicopter, smelled like a week-old barbeque, the smoke"
" was rising, I remember the sun was as red as the fire itself. But I just "
"kept looking at her determined expression, as she faced the natural "
"catastrophe happening on the ground."
msgstr ""
"Seděli jsme ve vrtulníku a páchli jako týden staré grilované maso. Nad "
"krajinou se valil dým a slunce bylo rudé jako plameny. Já ale pořád sledoval"
" její odhodlanou tvář, když hleděla na tu pohromu pod námi."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_PATRICK_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_PATRICK_OP01"
msgid ""
"And then she told me that I shouldn't leave the helicopter that day under "
"any circumstances, because she'd had a dream I'd be bitten by a rabid dog."
msgstr ""
"Pak mi řekla, že ten den nesmím za žádnou cenu vystoupit z vrtulníku. Zdálo "
"se jí totiž, že mě pokouše pes se vzteklinou."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_PATRICK_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 21"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_PATRICK_OP01"
msgid ""
"Now, just think, I'd only known her for a couple of weeks! I thought she'd "
"lost her marbles breathing in all that smoke!"
msgstr ""
"A to jsme se znali jen pár týdnů! Myslel jsem, že jí z toho kouře "
"přeskočilo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_PATRICK_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 22"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_PATRICK_OP01"
msgid ""
"But covered in ash, with the wind in her hair and a fiercely determined "
"expression on her face, I trusted her. And I didn't get out of the "
"helicopter that day."
msgstr ""
"Byla celá od popela, vítr jí cuchal vlasy a ve tváři měla neústupné "
"odhodlání. Uvěřil jsem jí a z vrtulníku ten den nevystoupil."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_PATRICK_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 23"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_PATRICK_OP01"
msgid ""
"Which really did save my life! Another volunteer got bitten that day and "
"died..."
msgstr ""
"A to mi opravdu zachránilo život! Jiného dobrovolníka ten den pes pokousal a"
" on zemřel..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_PATRICK_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 24"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_PATRICK_OP01"
msgid ""
"It taught me an important lesson, always listen to your wife! Even if she "
"sounds batshit crazy."
msgstr ""
"Vzal jsem si z toho důležité ponaučení: vždycky poslouchej svou ženu! I když"
" to, co říká, zní naprosto šíleně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 25"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_PLAYER"
msgid "Yeah, you should probably ask her yourself..."
msgstr "Jo, na to byste se měl zeptat spíš jí..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 26"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"Hey, I have a favor to ask. I need to film some turkeys, but I need them "
"close to the camera. Can you call them close?"
msgstr ""
"Hele, potřebuju laskavost. Chci natočit krocany, ale musejí se dostat blízko"
" ke kameře. Přilákáš je?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 27"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"I did buy some drones recently, the only drawback is... I don't know how to "
"use them. I almost steered it into a lake, and another time..."
msgstr ""
"Nedávno jsem si koupil drony. Jenže... neumím s nimi létat. Jeden jsem málem"
" poslal do jezera a podruhé..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 28"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"I shouldn't even admit this, but another time a turkey completely bulldozed "
"my drone. It was a big guy."
msgstr ""
"To bych ani neměl přiznávat, ale jednou mi dron úplně zdemoloval krocan. "
"Pořádný kus!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 29"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_PATRICK"
msgid "The turkey was okay. But the drone didn't make it."
msgstr "Krocanovi se nic nestalo. Dron to ale nepřežil."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 30"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_PATRICK"
msgid "Anyway, let's get to work! Get your caller, and I'll grab my camera."
msgstr "Tak do práce! Vezmi vábničku, já popadnu kameru."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission02 objective 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid ""
"Call 3 Wild turkeys to a distance of {maxCallDistance}|displayAs(distance) "
"or less from you."
msgstr ""
"Pomocí vábničky přilákejte tři krocany divoké na vzdálenost nejvýše "
"{maxCallDistance}|displayAs(distance) od vás."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"The new assignment from the Hearth & Hunt forum. Patrick is supposed to "
"check out some gear from the competition, WildHeart, but he doesn't have "
"time, as usual. Too many social media websites for him to monitor!"
msgstr ""
"Na fóru Hearth & Hunt se objevil nový úkol. Patrick má vyzkoušet vybavení "
"konkurenční značky WildHeart, ale jako obvykle nemá čas. Musí přece sledovat"
" všechny své sociální sítě!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_GREAT_WAVE_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_GREAT_WAVE_READABLE"
msgid ""
"From Patrick Harper, to a friend who let me know that it's never too late to"
" change."
msgstr ""
"Od Patricka Harpera příteli, který mi ukázal, že na změnu není nikdy pozdě."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_NAME"
msgid "Competition espionage"
msgstr "Špionáž u konkurence"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Player returns to Patrick after they finished
#. the task for him. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"I captured the turkey at its most majestic. It was just shaking its wattle, "
"looking like it was going to attack!"
msgstr ""
"Podařilo se mi natočit krocana v celé jeho kráse. Potřásal lalokem a "
"vypadal, že každou chvíli zaútočí!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"I'm glad I found a partner in crime for my videos. I'd rather not bother my "
"wife with it."
msgstr ""
"Jsem rád, že mám parťáka na natáčení. Manželku tím radši obtěžovat nebudu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "Trouble in paradise?"
msgstr "Potíže v ráji?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PATRICK_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PATRICK_OP01"
msgid "I don't think you wanna hear about an old man's problems."
msgstr "Pochybuju, že chceš poslouchat problémy starého chlapa."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "Try me."
msgstr "Jen povídejte."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PATRICK_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Patrick calls her wife Regina Gigi"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PATRICK_OP01"
msgid ""
"Buddy, I'm going to need a cold one for this. I mean, we're changing. Me, "
"and Gigi too."
msgstr ""
"Kamaráde, na tohle si musím dát vychlazené pivo. Jde o to, že se měníme. Já "
"i Gigi."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "How did you change?"
msgstr "Jak jste se změnil?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PATRICK_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PATRICK_OP01"
msgid ""
"It started a year ago. Gigi was telling me I'm an old grandpa. It hurt, "
"'cause I'm not."
msgstr ""
"Začalo to před rokem. Gigi mi říkala, že jsem starý dědek. Dotklo se mě to, "
"protože jím nejsem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_PATRICK_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_PATRICK_OP01"
msgid ""
"For a long time now, I've felt like I haven't been being true to myself."
msgstr "Už dlouho mám pocit, že nežiju tak, jak bych chtěl."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PATRICK_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PATRICK_OP01"
msgid ""
"Didn't buy the clothes I liked. Why spend money on myself when I can spend "
"it on my children?"
msgstr ""
"Nekupoval jsem si oblečení, které se mi líbilo. Proč utrácet za sebe, když "
"můžu utratit peníze za děti?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_PATRICK_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_PATRICK_OP01"
msgid ""
"I wasn't as loud as I wanted to be, because it ain't polite, Gigi would tell"
" me."
msgstr ""
"Nedovolil jsem si být tak hlučný, jak bych chtěl. Gigi mi vždycky říkala, že"
" se to nesluší."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_PATRICK_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_PATRICK_OP01"
msgid ""
"I just want to laugh the loudest in the cinema and not be ashamed, you know?"
msgstr ""
"Chci se prostě v kině smát ze všech nejhlasitěji a nestydět se za to, "
"chápeš?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_PATRICK_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_PATRICK_OP01"
msgid ""
"So I just became the version of myself I always wanted to be. Is it too late"
" for that?"
msgstr ""
"Tak jsem se rozhodl být takový, jaký jsem vždycky chtěl být. Není na to už "
"pozdě?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_PLAYER_OP01_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_PLAYER_OP01_OP01"
msgid ""
"Are you sure you aren't going through a late mid-life crisis? Or maybe more "
"like an end-of-life crisis?"
msgstr ""
"Jste si jistý, že to není opožděná krize středního věku? Nebo spíš krize na "
"sklonku života?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_PATRICK_OP01_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_PATRICK_OP01_OP01"
msgid ""
"That's what Gigi says. Not just her, everybody! At this point, I don't even "
"know anymore."
msgstr ""
"To říká i Gigi. A nejen ona, říkají to všichni! Už sám nevím, co si mám "
"myslet."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_PLAYER_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_PLAYER_OP01_OP02"
msgid ""
"It's never too late to be who you really are. Unless you're trying to be a "
"teen pop star... then maybe it would be a bit too late."
msgstr ""
"Nikdy není pozdě být sám sebou. Leda byste se chtěl stát náctiletou popovou "
"hvězdou... Na to už možná trochu pozdě je."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_PATRICK_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_PATRICK_OP01_OP02"
msgid "Thanks, buddy! I feel like you'd support me doing anything..."
msgstr "Díky, kamaráde! Mám pocit, že bys mě podpořil úplně ve všem..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_PLAYER_OP01_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_PLAYER_OP01_OP03"
msgid ""
"Don't mention it. It's a very Western idea, that people over 60 should just "
"shrivel up and die."
msgstr ""
"Nemáte zač. Představa, že lidé po šedesátce mají jen chřadnout a čekat na "
"smrt, je typická pro Západ."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_PLAYER_OP01_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_PLAYER_OP01_OP03"
msgid ""
"In Japan, they have a term \"kanreki\". Which literally means \"return to "
"the calendar\"."
msgstr ""
"V Japonsku mají pojem „kanreki“. Doslova znamená „návrat ke kalendáři“."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_PLAYER_OP01_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_PLAYER_OP01_OP03"
msgid ""
"It's celebrated when a person turns sixty. It's a philosophy that embodies "
"rejuvenation and the beginning of a new life cycle, starting a new calendar."
msgstr ""
"Slaví se při šedesátých narozeninách. Symbolizuje nový začátek, další "
"životní cyklus a nový kalendář."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_PLAYER_OP01_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 21"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_PLAYER_OP01_OP03"
msgid ""
"Did you know that Hokusai made his most famous paintings after he was 60?"
msgstr "Víte, že Hokusai namaloval svá nejslavnější díla až po šedesátce?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_PATRICK_OP01_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 22"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_PATRICK_OP01_OP03"
msgid "I have no idea who that is, buddy. But... Thanks. It means a lot."
msgstr ""
"Nemám tušení, kdo to je, kamaráde. Ale... díky. Moc to pro mě znamená."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 23"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_PLAYER"
msgid "Did you see the new assignment on the Hearth & Hunt forum?"
msgstr "Viděl jste nový úkol na fóru Hearth & Hunt?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 24"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"Yeah, looks like the new challenge on the forum is to gather information "
"about their competition. Interesting. I guess they're gunning for WildHeart."
msgstr ""
"Jo, podle všeho máme zjistit něco o konkurenci. Zajímavé. Nejspíš mají "
"spadeno na WildHeart."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 25"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"Can you give me any insider information on Hearth & Hunt? My followers would"
" greatly appreciate it."
msgstr ""
"Nemáš nějaké zákulisní informace o Hearth & Hunt? Moji sledující by je "
"ocenili."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 26"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_PLAYER_A"
msgid "You mean your four followers?"
msgstr "Myslíte všechny čtyři sledující?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_PATRICK_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 27"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_PATRICK_A"
msgid "Well, yes... But where there's four, there's room for more!"
msgstr "No jo... Ale když jsou čtyři, může jich být i víc!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 28"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_PLAYER_B"
msgid ""
"No, sorry. I can't share anything. I shouldn't even be helping you in the "
"first place."
msgstr "Promiňte, nic vám prozradit nemůžu. Vlastně vám ani nemám pomáhat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_PATRICK_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 29"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_PATRICK_B"
msgid "I understand. I appreciate your honesty, buddy."
msgstr "Chápu. Cením si tvé upřímnosti, kamaráde."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 30"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_PLAYER_C"
msgid "I'm a lowly cog. No idea what's cooking in the kitchen."
msgstr "Jsem jen malé kolečko v soukolí. Nemám tušení, co se chystá."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_PATRICK_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 31"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_PATRICK_C"
msgid ""
"Really? Huh, that's a shame. Here I was thinking I was working with some big"
" cheese chief of department! Hahah."
msgstr ""
"Vážně? Škoda. A já myslel, že pracuju s někým z vedení celého oddělení! "
"Haha."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 32"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_PATRICK"
msgid "Anyways, we should get to work!"
msgstr "Každopádně se pusťme do práce!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 33"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_PLAYER"
msgid "May I ask: what are you working on?"
msgstr "Můžu se zeptat, na čem pracujete?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 34"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_PATRICK"
msgid "Social media search ops! Gathering intel, engaging with trolls..."
msgstr ""
"Pátrám na sociálních sítích! Sbírám informace, dohaduju se s trolly..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "LinkedBy as in LinkedIn"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 35"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"Well, there are 3 social networks I still need to sign up with. And, hey, "
"you still need to confirm my LinkedBy account."
msgstr ""
"Ještě se musím zaregistrovat na třech sociálních sítích. A ty mi pořád musíš"
" potvrdit účet na LinkedBy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue 01 line 36"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_PATRICK"
msgid "I wanna connect with Genevieve Hearth! Chop, chop!"
msgstr "Chci se spojit s Genevieve Hearth! Tak sebou hoď!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Harvest a Wood bison using the WildHeart Front Cover blind."
msgstr "Ulovte a zpracujte bizona lesního z úkrytu WildHeart Front Cover."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for translators" : "changed during localization
#. batch 2"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory03 Mission03 objective 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid ""
"Harvest a Northwestern gray wolf using the Primos Trigger Stick Gen3 Tall "
"Monopod shooting stick."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte vlka kanadského s použitím střelecké hole Primos Trigger "
"Stick Gen3 Tall Monopod."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Habitat enhancement is an important part of hunting—it's all about caring "
"for the well-being of animals and the nature that surrounds them. Regina "
"Harper is in charge of habitat enhancement in New Laurentia. She wants you "
"to broaden your horizons and learn more by creating a butterfly garden and "
"removing invasive plant species."
msgstr ""
"Péče o životní prostředí zvěře je důležitou součástí myslivosti. Jde o "
"zdraví zvířat i krajiny, v níž žijí. V New Laurentia ji má na starosti "
"Regina Harper. Chce vám ukázat další stránku této práce: založit motýlí "
"zahradu a odstranit invazní rostliny."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for translators" : "Latin name for Margined white
#. butterfly, it is a name for the quest"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_NAME"
msgid "Pieris marginalis"
msgstr "Pieris marginalis"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Player meets Regina for the first time. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_REGINA"
msgid "A wonderful, colorful day to you, representative."
msgstr "Přeju ti nádherný den plný barev!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER"
msgid "Hello, did you know I was going to visit today?"
msgstr "Dobrý den. Věděla jste, že dnes přijdu?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_REGINA"
msgid "You already visited me in a dream."
msgstr "Už se mi o tobě zdálo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_REGINA"
msgid ""
"Also, my husband keeps talking about you, like you're the biggest rock star "
"who ever graced New Laurentia with their presence. He loves Hearth & Hunt."
msgstr ""
"Můj manžel o tobě navíc pořád mluví, jako by do New Laurentia zavítala "
"největší rocková hvězda všech dob. Hearth & Hunt přímo zbožňuje."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_REGINA"
msgid "He even hung an official poster of your company in our living room."
msgstr "Dokonce nám v obýváku vyvěsil oficiální plakát vaší firmy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PLAYER"
msgid "I didn't know we sold merch. You're Ms. Harper, aren't you?"
msgstr "To prodáváme i suvenýry? Vy jste paní Harperová, že?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_REGINA"
msgid "In flesh and blood. And a little moss and mud."
msgstr "Osobně. A trochu umazaná od mechu a bláta."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER"
msgid ""
"I read in your file that you're an integral part of New Laurentia. The "
"beating heart."
msgstr ""
"V našem spisu stojí, že jste nepostradatelnou součástí New Laurentia. Jejím "
"tepajícím srdcem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_REGINA"
msgid ""
"Oh, Hearth & Hunt files compile compliments, do they? What else does my file"
" have to say?"
msgstr ""
"Takže Hearth & Hunt píše do spisů i lichotky? Co dalšího se o mně píše?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PLAYER_A"
msgid "That's it."
msgstr "To je vše."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_REGINA_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_REGINA_A"
msgid ""
"Such a shame. Just when I was in the mood to spread my feathers like a "
"peacock."
msgstr "Škoda. Už jsem se chtěla naparovat jako páv."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_PLAYER_B"
msgid "It mentions that you're ethereal and elusive, like a rare white moose."
msgstr "Píšou, že jste éterická a nepolapitelná jako vzácný bílý los."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_REGINA_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_REGINA_B"
msgid "(laughs wholeheartedly)"
msgstr "(srdečně se směje)"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_REGINA_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_REGINA_B"
msgid ""
"You don't have to try so hard to get me on your side. I'm nothing special."
msgstr "Nemusíš se tolik snažit získat si mou přízeň. Nejsem ničím výjimečná."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_PLAYER_C"
msgid ""
"It says you sustain ecosystems at their peak, and that they seek your "
"expertise to expand the benefits across regions."
msgstr ""
"Píšou, že udržujete ekosystémy ve výborném stavu a o vaše zkušenosti stojí i"
" v jiných regionech."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_PLAYER_C"
msgid ""
"Maybe you could write a book about conservation, with advice for others."
msgstr "Mohla byste o péči o přírodu napsat knihu s radami pro ostatní."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_REGINA_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_REGINA_C"
msgid ""
"A true, heartfelt compliment lifts the spirit like sunlight through the "
"mist."
msgstr "Upřímná pochvala zahřeje na duši jako slunce prorážející mlhu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_REGINA"
msgid ""
"I'm granting you permission to operate in my lands. We need to deal with "
"those intrusive plants."
msgstr ""
"Dávám ti svolení pracovat na mých pozemcích. Musíme si poradit s těmi "
"invazními rostlinami."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_REGINA"
msgid "Here, take this equipment and go to the location I'm sending you."
msgstr "Vezmi si tohle vybavení a vydej se na místo, které ti pošlu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_REGINA"
msgid ""
"I'll teach you how to build something, just because you can make the world a"
" more beautiful place, not because you have to."
msgstr ""
"Ukážu ti, jak vytvořit něco krásného. Ne proto, že musíš, ale protože tím "
"můžeš udělat svět o trochu hezčí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 21"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_REGINA"
msgid ""
"Everyone has free will, to do something to make this a better world. It's "
"just that not everyone decides to use it."
msgstr ""
"Každý má možnost svobodně se rozhodnout, že udělá svět lepším. Ne každý se "
"pro to ale rozhodne."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 22"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "Where do these invasive plants come from?"
msgstr "Odkud tyto invazní rostliny pocházejí?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_REGINA_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 23"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_REGINA_OP01"
msgid ""
"All it takes is a couple of seeds attaching themselves to your jacket as "
"you're traveling, darling."
msgstr "Stačí, když se ti při cestování zachytí pár semen na bundu, miláčku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_REGINA_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 24"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_REGINA_OP01"
msgid ""
"This is how new plants reach even the most remote areas of New Laurentia."
msgstr ""
"Tak se nové druhy rostlin dostávají i do nejodlehlejších koutů New "
"Laurentia."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_REGINA_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 25"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_REGINA_OP01"
msgid ""
"You can't really do anything about the source. You just take a deep breath, "
"accept the inevitable, then deal with it."
msgstr ""
"Jejich šíření úplně nezastavíš. Nezbývá než se s tím smířit a pak je "
"odstranit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 26"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_PLAYER"
msgid "I'll take care of it."
msgstr "Postarám se o to."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Find invasive plant species in the location highlighted on your Map and "
"remove them."
msgstr "Najděte na vyznačeném místě invazní druhy rostlin a odstraňte je."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission01 objective 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid "Create a butterfly garden."
msgstr "Založte motýlí zahradu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"Regina tells you about a recurring dream she has with a Moose begging her "
"for help in New Laurentia. She's sure the dream is significant, and wants to"
" help the animals, but her husband thinks it's just a dream. You've decided "
"to trust her and offer to help. The first step is to make more food "
"available for Moose, without White-tailed deer infringing on their "
"territory."
msgstr ""
"Regina vám vyprávěla o opakujícím se snu, v němž ji los v New Laurentia "
"prosí o pomoc. Je přesvědčená, že sen něco znamená, a chce losům pomoci. "
"Její manžel v něm ale žádný význam nevidí. Regině věříte a nabízíte jí "
"pomoc. Nejdřív je třeba losům zajistit více potravy a zabránit jelencům "
"běloocasým pronikat na jejich území."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 description01\nShown
#. when Player is rude to Regina"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"You've been rude to Regina by mocking her dream about sick Moose in the "
"area, and she doesn't want to cooperate with you anymore. Angel doesn't "
"appreciate you potentially ruining a good relationship with a member of "
"Hearth & Hunt and wants you to apologize."
msgstr ""
"Vysmáli jste se Reginině snu o nemocných losech v oblasti a ona už s vámi "
"nechce spolupracovat. Angel nechce, abyste poškodili vztah Hearth & Hunt s "
"důležitou spolupracovnicí. Žádá vás, abyste se omluvili."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 description02\nShown
#. when Player returns to Regina after being rude"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"Regina accepted your apology and wants you to help her with improving the "
"state of Moose in New Laurentia. The first step is to make more food "
"available for Moose, without White-tailed deer infringing on their "
"territory."
msgstr ""
"Regina přijala vaši omluvu a chce s vaší pomocí zlepšit situaci losů v New "
"Laurentia. Nejdřív jim musíte zajistit více potravy a zabránit jelencům "
"běloocasým pronikat na jejich území."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for translators" : "Latin name for Common wood-nymph
#. butterfly, name of a quest"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_NAME"
msgid "Cercyonis pegala"
msgstr "Cercyonis pegala"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Player visits Regina after they do a task for
#. her. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_REGINA"
msgid "Do you believe in the power of dreams?"
msgstr "Věříš v sílu snů?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Nah. I'm always being chased by men with chainsaws in my dreams."
msgstr "Ne. Mě ve snech pořád honí chlapi s motorovými pilami."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_REGINA_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_REGINA_A"
msgid ""
"Something is chasing you in reality as well. It just manifests differently "
"in your dreams."
msgstr ""
"Něco tě pronásleduje i ve skutečnosti. Ve snech to jen dostává jinou podobu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER_B"
msgid ""
"Totally! I have a dream dictionary, and sometimes I look up the meaning of "
"my last dream, if I remember it."
msgstr ""
"Rozhodně! Mám snář a občas v něm hledám význam svého posledního snu. Tedy "
"pokud si ho pamatuju."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_REGINA_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_REGINA_B"
msgid "Really? I'm so glad I've met another dream believer."
msgstr ""
"Opravdu? Jsem ráda, že jsem potkala někoho, kdo také věří, že sny něco "
"znamenají."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PLAYER_C"
msgid ""
"If you're asking whether dreams are significant, I don't think so, it's just"
" the brain sorting itself out during REM sleep."
msgstr ""
"Jestli se ptáte, zda sny něco znamenají, podle mě ne. Mozek si během REM "
"spánku jen třídí zážitky."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_REGINA_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_REGINA_C"
msgid ""
"Cold rationality, huh? Then you probably won't believe the dream I had."
msgstr "Chladný rozum, co? Pak mému snu asi neuvěříš."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_REGINA"
msgid "I have a moose visiting me in my dreams."
msgstr "Ve snech mě navštěvuje los."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_REGINA"
msgid "I walk across a mossy meadow and he appears. I freeze."
msgstr ""
"Ve snu jdu přes louku porostlou mechem. Najednou se objeví los a já ztuhnu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_REGINA"
msgid "He doesn't hesitate, and moves slowly towards me."
msgstr "Neváhá a pomalu se ke mně přibližuje."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_REGINA"
msgid ""
"I keep staring into his large glossy eyes which are filled with a deep "
"despair, and as he gets closer..."
msgstr ""
"Dívám se do jeho velkých lesklých očí plných hlubokého zoufalství. A když "
"přijde blíž..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_REGINA"
msgid "...they swallow me like a lake."
msgstr "...pohltí mě jako hluboké jezero."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_REGINA"
msgid "I believe something is wrong with the moose of New Laurentia."
msgstr "Myslím, že s losy v New Laurentia je něco v nepořádku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_REGINA"
msgid "And they need our help."
msgstr "A potřebují naši pomoc."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Maybe you need help."
msgstr "Možná potřebujete pomoc spíš vy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_REGINA_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_REGINA_A"
msgid "Maybe I do."
msgstr "Možná ano."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_REGINA_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_REGINA_A"
msgid "Your emptiness must be painful."
msgstr "Ta prázdnota v tobě musí bolet."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_REGINA_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "In this branch of dialogue Player must wait
#. 24 hours to come and apologize"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_REGINA_A"
msgid "I will deal with this myself. Please leave."
msgstr "Postarám se o to sama. Prosím, odejdi."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Okay. What do you want me to do?"
msgstr "Dobře. Co pro vás můžu udělat?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_REGINA_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_REGINA_B"
msgid "I sensed I could rely on you the moment I saw you."
msgstr "Cítila jsem, že se na tebe můžu spolehnout, když jsem tě uviděla."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 21"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_PLAYER_C"
msgid "Just because of a dream?"
msgstr "Jen kvůli snu?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_REGINA_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 22"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_REGINA_C"
msgid "There's more to it. Moose are behaving strangely across the wetlands."
msgstr "Je toho víc. Losi se v mokřadech chovají podivně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 23"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_PLAYER_C"
msgid "You could have started with that."
msgstr "Tím jste měla začít."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_REGINA_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 24"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_REGINA_C"
msgid "Dreams hold as much water as any other evidence, darling."
msgstr "Sny mají stejnou váhu jako kterýkoli jiný důkaz, miláčku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 25"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_REGINA"
msgid ""
"My husband doesn't believe me. He's been avoiding me like... poison ivy."
msgstr "Můj manžel mi nevěří. Vyhýbá se mi jako... škumpě jedovaté."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 26"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_REGINA"
msgid ""
"He turns a deaf ear to the sick moose and just keeps on splashing out on new"
" clothes, glasses... Always lost in his phone. Snapping pictures of himself,"
" like nothing else exists."
msgstr ""
"Nemocné losy vůbec nevnímá. Jen utrácí za nové oblečení a brýle... Věčně "
"hledí do telefonu a fotí sám sebe, jako by nic jiného neexistovalo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 27"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_REGINA"
msgid "I feel like our symbiosis just vanished."
msgstr "Mám pocit, že naše symbióza prostě zmizela."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 28"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_REGINA"
msgid "Sorry, you didn't need to know about that."
msgstr "Promiň, tím jsem tě neměla zatěžovat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 29"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "Now I'm curious, tell me more."
msgstr "Teď mě to zajímá. Povězte mi víc."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_REGINA_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 30"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_REGINA_OP01"
msgid ""
"(sighs) Where do I even begin? The stranger he's become? Or the way he's "
"tethered to that brick in his hands?"
msgstr ""
"(povzdechne si) Kde vůbec začít? Tím, jak se z něj stal cizí člověk? Nebo "
"tou cihlou, od které se nedokáže odtrhnout?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_PLAYER_OP01_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 31"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_PLAYER_OP01_OP01"
msgid "A personality takeover?"
msgstr "Úplná změna osobnosti?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_REGINA_OP01_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 32"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_REGINA_OP01_OP01"
msgid ""
"If you've already met him, maybe you noticed his... extravagant clothing?"
msgstr ""
"Pokud už ho znáš, možná ti padlo do oka jeho... extravagantní oblečení."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_REGINA_OP01_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 33"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_REGINA_OP01_OP01"
msgid ""
"It could've been worse, but he never cared about his appearance before. Now "
"his beard is waxed, sculpted with tiny combs I didn't even know existed."
msgstr ""
"To by ještě šlo, jenže dřív mu na vzhledu vůbec nezáleželo. Teď si vousy "
"voskuje a upravuje drobnými hřebínky, o kterých jsem ani nevěděla, že "
"existují."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_REGINA_OP01_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 34"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_REGINA_OP01_OP01"
msgid "He gets to 70, and now he suddenly cares?"
msgstr "Blíží se k sedmdesátce a najednou mu na vzhledu záleží?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_PLAYER_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 35"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_PLAYER_OP01_OP02"
msgid "An obsession with technology?"
msgstr "Posedlost technologií?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_REGINA_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 36"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_REGINA_OP01_OP02"
msgid ""
"He keeps collecting gadgets, spending hours late into the night tinkering, "
"figuring them out."
msgstr ""
"Pořád si pořizuje nové přístroje a celé noci si s nimi hraje, aby přišel na "
"to, jak fungují."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_REGINA_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 37"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_REGINA_OP01_OP02"
msgid ""
"I've never cared about his spending habits, but isn't three drones a little "
"bit excessive?"
msgstr ""
"Nikdy jsem se nezajímala o jeho utrácení, ale nejsou tři drony trochu "
"přehnané?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_PLAYER_OP01_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 38"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_PLAYER_OP01_OP03"
msgid "I shouldn't pry anymore."
msgstr "Raději se nebudu dál vyptávat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 39"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_PLAYER"
msgid "How can I help?"
msgstr "Jak mohu pomoci?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L40_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 40"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L40_REGINA"
msgid ""
"Let's start by nurturing the moose near that swamp. Little by little, we'll "
"improve their situation."
msgstr ""
"Začněme péčí o losy poblíž bažiny. Krok za krokem zlepšíme jejich situaci."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L41_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 41"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L41_REGINA"
msgid ""
"And to do that, we need to help things along a little, by stopping the "
"white-tailed deer who are spreading too much and taking over the moose's "
"resources."
msgstr ""
"Musíme trochu pomoci přírodě a omezit jelence běloocasé. Příliš se rozšířili"
" a zabírají losům potravu i prostor."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L01_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Angel calls to the player after they've
#. insulted Regina and she sent them away. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue02 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L01_ANGEL"
msgid "Did you insult Regina Harper?"
msgstr "Regina Harper se kvůli vám urazila?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L02_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue02 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L02_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"From what I've heard, you're going to have to perform a sage cleansing to "
"avoid your house getting cursed."
msgstr ""
"Podle toho, co jsem slyšel, budete muset doma vykuřovat šalvějí, aby váš dům"
" nestihla kletba."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L03_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue02 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L03_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"But the curse is the least of your worries. You should be more concerned "
"with my frustration."
msgstr ""
"Kletba je ale ten nejmenší problém. Víc by vás měl znepokojovat můj hněv."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L04_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue02 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L04_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"She's a valuable asset, and we don't want to lose her because our employee "
"can't keep it together."
msgstr ""
"Regina je pro nás důležitou partnerkou. Nechceme o ni přijít jen proto, že "
"se náš člověk nedokáže ovládnout."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Wait for a day and try to talk to Regina again."
msgstr "Počkejte den a zkuste si znovu promluvit s Reginou."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L01_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L01_PLAYER"
msgid "Hi, Regina. I apologize for before. I'm in no position to judge you."
msgstr ""
"Dobrý den, Regino. Omlouvám se za minule. Bylo ode mě nefér vás soudit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L02_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L02_REGINA"
msgid "Apology accepted."
msgstr "Omluva přijata."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L03_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L03_REGINA"
msgid "Now, let's sort out the tragic state of the moose."
msgstr "Pojďme se teď postarat o losy, kteří jsou na tom špatně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L04_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L04_REGINA"
msgid ""
"And to do that, we need to help things along a little, by stopping the "
"white-tailed deer who are spreading too much and taking over the moose's "
"resources."
msgstr ""
"Musíme trochu pomoci přírodě a omezit jelence běloocasé. Příliš se rozšířili"
" a zabírají losům potravu i prostor."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 objective 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid "Try to talk to Regina again."
msgstr "Zkuste si znovu promluvit s Reginou."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission02 objective 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03"
msgid ""
"Harvest 3 White-tailed deer with their Fitness at "
"{maxFitness}|displayAs(percent) or lower."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte 3 jelence běloocasé s genetickou kvalitou nejvýše "
"{maxFitness}|displayAs(percent)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission03 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Regina has had samples from sick Moose in the area analyzed, and the results"
" are in—it's brainworm. A parasite that doesn't affect White-tailed deer at "
"all, but once moose get infected, the brainworm happy-tunnels through their "
"brain, leading to an agonizing death. Regina's got a location of more sick "
"moose in the area, and wants you to help cull them."
msgstr ""
"Regina nechala vyšetřit vzorky od nemocných losů v oblasti. Výsledky ukázaly"
" nákazu mozkovou hlísticí. Jelencům běloocasým většinou nepůsobí potíže, ale"
" losům při průchodu mozkem způsobuje těžké poškození a bolestivou smrt. "
"Regina našla další nemocné losy a žádá vás o pomoc s jejich sanitárním "
"odstřelem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for translators" : "Latin name for Columbine
#. Duskywing butterfly, name of the quest"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission03 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_NAME"
msgid "Erynnis lucilius"
msgstr "Erynnis lucilius"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_REGINA"
msgid ""
"Drivers and mushroom pickers have been telling me there's an unusual moose "
"in the area."
msgstr "Řidiči a houbaři mi hlásili, že se v okolí pohybuje zvláštní los."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_REGINA"
msgid "He kept approaching people, just like the moose from my dream."
msgstr "Pořád chodil k lidem, stejně jako los z mého snu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_REGINA"
msgid "But two days ago, a car hit him. He didn't survive."
msgstr "Před dvěma dny ho ale srazilo auto. Nepřežil."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_REGINA"
msgid "I had a bad feeling about it, so I got some samples checked."
msgstr "Měla jsem z toho špatný pocit, a tak jsem nechala vyšetřit vzorky."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_REGINA"
msgid "The results just came in. It's brainworm."
msgstr "Právě přišly výsledky. Je to mozková hlístice."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_REGINA"
msgid ""
"It's actually quite common, I don't know why I didn't think of it before."
msgstr "Je docela běžná. Nevím, proč mě nenapadla dřív."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_REGINA"
msgid "I must be getting old."
msgstr "Asi stárnu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_REGINA"
msgid ""
"It's a parasite that's carried by white-tailed deer. It doesn't really "
"affect the deer at all."
msgstr "Přenášejí ji jelenci běloocasí, kterým prakticky neškodí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_REGINA"
msgid ""
"The trouble starts once moose get infected from white-tailed deer feces."
msgstr ""
"Problém nastane, když se z trusu jelenců běloocasých nákaza dostane k losům."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_REGINA"
msgid "The parasite expects the same brain topography as in white-tails."
msgstr "Hlístice je zvyklá na stavbu mozku jelence běloocasého."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_REGINA"
msgid ""
"As it's browsing, it tunnels through the brain, causing untold neurological "
"damage."
msgstr ""
"Při pohybu v mozku losa si razí cestu tkání a způsobuje rozsáhlé "
"neurologické poškození."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_REGINA"
msgid ""
"The signs are weakness, fearlessness, lack of coordination, circling, "
"deafness, impaired vision and paralysis. Eventually, the host dies."
msgstr ""
"Příznaky zahrnují slabost, ztrátu plachosti, poruchy koordinace, chození v "
"kruhu, hluchotu, zhoršení zraku a ochrnutí. Nakonec zvíře uhyne."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "She really empathazies with the animals in
#. the second sentence. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_REGINA"
msgid ""
"Essentially, the moose becomes a walking zombie. It's a horrible way for an "
"animal to die."
msgstr ""
"Los se v podstatě změní v chodícího zombie. Pro zvíře je to strašná smrt."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_REGINA"
msgid "Culling the sick moose is inevitable."
msgstr "Nemocné losy musíme sanitárně odstřelit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission03 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Harvest the sick moose in the highlighted area on the hunting map."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte nemocného losa ve vyznačené oblasti na lovecké mapě."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission04 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"The tragic tale of the Moose continues. Regina's had another dream, this "
"time even more horrific than the one before. In this dream, the Moose "
"attacks her husband and ends up with antlers covered in his blood. "
"Coincidentally, a Moose with bloodied antlers appears in the area. Patrick "
"claims it's just shedding velvet, but Regina fears something even worse is "
"about to happen."
msgstr ""
"Tragický příběh losů pokračuje. Regině se zdál další sen, ještě děsivější "
"než ten předchozí: los v něm napadl Patricka a jeho paroží potřísnila "
"Patrickova krev. Shodou okolností se v oblasti objevil los se zakrváceným "
"parožím. Patrick si myslí, že si los jen vytlouká paroží, ale Regina se "
"obává něčeho horšího."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for translators" : "Latin name for a moth, name of
#. the quest"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission04 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_NAME"
msgid "Speiredonia mutabilis"
msgstr "Speiredonia mutabilis"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Player visits Regina after culling the sick
#. moose. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_REGINA"
msgid "Hello, darling."
msgstr "Ahoj, miláčku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_REGINA"
msgid ""
"Great job dealing with the culling so quickly, I didn't want the moose to "
"suffer any longer than necessary."
msgstr ""
"Díky za rychlý sanitární odstřel. Nechtěla jsem, aby losi trpěli déle, než "
"je nutné."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_REGINA"
msgid "Your assistance is greatly appreciated."
msgstr "Moc si vážím tvé pomoci."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER"
msgid "Why do you still sound so worried?"
msgstr "Proč pořád zníte tak ustaraně?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_REGINA"
msgid "I feel uneasy burdening you again."
msgstr "Není mi příjemné tě znovu zatěžovat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_REGINA"
msgid "But the dreams didn't stop. They evolved."
msgstr "Ale ty sny nepřestaly. Změnily se."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_REGINA"
msgid ""
"People have been telling me about a moose whose antlers are covered in "
"blood."
msgstr "Lidé mi hlásí losa se zakrváceným parožím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_REGINA"
msgid "We need to find him and relieve him of his pain."
msgstr "Musíme ho najít a ukončit jeho utrpení."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_REGINA"
msgid "Patrick says it's velvet shedding. But I don't believe it."
msgstr "Patrick říká, že si jen vytlouká paroží. Já tomu ale nevěřím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_REGINA"
msgid "I don't think the blood on the antlers belongs to the moose."
msgstr "Nemyslím si, že krev na paroží patří tomu losovi."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "What makes you think that?"
msgstr "Proč si to myslíte?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_REGINA_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_REGINA_OP01"
msgid ""
"I trust my dreams. And the lab tests confirm that the moose are troubled."
msgstr ""
"Věřím svým snům. A laboratorní testy potvrdily, že s losy je něco v "
"nepořádku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_REGINA_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_REGINA_OP01"
msgid ""
"In this new dream, there isn't a lake in the eyes of the moose. There's a "
"raging fire."
msgstr ""
"V tom novém snu už v losových očích nevidím jezero. Vidím v nich zuřící "
"oheň."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_REGINA_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_REGINA_OP01"
msgid "And he... pierces right through Patrick with his antlers."
msgstr "A pak... Patricka probodne parožím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_PLAYER"
msgid "Where were the last sightings of this moose?"
msgstr "Kde toho losa viděli naposledy?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_REGINA"
msgid "I'm glad to have you on my side, darling."
msgstr "Jsem ráda, že tě mám na své straně, miláčku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission04 Dialogue01 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_REGINA"
msgid "I'll send the location to your phone."
msgstr "Pošlu ti polohu do telefonu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission04 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Get to the area of the last known sighting of the moose with bloodied "
"antlers."
msgstr ""
"Vydejte se na místo posledního pozorování losa se zakrváceným parožím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Regina is trying to help a moose she dreamt of, its antlers bloodied. But is"
" it real?"
msgstr ""
"Regina se snaží pomoci losovi ze svého snu, tomu se zakrváceným parožím. "
"Existuje ale vůbec?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"Patrick Harper believes the moose is shedding its velvet, not attacking. He "
"wants you to let it live until its antlers grow. Regina insists the moose is"
" sick and must be culled. Who will you trust?"
msgstr ""
"Patrick Harper věří, že si los jen vytlouká paroží a nikoho nenapadl. Chce, "
"abyste ho nechali žít, dokud mu paroží nedoroste. Regina je přesvědčená, že "
"los je nemocný a je nutné ho odstřelit. Komu uvěříte?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"You’ve made your choice, and now you must face the consequences. Go speak "
"with the Harper couple."
msgstr ""
"Rozhodli jste se. Teď musíte čelit následkům. Promluvte si s manželi "
"Harperovými."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_NAME"
msgid "Tyria Jacobaeae"
msgstr "Tyria Jacobaeae"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE00
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE00"
msgid "Enter the swamps and get ready for the moose with bloodied antlers."
msgstr ""
"Vstupte do bažin a připravte se na setkání s losem se zakrváceným parožím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Option 1: Shoot and harvest the Moose with bloodied antlers."
msgstr "Možnost 1: Zastřelte a zpracujte losa se zakrváceným parožím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L01_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Regina says this when player enters the last
#. known location of the moose. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L01_REGINA"
msgid "He was seen here one day ago. I'm praying he's still here."
msgstr "Viděli ho tu včera. Doufám, že je pořád nablízku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L01_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Interaction of Regina if Player finds a dead
#. animal pierced by the moose."
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue02 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L01_REGINA"
msgid ""
"That's the victim of our moose. The brainworm must have caused him to lose "
"his mind. I can't imagine how much he's suffering."
msgstr ""
"To je oběť našeho losa. Mozková hlístice toho losa zřejmě připravila o "
"rozum. Nedokážu si představit, jak moc trpí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L01_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during VO"
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Patrick calls to player as they are on the
#. way to kill the dangerous moose. But Patrick doesn't think he is dangerous
#. at all. Player now has to make a decision, whether they'll listen to
#. Patrick or Regina. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue03 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L01_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"Hey there, buddy! I hear you're looking for the murderous moose with my "
"wife. Hahah."
msgstr ""
"Ahoj, kamaráde! Slyšel jsem, že s mojí ženou pátráš po losím vrahovi. Haha."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L02_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue03 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L02_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"She told you about her dream, right? How it pierced me? But here I am, alive"
" and kicking!"
msgstr ""
"Vyprávěla ti o svém snu, že? Jak mě los probodl? A přitom jsem tady, živý a "
"zdravý!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L03_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue03 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L03_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"The moose is harmless. It's just shedding velvet, I know it can look scary."
msgstr ""
"Ten los je neškodný. Jen si vytlouká paroží. Vím, že to může vypadat děsivě."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L04_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue03 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L04_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"I'm actually calling you to ask a favor, buddy. Don't shoot the moose when "
"you see it, alright?"
msgstr ""
"Vlastně ti volám kvůli jedné laskavosti, kamaráde. Až toho losa uvidíš, "
"nestřílej na něj, dobře?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L05_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue03 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L05_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"I saw him a few hours ago and he has almost PERFECT antlers. I just know "
"he's going to reach the maximum potential for antler growth, and there's "
"this ongoing competition at Hearth & Hunt."
msgstr ""
"Před pár hodinami jsem ho viděl. Má skoro DOKONALÉ paroží! Vím, že ještě "
"naplno doroste, a zrovna probíhá soutěž Hearth & Hunt."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L06_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue03 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L06_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"If I harvest it at the right time, I wouldn't just win the competition, I'd "
"set a new world record. Can you imagine how great that would be for "
"promoting the region?"
msgstr ""
"Kdybych ho ulovil ve správnou chvíli, nejenže bych vyhrál soutěž, ale "
"vytvořil bych i světový rekord. Představ si, jaká by to byla reklama pro "
"celý kraj!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L07_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue03 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L07_PATRICK"
msgid "Life changing! So just don't shoot him, buddy, alright?"
msgstr "To by mi změnilo život! Tak na něj prosím nestřílej, kamaráde, ano?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L01_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "If player killed the moose, they will get
#. this dialogue of happy Regina accepting them into being as close as a
#. family. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue04 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L01_REGINA"
msgid "What does your family call you?"
msgstr "Jak ti říká rodina?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L02_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue04 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L02_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Usually? A disappointment."
msgstr "Obvykle? Zklamání."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L03_REGINA_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue04 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L03_REGINA_A"
msgid ""
"That's harsh. In my eyes, you're about as far from disappointing as it gets."
msgstr "To je drsné. Já tě rozhodně za zklamání nepovažuju."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L04_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue04 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L04_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Sweet tater-tots. I'm not sure where it came from, though."
msgstr "„Sladké brambůrky.“ Vůbec nevím, kde se to vzalo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L05_REGINA_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue04 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L05_REGINA_B"
msgid ""
"(laughs) I'd like to know the origin of that one. I call my daughter Little "
"Carrot. But I don't remember where that came from either."
msgstr ""
"(směje se) Zajímalo by mě, odkud se ta přezdívka vzala. Já své dceři říkám "
"Mrkvička, ale taky už nevím proč."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L06_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue04 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L06_PLAYER_C"
msgid "I'd rather keep it private."
msgstr "To si radši nechám pro sebe."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L07_REGINA_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue04 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L07_REGINA_C"
msgid ""
"Oh, don't be embarrassed. It's a little late for embarrassment between us."
msgstr "Ale nestyď se. Na rozpaky už je mezi námi trochu pozdě."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L08_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue04 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L08_REGINA"
msgid "I just wanted to know, because you feel like family at this point."
msgstr "Ptám se proto, že už tě skoro beru jako člena rodiny."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L09_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue04 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L09_REGINA"
msgid ""
"You're doing a great job at Hearth & Hunt. Would you like me to submit a "
"review?"
msgstr "V Hearth & Hunt odvádíš skvělou práci. Mám ti napsat hodnocení?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L10_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue04 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L10_PLAYER_A"
msgid ""
"Alright, let me spell out my coordinator's name. Oh, and there's a "
"recommendation section on every profile. Go wild."
msgstr ""
"Jasně, vyhláskuju vám jméno svého koordinátora. A na každém profilu je i "
"místo pro doporučení. Klidně se rozepište."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L11_REGINA_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue04 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L11_REGINA_A"
msgid "Okay, I may have to ask Patrick to help me with all that."
msgstr "Dobře, možná budu muset požádat Patricka, aby mi s tím vším pomohl."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L12_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue04 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L12_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Absolutely! I thrive on feedback. Just, uh... go easy on me."
msgstr ""
"Rozhodně! Zpětná vazba mě posouvá dál. Jen na mě prosím nebuďte moc přísná."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L13_REGINA_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue04 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L13_REGINA_B"
msgid "Don't worry, sweetheart. You're getting five stars."
msgstr "Neboj, miláčku. Dám ti pět hvězdiček."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L14_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue04 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L14_PLAYER_C"
msgid ""
"No need for extra praise. My pay doesn't depend on it, so it's not worth "
"your time."
msgstr ""
"Další chválu nepotřebuju. Výplata na ní nezávisí, tak tím nemusíte ztrácet "
"čas."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L15_REGINA_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue04 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L15_REGINA_C"
msgid "Oh, are you sure? My husband's always ranting about Golden Ranks."
msgstr "Opravdu? Můj manžel pořád mluví o zlatých hodnostech."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L16_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue04 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L16_PLAYER_C"
msgid "I'm not even Silver yet!"
msgstr "Vždyť ještě nemám ani stříbrnou hodnost!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L17_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue04 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L17_REGINA"
msgid ""
"Well, then I'm sure you have other things to do than entertain this old "
"lady."
msgstr "Tak to máš určitě lepší věci na práci než bavit starou dámu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L18_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue04 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L18_REGINA"
msgid "Don't be a stranger, stop by from time to time!"
msgstr "A občas se zastav, ráda tě zase uvidím!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO05_L01_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Player visits Patrick, after killing the
#. moose, even though Patrick didn't want them to do it, but it was the right
#. choice. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue05 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO05_L01_PATRICK"
msgid "Stop grinning like a possum eating a sweet tater! I know."
msgstr "Přestaň se culit jako vačice nad sladkou bramborou! Já vím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO05_L02_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue05 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO05_L02_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"I should always listen to my wife... and her dreams. No matter how crazy "
"they sound."
msgstr ""
"Měl bych vždycky poslouchat svou ženu... a její sny. Ať znějí sebešíleněji."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO05_L03_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue05 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO05_L03_PATRICK"
msgid "Yes, the moose had brainworm, taking it out was the right call."
msgstr "Ano, ten los měl mozkovou hlístici. Bylo správné ho odstřelit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO05_L04_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue05 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO05_L04_PATRICK"
msgid "I was blinded by my own greed."
msgstr "Byl jsem zaslepen svou vlastní chamtivostí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO05_L05_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue05 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO05_L05_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"And now my Hearth & Hunt forum account has been suspended for breaking the "
"rules."
msgstr ""
"A nyní byl můj účet na fóru Hearth & Hunt pozastaven kvůli porušení "
"pravidel."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO05_L06_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during VO"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue05 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO05_L06_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"I guess I shouldn't brag on the forum, that I have a Hearth & Hunt rep "
"helping me, hahaha."
msgstr ""
"Asi jsem se na fóru neměl chlubit, že mi pomáhá někdo z Hearth & Hunt. Haha."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO05_L07_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue05 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO05_L07_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"But thanks anyways, buddy! Gotta go, these nature videos won't shoot "
"themselves!"
msgstr ""
"Ale i tak díky, kamaráde! Musím běžet, ta videa o přírodě se sama nenatočí!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO06_L01_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Angel calls to the player after finishing
#. tasks from Regina and Patrick. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue06 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO06_L01_ANGEL"
msgid "Their marriage seems like a rollercoaster."
msgstr "Jejich manželství je jako jízda na horské dráze."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO06_L02_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue06 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO06_L02_ANGEL"
msgid "Just watching it play out is exhausting."
msgstr "Už jen se na ně dívat je vyčerpávající."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO06_L03_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue06 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO06_L03_ANGEL"
msgid "My mother once took me on a rollercoaster."
msgstr "Moje matka mě jednou vzala na horskou dráhu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO06_L04_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue06 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO06_L04_ANGEL"
msgid "I didn't speak to her for two days."
msgstr "Nemluvil jsem s ní dva dny."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO06_L05_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue06 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO06_L05_ANGEL"
msgid "Anyway, the Harper business is done."
msgstr "Každopádně je záležitost s Harperovými uzavřená."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO06_L06_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue06 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO06_L06_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"If you feel like you want to take a break from New Laurentia, my sister is "
"eagerly awaiting your arrival at Kilimaya Reserve."
msgstr ""
"Jestli si budete chtít na chvíli odpočinout od New Laurentia, moje sestra "
"vás netrpělivě čeká v Kilimaya Reserve."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO06_L07_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue06 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO06_L07_ANGEL"
msgid "She's one of those people I label as..."
msgstr "Patří k lidem, které označuju za..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO06_L08_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue06 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE01_VO06_L08_ANGEL"
msgid "Exhausting."
msgstr "Vyčerpávající."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid "Option 2: Leave the highlighted zone and let the Moose live."
msgstr "Možnost 2: Opusťte vyznačenou oblast a nechte losa žít."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03"
msgid "Look for Patrick in his usual spot."
msgstr "Najděte Patricka na místě, kde se obvykle zdržuje."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L01_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "If player didn't decide to kill the moose,
#. when they go to visit Patrick he is not there, so player decides to call
#. him. Patrick picks up the phone. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue07 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L01_PATRICK"
msgid "Hey, buddy! Yeah, I'm kind of in hospital right now."
msgstr "Ahoj, kamaráde! Jo, teď jsem zrovna v nemocnici."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L02_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue07 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L02_PATRICK"
msgid "Turns out the moose ended up attacking me. HAHA. Ouch, ouch."
msgstr "Nakonec mě ten los přece jen napadl. Haha. Au, au."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L03_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Regina is in the background of the call"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue07 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L03_REGINA"
msgid "Is that Hearth & Hunt?"
msgstr "Je to Hearth & Hunt?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L04_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue07 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L04_PATRICK"
msgid "Oh, no, no, Gigi. I'm talking to Malachi."
msgstr "Oh, ne, ne, Gigi. Mluvím s Malachiem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L05_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "angry, snaps the phone"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue07 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L05_REGINA"
msgid "Give me that phone!"
msgstr "Dej mi ten telefon!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L06_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "angry"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue07 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L06_REGINA"
msgid "Now listen to me, you little Hearth & Hunt henchman."
msgstr "A teď mě poslouchej, ty poskoku z Hearth & Hunt."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L07_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue07 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L07_REGINA"
msgid ""
"Don't ever follow requests from my dumb husband if they contradict mine, is "
"that clear?"
msgstr ""
"Už nikdy neposlouchej mého natvrdlého manžela, když ti říká něco jiného než "
"já. Je to jasné?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L08_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "sigh of relief"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue07 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L08_REGINA"
msgid "At least you're both alive. That moose was incredibly dangerous."
msgstr "Aspoň jste oba naživu. Ten los byl neuvěřitelně nebezpečný."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L09_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during VO"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue07 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L09_PATRICK"
msgid ""
"I'm back, buddy! Don't take it too seriously. She calms down pretty fast."
msgstr ""
"Už jsem zpátky, kamaráde! Neber si to moc k srdci. Ona se rychle uklidní."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L10_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue07 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L10_PATRICK"
msgid "I think it at least brought us back together."
msgstr "Aspoň nás to zase sblížilo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L11_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue07 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L11_PATRICK"
msgid "All it took was a few stitches. HAHA. Ouch, ouch."
msgstr "Stačilo pár stehů. HAHA. Au, au."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L12_REGINA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "this is again heard only in the background of
#. the call"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue07 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L12_REGINA"
msgid "Put down that phone, you crazy old buzzard."
msgstr "Polož ten telefon, ty starý blázne."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L13_PATRICK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStory04 Mission05 Dialogue07 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE03_VO07_L13_PATRICK"
msgid "Gotta go. See you later!"
msgstr "Musím končit. Uvidíme se později!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE04"
msgid "Talk to Regina."
msgstr "Promluvte si s Reginou."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY04_MISSION05_OBJECTIVE05"
msgid "Talk to Patrick."
msgstr "Promluvte si s Patrickem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Mikael highlighted the Spots on the Hunting map that Dall sheep frequent. Go"
" there to learn more about animal daily routines. Mikael encourages you to "
"open the interactive map and click on animal icons to reveal more "
"information about the Spots. Find one and analyze the Tracks there."
msgstr ""
"Mikael na lovecké mapě vyznačil oblast výskytu ovcí aljašských. Vyberte "
"ikonu stáda a zobrazte místa, která navštěvuje. Na místě pastvy nebo "
"odpočinku prozkoumejte pobytové znaky a poznejte jeho denní režim."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_NAME"
msgid "Fox fires"
msgstr "Liščí ohně"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_PLAYER_A"
msgid "INTRUDER!"
msgstr "Vetřelec!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_MIKAEL_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_MIKAEL_A"
msgid "Excuse me?"
msgstr "Prosím?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_PLAYER_A"
msgid "You heard me! Get out of my lodge."
msgstr "Slyšel jsi. Vypadni z mé lovecké chaty."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_MIKAEL_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_MIKAEL_A"
msgid "Gladly."
msgstr "S radostí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Wait... Who are you?"
msgstr "Počkej... Kdo jsi?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Sorry, who are you?"
msgstr "Promiň, kdo jsi?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_MIKAEL_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_MIKAEL_B"
msgid "Mikael Anderson."
msgstr "Mikael Anderson."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Aaand who is that?"
msgstr "A to je kdo?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_MIKAEL_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_MIKAEL_B"
msgid "Hearth & Hunt representative in New Laurentia."
msgstr "Zástupce Hearth & Hunt v New Laurentia."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PLAYER_B"
msgid "That's... me."
msgstr "To jsem... já."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_MIKAEL_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_MIKAEL_B"
msgid "Hmm."
msgstr "Hmm."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_PLAYER_B"
msgid "You okay?"
msgstr "Jsi v pořádku?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_MIKAEL_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_MIKAEL_B"
msgid "I didn't know Angel worked this fast."
msgstr "Nevěděl jsem, že Angel pracuje tak rychle."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_MIKAEL_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_MIKAEL_B"
msgid "Means I'm a former New Laurentia rep now."
msgstr "Takže jsem teď bývalý zástupce Hearth & Hunt v New Laurentia."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_PLAYER_C"
msgid "What are you doing in my lodge?"
msgstr "Co děláš v mé lovecké chatě?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_MIKAEL_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_MIKAEL_C"
msgid "This is my lodge."
msgstr "Tohle je moje lovecká chata."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_PLAYER_C"
msgid "Somehow I doubt that, but what do you mean?"
msgstr "O tom pochybuju. Jak to myslíš?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_MIKAEL_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_MIKAEL_C"
msgid ""
"(sighs) You're right. It's not my lodge anymore. Are you the new "
"representative?"
msgstr ""
"(povzdechne si) Máš pravdu. Už to není moje lovecká chata. Teď tu zastupuješ"
" Hearth & Hunt ty?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_PLAYER_C"
msgid "Yes. I'm {playerCharacterName}. And you are?"
msgstr "Ano. Jsem {playerCharacterName}. A ty jsi?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_MIKAEL_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_MIKAEL_C"
msgid "Mikael Anderson."
msgstr "Mikael Anderson."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_MIKAEL_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_MIKAEL_C"
msgid "Former Hearth & Hunt representative in New Laurentia."
msgstr "Bývalý zástupce Hearth & Hunt v New Laurentia."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_MIKAEL"
msgid "(sighs)"
msgstr "(vzdychne)"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_MIKAEL"
msgid "I assume Angel gave you a rundown with the muley initiation?"
msgstr ""
"Předpokládám, že tě Angel při úvodním lovu jelence ušatého zasvětil do "
"základů?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_PLAYER"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "Ano."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_MIKAEL"
msgid "Then I have some routine checks for you."
msgstr "Tak si ještě ověřím pár věcí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_MIKAEL"
msgid "First, animal daily routines. Do you have a grasp of how they work?"
msgstr "Nejdřív denní režim zvěře. Víš, jak funguje?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_PLAYER"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr "Jasně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_MIKAEL"
msgid "Then let's get right to it."
msgstr "Tak pojďme rovnou na to."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_MIKAEL"
msgid "You've received an interactive Hunting map from Hearth & Hunt."
msgstr "Od Hearth & Hunt už máš interaktivní loveckou mapu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_MIKAEL"
msgid "Angel asked me not to share any data with you."
msgstr "Angel mě požádal, abych ti neposkytoval žádné údaje."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_MIKAEL"
msgid "He wants fresh data."
msgstr "Chce čerstvé údaje."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_MIKAEL"
msgid "But to get you started, I highlighted one Dall sheep herd."
msgstr "Pro začátek jsem ti ale vyznačil jedno stádo ovcí aljašských."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"Select it on your Hunting map, and you'll be able to see where they go to "
"drink water every day."
msgstr "Vyber ho na lovecké mapě a uvidíš, kam se chodí každý den napít."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_MIKAEL"
msgid "Call me when you find the others."
msgstr "Zavolej mi, až najdeš ostatní."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L01_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L01_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Hi! Are you the guy I'm replacing?"
msgstr "Ahoj! Jsi ten chlap, kterého nahrazuji?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L02_MIKAEL_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L02_MIKAEL_A"
msgid "I guess so."
msgstr "Asi ano."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L03_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L03_PLAYER_B"
msgid "I heard you have the ropes?"
msgstr "Prý mi ukážeš, za který konec to vzít."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L04_MIKAEL_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L04_MIKAEL_B"
msgid "What ropes?"
msgstr "Za který konec?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L05_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L05_PLAYER_B"
msgid "You know, show me the ropes, how to do the job properly?"
msgstr "No, že mi ukážeš, jak se tu ta práce dělá."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L06_MIKAEL_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L06_MIKAEL_B"
msgid "I don't really get…"
msgstr "Tenhle druh humoru…"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L07_MIKAEL_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L07_MIKAEL_B"
msgid "… that kind of humor."
msgstr "… mi moc nesedí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L08_MIKAEL_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L08_MIKAEL_B"
msgid "Where I come from, Lintukoto Reserve, we prefer to speak plainly."
msgstr "U nás v rezervaci Lintukoto radši mluvíme přímo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L09_MIKAEL_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L09_MIKAEL_B"
msgid "Well, except for Artturi…"
msgstr "Tedy kromě Artturiho…"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L10_MIKAEL_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for translators" : "\"No niin\" is \"anyways\" in
#. Finnish"
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "\"anyways\" in Finnish, pronounciation: noh
#. neen"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L10_MIKAEL_B"
msgid "No niin, I'm Mikael."
msgstr "No niin, já jsem Mikael."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L11_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L11_PLAYER_C"
msgid "Hello, I'm {playerCharacterName}."
msgstr "Ahoj, já jsem {playerCharacterName}."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L12_MIKAEL_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L12_MIKAEL_C"
msgid "New representative?"
msgstr "Teď zastupuješ Hearth & Hunt ty?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L13_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L13_PLAYER_C"
msgid "That's what they tell me."
msgstr "To mi říkají."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L14_MIKAEL_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L14_MIKAEL_C"
msgid "Then you're here to replace me."
msgstr "Takže mě tu máš nahradit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Analyze any Dall sheep feeding or resting zones. The areas where to find "
"them are highlighted on the Hunting map."
msgstr ""
"Na lovecké mapě najděte vyznačenou oblast s ovcemi aljašskými. Prozkoumejte "
"pobytové znaky na některém místě jejich pastvy nebo odpočinku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid "Harvest a Dall sheep."
msgstr "Ulovte a zpracujte ovci aljašskou."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L01_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L01_MIKAEL"
msgid "I see you've found one of the spots the herd visits."
msgstr "Vidím, že už znáš jedno z míst, která stádo navštěvuje."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L02_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L02_MIKAEL"
msgid "To discover the rest, find an animal path."
msgstr "Další místa objevíš, když najdeš stezku zvěře."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L03_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L03_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"It's a pathway made by Dall sheep. You can figure out which direction "
"they're going by looking at the split hoof prints. The wider split will be "
"to the front."
msgstr ""
"Vyšlapaly ji ovce aljašské. Směr jejich pohybu poznáš podle otisků spárků: "
"vpředu jsou od sebe dál."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L04_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L04_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"If you follow a path and begin to hear the animal, you know you’re tracking "
"it correctly."
msgstr "Jestli se vydáš po stezce a začneš zvěř slyšet, jdeš správně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L05_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L05_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"Be careful, you can spook them. If you hear them running away, you won’t "
"find them in their usual place within their daily routine."
msgstr ""
"Dávej pozor, ať je nevyplašíš. Když je uslyšíš prchat, na jejich obvyklém "
"místě je už nezastihneš."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L06_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L06_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"Also, if the animal is currently in the zone, you won’t find any paths."
msgstr "Pokud je zvěř právě na daném místě, žádné stezky tam nenajdeš."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L07_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L07_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"Thankfully, your Hunting map will tell you when each herd is expected to "
"drink, feed and rest."
msgstr ""
"Na lovecké mapě naštěstí zjistíš, kdy se jednotlivá stáda chodí napít, pást "
"a odpočívat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L08_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L08_MIKAEL"
msgid "To complete this task quickly, harvest Dall sheep from this territory."
msgstr "Chceš-li úkol splnit rychle, ulov ovci aljašskou na tomto území."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L09_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L09_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"Or you can harvest Dall sheep from any other herd, if you don't feel like "
"following my advice."
msgstr ""
"Jestli se mou radou řídit nechceš, můžeš ulovit i ovci aljašskou z jiného "
"stáda."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L01_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L01_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "Can you explain how animal daily routines work?"
msgstr "Vysvětlíš mi, jak funguje denní režim zvěře?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L02_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L02_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid "You can think of it more as an animal's schedule, if that helps."
msgstr "Představ si to jako denní rozvrh zvířat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L03_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L03_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"It's how animals live naturally. Every day, they follow the same timetable "
"and visit the same spots."
msgstr ""
"Tak zvířata běžně žijí: každý den se přibližně ve stejnou dobu vracejí na "
"stejná místa."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L04_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L04_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"There are a few slight variations, but you usually find similar animal "
"species following the same schedule."
msgstr "Čas se může trochu lišit, ale příbuzné druhy mívají podobný režim."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L05_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L05_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"For example, mule deer and white-tailed deer both visit their drinking spots"
" in the afternoon and early at night, before they go to sleep."
msgstr ""
"Třeba jelenci ušatí i běloocasí chodí pít odpoledne a na začátku noci, než "
"ulehnou."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L06_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L06_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"When you discover a herd, you can check the spots and the time when the herd"
" appears there on your Hunting map."
msgstr ""
"Když objevíš stádo, na lovecké mapě uvidíš, která místa navštěvuje a kdy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L07_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L07_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"Don't assume every species has the same schedule. Check the map before you "
"visit the spot."
msgstr ""
"Nepočítej ale s tím, že všechny druhy mají stejný režim. Před cestou se "
"podívej do mapy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L08_PLAYER_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L08_PLAYER_OP02"
msgid "I can't find any Dall sheep. Can you help me?"
msgstr "Nedaří se mi najít ovce aljašské. Pomůžeš mi?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L09_MIKAEL_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "tired not annoyed"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L09_MIKAEL_OP02"
msgid "(sighs)"
msgstr "(vzdychne)"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L10_MIKAEL_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L10_MIKAEL_OP02"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr "Jasně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L11_MIKAEL_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L11_MIKAEL_OP02"
msgid ""
"First, check your Hunting map. Make sure you're tracking the objective."
msgstr "Nejdřív se podívej na loveckou mapu a ověř, že sleduješ tento úkol."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L12_MIKAEL_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L12_MIKAEL_OP02"
msgid "The sheep will be in the glowing highlighted areas."
msgstr "Ovce najdeš ve zvýrazněných oblastech."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L13_MIKAEL_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L13_MIKAEL_OP02"
msgid ""
"Second, select the Dall sheep icon that represents the herd. I must admit, "
"this took me a while to grasp too."
msgstr ""
"Pak vyber ikonu ovce aljašské označující stádo. Přiznávám, že i mně chvíli "
"trvalo, než jsem na to přišel."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L14_MIKAEL_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L14_MIKAEL_OP02"
msgid ""
"Once you've selected the icon, you'll see all the discovered spots that this"
" herd frequents."
msgstr ""
"Po výběru ikony uvidíš všechna objevená místa, která stádo navštěvuje."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L15_MIKAEL_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L15_MIKAEL_OP02"
msgid ""
"Check the times when they're going to be there, and approach VERY slowly or "
"they'll run away."
msgstr ""
"Zjisti, kdy tam ovce budou, a přibližuj se VELMI pomalu, jinak utečou."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L16_PLAYER_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L16_PLAYER_OP03"
msgid "What's hunting pressure?"
msgstr "Co znamená lovecký tlak?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L17_MIKAEL_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L17_MIKAEL_OP03"
msgid "Ah, now you're getting onto the more advanced side of things."
msgstr "Aha, pouštíš se do pokročilejších věcí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L18_MIKAEL_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L18_MIKAEL_OP03"
msgid ""
"Think of it as animal annoyance. The more you visit them, the more annoyed "
"they'll be."
msgstr ""
"Představ si to jako míru, s jakou zvěř rušíš. Čím častěji za ní chodíš, tím "
"víc ji zneklidníš."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L19_PLAYER_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L19_PLAYER_OP03"
msgid "Are you trying to tell me something?"
msgstr "Snažíš se mi něco říct?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L20_MIKAEL_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L20_MIKAEL_OP03"
msgid "No…"
msgstr "Ne…"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L21_MIKAEL_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L21_MIKAEL_OP03"
msgid ""
"I have to stay here until you're done with the assignments. Animals are "
"under no such obligation."
msgstr ""
"Já tu musím zůstat, dokud úkoly nedokončíš. Zvěř takovou povinnost nemá."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L22_MIKAEL_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L22_MIKAEL_OP03"
msgid "But I'm here for you."
msgstr "Ale jsem tu pro tebe."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L23_MIKAEL_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L23_MIKAEL_OP03"
msgid ""
"This is why one herd usually has multiple spots for the same activity: "
"drinking, feeding or resting."
msgstr ""
"Proto má jedno stádo obvykle několik míst pro každou činnost: napájení, "
"pastvu i odpočinek."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L24_MIKAEL_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L24_MIKAEL_OP03"
msgid "The herd will always visit the same place for a certain activity."
msgstr "Za každou činností se stádo pravidelně vrací na své místo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L25_MIKAEL_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L25_MIKAEL_OP03"
msgid ""
"But if you bother them at that spot too much, they'll abandon it and start "
"going to another spot."
msgstr "Když ho tam budeš příliš rušit, místo opustí a přesune se jinam."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L26_MIKAEL_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L26_MIKAEL_OP03"
msgid ""
"And if you bother them at the new spot, they'll have to go back to the old "
"one again—or pick a third option, if there is one."
msgstr ""
"Budeš-li ho rušit i tam, vrátí se na původní místo, nebo si vybere třetí, "
"pokud nějaké má."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L27_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L27_PLAYER"
msgid "I don't have any other questions for now."
msgstr "Žádné další otázky zatím nemám."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L28_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "\"thank god\" in Finnish"
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "\"thank god\" in Finnish, pronounciation:
#. HYOO-vah"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L28_MIKAEL"
msgid "Hyvä."
msgstr "Hyvä."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Mikael has been taking care of an elk herd for years. He wants you to take a"
" look at a high-fitness elk for yourself."
msgstr ""
"Mikael už léta pečuje o stádo wapitiů. Chce, abyste se podívali na jedince s"
" vysokou genetickou kvalitou."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_NAME"
msgid "Loudest deer"
msgstr "Nejhlasitější jelen"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_MIKAEL"
msgid "You're back. Let's get straight to the next assignment."
msgstr "Jsi zpátky. Přejdeme rovnou k dalšímu úkolu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"I hope you got the gist of animal daily routines, because this next topic is"
" going to be more complicated."
msgstr ""
"Doufám, že už víš, jak funguje denní režim zvěře, protože další téma bude "
"složitější."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_MIKAEL"
msgid "It's animal fitness. Are you familiar with the subject?"
msgstr "Jde o genetickou kvalitu zvěře. Víš o ní něco?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER"
msgid "Explain, please."
msgstr "Vysvětli mi to, prosím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "\"damn\" in Finnish"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "\"damn\" in Finnish\npronounciation: HIT-toh"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_MIKAEL"
msgid "Hitto, I was hoping you'd already know about animal fitness..."
msgstr "Hitto, doufal jsem, že už víš o genetické kvalitě zvířat..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_MIKAEL"
msgid "It's a... Well, there's a lot to take in."
msgstr "To je... zkrátka dost obsáhlé téma."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_MIKAEL"
msgid "(sighs) But let's get to it."
msgstr "(povzdechne si) Ale pojďme na to."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "I'm already familiar with animal fitness."
msgstr "O genetické kvalitě zvěře už něco vím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid "That'll save us a lot of time."
msgstr "To nám ušetří spoustu času."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Don't worry, I got it. Is it something to do with... Going to the gym?"
msgstr "Neboj, chápu to. Souvisí to s... chozením do posilovny?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_MIKAEL_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "desperate"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_MIKAEL_A"
msgid "No, no, no..."
msgstr "Ne, ne, ne..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Please, your explanation will come in handy."
msgstr "Prosím, vysvětlení se mi bude hodit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_PLAYER_C"
msgid "It's kind of your job."
msgstr "To je přece tvoje práce."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_MIKAEL_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_MIKAEL_C"
msgid "You're right."
msgstr "Máš pravdu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_MIKAEL_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_MIKAEL_C"
msgid "I'll explain it to you, and eventually it'll be your job."
msgstr "Vysvětlím ti to a nakonec to bude tvoje práce."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_MIKAEL"
msgid "Think of fitness as the innate genetic potential each animal has."
msgstr "Genetická kvalita vyjadřuje vrozený potenciál každého jedince."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_MIKAEL"
msgid "It tells you whether the deer will have magnificent antlers…"
msgstr "Napoví ti, jestli bude mít jelen nádherné paroží…"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "in thoughts, referring to the reindeer with
#. stuck lamp in the antlers in Lintukoto reserve"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_MIKAEL"
msgid "Or a lamp stuck between them."
msgstr "… nebo jeho paroží poslouží jen jako držák na lampu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_PLAYER"
msgid "A lamp?"
msgstr "Lampa?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_MIKAEL"
msgid "Sorry, I got lost in thought for a moment."
msgstr "Promiň, na chvíli jsem se ztratil v myšlenkách."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"Once you discover an animal population, you can check its status on your "
"Hunting map."
msgstr ""
"Když objevíš populaci zvěře, její stav si můžeš prohlédnout na lovecké mapě."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"When populations are critical, vulnerable, or just stable, there will only "
"be a few animals born with high potential."
msgstr ""
"Je-li populace kritická, zranitelná nebo jen stabilní, rodí se v ní jen málo"
" jedinců s vysokým genetickým potenciálem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"Generally speaking, you want to leave a high fitness animal in peace so it "
"can reach its greatest potential. Wait for its oldest age for the highest "
"trophy score."
msgstr ""
"Zvěř s vysokou genetickou kvalitou nech dorůst a dosáhnout plného "
"potenciálu. S odlovem počkej až na vysoký věk, kdy má trofej nejvyšší bodové"
" hodnocení."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"At the same time, identify the lower-fitness animals in the herd, preferably"
" males, and harvest them early."
msgstr ""
"Zároveň ve stádě vyhledávej jedince s nižší genetickou kvalitou, nejlépe "
"samce, a ulov je dřív."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"Wait for the higher-fitness animals to mature, reach their potential, and "
"then harvest them for the best trophy."
msgstr ""
"Jedince s vyšší genetickou kvalitou nech dospět a naplno rozvinout trofejový"
" potenciál. Pak je ulovíš pro nejlepší trofej."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"I haven't talked this much in a while. It's exhausting. Do you get it now?"
msgstr "Už dlouho jsem tolik nemluvil. Je to vyčerpávající. Už to chápeš?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_PLAYER"
msgid "Yep."
msgstr "Ano."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "\"thank god\" in Finnish\npronounciation: ON-
#. nek-see"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_MIKAEL"
msgid "Onneksi. Now, just to confirm all this..."
msgstr "Onneksi. Teď jen pro potvrzení toho všeho..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"Over the last few years, I've been watching over an exceptional elk "
"population that I'd like to show you."
msgstr ""
"Posledních několik let pečuju o výjimečnou populaci wapitiů. Rád bych ti ji "
"ukázal."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"There's one bull that's getting older. He's at the peak of his physique."
msgstr "Jeden ze samců už stárne, ale právě teď je v nejlepší kondici."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_MIKAEL"
msgid "Treat it as my gift to welcome you on board."
msgstr "Ber ho jako dárek na uvítanou."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"As before, I've highlighted the herd on your Hunting map. The high-fitness "
"elk will be there."
msgstr ""
"Stádo jsem ti opět vyznačil na lovecké mapě. Najdeš v něm wapitiho s vysokou"
" genetickou kvalitou."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"Remember, you don't have to harvest the elk from this particular herd. Any "
"high-fitness elk will do."
msgstr ""
"Nemusíš ulovit wapitiho právě z tohoto stáda. Stačí kterýkoli s vysokou "
"genetickou kvalitou."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid ""
"I've seen star ratings in my harvest reports. Do they have anything to do "
"with fitness?"
msgstr ""
"Ve zprávách o lovu je hodnocení hvězdičkami. Má něco společného s genetickou"
" kvalitou?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid "They have everything to do with fitness."
msgstr "Právě z ní se hodnocení odvíjí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid "But I don't want to confuse you, so just remember this."
msgstr "Ale nechci tě zmást, tak si zapamatuj hlavně tohle."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid "You can't change the fitness of the animal you see in front of you."
msgstr "Genetickou kvalitu zvěře, kterou máš před sebou, už změnit nemůžeš."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"It's how they were born. When you cull, you only change the fitness of the "
"animals born later."
msgstr ""
"S takovou genetickou kvalitou se narodila. Selektivním odlovem ovlivníš až "
"genetickou kvalitu příštích generací."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid "So if you see a young animal with high fitness, you should wait."
msgstr ""
"Když uvidíš mladého jedince s vysokou genetickou kvalitou, počkej s odlovem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L40_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L40_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"Its trophy rating will increase with age. Once it's mature, the trophy will "
"be at its best. And you won't reduce the fitness of the next generation of "
"animals as much."
msgstr ""
"Hodnocení trofeje s věkem roste. Nejlepší bývá u starého jedince; jeho odlov"
" navíc méně oslabí genetickou kvalitu další generace."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L41_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L41_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"So always make sure to let the high-fitness animals grow to their full "
"potential before you harvest."
msgstr ""
"Zvěři s vysokou genetickou kvalitou proto vždy dopřej čas, aby dosáhla "
"plného potenciálu, než ji ulovíš."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L42_PLAYER_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L42_PLAYER_OP02"
msgid "Any benefit to harvesting female animals?"
msgstr "Má smysl lovit i samice?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L43_MIKAEL_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L43_MIKAEL_OP02"
msgid "That's a very specific question."
msgstr "To je velmi specifická otázka."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L44_MIKAEL_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L44_MIKAEL_OP02"
msgid ""
"Well, yes, some of them may not have \"trophies\" like antlers, apart from "
"female reindeer."
msgstr ""
"Samice sice většinou nemají paroží jako trofej; výjimkou jsou sobí samice."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L45_MIKAEL_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L45_MIKAEL_OP02"
msgid ""
"But there are, for example, female hyenas, which are larger than males and "
"more valuable for their trophies."
msgstr ""
"Například samice hyen ale bývají větší než samci, a proto mají cennější "
"trofeje."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L46_MIKAEL_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L46_MIKAEL_OP02"
msgid ""
"Harvesting females also affects the next generation of animals, but the "
"influence isn't as great as when you harvest males."
msgstr ""
"Odlov samic také ovlivňuje další generaci zvěře, ale méně než odlov samců."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L47_PLAYER_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L47_PLAYER_OP03"
msgid "When I look at animals, how can I tell if they're young or old?"
msgstr "Když se podívám na zvířata, jak poznám, jestli jsou mladá nebo stará?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L48_MIKAEL_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L48_MIKAEL_OP03"
msgid "You can tell from various hints, look at them carefully."
msgstr "Napoví ti několik znaků. Prohlédni si zvěř pozorně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L49_MIKAEL_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L49_MIKAEL_OP03"
msgid "How large are their bodies?"
msgstr "Jak velká jsou jejich těla?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L50_MIKAEL_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L50_MIKAEL_OP03"
msgid "Are their coats lighter or darker?"
msgstr "Mají světlejší, nebo tmavší srst?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L51_MIKAEL_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L51_MIKAEL_OP03"
msgid "What does their body language tell you?"
msgstr "Co ti napoví jejich držení těla?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L52_MIKAEL_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L52_MIKAEL_OP03"
msgid ""
"You have to take all these things into consideration. But you'll learn this "
"all with time."
msgstr "Všechny tyhle znaky ber v úvahu. Časem je poznáš snáz."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest a male Rocky Mountain elk. Its Fitness must be "
"{minFitness}|displayAs(percent) or higher."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte samce wapitiho Nelsonova s genetickou kvalitou alespoň "
"{minFitness}|displayAs(percent)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Animals possess intelligence that often surprises people. The older and "
"fitter an animal is, the better it conceals itself. That's when calling "
"becomes essential!"
msgstr ""
"Zvěř bývá chytřejší, než člověk čeká. Starší kusy s vysokou genetickou "
"kvalitou se umějí dobře skrývat. Při jejich lovu pomůže vábení."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_NAME"
msgid "Pack dynamics"
msgstr "Život ve smečce"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_MIKAEL"
msgid "Did you find the elk herd I highlighted for you?"
msgstr "Podařilo se ti najít vyznačené stádo wapitiů?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "No. I hunted another one."
msgstr "Ne. Úlovek je z jiného stáda."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid "Hm... It shouldn't have been that hard to find."
msgstr "Hm... To stádo přece nemělo být tak těžké najít."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid "You're getting me worried."
msgstr "Začínám si o tebe dělat starosti."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_PLAYER"
msgid "Yes!"
msgstr "Ano!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_MIKAEL"
msgid "Good."
msgstr "Dobře."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_MIKAEL"
msgid "I thought it was an easy enough task."
msgstr "Myslel jsem, že to bude docela snadný úkol."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_MIKAEL"
msgid "This time, I want you to get an idea of how smart animals can be."
msgstr "Tentokrát ti chci ukázat, jak chytrá zvěř dokáže být."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_MIKAEL"
msgid "Unlike humans, animals don’t get to learn from their mistakes."
msgstr "Na rozdíl od lidí nemá zvěř příležitost poučit se ze svých chyb."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_MIKAEL"
msgid "When they make mistakes, they get killed."
msgstr "Když udělá chybu, zaplatí za ni životem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_MIKAEL"
msgid "It's that simple."
msgstr "Je to tak jednoduché."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_MIKAEL"
msgid "This is why animals are constantly growing, changing and evolving."
msgstr "Proto se zvěř neustále mění, přizpůsobuje a vyvíjí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_MIKAEL"
msgid "You can see it in your dog too."
msgstr "Poznáš to i na svém psovi."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"But if you want to notice changes in the animals around us here, just "
"compare how they behave."
msgstr "U zdejší zvěře ty změny poznáš nejlépe porovnáním jejího chování."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"Take wolves. As they get older, and their fitness increases, they won't feed"
" in open spaces, you'll be more likely to find them in denser cover."
msgstr ""
"Vezmi si vlky. Starší jedinci s vyšší genetickou kvalitou už nežerují na "
"otevřených prostranstvích. Častěji je najdeš v hustším porostu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_MIKAEL"
msgid "This time, I want you to observe this behavior."
msgstr "Tentokrát sleduj právě toto chování."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_MIKAEL"
msgid "So watch them, and don't be intimidated."
msgstr "Sleduj je a nenech se zastrašit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"Some visitors love to complain how skittish animals can be in New Laurentia."
msgstr ""
"Někteří návštěvníci si rádi stěžují, jak plachá je zvěř v New Laurentia."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"What they fail to realize is it's not about the animals, it's about the "
"visitors being so damn noisy."
msgstr ""
"Nedochází jim, že problém není ve zvěři. To oni sami dělají takový rámus."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"There's still a way to get even the smarter animals though. Let me give you "
"some money to buy a Jackrabbit Predator caller."
msgstr ""
"I tu nejostražitější zvěř ale můžeš přelstít. Dám ti peníze na vábničku "
"Jackrabbit Predator."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"This can help you to get animals to come closer, if they're hiding in high "
"cover."
msgstr "Pomůže ti přilákat zvěř, která se schovává ve vysokém porostu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_MIKAEL"
msgid "Let's go for a wolf this time."
msgstr "Tentokrát se zaměříme na vlka."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"As usual, I've highlighted one pack on your Hunting map, but you're free to "
"hunt any pack you like."
msgstr ""
"Jako obvykle jsem ti na lovecké mapě vyznačil jednu smečku, ale můžeš lovit "
"kteroukoli."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_MIKAEL"
msgid "And if you have any questions, I'll be here."
msgstr "Kdyby tě něco zajímalo, budu tady."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Buy a Primos Double Jackrabbit Predator Call."
msgstr "Kupte si Primos Double Jackrabbit Predator Call."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid "Harvest a Northwestern gray wolf."
msgstr "Ulovte a zpracujte vlka kanadského."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L01_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L01_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "How do callers work?"
msgstr "Jak vábničky fungují?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L02_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L02_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"They attract your target by imitating the sounds of its prey or other "
"animals of interest."
msgstr ""
"Vábničky lákají zvěř napodobováním hlasů její kořisti nebo jiných zvířat, "
"která ji zajímají."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L03_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L03_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "But how do I use it?"
msgstr "Ale jak to mám používat?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L04_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L04_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"First, you need a caller that's appropriate for the animal you want to "
"attract."
msgstr "Nejdřív potřebuješ vábničku vhodnou pro zvěř, kterou chceš přilákat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L05_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L05_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"As wolves are predators, you'd want a caller that imitates prey sounds."
msgstr ""
"Vlci jsou šelmy, takže potřebuješ vábničku napodobující hlas jejich kořisti."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L06_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L06_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"When you start calling, there's a timing you should follow. If you call too "
"often, the animal will know that something's suspicious and unnatural."
msgstr ""
"Při vábení záleží na načasování. Když budeš vábit příliš často, zvěř pozná, "
"že volání zní nepřirozeně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L07_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L07_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"Certain callers let you switch between calls suitable for different fitness "
"levels, age groups and sexes."
msgstr ""
"U některých vábniček můžeš přepínat mezi hlasy určenými pro zvěř různé "
"genetické kvality, věku a pohlaví."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L08_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L08_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"With the Jackrabbit caller, you can call predators, which is its main use."
msgstr "Vábničkou Jackrabbit můžeš přilákat predátory; k tomu je určená."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L09_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L09_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid "But you can switch to call hares with it."
msgstr "Můžeš ale přepnout na hlas pro vábení zajíců."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L10_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L10_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid "As the name suggests."
msgstr "Jak název napovídá."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L11_PLAYER_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L11_PLAYER_OP02"
msgid "Observing animal intelligence... No idea what you mean."
msgstr "Pozorování zvířecí inteligence... Nevím, co tím myslíš."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L12_MIKAEL_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L12_MIKAEL_OP02"
msgid "Hm... In terms you already know..."
msgstr "Hm... Když to řeknu v pojmech, které už znáš..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L13_MIKAEL_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L13_MIKAEL_OP02"
msgid ""
"Wildlife behavior, or as I said intelligence, is influenced by the animal's "
"physical condition."
msgstr ""
"Chování zvěře, tedy to, čemu jsem říkal její inteligence, závisí na tělesné "
"kondici."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L14_MIKAEL_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L14_MIKAEL_OP02"
msgid ""
"Both age and fitness contribute to an animal's levels of caution and "
"experience."
msgstr "Věk i genetická kvalita ovlivňují, jak je zvěř ostražitá a zkušená."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L15_MIKAEL_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L15_MIKAEL_OP02"
msgid ""
"And experience will cause the animal to be smarter and move into higher "
"cover, so an older high-fitness animal may be more likely to be hiding in an"
" area you already know, just a little bit better hidden."
msgstr ""
"Se zkušenostmi je zvěř obezřetnější a drží se ve vyšším porostu. Starší "
"jedinec s vysokou genetickou kvalitou se tak může pohybovat v oblasti, "
"kterou už znáš, ale bude lépe ukrytý."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L16_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L16_PLAYER"
msgid "Better get to hunting."
msgstr "Radši půjdu lovit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE03"
msgid ""
"Call a Northwestern gray wolf to the distance of "
"{maxCallDistance}|displayAs(distance) or less from you."
msgstr ""
"Pomocí vábničky přilákejte vlka kanadského na vzdálenost nejvýše "
"{maxCallDistance}|displayAs(distance) od vás."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"For larger animals, you need more effective firearms so you don’t lose as "
"much meat due to damage caused by the ammunition. So this is the perfect "
"time to save up some money and buy a better rifle!"
msgstr ""
"Při lovu větší zvěře je důležité zvolit dostatečně účinnou zbraň a střelivo."
" Omezíte tak poškození a ztrátu zvěřiny. Je čas našetřit si na lepší pušku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_NAME"
msgid "One shot, no waste"
msgstr "Jedna rána, žádné plýtvání"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_MIKAEL"
msgid "Let's get to the last one."
msgstr "Pojďme na poslední téma."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_MIKAEL"
msgid "I want you to learn how to avoid losing meat when you harvest."
msgstr "Chci tě naučit, jak při lovu zbytečně nepřicházet o zvěřinu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_MIKAEL"
msgid "Do you know when that happens?"
msgstr "Víš, kdy k těm ztrátám dochází?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER_A"
msgid "No, I just follow my instinct."
msgstr "Ne, řídím se instinktem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_MIKAEL_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_MIKAEL_A"
msgid "Well, you shouldn't."
msgstr "Tak se radši neřiď."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_MIKAEL_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_MIKAEL_A"
msgid ""
"Apart from losing too much meat, which means money, you can also cause the "
"animal unnecessary suffering."
msgstr ""
"Kromě ztráty zvěřiny, a tím i peněz, můžeš zvířeti způsobit zbytečné "
"utrpení."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_MIKAEL_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_MIKAEL_A"
msgid "I'll pretend I didn't hear you say that."
msgstr "Budu dělat, že jsem to neslyšel."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_MIKAEL_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_MIKAEL_A"
msgid ""
"You waste meat when you don't pick a firearm and ammunition with optimal "
"energy."
msgstr ""
"O zvěřinu přicházíš, když nezvolíš zbraň a střelivo s odpovídající energií."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_PLAYER_B"
msgid "When you mis-steak it."
msgstr "Když to zmasím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_MIKAEL_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_MIKAEL_B"
msgid "Look, I'm trying to help you out here."
msgstr "Hele, snažím se ti pomoct."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_PLAYER_C"
msgid "When you use ammunition of the wrong tier."
msgstr "Když použiju střelivo nesprávné úrovně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_MIKAEL_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_MIKAEL_C"
msgid ""
"That's one example. Or when you shoot the animal too many times, too "
"close..."
msgstr ""
"To je jeden příklad. Stejně tak když na zvíře vystřelíš příliš mnohokrát "
"nebo z příliš malé vzdálenosti..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_MIKAEL_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_MIKAEL_C"
msgid ""
"But mostly it’s about picking a firearm and ammunition with optimal energy."
msgstr "Nejdůležitější je ale vybrat zbraň a střelivo s odpovídající energií."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"There are two tiers: one for the ammunition your firearm uses, and one for "
"the animal you want to harvest. The numbers should match."
msgstr ""
"Jsou tu dvě úrovně: úroveň střeliva pro tvou zbraň a úroveň zvěře, kterou "
"chceš ulovit. Čísla by měla souhlasit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_MIKAEL"
msgid "The guides you got from Hearth & Hunt explain it all in more detail."
msgstr "Příručky od Hearth & Hunt to vysvětlují podrobněji."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_MIKAEL"
msgid "For this assignment, I'd like you to harvest a wood bison."
msgstr "Teď zkus ulovit bizona lesního."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"They may not seem that big from a distance, but they can weigh as much as a "
"small car."
msgstr ""
"Z dálky se bizoni nemusí zdát tak velcí, ale mohou vážit tolik jako malé "
"auto."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_MIKAEL"
msgid "Wood bison belong to tier 8."
msgstr "Bizon lesní patří do úrovně 8."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"To harvest them properly, pick a firearm that supports tier 8 ammunition."
msgstr "Vyber zbraň na střelivo úrovně 8, ať ho ulovíš čistě."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"Just to confirm that you know everything you need to know, I'll need to see "
"a wood bison downed after one shot to the vitals."
msgstr ""
"Abych měl jistotu, že už víš, co je potřeba, ulov bizona lesního jedinou "
"ranou na komoru."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"This will help you to be more effective. Remember, your goal is to kill the "
"animal on the spot, always."
msgstr ""
"Tak budeš lovit účinněji. Pamatuj, že cílem je vždy skolit zvěř na místě."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_MIKAEL"
msgid "No needless pain, least damage to the meat possible. The perfect shot."
msgstr ""
"Bez zbytečného utrpení a s co nejmenším poškozením zvěřiny. Dokonalá rána."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"Buy a firearm that supports tier 8 ammunition if you don't already own one."
msgstr "Pokud ještě nemáš zbraň na střelivo úrovně 8, kup si ji."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_MIKAEL"
msgid "And this time, I won't highlight any herd on your Hunting map."
msgstr "Tentokrát ti na lovecké mapě nevyznačím žádné stádo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"Instead, once you're tracking this assignment, you'll see larger territory "
"outlines highlighted. That's where wood bison live in New Laurentia."
msgstr ""
"Jakmile začneš tento úkol sledovat, uvidíš na mapě vyznačené větší oblasti "
"výskytu bizona lesního v New Laurentia."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"You'll receive similar highlights for all your future assignments that "
"require a certain species. They serve as a recommendation. If you go there, "
"you may find the animal species you're looking for."
msgstr ""
"Podobné oblasti ti mapa ukáže i v dalších úkolech zaměřených na určitý druh "
"zvěře. Ber je jako vodítko: v označené oblasti můžeš hledanou zvěř najít."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"Discover tracks, stalk or ambush animals. Remember that animals won't be "
"waiting for you, they'll be following their daily routines."
msgstr ""
"Hledej tropy, šoulej nebo na zvěř číhej. Nečeká na tebe – řídí se svým "
"denním režimem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_MIKAEL"
msgid "Right, that's enough talking from me."
msgstr "No, už jsem toho namluvil dost."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "to himself"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_MIKAEL"
msgid "Ugh, this is the hardest job I ever had..."
msgstr "Uf, tohle je ta nejtěžší práce, jakou jsem kdy měl..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Harvest a Wood bison shot to its vitals (the heart or lungs)."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte bizona lesního ranou na komoru (srdce nebo plíce) a zpracujte ho."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L01_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L01_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid ""
"I don't think I understand the concept of meat damage. Can you explain it "
"again?"
msgstr ""
"Pořád mi není jasné, jak dochází ke ztrátě zvěřiny. Vysvětlíš mi to ještě "
"jednou?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L02_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L02_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"You get a kick out of asking me about complicated topics, just because you "
"know I don't like talking, huh?"
msgstr ""
"Ty se mě na složité věci ptáš schválně, protože víš, že nerad mluvím, co?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L03_PLAYER_OP01_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L03_PLAYER_OP01_A"
msgid "You got me."
msgstr "Prokoukl jsi mě."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L04_MIKAEL_OP01_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L04_MIKAEL_OP01_A"
msgid "Did someone prep you on how to test the limits of my patience?"
msgstr "Poradil ti někdo, jak pokoušet moji trpělivost?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L05_PLAYER_OP01_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L05_PLAYER_OP01_A"
msgid "Yep. I've got the full list right here. Wanna hear it?"
msgstr "Jo. Mám tady celý seznam. Chceš ho slyšet?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L06_MIKAEL_OP01_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L06_MIKAEL_OP01_A"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr "Jasně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L07_PLAYER_OP01_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L07_PLAYER_OP01_A"
msgid "First, continually pretend you don't understand what Mikael is saying."
msgstr "Zaprvé: pořád předstírej, že Mikaelovi nerozumíš."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L08_PLAYER_OP01_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L08_PLAYER_OP01_A"
msgid "Second, make him talk as much as possible."
msgstr "Zadruhé: nech ho mluvit co nejvíc."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L09_PLAYER_OP01_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L09_PLAYER_OP01_A"
msgid "And finally, make fun of his accent."
msgstr "A nakonec si dělej legraci z jeho přízvuku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L10_MIKAEL_OP01_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L10_MIKAEL_OP01_A"
msgid "Well, at least you haven't made fun of my accent."
msgstr "No, aspoň můj přízvuk zatím necháváš na pokoji."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L11_PLAYER_OP01_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for translators" : "ö - incorporated as a special
#. Finnish symbol"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L11_PLAYER_OP01_A"
msgid "Nöt yet."
msgstr "Ještě nö."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L12_MIKAEL_OP01_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L12_MIKAEL_OP01_A"
msgid "(laughs)"
msgstr "(smích)"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L13_MIKAEL_OP01_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "smiling, amused"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L13_MIKAEL_OP01_A"
msgid "So, do you want to hear about meat damage, or not?"
msgstr "Tak chceš slyšet, jak vznikají ztráty zvěřiny, nebo ne?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L14_PLAYER_OP01_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L14_PLAYER_OP01_A"
msgid "Yeah, sure."
msgstr "Jo, jasně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L15_PLAYER_OP01_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L15_PLAYER_OP01_A"
msgid "Not really."
msgstr "Vlastně ne."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L16_PLAYER_OP01_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L16_PLAYER_OP01_B"
msgid "I'm sorry. I'll leave you in peace."
msgstr "Promiň. Nechám tě být."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L17_PLAYER_OP01_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L17_PLAYER_OP01_C"
msgid "Doesn't sound too complicated. Just give me the lowdown."
msgstr "To nezní složitě. Tak mi řekni to hlavní."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L18_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L18_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid "Okay, there are three types of meat loss."
msgstr "Dobře. Zvěřinu ztrácíš třemi způsoby."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L19_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L19_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"First, the meat lost because of the type of projectile your ammunition has."
msgstr "Za prvé o ni přicházíš kvůli typu použité střely."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L20_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L20_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid "Let's say you're using a hollow-point bullet."
msgstr "Představ si třeba střelu s dutou špičkou."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L21_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L21_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"It'll expand on impact with an animal, transferring more, or even all, of "
"the projectile's energy into the target over a shorter distance."
msgstr ""
"Při zásahu se roztáhne a na krátké dráze předá zvěři větší část, někdy i "
"veškerou svou energii."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L22_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L22_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"This means higher meat loss. It usually drops animals quickly and has little"
" to no chance of pass-through, meaning the bullet often stays inside."
msgstr ""
"To znamená větší poškození zvěřiny. Střela zvěř obvykle rychle skolí a jen "
"zřídka jí zcela projde, takže často zůstane v těle."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L23_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L23_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"Second, the animal's body decomposes over time, that's why you want animals "
"to drop quickly."
msgstr ""
"Za druhé se tělo ulovené zvěře postupně rozkládá. Proto je důležité, aby "
"zasažené zvíře padlo co nejdřív."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L24_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L24_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"And the third way you will definitely lose some meat is when you're dressing"
" it."
msgstr "A za třetí se část zvěřiny nevyhnutelně ztratí při zpracování úlovku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L25_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L25_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid "Removing organs, bones and other waste."
msgstr "Odstraní se vnitřnosti, kosti a další nevyužitelné části."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L26_PLAYER_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L26_PLAYER_OP02"
msgid "How do I find out which animal has which tier?"
msgstr "Jak zjistím, do jaké úrovně zvěř patří?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L27_MIKAEL_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L27_MIKAEL_OP02"
msgid ""
"Start by discovering their tracks, or by analyzing animals with your "
"binoculars. Then open your Encyclopedia and check the number."
msgstr ""
"Najdi její stopy nebo ji prohlédni dalekohledem. Pak otevři encyklopedii a "
"podívej se na uvedenou úroveň."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L28_PLAYER_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L28_PLAYER_OP03"
msgid "I don't see any Wood bison herd highlighted on my Hunting map."
msgstr "Na lovecké mapě nevidím vyznačené žádné stádo bizonů lesních."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L29_MIKAEL_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L29_MIKAEL_OP03"
msgid "Make sure you're tracking the objective you want to see highlighted."
msgstr "Ujisti se, že sleduješ příslušný cíl úkolu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L30_MIKAEL_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L30_MIKAEL_OP03"
msgid ""
"As I mentioned, you won't see a specific herd anymore. You'll see the "
"outlines of the territories where the entire species lives in New Laurentia."
msgstr ""
"Jak už jsem říkal, jednotlivá stáda se teď neoznačují. Místo nich uvidíš "
"hranice oblastí, kde bizoni lesní žijí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L31_PLAYER_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L31_PLAYER_OP03"
msgid "And if I don't?"
msgstr "A když je neuvidím?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L32_MIKAEL_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L32_MIKAEL_OP03"
msgid "Then you should probably report a bug."
msgstr "Pak nahlas chybu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L33_MIKAEL_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L33_MIKAEL_OP03"
msgid "To Hearth & Hunt. Not me."
msgstr "Hearth & Hunt, ne mně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L34_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L34_PLAYER"
msgid "No more questions. I think I got all the bases covered."
msgstr "Další otázky nemám. Myslím, že už v tom mám jasno."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L35_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "Finnish for good luck"
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Finnish for good luck\npronounciation: TSEM-
#. pee-ah "
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L35_MIKAEL"
msgid "Tsemppiä."
msgstr "Tsemppiä."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L01_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L01_MIKAEL"
msgid "You did it! Now I can finally pack my bags."
msgstr "Povedlo se! Teď už si konečně můžu sbalit věci."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L02_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L02_PLAYER"
msgid "Why is Angel sending you away, anyway?"
msgstr "Proč tě vlastně Angel posílá pryč?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L03_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L03_MIKAEL"
msgid "Ugh. It's kind of embarrassing."
msgstr "Uf. Je to trochu trapné."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L04_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L04_MIKAEL"
msgid "But I suppose you deserve to know."
msgstr "Ale asi máš právo to vědět."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L05_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L05_MIKAEL"
msgid ""
"My evaluation said that I was doing well... in some areas. But that other "
"areas require \"a different personality type,\" as Angel put it."
msgstr ""
"V hodnocení stálo, že se mi v některých oblastech daří... Jenže pro jiné je "
"prý potřeba „jiný typ osobnosti“, jak to řekl Angel."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L06_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L06_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "What personality type?"
msgstr "Jaký typ osobnosti?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L07_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L07_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"Someone who gets on well with other people... Or at least tolerates them."
msgstr "Někdo, kdo dobře vychází s lidmi... nebo je aspoň snáší."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L08_PLAYER_OP01_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L08_PLAYER_OP01_A"
msgid "I can fake it for the job."
msgstr "Můžu to předstírat kvůli práci."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L09_MIKAEL_OP01_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L09_MIKAEL_OP01_A"
msgid "Then you possess qualities I don't."
msgstr "Pak máš vlastnosti, které já nemám."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L10_PLAYER_OP01_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L10_PLAYER_OP01_B"
msgid "Then I guess I fit the bill!"
msgstr "Pak se asi hodím!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L11_MIKAEL_OP01_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L11_MIKAEL_OP01_B"
msgid "I agree."
msgstr "Souhlasím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L12_MIKAEL_OP01_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L12_MIKAEL_OP01_B"
msgid "You even managed to get me talking."
msgstr "Dokonce se ti podařilo mě rozpovídat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L13_MIKAEL_OP01_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L13_MIKAEL_OP01_B"
msgid "And that never happens to me. Ever."
msgstr "A to se mi nestává. Nikdy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L14_MIKAEL_OP01_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L14_MIKAEL_OP01_B"
msgid "I think Angel will appreciate you more in this role."
msgstr "Myslím, že Angel tě v této roli ocení víc."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L15_PLAYER_OP01_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L15_PLAYER_OP01_C"
msgid ""
"It seems like an unnecessary requirement, for a job spending entire days "
"alone in nature."
msgstr ""
"To mi připadá jako zbytečný požadavek na práci, při které člověk tráví celé "
"dny sám v přírodě."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L16_MIKAEL_OP01_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L16_MIKAEL_OP01_C"
msgid "I agree with you."
msgstr "Souhlasím s tebou."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L17_MIKAEL_OP01_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L17_MIKAEL_OP01_C"
msgid "But Angel doesn't."
msgstr "Ale Angel ne."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L18_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L18_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid "As a parting gift, I'll give you the lowdown on some of the locals."
msgstr "Na rozloučenou ti povím něco o zdejších lidech."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L19_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L19_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"Juniper Crane. You're supposed to get her to join Hearth & Hunt, but she's "
"like me."
msgstr ""
"Juniper Crane. Máš ji přesvědčit, aby se přidala k Hearth & Hunt, jenže je "
"dost podobná mně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L20_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L20_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid "She doesn't like people. Or talking."
msgstr "Nemá ráda lidi. Ani povídání."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L21_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L21_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid "But she loves dogs, so talk to her about them."
msgstr "Zato miluje psy, tak si s ní o nich promluv."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L22_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L22_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"Patrick Harper, on the other hand, now he's a talker. Small talker, big "
"talker, walkie talker..."
msgstr ""
"Patrick Harper je pravý opak. Ten mluví pořád – o maličkostech, o velkých "
"věcech, klidně i do vysílačky..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L23_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L23_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid ""
"Unlike his wife Regina, who doesn't suffer fools gladly. Listen to what she "
"has to say, and don't be rude."
msgstr ""
"Jeho žena Regina je ale jiná. S hlupáky nemá trpělivost. Poslouchej ji a "
"nechovej se k ní neuctivě."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L24_MIKAEL_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L24_MIKAEL_OP01"
msgid "Or dismissive about her dreams. Like I was."
msgstr "A neber její sny na lehkou váhu. Já tu chybu udělal."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L25_PLAYER_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L25_PLAYER_OP02"
msgid "Why did you leave Lintukoto Reserve?"
msgstr "Proč jsi opustil rezervaci Lintukoto?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L26_MIKAEL_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L26_MIKAEL_OP02"
msgid ""
"Well, Hearth & Hunt is a great company. I've always liked their guiding "
"principles."
msgstr "Hearth & Hunt je skvělá společnost. Vždycky se mi líbily její zásady."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L27_MIKAEL_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L27_MIKAEL_OP02"
msgid ""
"I was actually recruited by the founder herself, Genevieve Hearth, years "
"ago."
msgstr "Vlastně mě před lety naverbovala sama zakladatelka Genevieve Hearth."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L28_MIKAEL_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L28_MIKAEL_OP02"
msgid ""
"She's passionate about preserving nature, connecting other hunters and "
"creating this sort of mushroom-like underground network."
msgstr ""
"Záleží jí na ochraně přírody i propojování myslivců. Buduje mezi nimi síť "
"kontaktů, skoro jako podhoubí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L29_MIKAEL_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L29_MIKAEL_OP02"
msgid ""
"But maybe Angel's right, and it's time for me to move on to a new reserve."
msgstr "Možná má ale Angel pravdu a je čas přesunout se do jiné rezervace."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L30_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L30_PLAYER"
msgid "Good luck out there."
msgstr "Hodně štěstí v nové rezervaci."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L31_MIKAEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORY05_MISSION04_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L31_MIKAEL"
msgid "Best of luck to you as well."
msgstr "I tobě hodně štěstí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Your travels in New Laurentia have come to an end. All that's left to do is "
"update the data on the locals with the new information you've learned, and "
"it will be shared with the rest of the Hearth & Hunt company."
msgstr ""
"Vaše působení v New Laurentia je u konce. Zbývá doplnit záznamy o místních "
"obyvatelích o nové poznatky a předat je ostatním pracovníkům Hearth & Hunt."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_NAME"
msgid "A hunt for a home"
msgstr "Honba za domovem"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 objective01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Update the Hearth & Hunt binder."
msgstr "Aktualizujte pořadač Hearth & Hunt."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L01_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Angel calls to the player after they finish
#. all the tasks in New Laurentia. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L01_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"Looks like you're done with all the tasks I needed from you for New "
"Laurentia."
msgstr ""
"Vypadá to, že máte hotové všechny úkoly, které jsem vám v New Laurentia "
"zadal."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L02_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L02_ANGEL"
msgid "And it didn't even hurt."
msgstr "A ani to nebolelo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L03_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L03_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"We almost lost a dog and a crazy married couple, but you've certainly helped"
" me sort out a real headache."
msgstr ""
"Málem jsme přišli o psa a jeden bláznivý manželský pár, ale pomohli jste mi "
"vyřešit pořádný problém."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L04_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L04_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"And our CEO, who also happens to be my mother, has incentivized us to "
"provide personalized gifts to our reps."
msgstr ""
"A naše generální ředitelka, která je shodou okolností i mou matkou, nás "
"vybídla, abychom našim zástupcům dávali dárky vybrané přímo pro ně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L05_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L05_ANGEL"
msgid "To make it feel more like a \"family\", I guess."
msgstr "Asi aby si tu všichni připadali jako v „rodině“."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L06_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L06_ANGEL"
msgid "I've sent your gift to your lodge."
msgstr "Dárek jsem vám poslal na loveckou chatu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L07_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L07_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"You'll probably be working with another coordinator at the next reserve, one"
" of my dear siblings."
msgstr ""
"V další rezervaci budete nejspíš spolupracovat s jiným koordinátorem, s "
"jedním z mých drahých sourozenců."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L08_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L08_ANGEL"
msgid ""
"I know some might see me as reserved or overly serious, but I'm actually "
"quite easy to work with, compared to them."
msgstr ""
"Vím, že někomu připadám odměřený nebo příliš vážný. Ve srovnání s nimi se se"
" mnou ale spolupracuje docela snadno."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L09_ANGEL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map01 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP01MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L09_ANGEL"
msgid "Good luck."
msgstr "Hodně štěstí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission01 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Someone who's trying to look impartial is asking themselves a question: "
"which is better, a compound crossbow or a recurve? They make a list of the "
"various pros and cons, and in the end they settle on the recurve crossbow. "
"What about you?"
msgstr ""
"Co je lepší: kladková, nebo reflexní kuše? Někdo se snaží tvářit nestranně, "
"sepíše výhody i nevýhody obou typů a nakonec si vybere reflexní kuši. Jakou "
"byste zvolili vy?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission01 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION01_NAME"
msgid "To recurve or not to recurve?"
msgstr "Reflexní kuše, či ne?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION01_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission01 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION01_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest a male Blesbok using a recurve crossbow. Shoot only once, delivering"
" between {minEnergy}|displayAs(projectileEnergy) and "
"{maxEnergy}|displayAs(projectileEnergy) of energy."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte samce buvolce běločelého reflexní kuší jediným výstřelem."
" Energie zásahu musí být mezi {minEnergy}|displayAs(projectileEnergy) a "
"{maxEnergy}|displayAs(projectileEnergy)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION01_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission01 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION01_READABLE"
msgid ""
"My buddy and I have an on-going dispute over crossbows.\n"
"\n"
"Recurve or compound?\n"
"\n"
"Now, let me give you some straight facts so you can decide for yourself.\n"
"\n"
"Recurve crossbows are simple and RELIABLE! They're lightweight and easy to aim. They may be a bit bigger—but bigger's always better! And it's true that they have a heavy draw weight, but if you're strong enough, what's the problem? They're the clear winner for anyone who values reliability and low cost. It's win-win, right?\n"
"\n"
"Then there's the compound crossbow. Their cam system MIGHT make them faster, more powerful, and easier to draw, but who cares about that? Anyway, they're heavier, more complex, and they need more maintenance. I suppose they might have the edge if you're looking for speed and power though.\n"
"\n"
"So which would you choose?\n"
"\n"
"RECURVE is the correct answer! I'm absolutely not biased. If you think I am, well, just get out there and try it for yourself.\n"
"\n"
"Eddie Pickle, recurve crossbow enthusiast"
msgstr ""
"S kamarádem se pořád přeme o kuše.\n"
"\n"
"Reflexní, nebo kladková?\n"
"\n"
"Uvedu pár nezpochybnitelných faktů. Rozhodněte se sami.\n"
"\n"
"Reflexní kuše jsou jednoduché a SPOLEHLIVÉ! Jsou lehké a snadno se s nimi míří. Možná jsou trochu větší, ale větší přece znamená lepší! A ano, k natažení potřebujete víc síly. Pokud ji máte, kde je problém? Kdo chce spolehlivou kuši za rozumnou cenu, má jasného vítěze.\n"
"\n"
"Pak je tu kladková kuše. Kladky ji MOŽNÁ dělají rychlejší, výkonnější a snazší k natažení. Ale koho to zajímá? Je těžší, složitější a potřebuje víc údržby. Pokud vám ovšem jde hlavně o rychlost a sílu, může mít navrch.\n"
"\n"
"Tak kterou si vyberete?\n"
"\n"
"Správná odpověď je REFLEXNÍ! Jsem naprosto nestranný. Jestli mi nevěříte, vyzkoušejte si obě sami.\n"
"\n"
"Eddie Pickle, nadšenec do reflexních kuší"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION02_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission02 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION02_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"To help develop your hunting skills, and encourage you to think on your "
"feet, you've undertaken a task set by a world-renowned gun trainer. If you "
"want to get the harvest even when the circumstances aren't ideal, you make "
"them ideal, or you don't take the shot."
msgstr ""
"Přijali jste úkol od světoznámého instruktora střelby. Má prověřit vaše "
"lovecké schopnosti a pohotovost. Když podmínky pro bezpečný a přesný zásah "
"nejsou ideální, nejprve si je vytvořte — nebo nestřílejte."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION02_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission02 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION02_NAME"
msgid "Right time, right place"
msgstr "Správný čas, správné místo"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION02_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission02 objective01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION02_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Harvest a Blue wildebeest. Shoot it only once from a rifle."
msgstr "Ulovte a zpracujte pakoně modrého jediným výstřelem z kulovnice."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION02_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission02 objective02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION02_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid "Harvest a Yellow-billed duck. Shoot it only once from a bow."
msgstr "Ulovte a zpracujte kachnu žlutozobou lukem jediným šípem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION02_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "changed after localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission02 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION02_READABLE"
msgid ""
"Now, this may be the most challenging task you've come across, but I don't avoid situations just because they're challenging.\n"
"\n"
"There may be a time when you come across the perfect harvest, but you don't have the ideal weapon. That doesn't matter. What matters is that you change the circumstances so that your weapon becomes ideal! Say you're only carrying a weak-ass rifle, because you got a taste for honey badgers, and now you come across the wildebeest you tracked last week that got away. What should you do?\n"
"\n"
"You can either go home and hope you'll bump into him again—or you can create the best situation for the circumstances. In this case, closing the distance as much as possible, making your rifle an effective and humane option.\n"
"\n"
"Take another example—there's a yellow-billed duck, but you only have a bow. This is actually great target practice, and it has a deep-rooted tradition, but it's tricky. If the hunter can take an accurate shot at close range, a well-placed arrow can be just as lethal and humane as a shotgun pellet spread.\n"
"\n"
"Don't take on this task if your skills aren't up to it. But if they are, it'll help you turn tricky circumstances to your advantage.\n"
"\n"
"Andaluzio Word, gun trainer"
msgstr ""
"Možná jde o nejtěžší úkol, s jakým jste se setkali. Já se ale výzvám nevyhýbám.\n"
"\n"
"Někdy narazíte na vhodnou zvěř, ale nemáte zrovna ideální zbraň. Pak musíte buď změnit podmínky, nebo nevystřelit. Představte si, že máte jen slabší kulovnici, protože jste původně šli po medojedovi. Najednou před vámi stojí pakoň, kterého jste minulý týden ztratili ze stop. Co uděláte?\n"
"\n"
"Můžete jít domů a doufat v další setkání. Nebo se přiblížit natolik, aby vaše kulovnice umožnila účinný a šetrný zásah.\n"
"\n"
"A co když před vámi stojí kachna žlutozobá a vy máte jen luk? Lov ptáků lukem má dlouhou tradici a procvičí přesnost, ale není snadný. Na krátkou vzdálenost může správně umístěný šíp usmrtit stejně rychle jako zásah brokovnicí.\n"
"\n"
"Do úkolu se nepouštějte, pokud si na něj nevěříte. Pokud své schopnosti znáte, naučí vás zvládat i nezvyklé podmínky.\n"
"\n"
"Andaluzio Word, instruktor střelby"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION03_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission03 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION03_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"This writer needs a picture for his book. He doesn't want you to take the "
"photograph—he wants to take it. Your job is to bring a male and a female "
"lion together during the golden hour. And he has more feline trivia: a "
"lion's roar can be heard from up to 5 miles (8 kilometers) away."
msgstr ""
"Spisovatel potřebuje snímek do své knihy, ale vyfotit ho chce sám. Vaším "
"úkolem je přivést během zlaté hodiny do blízkosti samce a samici lva. Rád "
"také připomíná, že lví řev je slyšet až na osm kilometrů."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION03_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission03 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION03_NAME"
msgid "The golden hour"
msgstr "Zlatá hodina"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION03_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission03 objective01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION03_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Shoot and harvest a male Lion during the golden hour, from "
"({timeFrom}|displayAs(timeShort) until {timeTo}|displayAs(timeShort))."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte samce lva během zlaté hodiny, mezi "
"{timeFrom}|displayAs(timeShort) a {timeTo}|displayAs(timeShort)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION03_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission03 objective02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION03_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid ""
"Shoot and harvest a female Lion during the golden hour, from "
"({timeFrom}|displayAs(timeShort) until {timeTo}|displayAs(timeShort))."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte lvici během zlaté hodiny, mezi "
"{timeFrom}|displayAs(timeShort) a {timeTo}|displayAs(timeShort)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION03_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission03 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION03_READABLE"
msgid ""
"I'm writing a book about lions. It's called Lion's Roar. I know the title isn't very original, but I don't strive for originality; it's meant to be an educational book packed with extensive information about lions.\n"
"\n"
"I already know what I want for the front cover: a beautiful male and female lion with the golden hour light behind them. Maybe it's a bit on the nose, but again, originality isn't my goal. I want anyone who wishes to learn about this species to know that THIS is the book for them.\n"
"\n"
"So, can you bring the lions together to the same place during the golden hour? I'll take the photo myself. In return, I can share some trivia from my book (and, of course, I'll pay you as well). For example:\n"
"\n"
"— Young lions have rosettes and spots on their sandy coats, but these generally disappear as they mature.\n"
"\n"
"— Not all male lions have manes. \"Maneless\" males are common in parts of Africa, such as Tsavo National Park in Kenya. This is thought to be an adaptation to the local climate, as manes can reduce heat loss.\n"
"\n"
"— Lions often hunt during storms. The noise, rain, and wind make it harder for prey to see or hear them, increasing the lions' chances of success."
msgstr ""
"Píšu knihu o lvech. Jmenuje se Lion's Roar. Příliš originální název to není, ale o originalitu mi nejde. Chci napsat poučnou knihu plnou informací o lvech.\n"
"\n"
"Na obálce chci mít lva a lvici ve světle zlaté hodiny. Možná je to prvoplánové, ale každý zájemce o lvy hned pozná, že tahle kniha je pro něj.\n"
"\n"
"Dostanete je ve zlaté hodině na jedno místo? Snímek pořídím sám. Zaplatím vám a přidám pár zajímavostí z knihy. Třeba tyto:\n"
"\n"
"— Mláďata lva mají na světlé srsti skvrny a kresbu připomínající rozety. S věkem většinou mizí.\n"
"\n"
"— Ne každému lvu samci roste hříva. V některých částech Afriky, například v keňském národním parku Tsavo, žijí i samci bez hřívy. Může jít o přizpůsobení teplému podnebí, protože hříva brání úniku tepla.\n"
"\n"
"— Lvi často loví za bouře. Déšť, vítr a hluk kořisti ztěžují, aby je včas spatřila nebo zaslechla."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION04_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission04 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION04_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Professor Wax wants to give his wife a thoughtful gift to make up for her "
"losing her favorite earrings. He's planning to give her... giant kudu horns "
"that look just like her lost earrings. Maybe she'll like them! It's your job"
" to find the best kudu for his gift."
msgstr ""
"Profesor Wax chce své ženě vynahradit ztrátu oblíbených náušnic. Napadlo ho "
"darovat jí velké rohy kudu, které mu je připomínají. Najděte pro jeho dárek "
"kudu s co nejlepší trofejí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION04_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission04 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION04_NAME"
msgid "A perfectly sensible gift"
msgstr "Naprosto rozumný dárek"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION04_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission04 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION04_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest a Greater kudu. Its Trophy rating must be "
"{minStar}|displayAs(ratingStars)."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte kudu velkého. Hodnocení jeho trofeje musí být "
"{minStar}|displayAs(ratingStars)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION04_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission04 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION04_READABLE"
msgid ""
"My wife once had a pair of sapphire earrings shaped like kudu horns. They weren't real horns, of course, just inspired by their shape. Last year, she lost those earrings, and I want to surprise her with something even more special: real kudu horns, bejeweled with sapphires. These will be so large that she won't be able to lose them. She won't be able to wear them either, of course, but that's okay.\n"
"\n"
"I've been researching kudu horns, and they are truly fascinating. At first, I thought they shed their horns like deer do, but it turns out that's not the case. Male kudus start growing their horns at around six months of age, and the twisting usually happens twice during their lifespan. They use their horns to attract females and establish dominance. Interestingly, the length and number of twists can help indicate a kudu's age. Older males have longer horns with more twists.\n"
"\n"
"Please find the longest horns you can.\n"
"\n"
"Send them to:\n"
"Professor Balthazar WAX\n"
"123 Curlyhorn Crescent"
msgstr ""
"Moje žena kdysi měla safírové náušnice ve tvaru rohů kudu. Skutečné rohy to samozřejmě nebyly, jen se jejich tvarem inspirovaly. Loni náušnice ztratila, a tak ji chci překvapit něčím výjimečným: opravdovými rohy kudu osazenými safíry. Budou tak veliké, že je neztratí. Nosit je pochopitelně také nebude, ale to nevadí.\n"
"\n"
"Rohy kudu jsem si důkladně prostudoval. Nejdřív jsem si myslel, že je shazují jako jelenovití parohy, ale tak to není. Samcům začínají rohy růst zhruba v šesti měsících a během života se obvykle dvakrát spirálovitě stočí. Pomáhají jim přilákat samice a prosadit se mezi ostatními samci. Délka rohů i počet závitů může napovědět věk jedince: starší samci mívají delší rohy s více závity.\n"
"\n"
"Najděte prosím co nejdelší rohy.\n"
"\n"
"Zašlete je na adresu:\n"
"profesor Balthazar WAX\n"
"123 Curlyhorn Crescent"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION05_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission05 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION05_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"A local veterinary epidemiologist is warning about an illness that spreads "
"quickly among young crocodiles. She's asking for your assistance to help "
"prevent it."
msgstr ""
"Místní veterinární epidemioložka varuje před nemocí, která se rychle šíří "
"mezi mladými krokodýly. Požádala vás o pomoc s jejím zvládnutím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION05_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission05 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION05_NAME"
msgid "Crocodylidpoxvirus"
msgstr "Crocodylidpoxvirus"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION05_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission05 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION05_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest a young Crocodile with its Fitness at "
"{maxFitness}|displayAs(percent) or lower."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte mladého krokodýla s genetickou kvalitou nejvýše "
"{maxFitness}|displayAs(percent)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION05_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission05 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION05_READABLE"
msgid ""
"Crocodile poxvirus is an enveloped, double-stranded DNA virus within the Poxviridae family that causes papillomatosis in crocodiles. Papillomatosis is a general medical term describing the condition of having multiple benign, wart-like growths known as papillomas.\n"
"\n"
"This is of great concern. We have received an individual with a confirmed case of poxvirus, and it spreads very easily. It's a serious threat to crocodile farms, where it most often infects hatchlings and juvenile crocodiles, but prevention is also important for wild populations. Poxvirus lesions haven't been documented in wild crocodiles thus far, but the virus itself hasn't been isolated from them yet.\n"
"\n"
"We need to begin putting prevention measures into place as soon as possible. Focus on young crocodiles with low fitness.\n"
"\n"
"Dr. Miriam K. Lategan, Veterinary Epidemiologist from Kilimaya Reserve"
msgstr ""
"Krokodýlí poxvirus je obalený dvouvláknový DNA virus z čeledi Poxviridae, který způsobuje papilomatózu u krokodýlů. Papilomatóza je obecný lékařský termín popisující výskyt mnoha nezhoubných bradavicovitých výrůstků známých jako papilomy.\n"
"\n"
"To vzbuzuje velké obavy. Přijali jsme jedince s potvrzeným případem poxviru, který se velmi snadno šíří. Je vážnou hrozbou pro krokodýlí farmy, kde nejčastěji infikuje čerstvě vylíhlá i odrostlá mláďata krokodýlů, ale prevence je důležitá i pro volně žijící populace. Poxvirové léze nebyly u divokých krokodýlů dosud zdokumentovány, ale samotný virus z nich dosud nebyl izolován.\n"
"\n"
"Musíme co nejdříve začít zavádět preventivní opatření. Zaměřte se na mladé krokodýly s nízkou genetickou kvalitou.\n"
"\n"
"Dr. Miriam K. Lategan, veterinární epidemioložka z rezervace Kilimaya"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION06_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission06 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION06_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"A local ethologist is observing the societal behavior of spotted hyenas and "
"wants your help to determine how dominance patterns shift after losing the "
"alpha female."
msgstr ""
"Místní etolog sleduje společenské chování hyen skvrnitých. Pomozte mu "
"zjistit, jak se ve skupině změní vztahy po ztrátě dominantní samice."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION06_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission06 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION06_NAME"
msgid "Who runs the world?"
msgstr "Kdo vládne světu?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION06_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission06 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION06_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest 3 female Spotted hyenas. Their Trophy ratings must be "
"{minStar}|displayAs(ratingStars) or higher."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte 3 samice hyeny skvrnité. Hodnocení trofeje každé z nich "
"musí být alespoň {minStar}|displayAs(ratingStars)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION06_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission06 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION06_READABLE"
msgid ""
"I study sociology in animals, and in the last few years my research has been completely focused on spotted hyenas.\n"
"\n"
"Unlike most other animals, spotted hyenas live in a matriarchal society. Females hold the alpha position and dominate males. Even the highest-ranking male is still below the lowest-ranking female. When it comes to feeding, males eat last.\n"
"\n"
"Spotted hyenas live in very complex societies, more complex than any other carnivorous mammal. There's a strict social hierarchy: at the top is the alpha female, followed by her offspring. Rankings can also be challenged, and the order may change over time.\n"
"\n"
"This female dominance is fascinating because it has only evolved in spotted hyenas. Their cousins, the striped hyenas, show no such behavior.\n"
"\n"
"What I want to observe is how the clan changes once they lose their alphas, and that's where you come in. Target the largest hyenas in the packs and report back to me.\n"
"\n"
"Dr. Leopold F. Snoutwhisk, Senior Field Ethologist from Hyena Behavior Research Unit at Kilimaya Reserve Wildlife Institute"
msgstr ""
"Zkoumám společenské chování zvířat. V posledních letech se věnuji hlavně hyeně skvrnité.\n"
"\n"
"Její skupiny mají matriarchální uspořádání: samice stojí nad samci. I nejvýše postavený samec má nižší postavení než samice na konci jejich hierarchie. Samci se proto dostanou k potravě až nakonec.\n"
"\n"
"Hyeny skvrnité žijí ve složitých skupinách s pevnou hierarchií. V čele stojí dominantní samice a vysoko postavená jsou i její mláďata. O pořadí se však soupeří a časem se může změnit. Tento druh samičí dominance je mezi hyenami výjimečný; hyeny žíhané se tak nechovají.\n"
"\n"
"Zajímá mě, jak se skupina promění po ztrátě vedoucích samic. Zaměřte se na největší samice a sdělte mi, co pozorujete.\n"
"\n"
"Dr. Leopold F. Snoutwhisk, vedoucí terénní etolog, Hyena Behavior Research Unit, Kilimaya Reserve Wildlife Institute"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION07_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission07 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION07_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Someone is deeply concerned about the way that ostriches evolved. They want "
"to have an ostrich for themselves as a constant reminder of how our own "
"future might turn out."
msgstr ""
"Jednoho člověka znepokojuje vývoj pštrosů. Chce si jednoho pořídit jako "
"trvalou připomínku toho, jak by mohla vypadat naše vlastní budoucnost."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION07_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission07 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION07_NAME"
msgid "Dangerous evolution"
msgstr "Nebezpečná evoluce"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION07_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission07 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION07_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest an Ostrich shot from {maxShotDistance}|displayAs(distance) or "
"closer. The animal must not be alerted before the shot. Don't use any blinds"
" or stands."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte pštrosa střeleného ze vzdálenosti nejvýše "
"{maxShotDistance}|displayAs(distance). Před výstřelem nesmí být ve střehu. "
"Nepoužívejte kryt ani posed."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION07_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission07 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION07_READABLE"
msgid ""
"I've always been fascinated by flightless birds. Why do they exist? How do they feel when they look up at the sky and see other birds traversing miles and miles?\n"
"\n"
"Ostriches, for example, are the largest birds in the world, and somehow that makes me sad. I don't know why, I mean, I presume ostriches aren't sad. Or are they? Their bodies are simply too heavy to fly, and they evolved in such a way that they don't need to, because their food is easily reachable from the ground.\n"
"\n"
"But it still makes me think. For example, we humans have knowledge and facts at our fingertips—does that mean we might evolve to no longer need critical thinking skills? The future scares me, especially when I look at ostriches. I want an ostrich for myself, to remind me that having everything you need so easily to hand can come at a cost. Sometimes, struggle is necessary.\n"
"\n"
"Please, don't alarm the ostrich before you shoot it. I want it to pass peacefully.\n"
"\n"
"Irving Featherstone (not a real ornithologist, but I'd like to be)"
msgstr ""
"Nelétaví ptáci mě odjakživa fascinují. Proč nelétají? Co asi cítí, když se dívají na oblohu a vidí jiné ptáky překonávat obrovské vzdálenosti?\n"
"\n"
"Pštros je největší pták světa a mně je ho kvůli tomu trochu líto. Sám nevím proč. Nejspíš smutný není. Anebo ano? Je příliš těžký, aby létal, a v jeho prostředí to ani nepotřebuje: potravu nachází na zemi.\n"
"\n"
"Stejně mě to nutí přemýšlet. My lidé máme všechny informace na dosah ruky. Znamená to, že jednou přestaneme potřebovat kritické myšlení? Když se dívám na pštrosa, budoucnost mě děsí. Chci mít jednoho u sebe jako připomínku, že snadný přístup ke všemu potřebnému může mít svou cenu. Někdy je třeba se snažit.\n"
"\n"
"Prosím, před zásahem pštrosa nevyplašte. Ať netrpí zbytečným strachem.\n"
"\n"
"Irving Featherstone (nejsem ornitolog, ale rád bych se jím stal)"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION08_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission08 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION08_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"This person is quite well-known among hunters for always trying to get her "
"hands on new types of meat! You've heard rumors it's because of a bet she "
"made with her grandfather, which seems to be the case. This time, it's cape "
"buffalo meat."
msgstr ""
"Meredith je mezi lovci známá tím, že neustále shání nové druhy masa. Prý se "
"o to vsadila s dědečkem. Tentokrát chce ochutnat maso buvola kaferského."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION08_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission08 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION08_NAME"
msgid "Cape buffalo is the new beef"
msgstr "Buvol je nové hovězí"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION08_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission08 objective01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION08_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Harvest a mature male Cape buffalo."
msgstr "Ulovte a zpracujte starého samce buvola kaferského."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION08_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission08 objective02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION08_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid "Harvest a mature female Cape buffalo."
msgstr "Ulovte a zpracujte starou samici buvola kaferského."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION08_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission08 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION08_READABLE"
msgid ""
"I'm Meredith St. James, heiress to the St. James Hotels, and I've made a bet with my grandfather. I bet him that I could taste 50 different types of meat without ever getting my hands dirty. Now there's a new animal at the top of the list of meat I've never tried—and believe me, I've tried a lot! Some of the meat I get my hands on is disgusting, but I'm not expecting that from this animal.\n"
"\n"
"Cape buffalo make for lean, flavorful, and often tough red meat, with a taste described as similar to beef, but with a deeper, sweeter flavor. It has lower fat and cholesterol content than beef, and it's a rich source of protein.\n"
"\n"
"I already have a recipe for it in mind, which pairs well with a glass of red. And to truly check it off my list, I'll need both a male and a female (I discovered my grandfather had slipped this clause in after I made the bet, the old fox!).\n"
"\n"
"Please contact my assistant for delivery details: +565xx416"
msgstr ""
"Jsem Meredith St. James, dědička hotelů St. James. Vsadila jsem se s dědečkem, že ochutnám 50 druhů masa, aniž bych si ušpinila ruce. Na prvním místě mého seznamu je teď maso zvířete, které jsem ještě neochutnala — a věřte mi, že jsem jich zkusila hodně! Některé druhy masa, které se mi dostanou na talíř, jsou odporné, ale od tohohle čekám něco lepšího.\n"
"\n"
"Maso buvola kaferského je libové, chutné a často tuhé. Připomíná hovězí, ale má výraznější a sladší chuť. Obsahuje méně tuku a cholesterolu než hovězí maso a je bohaté na bílkoviny.\n"
"\n"
"Recept už mám vybraný. Bude se k němu skvěle hodit sklenka červeného vína. Abych si ale mohla buvola odškrtnout ze seznamu, potřebuji samce i samici. Až po uzavření sázky jsem zjistila, že tuhle podmínku přidal dědeček. Starý lišák!\n"
"\n"
"Podrobnosti o dodání vám sdělí můj asistent: +565xx416"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION09_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission09 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION09_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"A wildlife researcher is having a beef with his friend. She doesn’t believe "
"certain species hunt at night. Numerous books with research don’t matter to "
"her, so he asks you to hunt at night so he can confront her with hard facts."
msgstr ""
"Výzkumník se pře s kamarádkou o tom, zda některá zvířata loví v noci. Nevěří"
" ani odborným knihám, a tak vás žádá o noční lov, aby jí mohl předložit "
"důkaz."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION09_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission09 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION09_NAME"
msgid "Nighttime facts"
msgstr "Noční fakta"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION09_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission09 objective01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION09_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Shoot and harvest a Warthog from {timeFrom}|displayAs(timeShort) until "
"{timeTo}|displayAs(timeShort). Use a night vision scope."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte prase bradavičnaté mezi {timeFrom}|displayAs(timeShort) a"
" {timeTo}|displayAs(timeShort). Použijte puškohled s nočním viděním."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION09_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission09 objective02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION09_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid ""
"Shoot and harvest a Lion from {timeFrom}|displayAs(timeShort) until "
"{timeTo}|displayAs(timeShort). Use a night vision scope."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte lva mezi {timeFrom}|displayAs(timeShort) a "
"{timeTo}|displayAs(timeShort). Použijte puškohled s nočním viděním."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION09_OBJECTIVE03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission09 objective03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION09_OBJECTIVE03"
msgid ""
"Shoot and harvest a Honey badger from {timeFrom}|displayAs(timeShort) until "
"{timeTo}|displayAs(timeShort). Use a night vision scope."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte medojeda kapského mezi {timeFrom}|displayAs(timeShort) a "
"{timeTo}|displayAs(timeShort). Použijte puškohled s nočním viděním."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION09_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission09 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION09_READABLE"
msgid ""
"I've been arguing with a buddy of mine about warthogs and their activity cycles. She says she never sees them during the night. She doesn’t care about facts! Even though I told her one warthog keeps stealing my bait!\n"
"\n"
"Warthogs are generally active during the day, but they may shift to nocturnal foraging in certain areas, especially where they face pressure from human hunters.\n"
"\n"
"And lions as well! You might think it's easier to hunt under daylight, but lions actually secure about 60% of their kills during nighttime hours.\n"
"\n"
"And honey badgers? They do whatever they want, so of course they hunt at night too.\n"
"\n"
"Do you know such people who, even when presented with irrefutable facts and evidence, will still claim their truth is the only one? Like that friend of mine, for example.\n"
"\n"
"I want to overwhelm her with evidence, so night hunting it is!\n"
"\n"
"Elias Marrow, Wildlife Behavior Researcher"
msgstr ""
"Přu se s kamarádkou o to, kdy jsou aktivní prasata bradavičnatá. Tvrdí, že je nikdy nevidí v noci. Fakta ji nezajímají, přestože mi jeden kus pravidelně krade návnadu!\n"
"\n"
"Prasata bradavičnatá jsou obvykle činná ve dne. Někde však hledají potravu i v noci, zvlášť když na ně přes den tlačí lovci.\n"
"\n"
"A lvi? Možná se vám zdá snazší lovit za světla, ale přibližně 60 % své kořisti uloví v noci.\n"
"\n"
"Medojedi si zase dělají, co chtějí. Samozřejmě tedy loví i v noci.\n"
"\n"
"Znáte lidi, kteří se drží svého názoru, i když jim předložíte důkazy? Přesně taková je moje kamarádka. Chci jí ukázat co nejvíc důkazů, takže vyrážíme na noční lov!\n"
"\n"
"Elias Marrow, výzkumník chování volně žijících zvířat"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION10_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission10 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION10_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"A local pub quiz enthusiast is collecting random animal trivia on his quest "
"to best his rival. But he also wants to go beyond just learning the facts, "
"he needs to see them in nature. The newest trivia piece requires observing "
"impalas from a greater distance."
msgstr ""
"Místní nadšenec do hospodských kvízů sbírá zajímavosti o zvěři, aby porazil "
"soupeře. Nechce o nich jen číst; rád by je viděl v přírodě. Tentokrát "
"potřebuje pozorovat impaly z větší vzdálenosti."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION10_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission10 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION10_NAME"
msgid "Crying wolf"
msgstr "Planý poplach"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION10_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission10 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION10_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest an Impala shot from {minShotDistance}|displayAs(distance) or more. "
"Don't use a scope when shooting."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte impalu střelenou ze vzdálenosti alespoň "
"{minShotDistance}|displayAs(distance). Při výstřelu nepoužívejte puškohled."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION10_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission10 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION10_READABLE"
msgid ""
"Impalas are often the first trophy of many foreign hunters who come to Kilimaya Reserve! Why? Because they are abundant and their horns look gorgeous.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks to this, we have a lot of studies about impalas, and I, as the number one animal trivia connoisseur, discovered a very interesting fact. (Take this, Jacob from the quiz night! You haven’t heard about this yet, have you?)\n"
"\n"
"So, listen to this: alarm calls can alert other species to predators, but how strongly animals respond depends on the reliability of the calls. A study featuring impalas, wildebeests, and zebras found that all three species react strongly to zebra alarm calls, as lions are their main predators. In contrast, impala alarm calls, which are linked to more predators, elicit weaker and mixed responses from other species.\n"
"\n"
"Apart from this being a million-dollar question in your local pub quiz, I also find it absolutely fascinating. I want to test this out and have more spectators, so I’m giving out tasks that require more detailed analyses of impalas from greater distances. Why? Just to satiate my curiosity.\n"
"\n"
"Benny Fletcher, Professional Pub Quiz Enthusiast & Amateur Wildlife Observer"
msgstr ""
"Pro mnoho zahraničních lovců jsou impaly první trofejí z rezervace Kilimaya. Jsou početné a jejich rohy jsou nádherné.\n"
"\n"
"Díky tomu máme o impalách spoustu poznatků. A já, samozvaný znalec zvířecích zajímavostí, jsem narazil na obzvlášť dobrou otázku do kvízu. To budeš koukat, Jacobe!\n"
"\n"
"Poplašné hlasy mohou před šelmou varovat i jiné druhy. Záleží ale na tom, nakolik jim ostatní zvířata věří. Studie impal, pakoní a zeber ukázala, že všechny tři druhy výrazně reagují na varovný hlas zeber, pro něž je hlavním nepřítelem lev. Hlas impaly může upozorňovat na více druhů šelem, a tak na něj ostatní reagují slaběji a nejednotně.\n"
"\n"
"Možná je to otázka za milion do hospodského kvízu, ale mě to upřímně fascinuje. Chci je pozorovat podrobněji a z větší dálky. Ať nás na to je víc, zadávám úkoly dalším lovcům. Proč? Prostě ze zvědavosti.\n"
"\n"
"Benny Fletcher, nadšenec do hospodských kvízů a amatérský pozorovatel zvěře"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION11_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission11 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION11_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Records are meant to be broken! But maybe not just yet... How about you "
"start with some training first? Grab a bow with arrows and aim for the "
"crocodile."
msgstr ""
"Rekordy jsou od toho, aby se překonávaly. Nejdřív ale trochu potrénujte: "
"vezměte si luk a šípy a zamiřte na krokodýla."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION11_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission11 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION11_NAME"
msgid "Record-breaking training"
msgstr "Trénink na rekord"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION11_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission11 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION11_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Harvest a Crocodile shot with a bow."
msgstr "Ulovte a zpracujte krokodýla lukem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION11_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission11 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION11_READABLE"
msgid ""
"I’m not exactly up-to-date on world records, but if I remember correctly, the previous record for the largest crocodile shot with a bow was 495 cm (195 in) long, taken at a distance of 23 m (25 yd) with a bow draw weight of 38 kg (84 lbs) and a 34 g (530 gr) arrow.\n"
"\n"
"These aren’t rookie numbers, they’re not something you just achieve casually.\n"
"\n"
"Breaking a world record requires serious training.\n"
"\n"
"And the training... STARTS NOW!\n"
"\n"
"(unless I remember the record completely wrong!)\n"
"\n"
"Logan Harper, Professional Bowhunter"
msgstr ""
"Ve světových rekordech nejsem úplně zběhlý. Pokud si ale dobře pamatuju, nejdelší krokodýl ulovený lukem měřil 495 cm (195 palců). Lovec ho zasáhl ze vzdálenosti 23 m (25 yardů) lukem s nátahovou silou 38 kg (84 liber) a šípem o hmotnosti 34 g (530 grainů).\n"
"\n"
"Taková čísla nejsou pro začátečníky. Náhodou jich nedosáhnete.\n"
"\n"
"Překonat světový rekord znamená pořádně trénovat.\n"
"\n"
"A trénink... ZAČÍNÁ TEĎ!\n"
"\n"
"Pokud si tedy ten rekord nepamatuju úplně špatně.\n"
"\n"
"Logan Harper, profesionální lovec lukem"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION12_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission12 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION12_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Very officially sounding International Pig Committee (all its rules are "
"completely transparent!) has announced that warthog is the third-cutest "
"animal in the Suidae (pig) family! They just need more specimens of warthogs"
" with low-scoring trophies."
msgstr ""
"Údajně velmi oficiální International Pig Committee s „naprosto průhlednými“ "
"pravidly vyhlásil prase bradavičnaté třetím nejroztomilejším druhem prasat. "
"Teď potřebuje další jedince se slabě hodnocenou trofejí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION12_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission12 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION12_NAME"
msgid "Pigs International"
msgstr "Pigs International"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION12_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission12 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION12_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest a Warthog. Its Trophy rating must be "
"{maxStar}|displayAs(ratingStars)."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte prase bradavičnaté. Hodnocení jeho trofeje musí být "
"{maxStar}|displayAs(ratingStars)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION12_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission12 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION12_READABLE"
msgid ""
"Welcome to Pigs International!\n"
"\n"
"In Kilimaya Reserve, you can find the beautiful warthogs. They currently rank number three on our cuteness scale for the Suidae family.\n"
"\n"
"First place: Babirusa\n"
"Second place: Bearded pig\n"
"Third place: Warthog\n"
"Honorable mention: Red river hog\n"
"\n"
"How are these ranked? Completely subjectively by myself, representing the International Committee of Pigs International.\n"
"\n"
"We actually have a large database of warthog images, but we are missing some with smaller tusks. Help us gather some of these low-scoring trophies!\n"
"\n"
"Many thanks!\n"
"\n"
"Pigs International, International Committee"
msgstr ""
"Vítejte v Pigs International!\n"
"\n"
"V rezervaci Kilimaya žijí krásná prasata bradavičnatá. V našem zcela subjektivním žebříčku roztomilosti prasatovitých (Suidae) jsou na třetím místě.\n"
"\n"
"1. Babirusa\n"
"2. Prase vousaté\n"
"3. Prase bradavičnaté\n"
"Čestné uznání: štětkoun africký\n"
"\n"
"Kdo o pořadí rozhodl? Já osobně, coby zástupce mezinárodního výboru Pigs International.\n"
"\n"
"Máme velkou sbírku snímků prasat bradavičnatých, ale chybějí nám jedinci s menšími kly. Pomozte nám získat několik slaběji hodnocených trofejí!\n"
"\n"
"Mnohokrát děkujeme!\n"
"\n"
"Pigs International, International Committee"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION13_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission13 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION13_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"There are some disagreements that need to be resolved and some that don’t "
"need to be. Let’s solve this and prove what the real zebra color is once and"
" for all."
msgstr ""
"Některé spory stojí za vyřešení, jiné ne. Tentokrát se pokuste jednou "
"provždy určit, jakou barvu zebra vlastně má."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION13_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission13 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION13_NAME"
msgid "A painful task"
msgstr "Bolestivý úkol"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION13_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission13 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION13_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest a young Mountain zebra. Its Fitness must be between "
"{minFitness}|displayAs(percent) and {maxFitness}|displayAs(percent)."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte mladou zebru horskou s genetickou kvalitou od "
"{minFitness}|displayAs(percent) do {maxFitness}|displayAs(percent)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION13_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission13 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION13_READABLE"
msgid ""
"“Are Zebras White with Black Stripes or Black with White Stripes?” is a question that humanity has asked itself for hundreds of years.\n"
"\n"
"My answer would be short: “Does it matter?”. No, not really, but some people really care. Like debating whether burgers are sandwiches or not. But if you’re reading this, chances are, you do care. And here is the answer.\n"
"\n"
"They are black with white stripes. That’s it. Ugh, do you need an explanation, too?\n"
"\n"
"Here it is then... A zebra’s black and white fur grows from cells called melanocytes, which produce the pigment melanin. Black fur gets the pigment, white fur appears where the pigment is blocked, so white isn’t its own color and black is essentially the zebra’s default color.\n"
"\n"
"Underneath all the fur, zebras have black skin as well. If shaved, zebras would look mostly black without their stripes. Do you believe me now? \n"
"\n"
"There are still some people who require further evidence. They carry out deep research and follow each stage of zebra aging, how healthy they are and then analyze their fur.\n"
"\n"
"For this analysis, they require a specific value of fitness and age. Please help me with further evidence. \n"
"\n"
"Zebra Enthusiast Society"
msgstr ""
"„Je zebra bílá s černými pruhy, nebo černá s bílými?“ Na tuhle otázku se lidé ptají už celé věky.\n"
"\n"
"Já bych odpověděl krátce: „Záleží na tom?“ Nejspíš ne. Někoho to ale zajímá stejně vážně jako otázka, zda je hamburger sendvič. Jestli čtete dál, patrně patříte mezi ně. Tak tedy: zebra je černá s bílými pruhy.\n"
"\n"
"Chcete i vysvětlení? Buňky zvané melanocyty vytvářejí pigment melanin. Tam, kde se dostane do srsti, vzniká černá barva. Bílé pruhy jsou místa bez tohoto pigmentu. Pod srstí mají zebry navíc černou kůži. Oholená zebra by tedy byla převážně tmavá. Věříte mi?\n"
"\n"
"Někteří lidé chtějí další důkazy. Sledují zebry různých věkových kategorií a zdravotního stavu a zkoumají jejich srst. Potřebují přitom jedince určitého věku a genetické kvality. Pomůžete jim?\n"
"\n"
"Zebra Enthusiast Society"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION14_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission14 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION14_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Malachi wants to popularize hunting hippos, so you should lead by example! "
"And let’s not put him to shame and aim for big ones, shall we?"
msgstr ""
"Malachi chce zpopularizovat lov hrochů. Jděte příkladem a zaměřte se na "
"pořádně velké kusy, ať mu neuděláte ostudu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION14_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission14 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION14_NAME"
msgid "Pause for hippos"
msgstr "Chvilka pro hrochy"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION14_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission14 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION14_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest 3 Hippos. Each animal must weigh {minMass}|displayAs(mass) or more."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte 3 hrochy. Každý musí vážit alespoň "
"{minMass}|displayAs(mass)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION14_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission14 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION14_READABLE"
msgid ""
"Hey there! I’m trying to popularize hunting hippos because a lot of hunters don’t enjoy it. But it’s on them—you can make it enjoyable, just don’t shoot them while they are in the water. Of course, it’s boring then. Waiting for their carcasses to float up because you aren't good enough to hunt them when they are on the ground!\n"
"\n"
"I did that once and would never again. Also, swimming towards a floating hippo is kind of scary. What if they are still alive? You'd never outswim it. So I think hunting them on the ground is also safer.\n"
"\n"
"Something fascinates me about hippos. Even though they are herbivores, they have the strength to crush your skull, so why would you choose to hunt them in the water?\n"
"\n"
"What do you think? Will you give this a try?\n"
"\n"
"Malachi Burnett, Co-owner at Panorama Inc."
msgstr ""
"Ahoj! Chtěl bych, aby si lov hrochů oblíbilo víc lidí. Záleží ale na tom, jak na něj půjdete. Když je zastřelíte ve vodě, čekáte, až tělo vyplave. To není žádná zábava. Zkuste je ulovit na souši.\n"
"\n"
"Jednou jsem na hrocha ve vodě vystřelil a už bych to neudělal. Plavat k jeho tělu není příjemné. Co když je ještě naživu? Hrochovi neuplavete. I proto mi lov na souši připadá bezpečnější.\n"
"\n"
"Fascinuje mě, jakou mají sílu. Jsou býložraví, a přesto by vám dokázali rozdrtit lebku. Proč je tedy lovit ve vodě?\n"
"\n"
"Co myslíte, zkusíte to?\n"
"\n"
"Malachi Burnett, spolumajitel Panorama Inc."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION15_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission15 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION15_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Sidney, Malachi's business partner, likes to give people work. And since he "
"feels like he is not hunting much on his own, this will at least give him "
"the feeling of belonging to the community. The challenge is a bit specific, "
"but that’s how he likes it."
msgstr ""
"Sidney, Malachiho obchodní partner, rád zadává úkoly ostatním. Sám už tolik "
"neloví, ale díky tomu zůstává součástí lovecké komunity. Jeho výzva je "
"poněkud zvláštní, přesně jak to má rád."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION15_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission15 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION15_NAME"
msgid "Kilimaya hunting extravaganza"
msgstr "Lovecká podívaná v Kilimaye"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION15_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission15 objective"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION15_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest a Northern black korhaan between "
"{timeFrom}|displayAs(timeShort)-{timeTo}|displayAs(timeShort). Shoot it with"
" a rifle from {minShotDistance}|displayAs(distance) or more."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte dropa šedotemenného mezi {timeFrom}|displayAs(timeShort) "
"a {timeTo}|displayAs(timeShort). Zasáhněte ho kulovnicí ze vzdálenosti "
"alespoň {minShotDistance}|displayAs(distance)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION15_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 LevelMission15 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02LEVELMISSION15_READABLE"
msgid ""
"Join Sidney Hayes' Hunting Extravaganza!\n"
"\n"
"I’ve been silent for a long time, and it’s very out of character! I feel like I’m losing touch with the hunting community, so I’m starting a competition of my own!\n"
"\n"
"And the more attributes I can add to it, the bigger joy it will bring me. I haven’t hunted on my own... gosh, I don’t even want to think about it! But doing this will help me feel like I still fit in among hunters! \n"
"\n"
"And korhaan hunts were always my favorite because, well, that's not who your usual hunter aims for. Just don’t forget to fulfill all the requirements!\n"
"\n"
"Sidney Hayes, Not So Retired Hunter!"
msgstr ""
"Zapojte se do lovecké soutěže Sidneyho Hayese!\n"
"\n"
"Dlouho jsem o sobě nedal vědět, což se mi vůbec nepodobá. Mám pocit, že ztrácím kontakt s ostatními lovci, a tak pořádám vlastní soutěž!\n"
"\n"
"Čím víc podmínek v ní bude, tím větší z toho budu mít radost. Jak dlouho jsem sám nelovil? Na to raději nechci ani pomyslet. Díky téhle soutěži si ale zase připadám jako součást lovecké komunity.\n"
"\n"
"Lov dropů jsem měl vždycky nejraději. Většina lovců se na ně totiž nezaměřuje. Jen nezapomeňte splnit všechny podmínky!\n"
"\n"
"Sidney Hayes, lovec, který ještě nepověsil pušku na hřebík"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION00_INTRO_VO01_L01_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION00_INTRO_VO01_L01_MALACHI"
msgid "At Kilimaya Reserve, time stretches like the sun-soaked horizon."
msgstr ""
"V rezervaci Kilimaya se čas táhne stejně líně jako sluncem zalitý obzor."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION00_INTRO_VO01_L02_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION00_INTRO_VO01_L02_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"You'll spot hippos cooling in the muddy wallows, lions lounging in golden "
"grass, and crocodiles lurking along the banks."
msgstr ""
"Uvidíte hrochy ochlazující se v bahništi, lvy odpočívající ve zlaté trávě i "
"krokodýly číhající na březích."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION00_INTRO_VO01_L03_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION00_INTRO_VO01_L03_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"Step quietly, and let Kilimaya Reserve speak the language of the rustle of "
"the savannah grass and the pounding of hooves."
msgstr ""
"Našlapujte tiše a naslouchejte šelestu savanové trávy a dusotu kopyt. Tak k "
"vám promlouvá Kilimaya."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Meeting a new Hearth & Hunt coordinator is always intense. This time, it's "
"the energetic Pandora, who's nothing like her brother Angel from New "
"Laurentia. Your first job here is to get acquainted with the locals of "
"Kilimaya Reserve."
msgstr ""
"Setkání s novou koordinátorkou Hearth & Hunt bývá vždycky zážitek. Tentokrát"
" vás přivítá energická Pandora, úplně jiná než její bratr Angel z New "
"Laurentia. Nejdřív se seznámíte s lidmi v rezervaci Kilimaya."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_NAME"
msgid "Pandora's box"
msgstr "Pandořina skříňka"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Player visits Kilimaya Reserve for the first
#. time and is greeted by a new coordinator."
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_PANDORA"
msgid "Welcome to Pandora's world!"
msgstr "Vítej v Pandořině světě!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PANDORA"
msgid "I mean, Kilimaya Reserve. Basically the same."
msgstr "Tedy v rezervaci Kilimaya. To je skoro totéž."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_PANDORA"
msgid "I'm Pandora Hearth, and I'll be your coordinator here."
msgstr "Jsem Pandora Hearth a tady budu tvoje koordinátorka."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"I hope you didn't get too used to Angel! Because now you're stuck with meee."
msgstr ""
"Doufám, že ti Angel nebude moc chybět! Teď tu se mnou totiž musíš vydržet."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_PANDORA"
msgid "But honestly? No one gets \"too used to\" Angel."
msgstr "I když upřímně? Na Angela si nikdo nedokáže zvyknout až tak moc."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PANDORA"
msgid "He is not even in my top three favorite brothers."
msgstr "Není ani mezi mými třemi nejoblíbenějšími bratry."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"Let's get you acquainted with Kilimaya Reserve! Please, check the files in "
"your lodge, and let's get started!"
msgstr ""
"Pojďme tě seznámit s Kilimayou. Projdi si na lovecké chatě složky o místních"
" a můžeme začít!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Check out the Hearth & Hunt files on the locals."
msgstr "Projděte si složky Hearth & Hunt o místních lidech."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L01_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "After player goes through the binder and
#. profiles of NPCs in the Kilimaya Reserve, Pandora gives them a call. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 objective01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L01_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"Malachi Burnett is a legend! He loves to tell the stories from his time as a"
" safari guide."
msgstr ""
"Malachi Burnett je legenda! Rád vypráví o dobách, kdy provázel výpravy na "
"safari."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L02_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 objective01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L02_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"But he had to sign NDAs for so many celebrity guests he had. Such a shame."
msgstr ""
"U tolika slavných hostů ale musel podepsat dohody o mlčenlivosti. Škoda."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L03_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 objective01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L03_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"He helped Hearth & Hunt a lot with creating a department for Coordinated "
"hunts."
msgstr "Hearth & Hunt hodně pomohl se založením oddělení organizovaných lovů."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L04_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 objective01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L04_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"My mother always hated the idea of someone paying large sums, for some "
"hunting guide to take you by your hand and guaranteeing you a kill, that's "
"easier than swatting away a fly."
msgstr ""
"Máma nesnášela představu, že někdo zaplatí horentní sumu průvodci, který ho "
"povede za ruku a zaručí mu úlovek snadnější než plácnout mouchu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L05_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 objective01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L05_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"Thanks to Malachi, we now have lots of hunting opportunities here that don't"
" cost a kidney."
msgstr ""
"Díky Malachimu tu teď nabízíme spoustu loveckých příležitostí za rozumnou "
"cenu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L06_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during VO"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 objective01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L06_PANDORA"
msgid "He'll never tell you though. He is \"humble.\""
msgstr "Sám ti to ale neřekne. Je prý „skromný“."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L07_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 objective01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L07_PANDORA"
msgid "Or, just \"boring.\""
msgstr "Nebo jen nudný."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L08_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 objective01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L08_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"I like Naomi, she is cool. But she left Hearth & Hunt. I don't know why."
msgstr "Naomi mám ráda. Je skvělá. Jenže odešla z Hearth & Hunt a nevím proč."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L09_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 objective01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L09_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"The previous representative said she chased him away with a knife, but it "
"was probably an exaggeration."
msgstr ""
"Předchozí zástupce tvrdil, že ho vyhnala s nožem v ruce. Nejspíš přeháněl."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L10_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 objective01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L10_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"And Damian? He is currently working on the curriculum for his advanced bow "
"shooting lessons."
msgstr "A Damian? Připravuje osnovy pokročilého kurzu střelby z luku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L11_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 objective01 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L11_PANDORA"
msgid "He is having some issues. And is getting on my nerves, to be honest."
msgstr "Moc mu to nejde. A abych byla upřímná, leze mi na nervy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L12_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 objective01 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L12_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"I hear you had a file for my brother in New Laurentia, so I made one for "
"myself too!"
msgstr ""
"Slyšela jsem, že máš v New Laurentia složku o mém bratrovi. Tak jsem ti "
"připravila i jednu o sobě!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L13_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 objective01 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L13_PANDORA"
msgid "Give me a call if you need help with anything!"
msgstr "Kdybys s něčím potřeboval pomoct, zavolej mi!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 objective 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid "Meet Malachi Burnett. He needs help with habitat enhancement."
msgstr ""
"Seznamte se s Malachim Burnettem. Potřebuje pomoct s péčí o přírodní "
"stanoviště."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 objective 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03"
msgid "Meet Naomi Vess and... survive?"
msgstr "Poznejte Naomi Vess. A... přežijte to."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory00 Mission01 objective 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY00_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE04"
msgid ""
"Meet Damian. He's struggling with the curriculum for bow shooting lectures."
msgstr ""
"Seznamte se s Damianem. Potřebuje pomoct s osnovami lukostřeleckého kurzu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"You've met Malachi, allegedly a famous person back from Tikamoon Plains. He "
"doesn't seem to be very good with technology. Patrick Harper from New "
"Laurentia has been trying to encourage him to update the promotional video "
"for Kilimaya Reserve, but now you're in charge."
msgstr ""
"Seznámili jste se s Malachim Burnettem, prý známou osobností z Tikamoon "
"Plains. S technikou si zřejmě moc nerozumí. Patrick Harper z New Laurentia "
"ho už nějakou dobu přesvědčuje, aby natočil nové propagační video pro "
"rezervaci Kilimaya. Teď je to na vás."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_NAME"
msgid "Marketing matters"
msgstr "Na marketingu záleží"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Player visits Malachi for the first time. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_MALACHI"
msgid "Oh, hey! Do you need some help?"
msgstr "Ale, dobrý den! Potřebujete s něčím pomoct?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER"
msgid "Could it be that you're... Mr. Burnett, in the flesh?"
msgstr "Vy jste snad... pan Burnett osobně?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_MALACHI"
msgid "In the flesh and bones, mind you!"
msgstr "Z masa a kostí!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"New Hearth & Hunt rep, right? You probably heard about me from Pandora."
msgstr ""
"Jste ten nový z Hearth & Hunt, že? Pandora vám o mně určitě vyprávěla."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"I'll mostly need you for odd jobs here and there. I can't find the time to "
"do everything."
msgstr "Budu vás potřebovat na různé drobné úkoly. Sám na všechno nemám čas."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"I'm working on promotional material for Kilimaya Reserve, and I don't spend "
"as much time in the field as I used to."
msgstr ""
"Pracuji na propagačních materiálech pro rezervaci Kilimaya a v terénu už "
"netrávím tolik času jako dřív."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_MALACHI"
msgid "Also, my knees hurt like crazy, but don't tell my daughter!"
msgstr "A taky mě příšerně bolí kolena. Ale mé dceři ani slovo!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"A friend of mine, Patrick Harper—maybe you know him—insists that I update "
"Panorama's promo video."
msgstr ""
"Můj přítel Patrick Harper — možná ho znáte — trvá na tom, abych natočil nové"
" propagační video pro Panorama."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_MALACHI"
msgid "He says that 360p is no longer in, whatever that means."
msgstr "Prý už rozlišení 360p vyšlo z módy. Ať tím myslí cokoli."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_MALACHI"
msgid "I mean, I told him I made that video 10 years ago on my phone!"
msgstr ""
"Vždyť jsem mu říkal, že jsem to video natočil před deseti lety na mobil!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "He tries to mimic Patrick's voice in the
#. first part. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"He just replied \"I can see that,\" in that smug way of his, adjusting his "
"fancy pink glasses."
msgstr ""
"Jen si upravil ty svoje drahé růžové brýle a povýšeně prohlásil: „To je "
"vidět.“"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_MALACHI"
msgid "Sometimes those glasses look very punchable, even over a video call."
msgstr "Někdy mám chuť mu ty brýle rozbít, i když ho vidím jen na obrazovce."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"Or maybe \"sittable\" in my case, given that I've already sat on three pairs"
" of sunglasses so far this year."
msgstr ""
"Nebo je spíš rozsednout. Jen letos jsem si sedl na troje sluneční brýle."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"Sorry, I tend to ramble, a bad habit I picked up over years of hunting "
"alone."
msgstr "Promiňte, zase se rozpovídávám. To mám z let, kdy jsem lovil sám."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"Here, take this camera. Just shoot some footage of a blesbok hunt, would "
"you?"
msgstr "Tady máte kameru. Natočíte mi pár záběrů z lovu buvolce běločelého?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"Lots of people have been coming to hunt them recently. Can you believe I "
"have no pictures or videos of them?"
msgstr ""
"V poslední době je sem chodí lovit spousta lidí. A já přitom nemám jedinou "
"jejich fotku ani záběr!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "Where do I find blesbok?"
msgstr "Kde najdu buvolce běločelého?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_MALACHI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_MALACHI_OP01"
msgid "Blesbok prefer veld plains and dislike woods."
msgstr ""
"Buvolci běločelí dávají přednost otevřeným travnatým pláním a lesům se "
"vyhýbají."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_MALACHI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_MALACHI_OP01"
msgid "They're always in the open, mostly in the north-western grasslands."
msgstr ""
"Drží se na otevřených prostranstvích, hlavně na severozápadních travnatých "
"pláních."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_PLAYER_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_PLAYER_OP02"
msgid "Are you the warden of this reserve?"
msgstr "Jste správcem této rezervace?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_MALACHI_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 21"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_MALACHI_OP02"
msgid ""
"No, I'm not. I apologize, I didn't properly introduce myself. I was just "
"expecting you to have a whole file about me or something."
msgstr ""
"Ne, nejsem. Promiňte, pořádně jsem se nepředstavil. Čekal jsem, že o mně "
"máte celou složku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_PLAYER_OP02_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 22"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_PLAYER_OP02_A"
msgid "We do, I'm just not an avid reader."
msgstr "Máme, jen nejsem vášnivý čtenář."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_MALACHI_OP02_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 23"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_MALACHI_OP02_A"
msgid "Neither am I. Unfortunately, now I have to read a ton of e-mails."
msgstr "Já taky ne. Bohužel teď musím číst spoustu e-mailů."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_PLAYER_OP02_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 24"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_PLAYER_OP02_B"
msgid ""
"Yeah, but my memory gets fuzzy sometimes. Are you the trickster shooter? "
"Someone like that was in the files."
msgstr ""
"Ano, ale paměť mi občas neslouží. Nejste ten střelec, co předvádí různé "
"triky? O někom takovém jsem ve složce četl."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_MALACHI_OP02_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 25"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_MALACHI_OP02_B"
msgid "No, no. Definitely not me. That must be Damian."
msgstr "Ne, ne. Já rozhodně ne. To musí být Damian."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_PLAYER_OP02_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 26"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_PLAYER_OP02_C"
msgid ""
"You're right. I just wanted to see how you'd introduce yourself. It can tell"
" you a lot about a person."
msgstr ""
"Máte pravdu. Jen mě zajímalo, jak se představíte. To o člověku hodně "
"prozradí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_MALACHI_OP02_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 27"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_MALACHI_OP02_C"
msgid "Okay. Sneaky. Well, allow me to entertain you then."
msgstr "Aha, mazané. Tak vám o sobě něco povím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_MALACHI_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 28"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_MALACHI_OP02"
msgid ""
"I'm a co-owner of Panorama Inc., a safari hotel franchise with branches all "
"over Africa. We'll be opening a new place here together with my business "
"partner Sidney Hayes."
msgstr ""
"Jsem spolumajitelem Panorama Inc., sítě safari hotelů po celé Africe. S "
"obchodním partnerem Sidneym Hayesem chystáme nový podnik i tady."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_MALACHI_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 29"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_MALACHI_OP02"
msgid "I used to be a safari guide. But I... got a promotion."
msgstr "Dřív jsem dělal průvodce na safari. Pak mě... povýšili."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_PLAYER_OP02_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 30"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_PLAYER_OP02_OP01"
msgid "How did you become a co-owner of Panorama Inc.?"
msgstr "Jak jste se stal spolumajitelem společnosti Panorama Inc.?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_MALACHI_OP02_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 31"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_MALACHI_OP02_OP01"
msgid ""
"To be completely honest, I got sick of people. Several years in service will"
" make you a misanthrope."
msgstr ""
"Upřímně? Už jsem měl lidí po krk. Po několika letech ve službách zákazníků "
"by se z vás stal misantrop taky."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_MALACHI_OP02_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 32"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_MALACHI_OP02_OP01"
msgid ""
"I wanted to quit and enjoy my retirement. My daughter makes enough for both "
"of us. I don't have to work for a single hour or worry about money."
msgstr ""
"Chtěl jsem skončit a užívat si důchod. Dcera vydělává dost pro nás oba, "
"takže bych nemusel pracovat ani se starat o peníze."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_MALACHI_OP02_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 33"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_MALACHI_OP02_OP01"
msgid ""
"But Sidney, my boss back then, begged me to stay. And he made me \"an offer "
"I couldn't refuse.\""
msgstr ""
"Sidney, můj tehdejší šéf, mě ale prosil, abych zůstal. Dal mi „nabídku, "
"kterou jsem nemohl odmítnout“."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_MALACHI_OP02_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 34"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_MALACHI_OP02_OP01"
msgid ""
"And he was right. I didn't refuse. Anyway, mooching off my daughter isn't "
"really my style. I wanted to eventually find some low-key job, but being the"
" co-owner of a successful business is good too."
msgstr ""
"A měl pravdu, neodmítl jsem. Žít na účet dcery by stejně nebylo pro mě. "
"Chtěl jsem si časem najít klidnější práci, ale spoluvlastnit úspěšnou firmu "
"také není špatné."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_MALACHI_OP02_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 35"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_MALACHI_OP02_OP01"
msgid ""
"So now I'm here. Still dealing with clients and contractors, but at least "
"mostly through e-mail and phone."
msgstr ""
"A tak jsem tady. S klienty a dodavateli jednám pořád, ale většinou jen po "
"telefonu a e-mailu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_MALACHI_OP02_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 36"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_MALACHI_OP02_OP01"
msgid "Sidney handles the in-person stuff, and people who are difficult."
msgstr "Osobní jednání a náročné klienty si bere na starost Sidney."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_PLAYER_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 37"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_PLAYER_OP02"
msgid "Sounds like a good promotion. Well, gotta go."
msgstr "To zní jako pěkné povýšení. Já už musím jít."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 38"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_PLAYER"
msgid "I'm on it."
msgstr "Pustím se do toho."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Place the camera to film a promotional video for Malachi."
msgstr "Umístěte kameru a natočte pro Malachiho propagační video."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission01 objective 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid ""
"Harvest a Blesbok. Fatally shoot it at a distance of "
"{maxObjectInVicinityDistance}|displayAs(distance) or less from the camera."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte buvolce běločelého smrtelným zásahem ve vzdálenosti "
"nejvýše {maxObjectInVicinityDistance}|displayAs(distance) od kamery."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 description 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"In addition to improving the Yellow-billed duck population, Malachi has "
"asked for help with a personal issue. He thinks that someone is stalking "
"him, but from what he's told you, it may just be a harmless prank. Time to "
"investigate."
msgstr ""
"Malachi vás kromě péče o populaci kachny žlutozobé požádal o pomoc s osobním"
" problémem. Myslí si, že ho někdo pronásleduje. Podle toho, co vám řekl, by "
"ale mohlo jít jen o neškodný žert. Je čas to prošetřit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 description 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"You've investigated the clues for Malachi's stalker. This one says that he's"
" \"like a balloon\", but what does it mean?"
msgstr ""
"Prozkoumali jste jednu ze stop od člověka, který Malachiho údajně "
"pronásleduje. Vzkaz říká, že je Malachi „jako balónek“. Co to znamená?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 description 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"There's a clue left by the stalker: tiny ducklings on a skywalk. Is this "
"really stalking?"
msgstr ""
"Další nápovědou jsou malá káčátka na lávce. Opravdu tu jde o pronásledování?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 description 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION04"
msgid "A snake in a hot tub. Does that sound scary? Or is it just a joke?"
msgstr "Had ve vířivce. Zní to děsivě? Nebo je to jen vtip?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_NAME"
msgid "Balloons, ducks, and snakes"
msgstr "Balónky, kachny a hadi"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Player returns to Malachi after doing a task
#. for him. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_MALACHI"
msgid "Thanks for the footage!"
msgstr "Díky za záběry!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_MALACHI"
msgid "I don't think I have what it takes to edit it myself."
msgstr "Sám si na střih netroufám."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"But Patrick volunteered to do it. He's found a new passion for editing "
"videos."
msgstr "Patrick se ale nabídl, že video sestříhá. Prý objevil novou vášeň."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"I just hope it won't end up like the last video he sent me. A lot of, well, "
"special effects... Camera shaking, color changes..."
msgstr ""
"Snad nedopadne jako to poslední, které mi poslal. Samé zvláštní efekty... "
"Roztřesený obraz, barvy všude možně..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_MALACHI"
msgid "It was..."
msgstr "Bylo to..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "He says it as if he didn't want to offend
#. him, but he clearly thinks Patrick didn't do a good job. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_MALACHI"
msgid "Intense."
msgstr "Pořádný nářez."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_MALACHI"
msgid "Speaking of intense..."
msgstr "A když už mluvíme o nářezu..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"I think somebody's stalking me. It's personal, not really about hunting, but"
" I hope it won't bother you to help me with it."
msgstr ""
"Myslím, že mě někdo pronásleduje. S lovem to nesouvisí, je to osobní. "
"Pomůžete mi?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_PLAYER_A"
msgid ""
"I love a little light stalking drama to spice things up between gutting "
"antelopes."
msgstr "Trocha detektivního dramatu příjemně zpestří vyvrhování antilop."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_MALACHI_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_MALACHI_A"
msgid "Then maybe you'll enjoy investigating it, because I don't."
msgstr "Tak vás pátrání možná bude bavit. Mě tedy nebaví vůbec."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_PLAYER_B"
msgid "That sounds serious. Of course I'll help."
msgstr "To zní vážně. Samozřejmě pomůžu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_MALACHI_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_MALACHI_B"
msgid "I'm glad to hear that because it's been driving me crazy..."
msgstr "To rád slyším, protože mě to přivádí k šílenství..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_PLAYER_C"
msgid "Have you reported it to the police?"
msgstr "Nahlásil jste to policii?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_MALACHI_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_MALACHI_C"
msgid "No, it feels like no crime's been committed. I don't know."
msgstr "Ne. Nevím, jestli se vůbec stal nějaký trestný čin."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"I think they're trying to get me to quit my job. But let's start at the "
"beginning."
msgstr ""
"Myslím, že se mě snaží přimět, abych odešel z práce. Ale začněme od začátku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"I've been discovering post-it notes around my cabin and other places I "
"frequent. They're messages suggesting how I could, well, do my job better."
msgstr ""
"Kolem svého srubu a na dalších místech, kam často chodím, nacházím lístečky "
"s poznámkami. Naznačují mi, jak bych mohl, no... dělat svou práci lépe."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"Then one day my keyboard letters were swapped around. It took me a LONG time"
" to fix that."
msgstr ""
"Jednou mi někdo přeházel klávesy na klávesnici. Trvalo mi věčnost, než jsem "
"je vrátil na místo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"Or recently, I arrived at the Panorama office, and everything had child "
"safety features active."
msgstr ""
"Nedávno jsem přišel do kanceláře Panorama a všude byly dětské pojistky."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"Making a cup of coffee was an ordeal. All the electrical outlets were "
"covered, the cabinets were locked..."
msgstr ""
"Uvařit si šálek kávy bylo utrpením. Všechny elektrické zásuvky byly zakryté,"
" skříně zamčené..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_PLAYER_A"
msgid ""
"Sheesh, someone hates you. Look out for salt in all the sugar containers."
msgstr ""
"No teda, někdo vás opravdu nemá rád. Dejte si pozor, aby vám ještě nenasypal"
" sůl do cukřenky."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_MALACHI_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 21"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_MALACHI_A"
msgid "Or cyanide."
msgstr "Nebo kyanid."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 22"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_PLAYER_B"
msgid "It sounds more like harmless pranks than stalking, doesn't it?"
msgstr "Zní to spíš jako neškodné žerty než pronásledování, že?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_MALACHI_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "truly horrified"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 23"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_MALACHI_B"
msgid "Harmless? It took me hours to fix all those damn things!"
msgstr "Neškodné? Strávil jsem celé hodiny napravováním těch lumpáren!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 24"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_PLAYER_C"
msgid "It must be someone with access to all those places."
msgstr "Musí to být někdo, kdo má přístup ke všem těm místům."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_MALACHI_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 25"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_MALACHI_C"
msgid "I know. I had a suspect."
msgstr "Já vím. Jednoho podezřelého jsem měl."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 26"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_MALACHI"
msgid "I asked Sidney, he was the only one I could think of."
msgstr "Zeptal jsem se Sidneyho. Byl jediný, kdo mě napadl."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 27"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"But he isn't the type to do such silly things, and he has a solid alibi."
msgstr "Ale není ten typ, co by dělal takové hlouposti, a má solidní alibi."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 28"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"I'm going mad and honestly? I'm scared—how come someone has access to these "
"places?"
msgstr ""
"Už z toho šílím. A popravdě mám strach. Jak se tam ten člověk vůbec dostává?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 29"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"Can you run a little investigation for me? Just as a side job. Check out the"
" places, maybe you'll notice something I didn't?"
msgstr ""
"Mohl byste to pro mě trochu prošetřit? Jako vedlejší úkol. Prohlédněte ta "
"místa. Třeba si všimnete něčeho, co mně uniklo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 30"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"I'll also need something more normal from you, something that actually falls"
" within your usual responsibilities."
msgstr "A pak pro vás mám ještě něco obvyklejšího, co už k vaší práci patří."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 31"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_MALACHI"
msgid "There's a bird at Kilimaya Reserve that is greatly overlooked."
msgstr "V rezervaci Kilimaya žije jeden opomíjený pták."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 32"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"It's the yellow-billed duck. They're very similar to American mallards, but "
"for some reason they aren't as popular with hunters."
msgstr ""
"Kachna žlutozobá. Podobá se kachně divoké, ale mezi lovci není zdaleka tak "
"oblíbená."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 33"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"Maybe if we improved their status? It's an uphill battle, I know. But it "
"would help Hearth & Hunt attract more hunters."
msgstr ""
"Mohli bychom zlepšit stav její populace. Nebude to snadné, ale Hearth & Hunt"
" by díky tomu mohla přilákat víc lovců."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 34"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_MALACHI"
msgid "And it would take your mind off the stalker investigation."
msgstr "Navíc vás to přivede na jiné myšlenky než to pátrání."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 35"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "I've heard you're a local legend in Tikamoon Plains!"
msgstr "Slyšel jsem, že jste místní legenda v Tikamoon Plains!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_MALACHI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 36"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_MALACHI_OP01"
msgid "Who did you hear that from?"
msgstr "Od koho jste to slyšel?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_MALACHI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 37"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_MALACHI_OP01"
msgid "Maybe more of a local scarecrow."
msgstr "Možná spíš místní strašák."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_MALACHI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 38"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_MALACHI_OP01"
msgid ""
"There was an... incident that made Tikamoon famous. Or infamous? And I "
"happened to be caught up in the middle of it."
msgstr ""
"Stala se tam jedna... událost, která Tikamoon proslavila. Nebo spíš neblaze "
"proslavila. A já jsem se ocitl přímo uprostřed."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_MALACHI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "he doesn't say it to brag, he sounds exhausted"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 39"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_MALACHI_OP01"
msgid "I solved it. Because that's what I am, a problem solver."
msgstr "Vyřešil jsem to. Řešení problémů mi jde."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L40_MALACHI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 40"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L40_MALACHI_OP01"
msgid ""
"Someone was mercilessly killing lions there, just to make \"art out of it\"."
msgstr "Někdo tam bezohledně zabíjel lvy, aby z jejich těl dělal „umění“."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L41_MALACHI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 41"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L41_MALACHI_OP01"
msgid ""
"But Sidney told me never to mention it again. It's not good for business."
msgstr ""
"Ale Sidney mi řekl, abych to už nikdy nezmiňoval. Není to dobré pro "
"podnikání."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L42_MALACHI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 42"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L42_MALACHI_OP01"
msgid ""
"He's changed his tune. He used to say \"bad publicity is still publicity.\""
msgstr "Dřív říkával, že i špatná reklama je reklama. Teď už mluví jinak."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L43_MALACHI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 43"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L43_MALACHI_OP01"
msgid ""
"So if you want to find out what happened in Tikamoon Plains... You'll have "
"to visit them yourself."
msgstr ""
"Jestli chcete vědět, co se v Tikamoon Plains stalo, budete se tam muset "
"podívat sám."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L44_PLAYER_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 44"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L44_PLAYER_OP02"
msgid "I read in your file that you have a daughter in the States?"
msgstr "Četl jsem ve vaší složce, že máte dceru ve Státech?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L45_MALACHI_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "his tone always gets softer when he speakst
#. about his daughter "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 45"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L45_MALACHI_OP02"
msgid "Hailey, the light of my life."
msgstr "Hailey, světlo mého života."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L46_MALACHI_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 46"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L46_MALACHI_OP02"
msgid "I built seven swings for her in Tikamoon Plains."
msgstr "Postavil jsem pro ni sedm houpaček v Tikamoon Plains."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L47_MALACHI_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 47"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L47_MALACHI_OP02"
msgid ""
"Wow, I guess I used to have a lot of free time, huh? The good old days."
msgstr "Páni, asi jsem míval hodně volného času, co? Staré dobré časy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L48_MALACHI_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 48"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L48_MALACHI_OP02"
msgid ""
"She graduated from university two years ago and now she has her own company."
msgstr "Před dvěma lety vystudovala vysokou školu a nyní má vlastní firmu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L49_MALACHI_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 49"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L49_MALACHI_OP02"
msgid ""
"I truly believe we switched her in the hospital with someone else's baby. "
"She's a genius."
msgstr "Někdy mám vážně pocit, že nám ji v porodnici vyměnili. Je to génius."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L50_MALACHI_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 50"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L50_MALACHI_OP02"
msgid "Shame that she has no time to come and visit."
msgstr "Škoda, že nemá čas přijet na návštěvu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L51_MALACHI_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 51"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L51_MALACHI_OP02"
msgid ""
"But we do facetime on the regular! She even has calls with Patrick, because "
"I talk about him so much."
msgstr ""
"Pravidelně si ale voláme s kamerou! Dokonce si volá i s Patrickem, protože o"
" něm pořád mluvím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L52_MALACHI_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 52"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L52_MALACHI_OP02"
msgid ""
"Now she calls him Uncle Patrick. She'll probably visit him and Gigi before "
"she gets around to me!"
msgstr "Teď mu říká strýček Patrick. Ještě navštíví jeho a Gigi dřív než mě!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L53_PLAYER_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 53"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L53_PLAYER_OP03"
msgid "How do you and Patrick Harper know each other?"
msgstr "Jak se vy a Patrick Harper znáte?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L54_MALACHI_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 54"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L54_MALACHI_OP03"
msgid "He's my internet friend. I've never actually met him. It's crazy."
msgstr "Známe se přes internet. Nikdy jsme se osobně nepotkali. Zvláštní, co?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L55_MALACHI_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 55"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L55_MALACHI_OP03"
msgid ""
"We met on a hunting forum! He's really active on there, and we bonded over "
"meat aging techniques."
msgstr ""
"Seznámili jsme se na loveckém fóru. Je tam hodně aktivní. Sblížil nás "
"společný zájem o postupy zrání zvěřiny."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L56_MALACHI_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 56"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L56_MALACHI_OP03"
msgid ""
"From that day on we've been in regular contact. Sometimes I'm glad we're in "
"different time zones, otherwise I wouldn't get anything done."
msgstr ""
"Od té doby jsme pravidelně v kontaktu. Občas jsem rád, že žijeme v různých "
"časových pásmech. Jinak bych nic neudělal."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L57_MALACHI_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 57"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L57_MALACHI_OP03"
msgid ""
"Usually, he'll tell me all about his fights with Gigi, fill me in on the "
"latest New Laurentia gossip, or tell me about his fashion troubles."
msgstr ""
"Vypráví mi o hádkách s Gigi, o nejnovějších drbech z New Laurentia i o svých"
" starostech s oblékáním."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L58_MALACHI_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 58"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L58_MALACHI_OP03"
msgid ""
"But the worst of it all is when he sends me AI-generated videos of animals "
"doing weird stuff, like deer flying and bison doing acrobatics."
msgstr ""
"Nejhorší jsou ale videa vytvořená umělou inteligencí, která mi posílá. "
"Létající jeleni, akrobatičtí bizoni a podobné výmysly."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L59_PLAYER_OP04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 59"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L59_PLAYER_OP04"
msgid "Where can I find yellow-billed ducks?"
msgstr "Kde najdu kachny žlutozobé?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L60_MALACHI_OP04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 60"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L60_MALACHI_OP04"
msgid ""
"Well, since they're ducks... you can find them near water. Surprisingly."
msgstr "Jsou to kachny, takže je najdete u vody. Překvapivě."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L61_MALACHI_OP04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 61"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L61_MALACHI_OP04"
msgid "But I often see their flocks moving in and out of the eastern oasis."
msgstr ""
"Často vídám jejich hejna, jak přilétají do východní oázy a zase odlétají."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L62_PLAYER_OP05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 62"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L62_PLAYER_OP05"
msgid "How do I improve the status of the ducks in Kilimaya?"
msgstr "Jak můžu zlepšit stav populace kachen v Kilimaye?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L63_MALACHI_OP05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 63"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L63_MALACHI_OP05"
msgid ""
"Binoculars are your best friend, don't just shoot at them without thinking. "
"Ignore the larger ones, target the ones that are older, less fit."
msgstr ""
"Vezměte si dalekohled a vybírejte pečlivě. Větší kusy nechte být. Zaměřte se"
" na starší kachny s nižší genetickou kvalitou."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L64_MALACHI_OP05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 64"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L64_MALACHI_OP05"
msgid "Don't just target all drakes or all hens! Maintain a balance."
msgstr "Nelovte jen kačery nebo jen kachny. Zachovejte mezi nimi rovnováhu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L65_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 65"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L65_PLAYER"
msgid "I'll get started."
msgstr "Začnu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid ""
"Harvest 5 Yellow-billed ducks. Their Fitness must be "
"{maxFitness}|displayAs(percent) or lower."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte 5 kachen žlutozobých s genetickou kvalitou nejvýše "
"{maxFitness}|displayAs(percent)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 objective 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid "Investigate the unusual occurrences at the locations sent by Malachi."
msgstr ""
"Prošetřete neobvyklé události na místech, jejichž polohu vám poslal Malachi."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_BALOON01_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "this is a note left on a paper"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Readable balloon 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_BALOON01_READABLE"
msgid "You're just like this balloon!"
msgstr "Jsi jako tenhle balón!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_BALOON02_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "this is a note left on a paper"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Readable balloon 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_BALOON02_READABLE"
msgid "You'll keep rising."
msgstr "Poletíš pořád výš."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_DUCK_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "this is a note left on a paper"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Readable duck"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_DUCK_READABLE"
msgid "Every tiny duckling needs their big duckling."
msgstr "Každé malé káčátko potřebuje své velké káčátko."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_DUCKLING_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "this is a note left on a paper"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Readable duckling"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_DUCKLING_READABLE"
msgid "What does every duckling need?"
msgstr "Co potřebuje každé káčátko?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L01_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "indirect dialogue,  call effect"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Reaction to player discovering balloons"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue02 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO02_L01_MALACHI"
msgid "Balloons? Be careful, they may not be as harmless as they seem."
msgstr "Balónky? Pozor, nemusí být tak neškodné, jak se zdají."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L01_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "indirect dialogue, call effect"
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Reaction to note saying: \"You're like this
#. balloon!\""
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L01_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"Am I like the balloon? This is what they always do. Subtly hint at something"
" wrong with me. Does it mean I'm fragile?"
msgstr ""
"Jsem jako ten balónek? Zase mi naznačují, že je se mnou něco v nepořádku. Že"
" jsem křehký?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L01_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue04 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO04_L01_MALACHI"
msgid "Keep looking around there some more, maybe you'll find something else."
msgstr "Rozhlédněte se tam ještě. Třeba najdete něco dalšího."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO05_L01_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "indirect dialogue, call effect"
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Reaction to note saying: \"You'll keep
#. rising.\""
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue05 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO05_L01_MALACHI"
msgid "Okay, maybe the message isn't as menacing as I thought."
msgstr "Dobře, možná ta zpráva není tak hrozivá, jak jsem si myslel."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO06_L01_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "indirect dialogue, call effect"
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Reaction to note next to a plastic duckling
#. saying: \"What does every duckling need?\""
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue06 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO06_L01_MALACHI"
msgid "What does every duckling need? How would I know?"
msgstr "Co potřebuje každé káčátko? Jak to mám vědět?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO06_L02_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for us" : "indirect dialogue, call effect one fmode
#. with previous line"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue06 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO06_L02_MALACHI"
msgid "Are they suggesting I'm just as useless as this tiny duckling?"
msgstr "Naznačují, že jsem stejně k ničemu jako tohle malé káčátko?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO07_L01_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue07 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO07_L01_MALACHI"
msgid "Is there something down there, underneath us? Or am I wrong?"
msgstr "Je něco tam dole, pod námi? Nebo se mýlím?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO08_L01_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "indirect dialogue, call effect"
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Reaction to note saying: \"Every tiny
#. duckling needs their big duckling.\" "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue08 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO08_L01_MALACHI"
msgid "Is the big duckling referring to a parent figure?"
msgstr "To velké káčátko má být rodič?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO09_L01_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "indirect dialogue, call effect"
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Reaction to player finding a plastic snake
#. staged near jaccuzzi."
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue09 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO09_L01_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"I was here a few days ago setting everything up for your arrival. And this "
"snake was NOT here."
msgstr ""
"Před pár dny jsem tu všechno chystal na váš příjezd. Ten had tu rozhodně "
"NEBYL."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO09_L02_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for us" : "indirect dialogue, call effect one fmode
#. with previous line"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue09 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO09_L02_MALACHI"
msgid "What's this supposed to mean? That I'm just a snake?"
msgstr "Co to má znamenat? Že jsem jen had?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO10_L01_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission02 Dialogue10 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO10_L01_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"Maybe there's something else around here? A snake without a message feels..."
" incomplete."
msgstr "Třeba je tu ještě něco. Had bez vzkazu... jako by tu něco chybělo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03"
msgid ""
"Look for more clues that will reveal information about the stalker around "
"the marked areas. "
msgstr ""
"V označených oblastech hledejte další stopy, které napoví, kdo Malachiho "
"údajně pronásleduje."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03_READABLE"
msgid ""
"H.B. Company\n"
"Hailey Burnett Company - TOO ON THE NOSE?\n"
"Burnett - for a planet that doesn't burn TOO CRINGE?\n"
"Balloons, ducks, and snakes! \n"
"\n"
"When will Dad figure it out? "
msgstr ""
"H.B. Company\n"
"Hailey Burnett Company — MOC OKATÉ?\n"
"Burnett — pro planetu, která nehoří (anglicky „burn“). MOC TRAPNÉ?\n"
"Balónky, kachny a hadi!\n"
"\n"
"Kdy už to tátovi dojde?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"Who's the stalker? That may be a question that will never be answered, but "
"what you do know is that the Greater kudu population needs to be reduced. "
"Let's head into the assignment!"
msgstr ""
"Kdo Malachiho pronásleduje? To se možná nikdy nedozvíte. Jisté je, že je "
"potřeba snížit počet kudu velkých. Pusťte se do práce."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 description 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"The Greater kudu population needs to be reduced, and you'll also be helping "
"Malachi's daughter, who turned out to be the \"stalker\"! It probably took "
"you longer than it should have to figure it out, but that's Malachi's fault,"
" as the pranks hinted at their specific personal history. Now she just needs"
" help with a project for her business."
msgstr ""
"Je potřeba snížit počet kudu velkých a pomoci Malachiho dceři, ze které se "
"vyklubala ona domnělá pronásledovatelka. Rozluštění záhady vám možná trvalo "
"déle, než bylo nutné, ale za to mohl Malachi: žerty odkazovaly na jejich "
"společné zážitky. Hailey teď potřebuje pomoc s projektem pro svou firmu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_NAME"
msgid "Savannah stalker"
msgstr "Pronásledovatel ze savany"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Player returns to Malachi after doing a task
#. for him AND finding all the clues about the stalker. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"Seems like the yellow-billed ducks are improving and... we know who the "
"\"stalker\" is."
msgstr ""
"Vypadá to, že se populaci kachny žlutozobé daří lépe a... víme, kdo mě "
"„pronásledoval“."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER_A"
msgid "\"We know?\" I still have no idea."
msgstr "„Víme?“ Já pořád nemám tušení."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_MALACHI_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_MALACHI_A"
msgid ""
"My daughter! Hailey Burnett! She left obvious clues, but I was too blind to "
"make sense of them."
msgstr ""
"Moje dcera! Hailey Burnett! Nechala mi před očima jasné stopy, ale mně nic "
"nedošlo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_MALACHI_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_MALACHI_A"
msgid ""
"The \"parent duck\", the logo she was scribbling for her company, and the "
"fact she was just hiding things to probably... I don't know why."
msgstr ""
"To „rodičovské káčátko“, logo, které navrhovala pro svou firmu, i ty "
"poschovávané věci... I když proč je schovávala, to nevím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_PLAYER_B"
msgid "You should probably stop calling her a stalker now, shouldn't you?"
msgstr "Tak už byste jí asi neměl říkat pronásledovatelka, co myslíte?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_MALACHI_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_MALACHI_B"
msgid "Yeah, you're right."
msgstr "Máte pravdu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_MALACHI_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_MALACHI_B"
msgid "I just don't understand. Why would she do that?"
msgstr "Jen nechápu, proč to dělala."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER_C"
msgid "Your daughter, yes."
msgstr "Takže to byla vaše dcera."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_MALACHI"
msgid "She's supposed to be in the States, how could she be doing it?"
msgstr "Vždyť měla být ve Státech. Jak to mohla všechno provést?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_MALACHI"
msgid "You know what? Let's call her."
msgstr "Víte co? Zavoláme jí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_MALACHI"
msgid "*gets his phone and starts dialing her number on loudspeaker*"
msgstr "*vytáhne telefon, zapne hlasitý odposlech a vytočí její číslo*"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_HAILEY
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_HAILEY"
msgid "Hi Dad!"
msgstr "Ahoj, tati!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_MALACHI"
msgid "Hailey! Are you by any chance at Kilimaya Reserve right now?"
msgstr "Hailey! Nejsi teď náhodou v rezervaci Kilimaya?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_HAILEY
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "she is ecstatic"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_HAILEY"
msgid ""
"YES! Finally! Did you figure it out on your own, or did Patrick blow my "
"cover?"
msgstr "ANO! Konečně! Přišel jsi na to sám, nebo mě prozradil Patrick?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_MALACHI"
msgid "Patrick?"
msgstr "Patrick?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"Not on my own, I had a rep for Hearth & Hunt help me, because you had your "
"old man scared that I have a stalker!"
msgstr ""
"Sám ne. Pomohl mi člověk z Hearth & Hunt. Pěkně jsi svého starého tátu "
"vyděsila! Myslel jsem, že mě někdo pronásleduje."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_HAILEY
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_HAILEY"
msgid "(laughs)"
msgstr "(smích)"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_HAILEY
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_HAILEY"
msgid "That's embarrassing, dad."
msgstr "To je trochu trapné, tati."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_HAILEY
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_HAILEY"
msgid ""
"I thought the first prank would make it obvious! The child locks everywhere!"
" You did that to me when I first moved to the US, remember?"
msgstr ""
"Myslela jsem, že ti to dojde hned po prvním žertu! Ty dětské pojistky přece."
" Udělal jsi mi totéž, když jsem se přestěhovala do USA, pamatuješ?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_MALACHI"
msgid "Oh. I do remember that. Now."
msgstr "Aha. Teď už si vzpomínám."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_HAILEY
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 21"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_HAILEY"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I'm back for a few months and I wanted to surprise you and lift your"
" spirits. I just didn't know it would take you so long, and after a few days"
" I didn't want to ruin my plan to surprise you."
msgstr ""
"Na pár měsíců jsem se vrátila a chtěla jsem tě překvapit a zvednout ti "
"náladu. Nenapadlo mě, že ti to bude trvat tak dlouho. Po pár dnech už mi "
"bylo líto překvapení vzdát."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 22"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_MALACHI"
msgid "Well, you managed to surprise me."
msgstr "Tak překvapit se ti mě povedlo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_HAILEY
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 23"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_HAILEY"
msgid ""
"Dad, I can finally talk to you! I'm here on a working trip actually. My "
"company is collaborating with Hearth & Hunt on habitat recovery."
msgstr ""
"Tati, konečně ti to můžu říct! Přijela jsem vlastně pracovně. Moje firma "
"spolupracuje s Hearth & Hunt na obnově přírodních stanovišť."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_HAILEY
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 24"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_HAILEY"
msgid ""
"My colleague's studying the effects of herds and their population increase "
"or decrease on specific habitats, and how that influences the local fauna. "
"Specifically, greater kudus."
msgstr ""
"Můj kolega zkoumá, jak stáda a změny jejich početnosti ovlivňují konkrétní "
"stanoviště a místní živočichy. Konkrétně se zabývá kudu velkým."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_HAILEY
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 25"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_HAILEY"
msgid "Do you think you could help me with that?"
msgstr "Pomohl bys mi s tím?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 26"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_PLAYER_A"
msgid ""
"I have a sinking feeling that I'll be the one who ends up helping you with "
"that."
msgstr "Mám neblahé tušení, že s tím nakonec budu pomáhat já."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_HAILEY_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 27"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_HAILEY_A"
msgid "Sorry, who are you?"
msgstr "Promiň, kdo jsi?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 29"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Of course! Pleasure to meet you, Hailey! I'm {playerCharacterName}."
msgstr "Jistě! Těší mě, Hailey. Jsem {playerCharacterName}."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_HAILEY_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 30"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_HAILEY_B"
msgid "Hello! Sorry, who are you?"
msgstr "Ahoj! Promiň, ale kdo jsi?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_PLAYER_B"
msgid ""
"I work for Hearth & Hunt, so whatever help you need will probably end up "
"being my responsibility."
msgstr ""
"Pracuju pro Hearth & Hunt, takže ta pomoc nakonec nejspíš připadne mně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_PLAYER_C"
msgid "That's probably where I come in."
msgstr "A tady asi přicházím na řadu já."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_HAILEY_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 33"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_HAILEY_C"
msgid "Aaand you are...?"
msgstr "A ty jsi...?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 34"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_PLAYER_C"
msgid ""
"I'm {playerCharacterName}, Hearth & Hunt agent. The one helping your dad "
"with his stalker issue."
msgstr ""
"Jsem {playerCharacterName} z Hearth & Hunt. Pomáhal jsem tvému otci s tím "
"údajným pronásledováním."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_HAILEY_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 35"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_HAILEY_C"
msgid ""
"Ah yes. Sorry about that. I didn't know my dad was so... Slow on the uptake."
msgstr ""
"Aha. To mě mrzí. Netušila jsem, že tátovi to bude docházet tak... pomalu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 36"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"All's well that ends well! Seems like now we can finally meet, and a rep "
"will help us with the research for your company."
msgstr ""
"Konec dobrý, všechno dobré! Konečně se uvidíme a zástupce Hearth & Hunt nám "
"pomůže s výzkumem pro tvoji firmu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 37"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_MALACHI"
msgid "Thank you. So, it looks like it's true!"
msgstr "Děkuju. Takže je to pravda!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_PLAYER"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Co?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 39"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_MALACHI"
msgid "(laughs) That Hearth & Hunt connects families."
msgstr "(smích) Že Hearth & Hunt spojuje rodiny."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Harvest 3 female Greater kudus."
msgstr "Ulovte a zpracujte 3 samice kudu velkého."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L01_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Pandora calls to player after they make all
#. the tasks for Malachi"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L01_PANDORA"
msgid "Did you meet Hailey Burnett?"
msgstr "Už znáš Hailey Burnett?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L02_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L02_PANDORA"
msgid "She is BRILLIANT!"
msgstr "Je skvělá!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L03_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L03_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"And so are you, by the way! By helping Malachi with this, you've also set us"
" up with her."
msgstr ""
"A ty taky! Tím, že jsi Malachimu pomohl, jsi nám otevřel cestu ke spolupráci"
" s ní."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L04_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L04_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"And Malachi has a sweet spot for his daughter. Meaning helping her will only"
" make him feel more..."
msgstr ""
"Malachi má pro svou dceru slabost. Když jí pomůžeme, bude se vůči nám cítit "
"ještě víc..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L05_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "her usually sweet tone turns a little bit
#. sinister"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L05_PANDORA"
msgid "Indebted to us."
msgstr "Zavázaný."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L01_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Dialouge after player doesn't discover all
#. the clues and they don't reveal that the \"stalker\" is the daughter. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L01_MALACHI"
msgid "So, we aren't any closer to finding out who the stalker is..."
msgstr "Takže pořád nevíme, kdo mě pronásleduje..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L02_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L02_MALACHI"
msgid "But at least you've managed to improve the status of the ducks!"
msgstr "Ale alespoň se vám podařilo zlepšit stav populace kachen!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L03_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L03_PLAYER_A"
msgid ""
"Life with a stalker is more exciting anyway! When they don't murder you, at "
"least."
msgstr ""
"Život s tajemným pronásledovatelem má aspoň říz. Tedy pokud vás nezabije."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L04_MALACHI_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L04_MALACHI_A"
msgid "Thank you. That's exactly what I wanted to hear."
msgstr "Děkuju. Přesně to jsem chtěl slyšet."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L05_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L05_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Don't worry. The stalker is probably just someone trying to be nice."
msgstr "Nebojte se. Třeba vás jen chtěl někdo potěšit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L06_MALACHI_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L06_MALACHI_B"
msgid "Somehow I doubt that."
msgstr "O tom nějak pochybuji."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L07_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L07_PLAYER_C"
msgid "You could set up cameras in your office and the surrounding area."
msgstr "Mohl byste do kanceláře a jejího okolí umístit kamery."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L08_MALACHI_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L08_MALACHI_C"
msgid "Oh... Why didn't I think of that?"
msgstr "Oh... Proč mě to nenapadlo?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L09_MALACHI_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L09_MALACHI_C"
msgid "I'm getting old."
msgstr "Už stárnu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L10_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L10_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"Anyways, Pandora asked me if we could work on the local kudu population."
msgstr ""
"Pandora mě požádala, abychom se věnovali místní populaci kudu velkého."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L11_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L11_MALACHI"
msgid "Recently I've been seeing a lot of ugly deaths around kudu herds."
msgstr ""
"Poslední dobou vídám ve stádech kudu spoustu zvířat, která uhynula za "
"hrozných okolností."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L12_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L12_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"The problem is, they still challenge each other. Very occasionally, they "
"interlock their horns."
msgstr ""
"Samci mezi sebou pořád soupeří a občas se jim při souboji zaklesnou rohy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L13_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L13_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"It's rare, but we've already seen three pairs die over the last few "
"months—out of starvation, locked together by their horns."
msgstr ""
"Bývá to vzácné, ale za posledních pár měsíců jsme našli tři takové dvojice. "
"Zaklesnutí samci uhynuli hlady."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L14_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L14_MALACHI"
msgid ""
"That means that there are just too many of them. They aren't usually "
"territorial or aggressive, after all."
msgstr ""
"To svědčí o tom, že je jich příliš mnoho. Obvykle totiž nejsou zvlášť "
"teritoriální ani agresivní."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L15_MALACHI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L15_MALACHI"
msgid "So let's concentrate on this. And forget about the stalker!"
msgstr "Tak se na kudu zaměřme. A na pronásledovatele zapomeňme!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L16_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L16_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "Where do greater kudus live?"
msgstr "Kde žije kudu velký?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L17_MALACHI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L17_MALACHI_OP01"
msgid ""
"Kudus are the complete opposite of blesbok. They prefer woods and hate "
"plains."
msgstr ""
"Kudu velký je pravým opakem buvolce běločelého. Drží se v lesích a otevřeným"
" pláním se vyhýbá."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L18_MALACHI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L18_MALACHI_OP01"
msgid ""
"They only go out in the open if there's no nearby water source secluded by "
"trees."
msgstr ""
"Na otevřené prostranství vyjdou jen tehdy, když v okolí není zdroj vody "
"krytý stromy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L19_MALACHI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L19_MALACHI_OP01"
msgid ""
"Kudus are extremely vigilant, so these open water sources are your best "
"chance to expose them."
msgstr ""
"Jsou velice ostražití. U otevřených napajedel máte nejlepší šanci je "
"spatřit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L20_PLAYER_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L20_PLAYER_OP02"
msgid "What's the best way to decrease the kudu population?"
msgstr "Jak nejlépe snížit počet kudu?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L21_MALACHI_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 21"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L21_MALACHI_OP02"
msgid ""
"Good question. There is no objectively right way, but there is one that I "
"prefer."
msgstr ""
"Dobrá otázka. Jediný správný postup neexistuje, ale já dávám přednost "
"jednomu z nich."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L22_MALACHI_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 22"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L22_MALACHI_OP02"
msgid ""
"If you target cows, the numbers will go down quickly, but I only do that "
"when a disease is spreading rapidly."
msgstr ""
"Lovem samic počty rychle snížíte. K tomu ale přistupuju jen tehdy, když se "
"rychle šíří nemoc."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L23_MALACHI_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 23"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L23_MALACHI_OP02"
msgid ""
"I suggest ignoring cows and targeting the old bulls with the most developed "
"horns."
msgstr ""
"Raději bych samice nechal být a zaměřil se na staré samce s nejmohutnějšími "
"rohy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L24_MALACHI_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 24"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L24_MALACHI_OP02"
msgid ""
"That way, the population decreases but stays strong. And you can score some "
"very impressive trophies."
msgstr ""
"Počet zvěře tak klesne, ale populace zůstane silná. A můžete získat "
"působivou trofej."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L25_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 25"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L25_PLAYER"
msgid "Avoiding it isn't gonna solve it! But I'll help with the kudus."
msgstr "Přehlížet ten problém nic nevyřeší! Ale s kudu vám pomůžu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L01_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Pandora calls the player after they do all
#. the tasks from Malachi, but failed to find out the identity of the stalker.
#. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue04 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L01_PANDORA"
msgid "Great job with the kudus!"
msgstr "S kudu jsi odvedl skvělou práci!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L02_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue04 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L02_PANDORA"
msgid "But I have to admit, I'm a little disappointed."
msgstr "Ale musím přiznat, že jsem trochu zklamaná."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L03_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue04 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L03_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"If you'd helped Malachi more, you'd have discovered that his \"stalker\" was"
" just trying to surprise him."
msgstr ""
"Kdybys Malachimu pomohl víc, zjistil bys, že ho jeho „pronásledovatel“ chtěl"
" jen překvapit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L04_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue04 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L04_PANDORA"
msgid "It was his daughter."
msgstr "Byla to jeho dcera."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L05_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue04 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L05_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"It could have been a heartwarming story for Hearth & Hunt's weekly "
"newsletter!"
msgstr "To by byl dojemný příběh do týdenního zpravodaje Hearth & Hunt!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L06_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "sweet"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue04 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L06_PANDORA"
msgid "But that's okay."
msgstr "Ale to je v pořádku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L07_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during VO"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "little bit sinister"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue04 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L07_PANDORA"
msgid "Just do better next time, yeah?"
msgstr "Příště si dej víc záležet, ano?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L08_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "sweet again"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory01 Mission03 Dialogue04 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO04_L08_PANDORA"
msgid "Thank youuu."
msgstr "Děkujuuu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"The erratic Damian, who doesn't look like the best possible choice for a "
"teaching position, needs to prepare a curriculum for a course covering "
"advanced bow-shooting techniques. Since the students are advanced, the "
"assignments he comes up with are pretty challenging, but he needs to make "
"sure that they're doable. And that's where you come in."
msgstr ""
"Damian je nevyzpytatelný a na učitele na první pohled nevypadá. Přesto má "
"připravit osnovy kurzu pokročilé lukostřelby. Vymýšlí náročné úkoly, ale "
"potřebuje ověřit, že je studenti dokážou splnit. S tím mu máte pomoct."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_NAME"
msgid "Chalk and talk"
msgstr "Křída a výklad"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Player visits Damian for the first time.
#. Damian is panicking. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"Okay, okay, I'm packing up. Pandora didn't have to send over a thug to throw"
" me out."
msgstr "Dobře, dobře, už balím. Pandora nemusela posílat vyhazovače."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER"
msgid "Throw you out? What for?"
msgstr "Vyhazovat tě? Za co?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_DAMIAN"
msgid "You're here to fire me, right?"
msgstr "Přišel jsi mě vyhodit, ne?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER"
msgid "Um... no?"
msgstr "Ehm... ne?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "relieved"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_DAMIAN"
msgid "Ohh."
msgstr "Aha."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_DAMIAN"
msgid "Then you must be a fan! I'll bring a pen to sign something for you."
msgstr "Tak to musíš být fanoušek! Dojdu pro propisku a něco ti podepíšu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "going through pens"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"This one doesn't write. Neither does this one. Or this one. Do you have a "
"pen?"
msgstr "Tahle nepíše. Tahle taky ne. A tahle... Nemáš propisku?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER"
msgid "Here."
msgstr "Tady."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"Where do you want the signature? There are some posters in the cabin, but "
"it'll cost you extra."
msgstr "Kam chceš podpis? Ve srubu mám i plakáty, ale za ty si připlatíš."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PLAYER_A"
msgid "You can sign your finished curriculum for Hearth & Hunt."
msgstr "Můžeš podepsat hotové osnovy pro Hearth & Hunt."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_DAMIAN_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_DAMIAN_A"
msgid "Aaaah. Did you just crawl out of my nightmares?"
msgstr "Ááá. Ty ses mi právě vyplazil z noční můry?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Um... Can you sign my arm?"
msgstr "Ehm... Podepíšeš se mi na ruku?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_DAMIAN_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_DAMIAN_B"
msgid "Sure! No problem. Just stick your hand out."
msgstr "Jasně! Nastav ruku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_DAMIAN_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_DAMIAN_B"
msgid "Some good muscle on you! And... it's done."
msgstr "Pěkné svaly! A... hotovo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Thank you?"
msgstr "Díky... asi?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_PLAYER_C"
msgid "I'm not here for your signature."
msgstr "Kvůli podpisu jsem nepřišel."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_DAMIAN_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_DAMIAN_C"
msgid "You know what? I had a hunch."
msgstr "Víš co? Tušil jsem to."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"Okay, I'm just trying to delay the inevitable. Pandora sent you, right?"
msgstr "Jen oddaluju nevyhnutelné. Poslala tě Pandora, že?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_DAMIAN"
msgid "Will you be my savior?"
msgstr "Zachráníš mě?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_PLAYER"
msgid "That depends on what I'd be saving you from."
msgstr "Záleží na tom, před čím tě mám zachránit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 21"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"Okay, get this. Hearth & Hunt hired me to prepare a new advanced shooting "
"curriculum."
msgstr ""
"Tak poslouchej. Hearth & Hunt mě najala, abych sestavil osnovy pokročilé "
"lukostřelby."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 22"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_DAMIAN"
msgid "The problem is..."
msgstr "Problém je..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 23"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_DAMIAN"
msgid "I'm not exactly teacher material."
msgstr "Jenže já se na učitele moc nehodím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 24"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Clearly."
msgstr "To je vidět."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_DAMIAN_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 25"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_DAMIAN_A"
msgid "Oh, so that's the first impression I make."
msgstr "Aha, takový dělám první dojem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_DAMIAN_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 26"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_DAMIAN_A"
msgid "Well, you're NOT wrong."
msgstr "Ale nemýlíš se."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 27"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_PLAYER_B"
msgid "With a little push, anyone can teach!"
msgstr "S trochou podpory může učit každý!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_DAMIAN_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 28"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_DAMIAN_B"
msgid ""
"I get that you're trying to be supportive, but that statement is very much "
"not true."
msgstr "Vím, že mě chceš povzbudit, ale tohle prostě není pravda."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_DAMIAN_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 29"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_DAMIAN_B"
msgid "Teaching is a very tough job and not everyone can handle it."
msgstr "Učit je těžké. Ne každý to zvládne."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 30"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_PLAYER_C"
msgid "So why did you take the job?"
msgstr "Tak proč jsi tu práci vzal?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_DAMIAN_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 31"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_DAMIAN_C"
msgid "That's... a good question!"
msgstr "To je... dobrá otázka!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_DAMIAN_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 32"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_DAMIAN_C"
msgid "General understatement of the job and overstatement of my skills?"
msgstr "Asi jsem podcenil práci a přecenil svoje schopnosti?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 33"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_DAMIAN"
msgid "I need your help, bud."
msgstr "Potřebuju tvoji pomoc, kámo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 34"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_DAMIAN"
msgid "Pandora is on my ass for making the assignments too difficult."
msgstr "Pandora mě pořád peskuje, že dávám studentům příliš těžké úkoly."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 35"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_DAMIAN"
msgid "But it's supposed to be difficult! It's advanced bow hunting."
msgstr "Ale mají být těžké! Je to pokročilý lov lukem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 36"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"Honestly, I think Pandora is just too hard on me because we're friends."
msgstr "Myslím, že na mě Pandora tak tlačí právě proto, že jsme přátelé."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 37"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_DAMIAN"
msgid "...Which I wasn't supposed to tell anybody. Oops."
msgstr "...Což jsem neměl nikomu říkat. Jejda."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 38"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "You two are friends?"
msgstr "Vy dva se přátelíte?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_DAMIAN_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 39"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_DAMIAN_OP01"
msgid ""
"Yeah, we've known each other for a long time now. We met at a bow shooting "
"camp as children."
msgstr "Známe se od dětství. Potkali jsme se na lukostřeleckém táboře."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L40_DAMIAN_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 40"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L40_DAMIAN_OP01"
msgid ""
"She asked me not to tell anyone because it would create a \"conflict of "
"interest.\""
msgstr "Požádala mě, ať to nikomu neříkám. Prý by šlo o „střet zájmů“."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L41_DAMIAN_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 41"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L41_DAMIAN_OP01"
msgid ""
"But just because she's my friend, she's treating me DIABOLICALLY. I'd rather"
" I didn't know her at all. Maybe then she would've been nicer."
msgstr ""
"Jenomže protože jsme přátelé, dává mi to pořádně sežrat! Kdybych ji neznal, "
"možná by ke mně byla milejší."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L42_DAMIAN_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 42"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L42_DAMIAN_OP01"
msgid "Nothing is good enough!"
msgstr "Nic jí není dost dobré!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L43_DAMIAN_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 43"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L43_DAMIAN_OP01"
msgid ""
"One day I'll steal her little sun umbrella and she'll no longer hold any "
"power over me."
msgstr ""
"Jednou jí ukradnu ten její malý slunečník. Pak nade mnou ztratí všechnu moc."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L44_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 44"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L44_PLAYER"
msgid "Isn't the whole of Hearth & Hunt supposed to be a family?"
msgstr "Nemá být celá Hearth & Hunt jedna rodina?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L45_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 45"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L45_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"You're right, bud. I don't know why I'm not supposed to tell anybody. Maybe "
"she's just ashamed of me?"
msgstr ""
"Máš pravdu, kámo. Taky nechápu, proč o našem přátelství nesmím mluvit. Možná"
" se za mě stydí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L46_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 46"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L46_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I've prepared a list of tasks for the first assignment, can you take"
" a look at it?"
msgstr "Každopádně mám seznam úkolů pro první zadání. Podíváš se na něj?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Harvest a male Mountain zebra using Skye Ferran Wonder bow. "
msgstr "Ulovte a zpracujte samce zebry horské lukem Skye Ferran Wonder."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_1"
msgid ""
"Harvest a male Mountain zebra. Use Primacy Diamond arrow with a Fixed Blade "
"and Short Vanes."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte samce zebry horské šípem Primacy Diamond s hrotem s "
"pevnými čepelemi a krátkými letkami."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OPTIONAL01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 objective 01
#. optional 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OPTIONAL01"
msgid "Use a single arrow for the harvest."
msgstr "Ulovte samce jediným šípem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OPTIONAL02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission01 objective 01
#. optional 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION01_OPTIONAL02"
msgid ""
"Deliver the fatal shot at a distance of "
"{minShotDistance}|displayAs(distance) or more."
msgstr ""
"Smrtelně zasáhněte samce ze vzdálenosti alespoň "
"{minShotDistance}|displayAs(distance)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 description 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"After a short lecture about... vanes (?) Damian got extremely excited about "
"his actual occupation—trickster shooter—and decided to insert his favorite "
"trick into the curriculum for advanced bow shooting lectures. Catch an arrow"
" mid-flight by hand! Or don't. Maybe call Pandora beforehand and check "
"first?"
msgstr ""
"Po krátké přednášce o... letkách (?) se Damian nadchl pro své skutečné "
"povolání – exhibiční střelbu – a rozhodl se zařadit do pokročilého kurzu "
"lukostřelby svůj oblíbený trik. Chytit letící šíp holou rukou! Nebo raději "
"ne. Možná se nejdřív poradit s Pandorou?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 description 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Pandora isn't keen on Damian's idea to include something so dangerous and "
"reckless. She demands you call her in his presence, so she can take care of "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Pandora nechce, aby Damian do kurzu zařadil tak nebezpečný a lehkomyslný "
"kousek. Trvá na tom, abyste jí zavolali před ním, a ona to s ním vyřeší."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 description 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"Pandora knocked some sense back into Damian and told him she doesn't want to"
" involve you, or anyone else, in his dangerous antics. So now you're left "
"with a sulking Damian and another assignment to do."
msgstr ""
"Pandora Damianovi důrazně vysvětlila, že do jeho nebezpečných kousků nenechá"
" zapojit vás ani nikoho dalšího. Teď vás čeká další úkol a trucující Damian."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_NAME"
msgid "Teacher's pet"
msgstr "Učitelův oblíbenec"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Player returns to Damian after doing his
#. first assignment. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"So how was it? Surprisingly insightful? Aren't I the best teacher around?"
msgstr "Tak co? Překvapivě poučné? Jsem nejlepší učitel široko daleko, ne?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER_A"
msgid "You knew that wasn't the case before that sentence left your mouth."
msgstr "Ještě než jsi to řekl, věděl jsi, že to není pravda."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_DAMIAN_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_DAMIAN_A"
msgid "Don't burst my bubble like that! I bruise easily."
msgstr "Nekaz mi radost! Jsem citlivá duše."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER_B"
msgid "There is such a thing as a healthy amount of confidence."
msgstr "Existuje i zdravá míra sebevědomí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_PLAYER_C"
msgid "Being a teacher isn't just about giving assignments."
msgstr "Učit znamená víc než jen zadávat úkoly."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_DAMIAN_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_DAMIAN_C"
msgid "I KNOW! But I'm not a good teacher, remember?"
msgstr "VÍM! Ale já nejsem dobrý učitel, pamatuješ?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_DAMIAN"
msgid "I'm ready for some real feedback, bud."
msgstr "Tak spusť. Opravdu chci slyšet, co si myslíš, kámo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER"
msgid "Maybe if you also explained the assignment and what it's good for?"
msgstr "Co kdybys studentům taky vysvětlil zadání a jeho smysl?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_DAMIAN"
msgid "Oh GOD. Teaching is so hard."
msgstr "Panebože. Učit je dřina."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_DAMIAN"
msgid "Okay, let's start the lecture!"
msgstr "Dobře, tak začneme výklad!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Well, I did sign up to help you..."
msgstr "No, přihlásil jsem se, abych ti pomohl..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during VO"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"So, I asked you to use a Primacy Diamond arrow with Fixed Blade and Short "
"Vanes."
msgstr ""
"Chtěl jsem po tobě šíp Primacy Diamond s loveckým hrotem s pevnými čepelemi "
"a krátkými letkami."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_PLAYER_B"
msgid "I have my student hat on."
msgstr "Tak jo, zahraju si na studenta."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_PLAYER_C"
msgid "No, I'm good, thanks. Keep it for your students."
msgstr "Ne, díky. Výklad si schovej pro studenty."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_DAMIAN_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_DAMIAN_C"
msgid "That saves me a bit of work!"
msgstr "To mi ušetří trochu práce!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_DAMIAN"
msgid "Do you know why?"
msgstr "Víš proč?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Because that's what Hearth & Hunt supplies to you?"
msgstr "Protože ti to dodává Hearth & Hunt?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_DAMIAN_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_DAMIAN_A"
msgid "No, this is where I, and not Pandora, get to have my say."
msgstr "Ne. O tomhle rozhoduju já, ne Pandora."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Uuugh, no."
msgstr "Ehm... ne."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_DAMIAN_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_DAMIAN_B"
msgid ""
"Fixed-blade broadheads are great for hunting larger animals like deer or "
"zebras because of their sturdy construction and reliable cutting power."
msgstr ""
"Lovecké hroty s pevnými čepelemi se hodí na větší zvěř, třeba jeleny nebo "
"zebry. Jsou odolné a jejich čepele spolehlivě řežou."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 21"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_PLAYER_C"
msgid "The game was large. Other broadheads wouldn't cut it."
msgstr "Zvěř byla velká. Jiný lovecký hrot by nemusel stačit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_DAMIAN_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 22"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_DAMIAN_C"
msgid "Oh, I have a smart student today!"
msgstr "Vida, dnes mám bystrého studenta!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 23"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"Broad-cutting edges make the wound larger. And better penetration means "
"quicker kills."
msgstr ""
"Široké čepele vytvoří větší ránu. A hlubší průnik znamená rychlejší "
"usmrcení."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 24"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_DAMIAN"
msgid "Do you know what the short vanes are good for?"
msgstr "A víš, k čemu jsou krátké letky?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 25"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Um... for short... vaning?"
msgstr "Ehm... aby se šíp... krátce letkal?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_DAMIAN_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 26"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_DAMIAN_A"
msgid "Vaning? Sounds like you skipped a bow-hunting class or two, student."
msgstr "„Letkal“? Někdo nám tu asi chyběl na hodinách lukostřelby."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_DAMIAN_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 27"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_DAMIAN_A"
msgid ""
"Short vanes are lightweight and create less drag. So arrows fly faster with "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Krátké letky jsou lehké a kladou menší odpor vzduchu. Šíp s nimi letí "
"rychleji."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 28"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Yes. For very long ranges."
msgstr "Jasně. Hodí se na velké vzdálenosti."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_DAMIAN_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 29"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_DAMIAN_B"
msgid "Not really."
msgstr "Vlastně ne."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 30"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_PLAYER_C"
msgid "Yes. Arrows fly faster with them."
msgstr "Jasně. Šíp s nimi letí rychleji."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 31"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"The catch is that short vanes suit shorter and medium ranges, but I wanted "
"it at a longer distance."
msgstr ""
"Háček je v tom, že krátké letky se hodí spíš na krátké a střední "
"vzdálenosti. Já ale chtěl střílet dál."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 32"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"This is what makes the assignment advanced. You have to get it all together "
"in your head before you shoot."
msgstr ""
"Proto je to pokročilý úkol. Než vypustíš šíp, musíš promyslet všechny "
"podmínky."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 33"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_PLAYER_A"
msgid "I'd appreciate it more if you'd let me know that in ADVANCE."
msgstr "Ocenil bych, kdybys mi to řekl PŘEDEM."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_DAMIAN_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 34"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_DAMIAN_A"
msgid "That's why your feedback is so important, bud! I'll work on it."
msgstr "A právě proto potřebuju tvoji zpětnou vazbu, kámo! Zapracuju na tom."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 35"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Wow, that felt like you... taught me something."
msgstr "Páni. Mám pocit, že jsi mě právě něco naučil."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_DAMIAN_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 36"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_DAMIAN_B"
msgid "Is this what... being a good teacher feels like?"
msgstr "Takhle se tedy cítí dobrý učitel?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 37"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_PLAYER_C"
msgid ""
"Why don't you write it down for your materials? Kill two birds with one "
"stone."
msgstr ""
"Co si to zapsat do výukových materiálů? Zabiješ dvě mouchy jednou ranou."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_DAMIAN_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 38"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_DAMIAN_C"
msgid "But that would require me to... work."
msgstr "Ale to by vyžadovalo, abych... pracoval."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 39"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_PLAYER_C"
msgid "That's the point."
msgstr "O to právě jde."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L40_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 40"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L40_DAMIAN"
msgid "Okay, student, are you ready for the next assignment?"
msgstr "Dobře, studente, jsi připravený na další úkol?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L41_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 41"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L41_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid ""
"Wait! I've heard you make your own arrows and have a world record for some "
"crazy shot."
msgstr ""
"Počkej! Prý si vyrábíš vlastní šípy a držíš světový rekord v nějaké "
"neuvěřitelné střelbě."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L42_DAMIAN_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 42"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L42_DAMIAN_OP01"
msgid "That I do. What do you want to hear about?"
msgstr "Přesně tak. O čem chceš slyšet?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L43_PLAYER_OP01_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 43"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L43_PLAYER_OP01_OP01"
msgid "Your World Record?"
msgstr "Tvůj světový rekord?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L44_DAMIAN_OP01_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 44"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L44_DAMIAN_OP01_OP01"
msgid ""
"That would be my selling point. It's probably the only reason Pandora "
"employed me."
msgstr ""
"To je můj hlavní trumf. Nejspíš jediný důvod, proč mě Pandora zaměstnala."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L45_DAMIAN_OP01_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 45"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L45_DAMIAN_OP01_OP01"
msgid "Not probably. Definitely."
msgstr "Co nejspíš. Určitě."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L46_DAMIAN_OP01_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 46"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L46_DAMIAN_OP01_OP01"
msgid "Damian Underwood, the trickster archer."
msgstr "Damian Underwood, exhibiční lukostřelec."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L47_DAMIAN_OP01_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 47"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L47_DAMIAN_OP01_OP01"
msgid ""
"That's the name of the article about me in the World Records Compendium."
msgstr "Tak se jmenuje článek o mně ve World Records Compendium."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L48_DAMIAN_OP01_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 48"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L48_DAMIAN_OP01_OP01"
msgid ""
"I don't want to brag, but I can shoot almost anything, anytime, doesn't "
"matter how small."
msgstr ""
"Nechci se chlubit, ale lukem trefím skoro cokoli a kdykoli. I ten nejmenší "
"cíl."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L49_DAMIAN_OP01_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during VO"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 49"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L49_DAMIAN_OP01_OP01"
msgid ""
"The problem is I don't do a lot of thinking while I'm doing it, so it's hard"
" to teach."
msgstr "Potíž je, že při tom moc nepřemýšlím. A pak se to těžko učí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L50_PLAYER_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 50"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L50_PLAYER_OP01_OP02"
msgid "Your own arrows?"
msgstr "O tvých vlastních šípech?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L51_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 51"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L51_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02"
msgid ""
"Yes! This boy needs custom arrows, which fit like a glove. For the kinds of "
"shots I do—you gotta make them yourself."
msgstr ""
"Jasně! Na moje kousky potřebuju šípy přesně na míru. Ty si člověk musí "
"vyrobit sám."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L52_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 52"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L52_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02"
msgid "It's not just about putting feathers on a stick and calling it a day."
msgstr "Nestačí připevnit peří k dříku a prohlásit šíp za hotový."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L53_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Damian starts to get serious"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 53"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L53_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02"
msgid "You gotta feel it, it's like an extension of your own hand."
msgstr "Musíš šíp cítit jako prodloužení vlastní ruky."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L54_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 54"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L54_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02"
msgid ""
"First, you pick the shaft. Too stiff, it fights you. Too flexible, it "
"wobbles like a drunk man in the wind."
msgstr ""
"Nejdřív vybereš dřík. Příliš tuhý ti vzdoruje, příliš pružný se ve větru "
"kymácí jako opilec."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L55_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 55"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L55_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02"
msgid "I make it juuust the right size according to my draw length."
msgstr "Délku šípu přizpůsobuju délce svého nátahu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L56_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 56"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L56_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02"
msgid ""
"Next comes the fletching. Three vanes, sometimes four if I'm feeling fancy."
msgstr "Pak přijdou letky. Obvykle tři, někdy čtyři, když si chci vyhrát."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L57_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 57"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L57_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02"
msgid "And then the tip... that's where the arrow earns its purpose."
msgstr "A nakonec hrot. Ten určuje, k čemu šíp poslouží."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L58_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 58"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L58_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02"
msgid ""
"Maybe a broadhead for the hunt, sharp enough to cut through thick hide or a "
"simple field point for practice. Whatever it is, I make sure it's fixed "
"straight, balanced and ready."
msgstr ""
"Na lov ostrý lovecký hrot, který pronikne i silnou kůží. Na trénink "
"jednoduchý terčový hrot. Vždycky musí být nasazený rovně a šíp správně "
"vyvážený."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L59_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 59"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L59_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02"
msgid ""
"By the time I'm done, it's not just an arrow. It's a promise I've made to "
"myself."
msgstr ""
"Když skončím, není to pro mě jen šíp. Je to slib, který dávám sám sobě."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L60_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 60"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L60_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02"
msgid ""
"I promise that when I release that bowstring, it will reach its target no "
"matter what."
msgstr "Že až pustím tětivu, šíp doletí do cíle. Ať se děje cokoli."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L61_PLAYER_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 61"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L61_PLAYER_OP01_OP02"
msgid "You put a lot of thought into it."
msgstr "Hodně o tom přemýšlíš."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L62_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "now he bursts the \"bubble\" of seriousness"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 62"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L62_DAMIAN_OP01_OP02"
msgid ""
"Eh, not really. But it's a nice tradition. Trick shots are tough to execute,"
" but that's why we train."
msgstr ""
"Ale kdeže. Je to hezký rituál. Exhibiční zásahy jsou těžké, a proto trénuju."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L63_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 63"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L63_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "I'm writing notes for the next assignment!"
msgstr "Píšu si poznámky k dalšímu zadání!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L64_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 64"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L64_PLAYER"
msgid "Let's do it."
msgstr "Pojďme na to."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L65_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 65"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L65_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"They call me a \"trickster archer\" for a reason. I'm not just precise, I "
"get creative with this."
msgstr ""
"Neříkají mi exhibiční lukostřelec pro nic za nic. Nejde jen o přesnost, ale "
"i o nápad."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L66_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 66"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L66_DAMIAN"
msgid "Just moving and aiming at static targets isn't what archery is about."
msgstr "Lukostřelba přece není jen pohyb a míření na nehybné terče."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L67_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 67"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L67_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"If archers from hundreds of years ago saw our modern-day archers, they'd "
"laugh."
msgstr "Kdyby lučištníci z dávných dob viděli ty dnešní, smáli by se."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L68_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 68"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L68_DAMIAN"
msgid "Performing tricks was the thing! You also had to shoot really fast."
msgstr "Tehdy se předváděly různé triky. A muselo se střílet rychle."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L69_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 69"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L69_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"What people usually think of as historical archery only works for modern "
"target archery and Hollywood films."
msgstr ""
"To, co si lidé obvykle představují pod historickou lukostřelbou, funguje jen"
" při dnešní terčové lukostřelbě a v hollywoodských filmech."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L70_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 70"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L70_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"I hate it when rules tie me down, bud. That's why I add a creative spin to "
"the shots I make."
msgstr ""
"Nesnáším, když mě svazují pravidla, kámo. Proto si každý zásah rád "
"ozvláštním."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L71_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 71"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L71_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"For example, I hold the arrow in the same hand that I shoot with. To paint "
"you a picture: I hold the arrow in my bow hand. But a lot of archers have "
"started to do this."
msgstr ""
"Třeba si při střelbě přidržuju šíp v ruce s lukem. Dělá to už ale spousta "
"dalších lukostřelců."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L72_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 72"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L72_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"If you aim to become a master archer, you need to learn to have total "
"control of your bow and your body. That means learning to shoot with both "
"hands!"
msgstr ""
"Chceš být mistrem lukostřelby? Nauč se ovládat luk i vlastní tělo. Musíš "
"umět střílet pravou i levou rukou!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L73_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 73"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L73_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"My favorite trick is lighting an arrow on fire and shooting it at a candle "
"to light it."
msgstr ""
"Můj oblíbený trik je zapálit šíp a trefit s ním svíčku tak, aby se "
"rozhořela."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L74_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 74"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L74_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"When you have a whole crowd watching, waiting for the candle to light up, "
"it's a real adrenaline boost."
msgstr ""
"Když se na to dívá celý dav a čeká, jestli svíčka vzplane, adrenalin "
"vystřelí vzhůru."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L75_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 75"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L75_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"You shoot, and you know you hit it, but for a split second you feel a deep "
"sense of shame, thinking: \"What if I didn't hit it?\" And then it lights "
"up!"
msgstr ""
"Vypustíš šíp a víš, že jsi trefil. Na zlomek vteřiny tě ale přepadne pocit "
"studu: „Co když jsem se netrefil?“ A pak svíčka vzplane!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L76_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "getting very excited"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 76"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L76_DAMIAN"
msgid "Just speaking about it gets me all FIRED UP!"
msgstr "Už jen když o tom mluvím, úplně mě to ROZPÁLÍ!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L77_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 77"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L77_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"In the past, if you wanted to be a master archer, you had to be able to "
"catch an arrow mid-flight and shoot it back."
msgstr ""
"Kdysi prý mistr lukostřelec dokázal chytit letící šíp a poslat ho zpátky."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L78_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 78"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L78_DAMIAN"
msgid "I haven't mastered that yet, but with you, I think we can do it!"
msgstr "To jsem ještě nezvládl, ale s tebou by se to mohlo povést!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L79_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 79"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L79_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Yeah! Let's DO IT!"
msgstr "Jo! JDEME DO TOHO!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L80_DAMIAN_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 80"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L80_DAMIAN_A"
msgid "That's what I like to hear!"
msgstr "To rád slyším!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L81_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 81"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L81_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Um... I don't think it sounds very safe."
msgstr "Ehm... To nezní moc bezpečně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L82_DAMIAN_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 82"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L82_DAMIAN_B"
msgid "Of course it's not safe! That's why it's exciting."
msgstr "Samozřejmě to není bezpečné! Proto je to vzrušující."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L83_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 83"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L83_PLAYER_C"
msgid "Are you insane?"
msgstr "Zbláznil ses?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L84_DAMIAN_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "shouts"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 84"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L84_DAMIAN_C"
msgid "YES!"
msgstr "ANO!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L85_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "completely pumped-up"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 85"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L85_DAMIAN"
msgid "Let's do it! WOOO!"
msgstr "Tak do toho! JÚÚ!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Call Pandora to talk about Damian's idea."
msgstr "Zavolejte Pandoře a promluvte si o Damianově nápadu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L01_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Pandora reacts to player calling her about
#. Damian wanting to do something dangerous"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue02 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L01_PANDORA"
msgid "He's going to do WHAT?"
msgstr "CO bude dělat?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L02_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue02 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L02_PANDORA"
msgid "I apologize for yelling."
msgstr "Omlouvám se za křik."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L03_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "she gets angry"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue02 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L03_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"Could you put me on speakerphone with Damian? Suddenly, he isn't answering "
"my calls."
msgstr ""
"Zapneš hlasitý odposlech, ať můžu mluvit s Damianem? Najednou mi nebere "
"hovory."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 objective 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid "Speak to Damian and put Pandora on speakerphone."
msgstr ""
"Promluvte si s Damianem a zapněte u hovoru s Pandorou hlasitý odposlech."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L01_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L01_PLAYER"
msgid "Damian? I'm sorry, man, but I have to do this."
msgstr "Damiane, promiň, ale musím to udělat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L02_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L02_PLAYER"
msgid "*taps on the phone, to put Pandora on speakerphone*"
msgstr "*zapne na telefonu hlasitý odposlech*"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L03_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for us" :
#. "KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L03_PANDORA"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L03_PANDORA"
msgid "What on earth do you think you're doing?"
msgstr "Co si proboha myslíš, že děláš?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L04_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "whispers to the player"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L04_DAMIAN"
msgid "I can't believe you set me up, bud..."
msgstr "Nemůžu uvěřit, že jsi mě takhle napráskal, kámo..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L05_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during VO"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "tries to act innocent"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L05_DAMIAN"
msgid "Heeey, Pandora! How are you?"
msgstr "Čau, Pandoro! Jak se máš?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L06_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L06_PANDORA"
msgid "Don't try to change the subject!"
msgstr "Nesnaž se změnit téma!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L07_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L07_PANDORA"
msgid "Please, don't kill our rep this time."
msgstr "Prosím tě, našeho člověka tentokrát nezabij."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L08_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L08_PLAYER"
msgid "This time?"
msgstr "Tentokrát?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L09_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L09_PANDORA"
msgid "I hired you to prepare a NORMAL advanced bow-hunting curriculum."
msgstr ""
"Najala jsem tě, abys připravil NORMÁLNÍ osnovy pokročilého lovu lukem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L10_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L10_PANDORA"
msgid "Not to sponsor your crazy trickster shooting ideas."
msgstr "Ne abych platila tvoje šílené exhibiční kousky."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L11_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L11_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"We've been through this already, and now the rep is going to help you finish"
" it."
msgstr "To už jsme probírali. Náš člověk ti teď pomůže osnovy dokončit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L12_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "very harsh"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L12_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"If I hear about this again, you will no longer be working for Hearth & Hunt."
msgstr "Jestli o tom ještě jednou uslyším, v Hearth & Hunt skončíš."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L13_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "suddenly sweet"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L13_PANDORA"
msgid "Oh, and rep, great work so far. I'm glad you're here."
msgstr "A ty, skvělá práce. Jsem ráda, že tě tu máme."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L14_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L14_PLAYER"
msgid "*phone beeping, signaling end*"
msgstr "*telefon zapípá a hovor skončí*"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L15_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L15_DAMIAN"
msgid "Okay?"
msgstr "Dobře?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L16_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L16_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"I'm going to overlook this ginormous betrayal, because... Well, maybe I got "
"a little over-excited, and she might be right."
msgstr ""
"Tu obří zradu ti prominu, protože... Možná jsem se nechal trochu unést a "
"Pandora může mít pravdu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L17_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue03 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L17_DAMIAN"
msgid "So let's try a different assignment..."
msgstr "Tak zkusme jiné zadání..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 objective 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03"
msgid "Harvest 3 Ostriches using Terra Fractal TR bow."
msgstr "Ulovte a zpracujte 3 pštrosy lukem Terra Fractal TR."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03_1"
msgid ""
"Harvest 3 Ostriches. Use Primacy Impact arrow with a Mechanical Blade and "
"Long Vanes."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte 3 pštrosy. Použijte šíp Primacy Impact s mechanickým "
"hrotem a dlouhými letkami."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L01_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Damian says this during the hunt, but he is
#. bored, he says it like a machine"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue04 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L01_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"This 3-head broadhead should cut through an ostrich's tough skin and muscle "
"and ensure a quick kill."
msgstr ""
"Tenhle lovecký hrot se třemi čepelemi by měl proniknout silnou kůží i "
"svalstvem pštrosa a rychle ho usmrtit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L02_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue04 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L02_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"Do you see these blades? With three cutting edges, even a less-than-perfect "
"shot can cause lethal damage."
msgstr ""
"Vidíš ty čepele? Díky třem ostřím může i méně přesný zásah způsobit smrtelné"
" poranění."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L03_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue04 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L03_DAMIAN"
msgid "This is the first time I've seen one in person, actually."
msgstr "Vlastně takový hrot vidím naživo poprvé."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L04_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue04 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L04_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"Um... Forget the last thing I just said. I'm pretty stoked and I don't know "
"what I'm talking about."
msgstr ""
"Ehm... Na to, co jsem právě řekl, zapomeň. Jsem tak nadšený, že ani nevím, "
"co povídám."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03_VO05_L01_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "sarcastic"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue05 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03_VO05_L01_DAMIAN"
msgid "Good job! Pandora would be proud of this boring assignment."
msgstr "Dobrá práce! Na tenhle nudný úkol by Pandora byla pyšná."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03_VO05_L02_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 Dialogue05 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE03_VO05_L02_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"Now I'll try to think of another \"safe assignment that won't kill anyone.\""
msgstr "Teď zkusím vymyslet další „bezpečné zadání, při kterém nikdo neumře“."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OPTIONAL01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission02 objective 03
#. optional 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION02_OPTIONAL01"
msgid ""
"Harvest an Ostrich. Fatally shoot it from "
"{maxShotDistance}|displayAs(distance) or closer."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte pštrosa smrtelným zásahem ze vzdálenosti nejvýše "
"{maxShotDistance}|displayAs(distance)."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 description 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"At first, Pandora seemed like... a sweet coordinator. Now Damian is scared "
"of her (and so are you, a little bit). She suggested an assignment to Damian"
" and he refused because he apparently loves Hippos too much (or just never "
"killed an animal, as you found out once he revealed his secret). Pandora "
"wasn't happy about it AT ALL, and now you are left with a scared Damian and "
"a new assignment, which includes Hippos."
msgstr ""
"Pandora zprvu působila jako milá koordinátorka. Teď se jí Damian bojí a vy "
"trochu také. Navrhla mu úkol s lovem hrochů, ale odmítl. Buď proto, že má "
"hrochy rád, nebo proto, že dosud nikdy žádné zvíře nezabil, jak vám právě "
"přiznal. Pandora z toho neměla vůbec radost. Čeká vás tedy nový úkol a "
"vyděšený Damian."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 description 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"The assignment involving Hippos turned out to be a good idea after all. "
"Damian begrudgingly agreed, since the final task was meant to be both "
"exciting and challenging. You're about to talk to him to finish the "
"curriculum for Hearth & Hunt advanced bow shooting students."
msgstr ""
"Úkol s hrochy se nakonec ukázal jako dobrý nápad. Damian neochotně "
"souhlasil: závěrečné zadání má být napínavé i náročné. Promluvte si s ním a "
"dokončete osnovy pokročilého kurzu lukostřelby pro Hearth & Hunt."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_NAME"
msgid "Empirical learning"
msgstr "Učení praxí"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_DAMIAN"
msgid "Back for another boring assignment?"
msgstr "Zase jsi tu kvůli dalšímu nudnému úkolu?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Don't be so pissy."
msgstr "Nebuď hned tak protivný."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_PLAYER_A"
msgid ""
"I'm sure you can come up with something that doesn't include \"catching an "
"arrow midflight.\""
msgstr "Určitě vymyslíš něco, při čem nemusíme chytat šíp za letu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER_B"
msgid "They're not boring, they're actually quite insightful."
msgstr "Nejsou nudné. Vlastně jsou docela poučné."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_DAMIAN_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_DAMIAN_B"
msgid "Yeah? Well, not for me."
msgstr "Jo? Pro mě tedy ne."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PLAYER_C"
msgid "Don't make them boring. Just make them safe."
msgstr "Nemusí být nudné. Jen bezpečné."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_DAMIAN_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_DAMIAN_C"
msgid "Safe is boring."
msgstr "Bezpečí je nuda."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_DAMIAN"
msgid "Right now I'm thinking up something exciting for the final assignment."
msgstr "Právě vymýšlím něco pořádného na závěrečné zadání."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"But it's tricky if it has to involve hunting animals. Because you don't "
"really want to hurt them..."
msgstr "Jenže má jít o lov zvěře. A člověk jí přece nechce ubližovat..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PLAYER"
msgid "Well, we are called Hearth & Hunt."
msgstr "No, jmenujeme se Hearth & Hunt."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_DAMIAN"
msgid "I have to tell you a secret."
msgstr "Musím ti říct tajemství."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_DAMIAN"
msgid "But promise me you won't tell Pandora."
msgstr "Ale slib mi, že to neřekneš Pandoře."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_PLAYER_A"
msgid "A spicy secret? Do tell."
msgstr "Pikantní tajemství? Povídej."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_DAMIAN_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_DAMIAN_A"
msgid "You didn't promise, but alright."
msgstr "Nic jsi neslíbil, ale dobře."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Pinky promise."
msgstr "Na malíček."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_PLAYER_C"
msgid "If you aren't breaking any laws, I won't tell anyone."
msgstr "Pokud neporušuješ zákon, nikomu to neřeknu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_DAMIAN_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_DAMIAN_C"
msgid "Well, it isn't a law! So I should be safe... Hopefully."
msgstr "Zákon neporušuju! Tak snad budu v bezpečí..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_DAMIAN"
msgid "(sighs) Here it comes."
msgstr "(povzdechne si) Tak jo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_DAMIAN"
msgid "I've never actually hunted."
msgstr "Ve skutečnosti jsem nikdy nelovil."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_PLAYER_A"
msgid "You're kidding, right?"
msgstr "To si děláš srandu, ne?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_DAMIAN_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 21"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_DAMIAN_A"
msgid "No, I'm not."
msgstr "Ne, nedělám si srandu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 22"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_PLAYER_B"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Jak to myslíš?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 23"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_PLAYER_C"
msgid "Elaborate, please."
msgstr "Vysvětli mi to."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 24"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"I've never killed an animal! Never butchered one! None of my arrows have "
"ever been near an animal!"
msgstr ""
"Nikdy jsem žádné zvíře nezabil ani nezpracoval úlovek! Žádný můj šíp se "
"nikdy ke zvířeti ani nepřiblížil!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 25"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_PLAYER_A"
msgid "*starting to dial Pandora on the phone*"
msgstr "*začne na telefonu vytáčet Pandoru*"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_DAMIAN_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 26"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_DAMIAN_A"
msgid "Hey! Stop that! One betrayal wasn't enough for you?"
msgstr "Hej! Nech toho! Jednou jsi mě už napráskal!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 27"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Not even... An ant?"
msgstr "Ani... mravence?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_DAMIAN_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 28"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_DAMIAN_B"
msgid "No, I've never shot any ants with my bow and arrows."
msgstr "Ne, nikdy jsem z luku nestřílel na mravence."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 29"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_PLAYER_C"
msgid "Then why did you take this job?"
msgstr "Tak proč jsi tu práci přijal?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_DAMIAN_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 30"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_DAMIAN_C"
msgid "Because I'm dumb? I don't know!"
msgstr "Protože jsem blbec? Já nevím!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 31"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"I thought I'd just come out here and pester that Malachi guy until he took "
"me on a few hunts."
msgstr ""
"Myslel jsem, že budu otravovat Malachiho, dokud mě nevezme na pár lovů."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 32"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_DAMIAN"
msgid "But I just... can't kill animals?"
msgstr "Jenže já prostě... nedokážu zvíře zabít."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 33"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_PANDORA"
msgid "*phone ringing*"
msgstr "*zazvoní telefon*"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 34"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_DAMIAN"
msgid "Oh god, she knows! Quickly, let's leave the country!"
msgstr "Proboha, ona to ví! Rychle, utečeme ze země!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 35"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_PLAYER"
msgid "*accept the call*"
msgstr "*přijme hovor*"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "whipser-screams at the player, panicking"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 36"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_DAMIAN"
msgid "What are you doing?!"
msgstr "Co to děláš?!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 37"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_PANDORA"
msgid "Hi there, rep, do you have anything urgent going on right now?"
msgstr "Ahoj, máš teď něco naléhavého?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 38"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Just trading some top-secret secrets with Damian, what's up?"
msgstr "Jen si s Damianem vyměňujeme přísně tajné informace. Copak se děje?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_DAMIAN_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 39"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_DAMIAN_A"
msgid "Stop it!"
msgstr "Přestaň!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L40_PANDORA_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 40"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L40_PANDORA_A"
msgid "I'd rather not know."
msgstr "Radši to nechci vědět."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L41_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 41"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L41_PLAYER_B"
msgid "We can help with Damian!"
msgstr "S Damianem ti můžeme pomoct!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L42_PANDORA_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 42"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L42_PANDORA_B"
msgid ""
"You're with him? That's great, he mentioned he wanted to hunt hippos in "
"Kilimaya Reserve."
msgstr "Jsi s ním? Skvělé. Říkal, že chce v rezervaci Kilimaya lovit hrochy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L43_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 43"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L43_PLAYER_C"
msgid "Dealing with Damian. Meaning I'm free to help."
msgstr "Zrovna řeším něco s Damianem, ale můžu pomoct."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L44_PANDORA_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 44"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L44_PANDORA_C"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry you have to deal with him... At least someone else gets to find "
"out how tough my job can be."
msgstr ""
"To mě mrzí, že ho musíš snášet. Aspoň někdo jiný pozná, jak těžkou mám "
"práci."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L45_DAMIAN_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 45"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L45_DAMIAN_C"
msgid "Hey! I heard that!"
msgstr "Hej! To jsem slyšel!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L46_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 46"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L46_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"So, you two are putting together a curriculum for bow shooting, and I've "
"just received some requirements from mum."
msgstr ""
"Takže vy dva dáváte dohromady osnovy pro střelbu z luku a já jsem právě "
"dostala nějaké požadavky od mámy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L47_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 47"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L47_PANDORA"
msgid "She wants to include some assignments involving harvesting hippo."
msgstr "Chce do něj zařadit úkoly s lovem hrochů."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L48_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 48"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L48_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"Since Damian set a higher price for the advanced course than Hearth & Hunt "
"normally would, she wants to make sure it's worth the students' money, so "
"she's secured permits for hippo harvests."
msgstr ""
"Damian si za pokročilý kurz řekl víc, než je u Hearth & Hunt obvyklé. Máma "
"chce, aby studenti za své peníze dostali odpovídající zážitek, a tak "
"zajistila povolení k lovu hrochů."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L49_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 49"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L49_DAMIAN"
msgid "No."
msgstr "Ne."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L50_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 50"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L50_PANDORA"
msgid "What do you mean, \"no\"?"
msgstr "Co tím myslíš, \"ne\"?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L51_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 51"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L51_DAMIAN"
msgid "I mean what I said. No. I don't want to involve hippos."
msgstr "Myslím vážně to, co jsem řekl. Ne. Nechci do toho zatahovat hrochy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L52_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 52"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L52_DAMIAN"
msgid "I'm a big fan of Moo Deng."
msgstr "Jsem velký fanoušek Moo Deng."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L53_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 53"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L53_PANDORA"
msgid "Moo Deng?"
msgstr "Moo Deng?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L54_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 54"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L54_DAMIAN"
msgid "You don't know her? The famous pygmy hippo from Thailand?"
msgstr "Ty ji neznáš? Tu slavnou samičku hrošíka liberijského z Thajska?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L55_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 55"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L55_PANDORA"
msgid "I don't care. Moo Deng isn't your employer. Hearth & Hunt is."
msgstr "Je mi to jedno. Moo Deng tě nezaměstnává. Hearth & Hunt ano."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L56_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 56"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L56_DAMIAN"
msgid "Yeah, but you hired me for my insight, experience and values, right?"
msgstr ""
"Jo, ale najala sis mě kvůli mým znalostem, zkušenostem a hodnotám, že?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L57_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 57"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L57_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"Here you go again, you struggle for months to come up with a curriculum, and"
" when you finally get help, you can't accept it because it wasn't your idea."
msgstr ""
"Zase to samé. Měsíce se trápíš s osnovami, a když konečně dostaneš pomoc, "
"nedokážeš ji přijmout, protože to nebyl tvůj nápad."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L58_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 58"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L58_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"That's... not true. Let's get the rep to decide, as an objective third "
"party."
msgstr ""
"To není... není pravda. Nechme rozhodnout zástupce jako objektivní třetí "
"stranu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L59_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 59"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L59_PLAYER_A"
msgid "You have some issues with your ego. And by some, I mean A LOT."
msgstr "Máš pár problémů se svým egem. A tím „pár“ myslím HODNĚ."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L60_DAMIAN_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 60"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L60_DAMIAN_A"
msgid "What sort of issues?"
msgstr "Jaké problémy?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L61_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 61"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L61_PLAYER_A"
msgid ""
"Like... accepting a job you aren't qualified for, because of your... secret."
msgstr ""
"Třeba... přijal jsi práci, na kterou nemáš potřebné předpoklady kvůli "
"svému... tajemství."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L62_DAMIAN_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "nervous, tries to change the topic"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 62"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L62_DAMIAN_A"
msgid "Hey, hey! Ha... Let's all keep calm, now..."
msgstr "Hej, hej! Ha... Zachovejme teď všichni klid..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L63_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 63"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L63_PLAYER_B"
msgid "I mean... Have you seen Moo Deng? Those blushing cheeks?"
msgstr "Chci říct... Viděla jsi Moo Deng? Ty růžové tvářičky?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L64_DAMIAN_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 64"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L64_DAMIAN_B"
msgid "Exactly! Rep gets me."
msgstr "Přesně! Konečně někdo, kdo mě chápe."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L65_PANDORA_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 65"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L65_PANDORA_B"
msgid "Okay then. You're both fired."
msgstr "Tak dobře. Oba máte padáka."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L66_DAMIAN_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 66"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L66_DAMIAN_B"
msgid "WHAT?"
msgstr "CO?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L67_PANDORA_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 67"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L67_PANDORA_B"
msgid ""
"And since you haven't fulfilled your part of the contract, you won't be "
"getting paid."
msgstr "A protože jsi nesplnil svou část smlouvy, nedostaneš zaplaceno."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L68_DAMIAN_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 68"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L68_DAMIAN_B"
msgid "Hey, hey, let's not escalate the situation!"
msgstr "Hej, hej, nehroťme to!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L69_PANDORA_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 69"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L69_PANDORA_B"
msgid ""
"I have to escalate it. I've been tiptoeing around you and your "
"\"creativity\" for months."
msgstr ""
"Musím přitvrdit. Už měsíce s tebou a tvou „kreativitou“ jednám v "
"rukavičkách."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L70_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 70"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L70_PLAYER_C"
msgid "I'm not an objective party since I'm also on Hearth & Hunt's payroll."
msgstr "Nejsem nestranný. I mně platí Hearth & Hunt."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L71_PANDORA_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 71"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L71_PANDORA_C"
msgid "At least someone understands what it means to be employed."
msgstr "Alespoň někdo chápe, co to znamená být zaměstnán."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L72_DAMIAN_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 72"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L72_DAMIAN_C"
msgid "Does being employed mean I have to forsake my values?"
msgstr "Mám se kvůli práci vzdát svých hodnot?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L73_PANDORA_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during VO"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 73"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L73_PANDORA_C"
msgid "Ugh, stop being so dramatic, Damian."
msgstr "Damiane, přestaň dramatizovat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L74_PANDORA_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 74"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L74_PANDORA_C"
msgid ""
"You were hired by a hunting company, to teach a bow course by shooting "
"animals."
msgstr "Najala tě lovecká společnost, abys učil lukostřelbu při lovu zvěře."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L75_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 75"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L75_PANDORA"
msgid "I'm done with your theatrics."
msgstr "Už mám tvého divadla dost."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L76_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 76"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L76_PANDORA"
msgid "You either do your job, or we can say our goodbyes. It's not so hard."
msgstr "Buď uděláš svou práci, nebo se můžeme rozloučit. Není to tak těžké."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L77_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 77"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L77_PANDORA"
msgid "*phone hangs up*"
msgstr "*hovor skončí*"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L78_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 78"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L78_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"Um... Better find those hippos and think of some kind of assignment, right?"
msgstr "Ehm... Bude lepší najít ty hrochy a vymyslet nějaký úkol, ne?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Enter the area near Hippopotamus territories."
msgstr "Vstupte do oblasti poblíž teritorií hrochů."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L01_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L01_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"Having to harvest a hippo for the last assignment with a bow makes it pretty"
" obvious what it should be."
msgstr ""
"Když máš v závěrečném úkolu ulovit hrocha lukem, je celkem jasné, jak na to."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L02_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L02_DAMIAN"
msgid "There's only one acceptable way to do this with a bow."
msgstr "S lukem připadá v úvahu jediný přijatelný postup."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L03_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L03_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"It'll have to be a side-on heart-lung shot, and it'll have to be close."
msgstr ""
"Musíš být blízko a zasáhnout ho z boku na komoru, tedy srdce nebo plíce."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L04_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L04_DAMIAN"
msgid "Which will put you at risk... Because these hippos aren't Moo Deng."
msgstr "Budeš tím riskovat. Tihle hroši totiž nejsou Moo Deng."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L05_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L05_DAMIAN"
msgid "Damn, that's actually pretty good for the last assignment."
msgstr "Sakra, to je na závěrečný úkol vlastně docela dobré."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 objective 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid ""
"Harvest a Hippo. Shoot it to the heart or lungs from "
"{maxShotDistance}|displayAs(distance) or closer. Use a single arrow."
msgstr ""
"Ulovte a zpracujte hrocha jediným šípem. Ze vzdálenosti nejvýše "
"{maxShotDistance}|displayAs(distance) ho zasáhněte na srdce nebo plíce."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L01_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L01_DAMIAN"
msgid "The assignments are done!"
msgstr "Zadání jsou hotová!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L02_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L02_DAMIAN"
msgid "You know what, Pandora's right."
msgstr "Víš co, Pandora má pravdu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L03_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L03_DAMIAN"
msgid "She knows me too well."
msgstr "Zná mě až moc dobře."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L04_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L04_DAMIAN"
msgid "Hippos are formidable opponents."
msgstr "Hroch je pořádně nebezpečná zvěř."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L05_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L05_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"They're one of the most aggressive herbivores, accounting for more human "
"deaths each year than lions or crocodiles combined."
msgstr ""
"Patří k nejagresivnějším býložravcům. Každý rok mají na svědomí víc lidských"
" životů než lvi a krokodýli dohromady."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L06_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L06_PLAYER_A"
msgid "What is this, an ego death?"
msgstr "Co se děje? Už ti splasklo ego?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L07_DAMIAN_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L07_DAMIAN_A"
msgid "No, don't worry. That would take more than Pandora. But..."
msgstr "Neboj, na to by ani Pandora nestačila. Ale..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L08_DAMIAN_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L08_DAMIAN_A"
msgid "She can get close."
msgstr "Dokáže se tomu přiblížit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L09_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L09_PLAYER_B"
msgid "You sound like a teacher again!"
msgstr "Už zase mluvíš jako učitel!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L10_DAMIAN_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L10_DAMIAN_B"
msgid "You see, you've managed to turn me into teacher material."
msgstr "Vidíš? Nakonec jsi ze mě učitele přece jen udělal."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L11_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L11_PLAYER_C"
msgid "A single bite from a hippo can crush a lion like it was nothing."
msgstr "Hroší čelisti dokážou lva rozdrtit jediným stiskem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L12_DAMIAN_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L12_DAMIAN_C"
msgid "I see you've been studying."
msgstr "Vidím, že jsi studoval."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L13_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L13_DAMIAN"
msgid "Do you know what the archer's paradox is?"
msgstr "Znáš lukostřelecký paradox?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L14_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L14_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"It's the phenomenon of an arrow traveling in the direction it was pointed in"
" at full draw."
msgstr ""
"Šíp letí směrem, kterým mířil při plném nátahu, i když leží vedle luku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L15_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L15_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"It seems that the arrow would have to pass through the starting position it "
"was in before being drawn, when it was aimed towards the side of the target."
msgstr ""
"Na první pohled by musel při vypuštění narazit do luku nebo letět mimo cíl."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L16_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L16_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"It looks like it should miss, but the bending of the arrow means it corrects"
" itself when released."
msgstr ""
"Jenže dřík se po vypuštění ohne, obejde luk a pokračuje směrem k cíli."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L17_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L17_PLAYER"
msgid "And you're telling me this because...?"
msgstr "A ty mi to říkáš, protože...?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L18_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L18_DAMIAN"
msgid ""
"I'm like the archer's paradox, people think my way won't work... until it "
"does."
msgstr ""
"Já jsem jako ten lukostřelecký paradox. Všichni si myslí, že moje postupy "
"nemůžou fungovat... dokud nezafungují."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L19_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L19_PLAYER_A"
msgid "It wasn't exactly your way."
msgstr "Zrovna podle tvých představ to ale nebylo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L20_DAMIAN_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L20_DAMIAN_A"
msgid "Hey, it's still my course!"
msgstr "Hej, pořád je to můj kurz!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L21_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 21"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L21_PLAYER_B"
msgid "You do you, boo."
msgstr "Tak si to dělej po svém, kámo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L22_DAMIAN_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 22"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L22_DAMIAN_B"
msgid "It's a great metaphor. Don't ruin it."
msgstr "Je to skvělá metafora. Nekaž mi ji."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L23_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 23"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L23_PLAYER_C"
msgid "That's it. I'm calling Pandora."
msgstr "Dost. Volám Pandoře."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L24_DAMIAN_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 24"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L24_DAMIAN_C"
msgid ""
"Whatever! Call her! I'm not afraid of her... Well, maybe just a little."
msgstr "Klidně! Zavolej jí! Vůbec se jí nebojím... Tedy skoro."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L25_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 25"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L25_DAMIAN"
msgid "Anyway, thanks for helping me finish it."
msgstr "Každopádně díky, že jsi mi pomohl osnovy dokončit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L26_DAMIAN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 26"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L26_DAMIAN"
msgid "I do sometimes need a little push."
msgstr "Občas potřebuju trochu popostrčit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory02 Mission03 objective 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY02_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE03"
msgid "Talk to Damian."
msgstr "Promluvte si s Damianem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 description 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"You were chased away by a knife-wielding Naomi, but Pandora insists you try "
"to talk to her again. She was once part of Hearth & Hunt, but she left and "
"nobody knows why. You are now tasked with no mean feat—to try and get her "
"back."
msgstr ""
"Naomi vás vyhnala s nožem v ruce, ale Pandora trvá na tom, abyste s ní "
"zkusili znovu promluvit. Kdysi patřila k Hearth & Hunt, pak odešla a nikdo "
"neví proč. Čeká vás nelehký úkol: přimět ji k návratu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 description 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Naomi has given you a chance, she'll speak to you under one condition. You "
"need to accept the challenging task of harvesting a Cape buffalo."
msgstr ""
"Naomi vám dala šanci. Promluví s vámi, pokud přijmete náročný úkol: ulovit "
"buvola kaferského."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_NAME"
msgid "Knives out"
msgstr "Na nože"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_NAOMI"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "Kdo jsi?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_PLAYER"
msgid "Hi there! I'm {playerCharacterName} from Hearth & Hunt..."
msgstr "Ahoj! Jsem {playerCharacterName} z Hearth & Hunt..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_NAOMI"
msgid "Stop right there. Leave."
msgstr "Ani slovo. Odejdi."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER"
msgid "I don't think I can? I was assigned to..."
msgstr "Obávám se, že nemůžu. Poslali mě, abych..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_NAOMI"
msgid "I. Said. Leave."
msgstr "Řekla jsem: odejdi."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PLAYER_A"
msgid ""
"Can I take a picture of you with the knife, so I can send it to my boss as "
"evidence?"
msgstr "Můžu si tě vyfotit s tím nožem, abych poslal šéfce důkaz?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_NAOMI_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_NAOMI_A"
msgid "Try to take a picture of me, and it will be the last thing you do."
msgstr "Zkus to a bude to poslední věc, kterou uděláš."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "changed during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER_B"
msgid ""
"Hey, maybe we can start again? Hello! My name is {playerCharacterName}. "
"What's your name?"
msgstr ""
"Hele, co kdybychom začali znovu? Ahoj! Jmenuju se {playerCharacterName}. A "
"ty?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_NAOMI_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_NAOMI_B"
msgid "That's it, I'm going to kick you out."
msgstr "Tak dost. Vyhodím tě odsud."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PLAYER_C"
msgid "Okay, I'll just go."
msgstr "Dobře, už jdu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue01 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_PLAYER"
msgid "I'm leaving! I'm leaving!!"
msgstr "Už jdu! Už jdu!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L01_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Pandora calls with player after Naomi refused
#. to talk to the player. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L01_PANDORA"
msgid "She kicked you out?"
msgstr "Vyhodila tě?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L02_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L02_PANDORA"
msgid "Yeah, you aren't the first one."
msgstr "Jo, nejsi první."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L03_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L03_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"Maybe you could try again tomorrow? We really need her back at Hearth & "
"Hunt."
msgstr ""
"Možná bys to mohl zkusit znovu zítra? Opravdu ji potřebujeme zpátky v Hearth"
" & Hunt."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L04_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L04_PANDORA"
msgid "What do you mean, she'll kill you? No, don't worry."
msgstr "Cože, prý tě zabije? Neboj se."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L05_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L05_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"She's a good friend of mine, or I hope she still is, anyway. I'll try "
"talking to her."
msgstr ""
"Je to moje dobrá kamarádka, nebo doufám, že pořád je. Zkusím si s ní "
"promluvit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L06_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L06_PANDORA"
msgid "Even though she's been ignoring my calls since the accident..."
msgstr "I když od té nehody ignoruje moje hovory..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L07_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L07_PANDORA"
msgid "What accident? You don't need to know about that."
msgstr "Jaká nehoda? O tom nemusíš nic vědět."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L08_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue02 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE00_VO02_L08_PANDORA"
msgid "She doesn't like talking about it, and it's not up to me to share."
msgstr "Nerada o tom mluví. A mně nepřísluší ti to vyprávět."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Talk to Pandora about how to proceed."
msgstr "Promluvte si s Pandorou o tom, jak postupovat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 objective 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid "Wait for a day and then talk to Naomi again."
msgstr "Počkejte den a pak si znovu promluvte s Naomi."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L01_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Player visits Naomi for the second time. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue03 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L01_NAOMI"
msgid "You again? Are you plain stupid?"
msgstr "Zase ty? To jsi vážně tak hloupý?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L02_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue03 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L02_PLAYER"
msgid "Listen, I've told people I was coming here, so you can't kill me!"
msgstr "Poslouchej, řekl jsem ostatním, že sem jdu. Nemůžeš mě zabít!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L03_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue03 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L03_NAOMI"
msgid "I don't kill people."
msgstr "Nezabíjím lidi."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L04_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue03 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L04_NAOMI"
msgid "But that doesn't mean that the thought hasn't crossed my mind."
msgstr "Ale to neznamená, že mě ta myšlenka nenapadla."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L05_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue03 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L05_NAOMI"
msgid "Pandora Hearth called me, telling me to give you a chance."
msgstr "Volala mi Pandora Hearth. Chce, abych ti dala šanci."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L06_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue03 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L06_NAOMI"
msgid "To give Hearth & Hunt a chance. Again."
msgstr "Dát Hearth & Hunt šanci. Znovu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L07_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue03 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L07_NAOMI"
msgid "But here's the thing: I don't want to."
msgstr "Ale jde o to: nechci."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L08_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue03 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L08_NAOMI"
msgid "Oh well, I suppose I owe it to Pandora."
msgstr "No, asi to dlužím Pandoře."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L09_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue03 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L09_NAOMI"
msgid "Literally."
msgstr "Doslova."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L10_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue03 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L10_NAOMI"
msgid "Let's make a bet. You in?"
msgstr "Tak se vsadíme. Jdeš do toho?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L11_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue03 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L11_PLAYER"
msgid "I'm in."
msgstr "Jdu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L12_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue03 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L12_NAOMI"
msgid ""
"If you can take down a Cape buffalo with a single arrow, I'll talk to you."
msgstr "Když jediným šípem skolíš buvola kaferského, promluvím si s tebou."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L13_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue03 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L13_NAOMI"
msgid "But if you can't... Don't ever try talking to me again."
msgstr "A když ne, už za mnou nikdy nechoď."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L14_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue03 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L14_PLAYER"
msgid "Deal. And can I just ask you..."
msgstr "Platí. A můžu se ještě zeptat..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L15_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue03 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L15_NAOMI"
msgid "No. Buffalo first."
msgstr "Ne. Nejdřív buvol."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L16_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue03 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE02_VO03_L16_NAOMI"
msgid "Go."
msgstr "Jdi."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 objective 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03"
msgid "Talk to Naomi again."
msgstr "Promluvte si znovu s Naomi."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L01_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Pandora calls to player after they manage to
#. get first task from Naomi. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue04 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L01_PANDORA"
msgid "Well, it's... progress!"
msgstr "No, to je... pokrok!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L02_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue04 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L02_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"I'll have to come and approach her in person, it's too easy for her to avoid"
" my calls, or hang up before I'm done."
msgstr ""
"Budu za ní muset zajít osobně. Moje hovory snadno ignoruje nebo mi položí "
"telefon dřív, než domluvím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L03_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue04 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L03_PANDORA"
msgid "She used to love telling hunting stories."
msgstr "Ráda vyprávěla lovecké příběhy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L04_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue04 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L04_PANDORA"
msgid "She always had a cold side too, but it was never this bad."
msgstr "Vždycky uměla být chladná, ale nikdy to nebylo tak zlé."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L05_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue04 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L05_PANDORA"
msgid "She's probably hunted on every continent in the world!"
msgstr "Snad lovila na všech kontinentech!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L06_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue04 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L06_PANDORA"
msgid "If she could hunt on Mars, she probably would."
msgstr "Kdyby mohla lovit na Marsu, pravděpodobně by to udělala."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L07_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue04 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L07_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"If you do get her to open up, you should definitely ask her to share some of"
" her stories."
msgstr ""
"Jestli se ti ji podaří rozmluvit, určitě se jí zeptej na nějaký lovecký "
"příběh."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L08_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 Dialogue04 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE03_VO04_L08_PANDORA"
msgid "I'll make sure to visit her in the meantime."
msgstr "Určitě ji mezitím navštívím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission01 objective 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE04"
msgid "Harvest a male Cape buffalo shot with only one arrow."
msgstr "Ulovte samce buvola kaferského jediným šípem a zpracujte úlovek."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Are you dreaming? Naomi seems to now trust you enough to ask for help. Let's"
" grab the bull by the horns! She needs help with an extremely vicious "
"Crocodile that has already claimed several victims. How can you identify it?"
" It's carrying a Crocs shoe in its mouth."
msgstr ""
"Zdá se vám to? Naomi vám zřejmě důvěřuje natolik, že vás požádala o pomoc. "
"Pusťte se do toho! Potřebuje se vypořádat s nebezpečným krokodýlem, který už"
" má na svědomí několik obětí. Poznáte ho podle boty Crocs, kterou nosí v "
"tlamě."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_NAME"
msgid "Crocodile tears"
msgstr "Krokodýlí slzy"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_PLAYER"
msgid "Did you think you'd get rid of me that easily?"
msgstr "Myslela sis, že se mě tak snadno zbavíš?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_NAOMI"
msgid ""
"I wanted to scare you away, but it looks like I'm not the only person who "
"can pull that off..."
msgstr ""
"Chtěla jsem tě odehnat, ale zdá se, že nejsem jediná, kdo to dokáže..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_NAOMI"
msgid "How was it?"
msgstr "Jaké to bylo?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Hard as hell, I never want to see a buffalo again."
msgstr "Pekelně těžké. Už nechci žádného buvola ani vidět."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_NAOMI_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_NAOMI_A"
msgid "Then we aren't going to get very far."
msgstr "Pak se moc daleko nedostaneme."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Surprisingly, I enjoyed the challenge."
msgstr "Výzva mě kupodivu bavila."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_NAOMI_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_NAOMI_B"
msgid "That's how it should be."
msgstr "Tak to má být."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_PLAYER_C"
msgid "A job like any other."
msgstr "Práce jako každá jiná."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_NAOMI_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_NAOMI_C"
msgid "And here I was thinking you'd find it a challenge."
msgstr "A já čekala, že ti to dá zabrat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_PLAYER"
msgid "You seem a little more... gentle today."
msgstr "Dneska jsi nějaká... mírnější."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_NAOMI"
msgid "What, because I don't have a knife in my hand?"
msgstr "Cože, protože nemám v ruce nůž?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_NAOMI"
msgid "*touches scarred part of her face* Some days are just... better."
msgstr "*dotkne se zjizvené části tváře* Některé dny jsou prostě... lepší."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_NAOMI"
msgid "Oh, and Pandora visited me a few hours before you."
msgstr "A pár hodin před tebou mě navštívila Pandora."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_NAOMI"
msgid "She always has that effect on me."
msgstr "Vždycky na mě tak působí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_NAOMI"
msgid "I trust the world a little more in her presence."
msgstr "V její přítomnosti věřím světu o něco víc."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_NAOMI"
msgid ""
"But this effect won't last forever, so you better use it to your advantage "
"right now."
msgstr "Ale nebude to trvat věčně, tak toho radši využij."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "Can I ask what happened to your face?"
msgstr "Můžu se zeptat, co se ti stalo s obličejem?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_NAOMI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_NAOMI_OP01"
msgid "No you can't. But you already did."
msgstr "Ne, nemůžeš. Ale už jsi to udělal."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_NAOMI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_NAOMI_OP01"
msgid "You think you can do one little thing and we're already best friends?"
msgstr "Myslíš, že uděláš jednu maličkost a hned jsme nejlepší přátelé?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_NAOMI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "very cold"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_NAOMI_OP01"
msgid "Know your place."
msgstr "Drž si odstup."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_PLAYER_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 21"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_PLAYER_OP02"
msgid "How do you know Pandora Hearth?"
msgstr "Jak ses s Pandorou Hearth seznámila?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_NAOMI_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 22"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_NAOMI_OP02"
msgid ""
"We were childhood friends. Her mother and my father have known each other "
"since back when the company was just called Hearth."
msgstr ""
"Kamarádily jsme se už jako děti. Její matka a můj otec se znají od dob, kdy "
"se firma ještě jmenovala Hearth."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_NAOMI_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 23"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_NAOMI_OP02"
msgid ""
"People often underestimate her because of her albinism. She looks really "
"frail."
msgstr ""
"Lidé ji často podceňují kvůli jejímu albinismu. Vypadá opravdu křehce."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_NAOMI_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 24"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_NAOMI_OP02"
msgid "But I never treated her as a fragile thing, so we became friends."
msgstr ""
"Nikdy jsem s ní ale nejednala v rukavičkách, a tak jsme se spřátelily."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_NAOMI_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 25"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_NAOMI_OP02"
msgid ""
"She changed a lot after her mother married Jonathan Hunt and their family "
"grew."
msgstr ""
"Hodně se změnila poté, co se její matka provdala za Jonathana Hunta a jejich"
" rodina se rozrostla."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_NAOMI_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 26"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_NAOMI_OP02"
msgid ""
"But that's not for me to tell. And you can probably look it up somewhere "
"pretty easily."
msgstr "Ale mně nepřísluší o tom vyprávět. Snadno si to můžeš zjistit sám."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_PLAYER_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 27"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_PLAYER_OP03"
msgid "Why did you leave Hearth & Hunt?"
msgstr "Proč jsi odešla z Hearth & Hunt?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_NAOMI_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 28"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_NAOMI_OP03"
msgid "I just... don't think I'm an asset anymore."
msgstr "Já jen... už si nemyslím, že jsem přínosem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_PLAYER_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 29"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_PLAYER_OP03"
msgid "Why not?"
msgstr "Proč ne?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_NAOMI_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 30"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_NAOMI_OP03"
msgid "I don't want to talk about it."
msgstr "Nechci o tom mluvit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_PLAYER_OP04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 31"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_PLAYER_OP04"
msgid "I've heard you traveled a lot and have the craziest hunting stories."
msgstr ""
"Slyšel jsem, že jsi hodně cestovala a máš neuvěřitelné lovecké historky."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_NAOMI_OP04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 32"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_NAOMI_OP04"
msgid "I sure do. I guess I could tell you one, as a reward for the buffalo."
msgstr "To mám. Za toho buvola si jednu zasloužíš."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_NAOMI_OP04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 33"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_NAOMI_OP04"
msgid ""
"What do you want to hear about? Almost being swallowed by one of Pablo "
"Escobar's hippos? Being stalked by a polar bear? Or spending a night in a "
"hole full of bones?"
msgstr ""
"Co chceš slyšet? Jak mě málem spolkl jeden z hrochů Pabla Escobara? Jak mě "
"pronásledoval lední medvěd? Nebo jak jsem strávila noc v jámě plné kostí?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_NAOMI_OP04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 34"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_NAOMI_OP04"
msgid "You can only choose one. I'm not gonna talk my throat off."
msgstr "Vyber si jednu. Mluvit do ochraptění nebudu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_PLAYER_OP04_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 35"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_PLAYER_OP04_OP01"
msgid "Swallowed by a hippo?!"
msgstr "Málem tě spolkl hroch?!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_NAOMI_OP04_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 36"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_NAOMI_OP04_OP01"
msgid "So, I assume you know who Pablo Escobar is."
msgstr "Předpokládám, že víš, kdo byl Pablo Escobar."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_NAOMI_OP04_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 37"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_NAOMI_OP04_OP01"
msgid ""
"After he was killed, most of the wild animals he kept as pets—zebras, "
"rhinos, giraffes, kangaroos—either died or went to zoos."
msgstr ""
"Když ho zabili, většina divokých zvířat, která choval — zebry, nosorožci, "
"žirafy i klokani — buď uhynula, nebo skončila v zoo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_NAOMI_OP04_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 38"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_NAOMI_OP04_OP01"
msgid "But not the hippos, they thrived."
msgstr "Ale ne hroši, těm se dařilo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_NAOMI_OP04_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 39"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_NAOMI_OP04_OP01"
msgid ""
"They started to pose a serious risk to everyone and everything around them."
msgstr "Začali vážně ohrožovat všechno a všechny kolem sebe."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L40_NAOMI_OP04_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 40"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L40_NAOMI_OP04_OP01"
msgid ""
"So my friend called me, to help her with the capture and transfer of some "
"hippos. The plan was to capture a few every year and sterilize them."
msgstr ""
"Kamarádka mě proto požádala o pomoc s odchytem a přesunem několika hrochů. "
"Každý rok jich chtěli pár odchytit a sterilizovat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L41_NAOMI_OP04_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 41"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L41_NAOMI_OP04_OP01"
msgid ""
"Have you ever thought about what anaesthetizing a hippopotamus might entail?"
" It's a risky job, and with their weight, it's hard to calculate the right "
"dose. And it's extremely expensive."
msgstr ""
"Napadlo tě někdy, co obnáší uspání hrocha? Je to nebezpečné a kvůli jeho "
"hmotnosti se těžko určuje správná dávka. Navíc to stojí spoustu peněz."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L42_NAOMI_OP04_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 42"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L42_NAOMI_OP04_OP01"
msgid "One time the hippo was knocked out, or so we thought."
msgstr "Jednou jsme si mysleli, že už je hroch uspaný."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L43_NAOMI_OP04_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 43"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L43_NAOMI_OP04_OP01"
msgid ""
"In hindsight, I realize I was reckless. Like a complete amateur. I "
"approached the hippo, there was no transition at all, no sense of "
"approaching danger."
msgstr ""
"Zpětně vím, že jsem se zachovala lehkomyslně. Jako úplný začátečník. "
"Přiblížila jsem se k němu, aniž bych postřehla jediné varování."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L44_NAOMI_OP04_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 44"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L44_NAOMI_OP04_OP01"
msgid "It was as if I had suddenly gone blind and deaf."
msgstr "Jako bych najednou oslepla a ohluchla."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L45_NAOMI_OP04_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 45"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L45_NAOMI_OP04_OP01"
msgid ""
"The top half of my body was trapped in a slimy hippo mouth. And the hippo's "
"breath almost made me lose consciousness. A terrible sulphureous smell, and "
"this huge pressure on my chest."
msgstr ""
"Horní polovina těla mi uvázla ve slizké hroší tlamě. Z jeho dechu se mi "
"dělalo na omdlení. Příšerný sirný zápach a obrovský tlak na hrudi."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L46_NAOMI_OP04_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 46"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L46_NAOMI_OP04_OP01"
msgid ""
"My arms were trapped, but I managed to free one hand and felt around. I "
"could feel my palm passing through the bristles of the hippo's snout."
msgstr ""
"Ruce jsem měla uvězněné, ale jednu se mi podařilo uvolnit. Nahmatala jsem "
"štětiny na hroším čenichu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L47_NAOMI_OP04_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 47"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L47_NAOMI_OP04_OP01"
msgid ""
"I could hear the screams of the people around me. It must have been a "
"horrific sight. I wriggled as hard as I could. When the hippo opened its "
"jaws for a few seconds, I managed to escape."
msgstr ""
"Slyšela jsem křik lidí kolem mě. Musel to být hrozný pohled. Svíjela jsem "
"se, jak jen to šlo. Když hroch na pár sekund otevřel čelisti, podařilo se mi"
" uniknout."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L48_NAOMI_OP04_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 48"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L48_NAOMI_OP04_OP01"
msgid ""
"I still have the scars. There were quite a few puncture wounds and bite "
"marks, but I was lucky the hippo was drugged, even though it wasn't drugged "
"enough."
msgstr ""
"Jizvy mám dodnes. Utržila jsem spoustu bodných ran a zůstaly mi stopy po "
"kousnutí, ale měla jsem štěstí, že byl hroch aspoň částečně utlumený."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L49_PLAYER_OP04_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 49"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L49_PLAYER_OP04_OP01"
msgid "Yes, right... real lucky."
msgstr "No jasně... Opravdové štěstí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L50_PLAYER_OP04_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 50"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L50_PLAYER_OP04_OP02"
msgid "Tell me about the stalking polar bear."
msgstr "Pověz mi o tom ledním medvědovi."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L51_NAOMI_OP04_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 51"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L51_NAOMI_OP04_OP02"
msgid ""
"Some people collect stamps, or countries they visit, and mark them on their "
"world maps..."
msgstr ""
"Někdo sbírá známky. Jiní si na mapě označují země, které navštívili..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L52_NAOMI_OP04_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 52"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L52_NAOMI_OP04_OP02"
msgid "I do that too, but for countries I hunt in. Or at least I used to."
msgstr ""
"Já si označuju země, v nichž jsem lovila. Tedy aspoň dřív jsem to dělala."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L53_NAOMI_OP04_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 53"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L53_NAOMI_OP04_OP02"
msgid ""
"I joined Hearth & Hunt on an Arctic hunting trip. We had permits to hunt "
"musk oxen."
msgstr ""
"Připojila jsem se k Hearth & Hunt na arktickém lovu. Měli jsme povolení k "
"lovu pižmoňů."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L54_NAOMI_OP04_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 54"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L54_NAOMI_OP04_OP02"
msgid "We soon found out that a polar bear had been following us."
msgstr "Brzy jsme zjistili, že nás pronásleduje lední medvěd."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L55_NAOMI_OP04_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 55"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L55_NAOMI_OP04_OP02"
msgid ""
"Some people from the group were excited, they were taking pictures. I tried "
"to warn them."
msgstr ""
"Někteří z výpravy byli nadšení a fotili ho. Snažila jsem se je varovat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L56_NAOMI_OP04_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 56"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L56_NAOMI_OP04_OP02"
msgid ""
"It's a wild and dangerous animal. It wasn't following us like a cute puppy."
msgstr ""
"Byla to divoká, nebezpečná šelma. Nenásledovala nás jako roztomilé štěně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L57_NAOMI_OP04_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 57"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L57_NAOMI_OP04_OP02"
msgid "It was hungry."
msgstr "Měla hlad."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L58_NAOMI_OP04_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 58"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L58_NAOMI_OP04_OP02"
msgid ""
"But we weren't allowed to shoot it, we only had the permits for oxen, and it"
" was ignoring the warning shots."
msgstr ""
"Nesměli jsme ho ale zastřelit. Měli jsme povolení jen k lovu pižmoňů a "
"varovné výstřely medvěd ignoroval."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L59_NAOMI_OP04_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 59"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L59_NAOMI_OP04_OP02"
msgid "Then it was too late."
msgstr "Pak už bylo pozdě."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L60_NAOMI_OP04_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 60"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L60_NAOMI_OP04_OP02"
msgid ""
"The polar bear swiped one of the guys like a ragdoll and bit off his head as"
" if it were an apple."
msgstr ""
"Lední medvěd odhodil jednoho z mužů jako hadrovou panenku a ukousl mu hlavu "
"jako jablko."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L61_NAOMI_OP04_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 61"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L61_NAOMI_OP04_OP02"
msgid "It took multiple headshots before it went down."
msgstr "Padl až po několika zásazích do hlavy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L62_NAOMI_OP04_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 62"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L62_NAOMI_OP04_OP02"
msgid ""
"I guess you never heard about that one. Hearth & Hunt probably swept it "
"under the rug."
msgstr ""
"O tom jsi asi nikdy neslyšel. Hearth & Hunt to nejspíš zametla pod koberec."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L63_PLAYER_OP04_OP02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 63"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L63_PLAYER_OP04_OP02"
msgid "Uh... Yeah, I hadn't heard about that."
msgstr "Ehm... Jo, o tom jsem neslyšel."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L64_PLAYER_OP04_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 64"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L64_PLAYER_OP04_OP03"
msgid "Why did you spend a night in a pile of bones?"
msgstr "Proč jsi strávila noc v jámě plné kostí?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L65_NAOMI_OP04_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 65"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L65_NAOMI_OP04_OP03"
msgid "You chose the most embarrassing one."
msgstr "Vybral jsi ten nejtrapnější."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L66_NAOMI_OP04_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 66"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L66_NAOMI_OP04_OP03"
msgid "But I promised a wild story, so here it is."
msgstr "Ale slíbila jsem divokou historku, tak tady je."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L67_NAOMI_OP04_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 67"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L67_NAOMI_OP04_OP03"
msgid "I was only 15 when this happened, but that's no excuse."
msgstr "Bylo mi pouhých 15, když se to stalo, ale to není omluva."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L68_NAOMI_OP04_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 68"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L68_NAOMI_OP04_OP03"
msgid ""
"I was hunting elk with my father. I was really excited, and I was determined"
" to bag the biggest elk there was, so I was really focused on stalking."
msgstr ""
"Lovila jsem s otcem wapiti. Byla jsem nadšená a chtěla jsem ulovit toho "
"největšího, takže jsem se soustředila jen na šoulačku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L69_NAOMI_OP04_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 69"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L69_NAOMI_OP04_OP03"
msgid "But I wasn't paying enough attention, and didn't look down."
msgstr "Nevěnovala jsem ale dost pozornosti okolí a nedívala se pod nohy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L70_NAOMI_OP04_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 70"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L70_NAOMI_OP04_OP03"
msgid "And I fell into a hole."
msgstr "A spadla jsem do díry."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L71_NAOMI_OP04_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 71"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L71_NAOMI_OP04_OP03"
msgid ""
"As I was trying to get up and climb out, I realized it was full of animal "
"bones."
msgstr ""
"Když jsem se pokoušela vstát a vylézt ven, všimla jsem si, že je jáma plná "
"zvířecích kostí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L72_NAOMI_OP04_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 72"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L72_NAOMI_OP04_OP03"
msgid ""
"At first, I didn't smell anything. The adrenaline had blocked my senses, and"
" I just wanted to get the hell out of there."
msgstr ""
"Zpočátku jsem nic necítila. Adrenalin otupil mé smysly a já se chtěla jen "
"dostat pryč."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L73_NAOMI_OP04_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 73"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L73_NAOMI_OP04_OP03"
msgid "But then I found out I couldn't climb out. I'd broken my leg."
msgstr "Ale pak jsem zjistila, že nemůžu vylézt. Zlomila jsem si nohu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L74_NAOMI_OP04_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 74"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L74_NAOMI_OP04_OP03"
msgid ""
"So I spent the night in a wolf den, in a hole they used for storing the "
"carcasses of their victims."
msgstr ""
"Noc jsem strávila ve vlčím doupěti, v jámě, kam si vlci odkládali zbytky "
"kořisti."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L75_NAOMI_OP04_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 75"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L75_NAOMI_OP04_OP03"
msgid ""
"I was screaming for help... While my father spent the whole night looking "
"for me. He likes to claim that night is the cause of his early baldness."
msgstr ""
"Volala jsem o pomoc, zatímco mě otec celou noc hledal. Dodnes tvrdí, že "
"kvůli té noci začal předčasně plešatět."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L76_NAOMI_OP04_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 76"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L76_NAOMI_OP04_OP03"
msgid "Safe to say, now I always look where I put my feet."
msgstr "Od té doby si vždycky dávám pozor, kam šlapu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L77_PLAYER_OP04_OP03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 77"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L77_PLAYER_OP04_OP03"
msgid "Now I'll look as well."
msgstr "Odteď si budu dávat pozor taky."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L78_PLAYER_OP05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 78"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L78_PLAYER_OP05"
msgid "What can I do to make you join us again?"
msgstr "Co mám udělat, aby ses k nám vrátila?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L79_NAOMI_OP05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 79"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L79_NAOMI_OP05"
msgid "Can you turn back time?"
msgstr "Dokážeš vrátit čas?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L80_PLAYER_OP05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 80"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L80_PLAYER_OP05"
msgid "I can try."
msgstr "Můžu to zkusit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L81_NAOMI_OP05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 81"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L81_NAOMI_OP05"
msgid "I'd like to see that."
msgstr "To bych ráda viděla."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L82_NAOMI_OP05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during VO"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 82"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L82_NAOMI_OP05"
msgid ""
"But seeing how you handled that cape buffalo, you might be able to help me "
"out."
msgstr "Ale jak jsi zvládl toho buvola, možná bys mi dokázal pomoct."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L83_NAOMI_OP05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 83"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L83_NAOMI_OP05"
msgid ""
"I've been tracking a dangerous crocodile, it's already attacked a couple of "
"tourists."
msgstr "Stopuju nebezpečného krokodýla. Už napadl pár turistů."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L84_NAOMI_OP05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 84"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L84_NAOMI_OP05"
msgid ""
"It's a vicious beast. Weirdly, it's been carrying off stuff it manages to "
"grab from its victims. It's the first time I've ever observed behavior like "
"that."
msgstr ""
"Je to nebezpečný kus. Kupodivu odnáší věci, které vyrve svým obětem. S "
"takovým chováním jsem se ještě nesetkala."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L85_NAOMI_OP05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 85"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L85_NAOMI_OP05"
msgid "And I can't take him down myself right now. I'm... too busy."
msgstr "Sama ho teď nemůžu ulovit. Mám... moc práce."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L86_PLAYER_OP05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 86"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L86_PLAYER_OP05"
msgid "Sharpening your knives?"
msgstr "Broušením nožů?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L87_NAOMI_OP05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 87"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L87_NAOMI_OP05"
msgid "Exactly."
msgstr "Přesně tak."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L88_NAOMI_OP05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 88"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L88_NAOMI_OP05"
msgid "I'll send you the location where it was last spotted."
msgstr "Pošlu ti místo, kde ho naposledy viděli."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L89_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 Dialogue01 line 89"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L89_PLAYER"
msgid "I need to stop letting my curiosity get the better of me."
msgstr "Neměl bych se pořád nechat ovládat zvědavostí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission02 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION02_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Find the vicious Crocodile and harvest it."
msgstr "Najděte nebezpečného krokodýla, ulovte ho a zpracujte úlovek."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Naomi shares a story about her \"spirit animal\", a half-blind Lion she was "
"supposed to cull. But she can't bring herself to do it, as it reminds her "
"too much of herself and her recent hunting accident."
msgstr ""
"Naomi vám vypráví o svém „duchovním zvířeti“, poloslepém lvu, kterého měla "
"ulovit. Nedokáže se k tomu ale odhodlat, protože jí příliš připomíná ji "
"samotnou a její nedávnou nehodu při lovu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_NAME"
msgid "Final roar"
msgstr "Závěrečný řev"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Naomi is now much friendlier than before"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L01_NAOMI"
msgid ""
"I've been feeling guilty since I asked you to bag that croc. I was worried "
"you'd become its next victim."
msgstr ""
"Od chvíle, kdy jsem tě poslala za tím krokodýlem, mám výčitky. Bála jsem se,"
" že budeš jeho další obětí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L02_NAOMI"
msgid ""
"I'm glad you're okay, and that the crocodile's grisly reign of terror has "
"finally come to an end."
msgstr ""
"Jsem ráda, že jsi v pořádku a že krokodýlí hrůzovláda konečně skončila."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L03_NAOMI"
msgid "But I should have taken care of it myself."
msgstr "Měla jsem se o něj postarat sama."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L04_PLAYER"
msgid "So why didn't you?"
msgstr "Tak proč jsi to neudělala?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L05_NAOMI"
msgid "I... haven't told this to anyone."
msgstr "Já... jsem o tom ještě nikomu neřekla."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L06_NAOMI"
msgid "It's probably Pandora's influence, but she told me I can rely on you."
msgstr ""
"Pravděpodobně je to vliv Pandory, ale řekla mi, že se na tebe můžu "
"spolehnout."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L07_NAOMI"
msgid ""
"And she may seem childlike, so she can come across as naive, but believe "
"me..."
msgstr "Možná působí dětinsky, až naivně, ale věř mi..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L08_NAOMI"
msgid "She's scarier than me sharpening my knives."
msgstr "Je děsivější než já, když si brousím nože."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L09_NAOMI"
msgid "Anyway, I trust her judgment."
msgstr "Každopádně věřím jejímu úsudku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L10_NAOMI"
msgid "And I'm just desperate to share this with someone."
msgstr "A strašně se potřebuju někomu svěřit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L11_NAOMI"
msgid "I'd like to get someone else's take."
msgstr "Chci slyšet názor někoho jiného."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L12_NAOMI"
msgid "I can't see out of my left eye."
msgstr "Nevidím na levé oko."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_PLAYER_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L13_PLAYER_OP01"
msgid "How did that happen?"
msgstr "Jak se to stalo?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_NAOMI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L14_NAOMI_OP01"
msgid "I overestimated my skills and underestimated nature."
msgstr "Přecenila jsem své schopnosti a podcenila přírodu."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_NAOMI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L15_NAOMI_OP01"
msgid "Basically, I was an idiot."
msgstr "Zkrátka jsem byla hloupá."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_NAOMI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L16_NAOMI_OP01"
msgid ""
"I was surrounded by a group of hyenas and I didn't want to kill them, so I "
"only fired a warning shot."
msgstr ""
"Obklíčila mě skupina hyen a nechtěla jsem je zabít, tak jsem vypálila jen "
"varovný výstřel."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_NAOMI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L17_NAOMI_OP01"
msgid "This had worked out for me a bunch of times before, but not this time."
msgstr "To se mi už mnohokrát osvědčilo, ale tentokrát ne."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_NAOMI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during VO"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L18_NAOMI_OP01"
msgid ""
"The pack leader of the hyenas didn't get scared. She just got much angrier."
msgstr "Vůdkyně hyen se nezalekla. Jen se ještě víc rozzuřila."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_NAOMI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L19_NAOMI_OP01"
msgid ""
"She jumped at me. Now, I wasn't scared. This wasn't anything new to me."
msgstr "Skočila po mně. Nebála jsem se. Nebylo to pro mě nic nového."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_NAOMI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L20_NAOMI_OP01"
msgid "I stayed calm and quickly fired again, still not aiming to kill."
msgstr ""
"Zachovala jsem klid a rychle znovu vystřelila. Pořád jsem ji nechtěla zabít."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_NAOMI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 21"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L21_NAOMI_OP01"
msgid "But her intention was to kill."
msgstr "Ale jejím záměrem bylo zabít."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_NAOMI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 22"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L22_NAOMI_OP01"
msgid "She lunged at my face, and that's when I finished her with a knife."
msgstr "Vrhla se mi po obličeji. Teprve potom jsem ji skolila nožem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_NAOMI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 23"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L23_NAOMI_OP01"
msgid ""
"I remember standing over her dead body. That was when I noticed the blood "
"dripping from my face."
msgstr ""
"Pamatuji si, jak jsem stála nad jejím mrtvým tělem. Tehdy jsem si všimla, "
"jak mi z obličeje kape krev."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_NAOMI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 24"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L24_NAOMI_OP01"
msgid "I was pretty shook up."
msgstr "Byla jsem pěkně rozklepaná."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_NAOMI_OP01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 25"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L25_NAOMI_OP01"
msgid ""
"But mostly, I was just glad I'd survived. Sometimes nature has its way of "
"reminding us who's in charge."
msgstr ""
"Hlavně jsem ale byla ráda, že jsem přežila. Příroda nám někdy připomene, kdo"
" tu velí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 26"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L26_PLAYER"
msgid "So...?"
msgstr "Tak...?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 27"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L27_NAOMI"
msgid "So..."
msgstr "Takže..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 28"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L28_NAOMI"
msgid "...I'm damaged goods. I can't hunt anymore."
msgstr "...jsem odepsaná. Už nemůžu lovit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 29"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L29_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Then pack up and leave."
msgstr "Tak si sbal věci a odejdi."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_NAOMI_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 30"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L30_NAOMI_A"
msgid ""
"I think you're forgetting about the very sharp knife I'm holding right now."
msgstr "Myslím, že zapomínáš na velmi ostrý nůž, který právě držím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 31"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L31_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Heck, even I sometimes cheat at the eye doctor."
msgstr "No tak. I já někdy při vyšetření zraku trochu podvádím."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_NAOMI_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 32"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L32_NAOMI_B"
msgid ""
"There's a difference between reading a line of small letters and completely "
"losing your vision in one eye."
msgstr ""
"Je rozdíl mezi tím, když nepřečteš drobná písmena, a úplnou ztrátou zraku v "
"jednom oku."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 33"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L33_PLAYER_C"
msgid "That's bullshit."
msgstr "To jsou kecy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_NAOMI_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 34"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L34_NAOMI_C"
msgid ""
"I know you want to encourage me, but I've tried everything to convince "
"myself, and it's just no good."
msgstr ""
"Vím, že mě chceš povzbudit. Sama jsem se ale pokoušela přesvědčit všemi "
"způsoby. Nepomohlo to."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 35"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L35_NAOMI"
msgid "I have no depth perception. My field of view is reduced."
msgstr "Špatně odhaduju vzdálenost a mám zúžené zorné pole."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 36"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L36_NAOMI"
msgid ""
"I was tasked with finding and culling a half-blind lion a few months ago. "
"Some tourists had reported his presence as being \"too disturbing.\""
msgstr ""
"Před několika měsíci jsem dostala za úkol najít a ulovit poloslepého lva. "
"Turisté si stěžovali, že je pohled na něj příliš znepokojující."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 37"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L37_NAOMI"
msgid "The irony. A half-blind huntress killing a half-blind lion?"
msgstr "Ta ironie. Poloslepá lovkyně má ulovit poloslepého lva?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 38"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L38_NAOMI"
msgid "It would feel like I was mercy killing myself."
msgstr "Připadala bych si, jako bych z milosti zabíjela samu sebe."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 39"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L39_NAOMI"
msgid "Could you... Take care of it? Swiftly? So that he doesn't suffer."
msgstr "Mohl by ses o to postarat? Rychle, ať netrpí."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L40_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during VO"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 40"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L40_NAOMI"
msgid "I'm sure he's struggling and has trouble getting enough food."
msgstr "Jsem si jistá, že se trápí a má problém sehnat dost potravy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L41_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue01 line 41"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE00_VO01_L41_NAOMI"
msgid "It'll be an easy job for you."
msgstr "Pro tebe to bude snadný úkol."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Find the half-blind Lion and harvest it."
msgstr "Najděte poloslepého lva, ulovte ho a zpracujte úlovek."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L01_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Player visits Naomi after they kill the half-
#. blind lion. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L01_PLAYER"
msgid "It's done."
msgstr "Je hotovo."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L02_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L02_NAOMI"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "Děkuju."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L03_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L03_PLAYER_A"
msgid "That lion was the angriest animal I've come across in a long time."
msgstr "Tak rozzuřené zvíře, jako byl ten lev, jsem už dlouho nepotkal."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L04_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L04_PLAYER_B"
msgid "He definitely didn't have trouble finding food. He was HUGE."
msgstr "S hledáním potravy rozhodně neměl problém. Byl OBROVSKÝ."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L05_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L05_PLAYER_C"
msgid "The crocodile was a walk in the park compared to that lion."
msgstr ""
"Ve srovnání s tím lvem byla výprava za krokodýlem procházka růžovým sadem."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L06_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "laughs slowly until it rises into a complete
#. laughter, like she is relieved"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L06_NAOMI"
msgid "(laughs)"
msgstr "(smích)"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L07_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L07_PLAYER_A"
msgid "I'm sure there's a universe out there where this is funny..."
msgstr "Tohle by mi přišlo vtipné snad jen v nějakém jiném vesmíru..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L08_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L08_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Haha... Ha..."
msgstr "Haha...ha..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L09_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L09_PLAYER_C"
msgid "Losing one's mind seems like an appropriate response."
msgstr "Z toho by člověku snad muselo přeskočit."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L10_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for translators" : "changed during VO"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "trying to catch her breath after laughing"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L10_NAOMI"
msgid "I'm sorry... I just..."
msgstr "Omlouvám se... já jen..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L11_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 11"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L11_NAOMI"
msgid "This whole time I thought the lion was some huge metaphor for my life."
msgstr "Celou dobu jsem v tom lvu viděla obraz vlastního života."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L12_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L12_NAOMI"
msgid ""
"Big predator, hunting others its whole life, reduced to a mere shadow of its"
" former glory."
msgstr ""
"Velká šelma, která celý život lovila, a teď je jen stínem své někdejší síly."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L13_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 13"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L13_NAOMI"
msgid ""
"But it turns out the lion had no trouble with its reduced vision. It "
"adapted."
msgstr ""
"Jenže se ukázalo, že si lev se slabším zrakem poradil. Přizpůsobil se."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L14_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 14"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L14_NAOMI"
msgid "Maybe that's what I should do as well."
msgstr "Možná bych to měla udělat také."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L15_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 15"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L15_NAOMI"
msgid "You know what? Give me that Hearth & Hunt contract. I'm joining."
msgstr "Víš co? Dej mi tu smlouvu s Hearth & Hunt. Vrátím se."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L16_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L16_PLAYER_A"
msgid ""
"I might have made all that up, and just shot the sleeping lion in the head."
msgstr "Možná jsem si to všechno vymyslel a střelil spícího lva do hlavy."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L17_NAOMI_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L17_NAOMI_A"
msgid ""
"So you were expecting me to consider the lion a metaphor for my life, and "
"knew that seeing it full of life would persuade me to rejoin Hearth & Hunt?"
msgstr ""
"Takže jsi čekal, že v tom lvu uvidím obraz vlastního života, a věděl jsi, že"
" když zjistím, že je pořád plný života, přesvědčí mě to k návratu do Hearth "
"& Hunt?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L18_NAOMI_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L18_NAOMI_A"
msgid "Now that would make you the Sybil of Kilimaya Reserve."
msgstr "To by z tebe dělalo věštce celé rezervace Kilimaya."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L19_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L19_PLAYER_B"
msgid "What??"
msgstr "Cože?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L20_NAOMI_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L20_NAOMI_B"
msgid ""
"Don't act so surprised, that's why you're here, isn't it? Or did you forget?"
msgstr "Netvař se tak překvapeně, proto jsi tady, ne? Nebo jsi zapomněl?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L21_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 21"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L21_PLAYER_C"
msgid "Sure, here it is."
msgstr "Jasně, tady to je."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L22_NAOMI_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 22"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L22_NAOMI_C"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "Děkuju."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L23_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 23"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L23_NAOMI"
msgid "Well, I'm back. I guess that makes you my colleague?"
msgstr "Tak jsem zpátky. To z nás asi dělá kolegy, co?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L24_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 24"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L24_PLAYER_A"
msgid "That would be an improvement, after chasing me away with knives."
msgstr "Po tom, jak jsi mě vyháněla s nožem v ruce, je to pokrok."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L25_NAOMI_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 25"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L25_NAOMI_A"
msgid "I never chased you."
msgstr "Já tě nikdy nehonila."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L26_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 26"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L26_PLAYER_B"
msgid "Not just a colleague. A friend!"
msgstr "Nejen kolega. Přítel!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L27_NAOMI_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 27"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L27_NAOMI_B"
msgid "We'll see about crossing that bridge later."
msgstr "Uvidíme. Na přátelství máme ještě čas."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L28_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 28"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L28_PLAYER_C"
msgid "You can call me whatever it takes to help you keep up."
msgstr "Říkej mi, jak chceš, pokud se mnou udržíš krok."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L29_NAOMI_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 29"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L29_NAOMI_C"
msgid ""
"Getting cocky, are we? I should show you the serious knife I save for larger"
" prey..."
msgstr ""
"Už začínáš být drzý? Měla bych ti ukázat pořádný nůž, který si schovávám na "
"větší zvěř..."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L30_NAOMI
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue02 line 30"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO02_L30_NAOMI"
msgid "See you around, colleague."
msgstr "Uvidíme se, kolego."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L01_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Pandora calls Player after they manage to
#. recruit Naomi. "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L01_PANDORA"
msgid "I'm starting to get jealous of your skills."
msgstr "Začínám závidět tvé schopnosti."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L02_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L02_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"I just got a message from Naomi that she's back at Hearth & Hunt and that I "
"have you to thank for her return."
msgstr ""
"Naomi mi právě napsala, že se vrací do Hearth & Hunt. Prý za to mám "
"poděkovat tobě."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L03_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "jealous"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L03_PANDORA"
msgid "So... thank you."
msgstr "Takže... děkuji."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L04_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L04_PANDORA"
msgid "You're more capable than I expected."
msgstr "Jsi schopnější, než jsem čekala."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L05_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "tries to shake off the jealousness of the
#. player's skills"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 Dialogue03 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_VO03_L05_PANDORA"
msgid "Which is... great!"
msgstr "Což je... skvělé!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStory03 Mission03 objective 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORY03_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02"
msgid "Talk to Naomi."
msgstr "Promluvte si s Naomi."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"You did it! You managed to help everyone at Kilimaya Reserve. Pandora has "
"one last task for you, which is mostly a celebratory tradition—to update the"
" Hearth & Hunt binder with all the info you've gathered on the locals."
msgstr ""
"Pomohli jste všem v rezervaci Kilimaya! Pandora má pro vás ještě poslední, "
"spíš slavnostní úkol: doplnit do pořadače Hearth & Hunt všechno, co jste se "
"o místních dozvěděli."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_NAME"
msgid "The last gift"
msgstr "Poslední dárek"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 objective 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01"
msgid "Update the Hearth & Hunt binder."
msgstr "Doplňte pořadač Hearth & Hunt."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L01_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Pandora calls to Player after they finished
#. all the tasks from the NPCs."
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 Dialogue01 line 01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L01_PANDORA"
msgid "Wow, you did it! You've helped me with everyone at Kilimaya Reserve."
msgstr "Páni, dokázal jsi to! Pomohl jsi mi se všemi v Kilimaye."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L02_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 Dialogue01 line 02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L02_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"I think you should feel especially proud of finishing those teaching "
"materials with Damian."
msgstr "Na dokončení výukových materiálů s Damianem můžeš být obzvlášť pyšný."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L03_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 Dialogue01 line 03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L03_PANDORA"
msgid "And I still don't understand how you got Naomi back."
msgstr "A pořád nechápu, jak se ti podařilo přivést Naomi zpátky."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L04_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "jealous"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 Dialogue01 line 04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L04_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"I considered it a Herculean task, perhaps I should start calling you "
"Hercules, what do you think?"
msgstr ""
"Připadalo mi to jako úkol pro Herkula. Možná bych ti tak měla začít říkat. "
"Co myslíš?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L05_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 Dialogue01 line 05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L05_PANDORA"
msgid "Maybe not, it might sound a bit cringy."
msgstr "Radši ne. Znělo by to trochu trapně."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L06_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 Dialogue01 line 06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L06_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"Well, I trust I'm your favorite Hearth & Hunt coordinator for now. It won't "
"be too long before you meet other coordinators."
msgstr ""
"Doufám, že jsem zatím tvoje nejoblíbenější koordinátorka Hearth & Hunt. Brzy"
" poznáš i další."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L07_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 Dialogue01 line 07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L07_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"Just don't forget to keep me in the loop, okay? Especially if you find out "
"anything juicy."
msgstr ""
"Nezapomeň mě o všem informovat, ano? Zvlášť když se dozvíš něco peprného."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L08_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 Dialogue01 line 08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L08_PANDORA"
msgid "Safe travels! Wherever you go next."
msgstr "Šťastnou cestu, ať už se vydáš kamkoli!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L09_PANDORA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 Dialogue01 line 09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt ""
"ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_OBJECTIVE01_VO01_L09_PANDORA"
msgid ""
"Oh, and I almost forgot. You'll find a little gift from me at your lodge!"
msgstr "A málem bych zapomněla: na lovecké chatě ode mě najdeš malý dárek!"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_READABLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for translators" : "note when Player is opening gift
#. from Pandora"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Order" : "Map02 MiniStoryEnd Mission01 readable"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/Missions/ST_Missions.ST_Missions
msgctxt "ST_Missions,KEY_MAP02MINISTORYEND_MISSION01_READABLE"
msgid "Do you dare to open this?"
msgstr "Troufnete si to otevřít?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L01_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L01_ELIJAH"
msgid "Hello there!"
msgstr "Dobrý den!"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L02_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L02_ELIJAH"
msgid "I was wonderin' when ye'd finally come home."
msgstr "Byl jsem zvědavý, kdy se konečně vrátíš domů."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L03_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L03_ELIJAH"
msgid "So this is your home then?"
msgstr "Tak tohle je tvůj domov?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L04_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L04_PLAYER"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Co?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L05_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for us" : "an Irish  slang term for an idiot or a
#. foolish person"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L05_ELIJAH"
msgid "Ah. They've sent me an eejit, have they?"
msgstr "Aha. Tak mi poslali troubu, co?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L06_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L06_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Well, anybody would've been surprised to come home and find... you."
msgstr "No, každého by překvapilo, kdyby přišel domů a našel tam... tebe."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L07_ELIJAH_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L07_ELIJAH_A"
msgid "What d'you mean?"
msgstr "Co tím myslíš?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L08_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L08_PLAYER_A"
msgid "(...)"
msgstr "(...)"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L09_PLAYER_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L09_PLAYER_A"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr "Nic."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L10_ELIJAH_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L10_ELIJAH_A"
msgid "Right so. Not an eejit then. Just rude."
msgstr "Aha. Takže nejsi trouba. Jenom drzoun."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L11_ELIJAH_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L11_ELIJAH_A"
msgid "I'm Elijah Byrnes."
msgstr "Jsem Elijah Byrnes."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L12_ELIJAH_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "not happily"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L12_ELIJAH_A"
msgid "Pleasure."
msgstr "Těší mě."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L13_PLAYER_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L13_PLAYER_B"
msgid "By \"they,\" you mean \"Hearth & Hunt?\""
msgstr "Těmi „oni“ myslíš Hearth & Hunt?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L14_ELIJAH_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for us" : "The idiom \"the penny drops\" means that
#. someone finally understands something after a period of confusion"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L14_ELIJAH_B"
msgid "Aye. The penny's dropping."
msgstr "Jo. Už ti to začíná docházet."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L15_ELIJAH_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L15_ELIJAH_B"
msgid "Elijah Byrnes. Pleasure to meet ya."
msgstr "Elijah Byrnes. Rád tě poznávám."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L16_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L16_PLAYER_C"
msgid "I'm not the one standing in someone else's home."
msgstr "Nejsem ten, kdo stojí v domě někoho jiného."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L17_ELIJAH_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L17_ELIJAH_C"
msgid "What, ye buildin' all this yourself?"
msgstr "Cože, to všechno stavíš sám?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L18_PLAYER_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L18_PLAYER_C"
msgid "(...)"
msgstr "(...)"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L19_ELIJAH_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L19_ELIJAH_C"
msgid "Now, didn't think so."
msgstr "Nemyslel jsem si to."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L20_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L20_ELIJAH"
msgid "Right so, let's get to it. Elijah Byrnes. What's your name?"
msgstr "Tak dobře, pojďme k věci. Elijah Byrnes. Jak se jmenuješ?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L21_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L21_PLAYER"
msgid "I'm {playerCharacterName}. You're helping with the upgrades?"
msgstr "Jsem {playerCharacterName}. Pomáháš tady s vylepšeními?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L22_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L22_ELIJAH"
msgid "Aye. The lodge expansions."
msgstr "Jo. S rozšířením lovecké chaty."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L23_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L23_ELIJAH"
msgid "Didn't they tell ya?"
msgstr "Oni ti to neřekli?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L24_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L24_ELIJAH"
msgid "Ah sure, doesn't matter now."
msgstr "Aha, to je teď jedno."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L25_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "proud"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L25_ELIJAH"
msgid "I work for Hearth & Hunt. Carpenter, builder."
msgstr "Pracuji pro Hearth & Hunt. Tesař, stavitel."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L26_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "hesitating"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L26_ELIJAH"
msgid "And I know a thing or two more..."
msgstr "A vyznám se i v pár dalších věcech..."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L27_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "hesitating"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L27_ELIJAH"
msgid "About mushrooms. And people."
msgstr "V houbách. A v lidech."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L28_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L28_ELIJAH"
msgid "Those two aren't that different, ya know?"
msgstr "Houby a lidi se od sebe tolik neliší, víš?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L29_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L29_ELIJAH"
msgid "I'll be here if ya need anything."
msgstr "Budu tady, když budeš něco potřebovat."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L30_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "embarassed"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L30_ELIJAH"
msgid "Well, not anything, like."
msgstr "Tedy ne s úplně čímkoli."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L31_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L31_ELIJAH"
msgid "Ya know what I mean."
msgstr "Víš, co myslím."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L32_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "whispering to himself"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE01_VO01_L32_ELIJAH"
msgid "I'm some fool."
msgstr "Já jsem ale trouba."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L01_PLAYER_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L01_PLAYER_OP1"
msgid "Can I expand the lodge now?"
msgstr "Mohu nyní chatu rozšířit?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L02_ELIJAH_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L02_ELIJAH_OP1"
msgid "Well, I don't know... Can ya?"
msgstr "No já nevím... Můžeš?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L03_ELIJAH_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L03_ELIJAH_OP1"
msgid "Do ya have the money for it?"
msgstr "Máš na to peníze?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L04_PLAYER_OP1_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L04_PLAYER_OP1_A"
msgid "No."
msgstr "Ne."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L05_ELIJAH_OP1_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L05_ELIJAH_OP1_A"
msgid "Well then, that'd be a no, so."
msgstr "Tak v tom případě ne."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L06_PLAYER_OP1_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L06_PLAYER_OP1_B"
msgid "I don't know?"
msgstr "Já nevím?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L07_ELIJAH_OP1_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L07_ELIJAH_OP1_B"
msgid "And who should know?"
msgstr "A kdo by to měl vědět?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L08_ELIJAH_OP1_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L08_ELIJAH_OP1_B"
msgid "Ya can check the prices on the boxes outside."
msgstr "Ceny najdeš na bednách venku."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L09_PLAYER_OP1_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L09_PLAYER_OP1_C"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "Ano."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L10_ELIJAH_OP1_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L10_ELIJAH_OP1_C"
msgid "Then why ya asking me?"
msgstr "Tak proč se mě ptáš?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L11_PLAYER_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L11_PLAYER_OP2"
msgid "What is special about this lodge?"
msgstr "Co je na této chatě zvláštní?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L12_ELIJAH_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for us" : "\"Amn't I\" is a dialectal contraction of
#. \"am I not"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L12_ELIJAH_OP2"
msgid "I'm here, amn't I?"
msgstr "Jsem tady, ne?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L13_ELIJAH_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "sheepishly"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L13_ELIJAH_OP2"
msgid "(laughs)"
msgstr "(smích)"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L14_ELIJAH_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for us" : "In Irish slang, \"slagging\" means to
#. playfully tease, mock, or joke around with someone. "
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L14_ELIJAH_OP2"
msgid "I'm just slagging ye."
msgstr "Jen tě škádlím."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L15_ELIJAH_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L15_ELIJAH_OP2"
msgid "Well, it's ya home, like."
msgstr "No, je to přece tvůj domov."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L16_ELIJAH_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L16_ELIJAH_OP2"
msgid "Isn't that grand?"
msgstr "To je přece paráda, ne?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L17_ELIJAH_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L17_ELIJAH_OP2"
msgid ""
"But you can also place dioramas of any animal from any country ya visited "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Můžeš sem ale umístit i diorámata se zvěří z kterékoli země, kterou jsi "
"navštívil."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L18_ELIJAH_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L18_ELIJAH_OP2"
msgid "Then there's a special shooting range, just for ya."
msgstr "Pak je tu speciální střelnice, jen pro tebe."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L19_ELIJAH_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE02_VO01_L19_ELIJAH_OP2"
msgid "Go on so, try your favourite one, won't ya?"
msgstr "Tak si tam běž vyzkoušet svou oblíbenou zbraň, co říkáš?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L01_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L01_PLAYER"
msgid "You told me I can talk to you about people?"
msgstr "Řekl jsi mi, že s tebou můžu mluvit o lidech?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L02_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L02_ELIJAH"
msgid "People? It's me favourite subject. What do you want to hear?"
msgstr "Lidi? To je moje oblíbené téma. Co chceš vědět?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L03_PLAYER_NL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L03_PLAYER_NL"
msgid "About people in New Laurentia..."
msgstr "O lidech v New Laurentia..."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L04_PLAYER_KR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L04_PLAYER_KR"
msgid "People from Kilimaya Reserve."
msgstr "Lidé z rezervace Kilimaya."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L05_ELIJAH_NL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L05_ELIJAH_NL"
msgid "Who're ya fishing around for?"
msgstr "Na koho se chceš vyptat?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L06_ELIJAH_KR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L06_ELIJAH_KR"
msgid "Who interests ya there?"
msgstr "Kdo tě tam zajímá?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L07_PLAYER_NL_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L07_PLAYER_NL_OP1"
msgid "Angel Hearth."
msgstr "Angel Hearth."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L08_ELIJAH_NL_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L08_ELIJAH_NL_OP1"
msgid "Hmmm."
msgstr "Hmmm."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L09_ELIJAH_NL_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L09_ELIJAH_NL_OP1"
msgid ""
"Sure Genevieve Hearth has a knack for naming her children, doesn't she?"
msgstr "Genevieve Hearth jistě umí pojmenovávat své děti, že?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L100_ELIJAH_KR_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L100_ELIJAH_KR_OP2"
msgid "Big hands."
msgstr "Velké ruce."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L101_ELIJAH_KR_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for us" : "The phrase \"wee buns\" is a popular
#. slang term from Northern Ireland. It means something is very easy or \"no
#. problem\""
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L101_ELIJAH_KR_OP2"
msgid "But he shoots like it's wee buns!"
msgstr "Ale střílení je pro něj hračka!"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L102_ELIJAH_KR_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L102_ELIJAH_KR_OP2"
msgid "I got his signature, so I did!"
msgstr "Mám jeho autogram, vážně!"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L103_ELIJAH_KR_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L103_ELIJAH_KR_OP2"
msgid "In the book of world records, last time I visited Kilimaya Reserve."
msgstr ""
"Podepsal mi knihu světových rekordů, když jsem byl naposledy v rezervaci "
"Kilimaya."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L104_ELIJAH_KR_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "excited"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L104_ELIJAH_KR_OP2"
msgid "And he showed me some grand shots."
msgstr "A předvedl mi pár parádních výstřelů."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L105_ELIJAH_KR_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "pronounced as \"a mak
#. koi\"\nhttps://youtu.be/7OOb5KyHlXU?si=Vo2a4qAOTwl12Drw&t=38"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L105_ELIJAH_KR_OP2"
msgid "I cooked him some amakhowe mushroom I found that day."
msgstr "Uvařil jsem mu houbu amakhowe, kterou jsem toho dne našel."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L106_ELIJAH_KR_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L106_ELIJAH_KR_OP2"
msgid "Those are large beefsteak mushrooms, local delicacy."
msgstr "To jsou velké masité houby, místní pochoutka."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L107_ELIJAH_KR_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "nostalgic"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L107_ELIJAH_KR_OP2"
msgid "It was a good day."
msgstr "Byl to dobrý den."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L108_PLAYER_KR_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L108_PLAYER_KR_OP3"
msgid "Naomi Vess."
msgstr "Naomi Vess."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L109_ELIJAH_KR_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L109_ELIJAH_KR_OP3"
msgid "I heard Naomi left Hearth & Hunt."
msgstr "Slyšel jsem, že Naomi odešla z Hearth & Hunt."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L10_ELIJAH_NL_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L10_ELIJAH_NL_OP1"
msgid "Angel with the motives of the devil."
msgstr "Angel s ďábelskými úmysly."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L110_ELIJAH_KR_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L110_ELIJAH_KR_OP3"
msgid "Now, I don't blame her."
msgstr "No, nevyčítám jí to."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L111_ELIJAH_KR_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L111_ELIJAH_KR_OP3"
msgid "Sometimes I want to leave too and be on me own, ya know?"
msgstr "Někdy chci taky odejít a být sám, víš?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L112_ELIJAH_KR_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L112_ELIJAH_KR_OP3"
msgid "But I hate solitude more."
msgstr "Ale víc nesnáším samotu."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L113_ELIJAH_KR_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L113_ELIJAH_KR_OP3"
msgid "So visit more often, would ya?"
msgstr "Tak za mnou choď častěji, co říkáš?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L11_ELIJAH_NL_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L11_ELIJAH_NL_OP1"
msgid "What's the motive?"
msgstr "Jaké úmysly?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L12_ELIJAH_NL_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L12_ELIJAH_NL_OP1"
msgid "Money."
msgstr "Peníze."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L13_ELIJAH_NL_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L13_ELIJAH_NL_OP1"
msgid "Now that's some gossip, isn't it?"
msgstr "To jsou nějaké drby, ne?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L14_ELIJAH_NL_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "acting silly"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L14_ELIJAH_NL_OP1"
msgid "Ah, a true journalist never reveals his sources."
msgstr "Opravdový novinář nikdy neprozradí své zdroje."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L15_ELIJAH_NL_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "awkwardly"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L15_ELIJAH_NL_OP1"
msgid "(laughs)"
msgstr "(smích)"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L16_ELIJAH_NL_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for us" : "a dryshite is a boring person who brings
#. \"no fun\" to a social situation. It is a strong insult. People use it to
#. tease friends who refuse to go out, kill the mood, or complain about
#. everything."
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L16_ELIJAH_NL_OP1"
msgid "It was Mikael, he's some dryshite."
msgstr "Mikael mi to řekl, ten starý suchar."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L16_ELIJAH_NL_OP1_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "alternative take"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L16_ELIJAH_NL_OP1_1"
msgid "It was Mikael, that miserable man."
msgstr "Mikael mi to řekl, ten věčný morous."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L17_ELIJAH_NL_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L17_ELIJAH_NL_OP1"
msgid "And now he's all surprised he's being removed from New Laurentia."
msgstr "A teď se hrozně diví, že ho z New Laurentia posílají pryč."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L18_ELIJAH_NL_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L18_ELIJAH_NL_OP1"
msgid "I better stop there."
msgstr "Radši už toho nechám."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L19_ELIJAH_NL_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L19_ELIJAH_NL_OP1"
msgid "I don't like talking about Mikael."
msgstr "Nerad mluvím o Mikaelovi."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L20_PLAYER_NL_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L20_PLAYER_NL_OP2"
msgid "Regina Harper."
msgstr "Regina Harper."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L21_ELIJAH_NL_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L21_ELIJAH_NL_OP2"
msgid "Regina's a bit of a witch."
msgstr "Regina je tak trochu čarodějnice."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L22_ELIJAH_NL_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L22_ELIJAH_NL_OP2"
msgid "She can see right through ya, so don't bother lying to the lass."
msgstr "Prokoukne tě, takže se jí ani nepokoušej lhát."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L23_ELIJAH_NL_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L23_ELIJAH_NL_OP2"
msgid "And believe her dreams."
msgstr "A věř jejím snům."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L24_ELIJAH_NL_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L24_ELIJAH_NL_OP2"
msgid "There was a time the Irish didn't like mushrooms, can ya believe that?"
msgstr "Bývaly doby, kdy Irové neměli rádi houby. Věřil bys tomu?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L25_ELIJAH_NL_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L25_ELIJAH_NL_OP2"
msgid ""
"If ya saw a mushroom, you'd think more of a fairy than something to eat."
msgstr "Když jsi uviděl houbu, vybavila se ti spíš víla než něco k jídlu."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L26_ELIJAH_NL_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L26_ELIJAH_NL_OP2"
msgid "If ya were Celtic, that is."
msgstr "Tedy pokud jsi měl keltské kořeny."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L27_ELIJAH_NL_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L27_ELIJAH_NL_OP2"
msgid "Ah, what were we on about?"
msgstr "O čem jsme to mluvili?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L28_ELIJAH_NL_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L28_ELIJAH_NL_OP2"
msgid "Mushrooms are distracting me."
msgstr "Houby mě rozptylují."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L29_PLAYER_NL_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L29_PLAYER_NL_OP2"
msgid "Regina Harper being a witch."
msgstr "O tom, že Regina Harper je čarodějnice."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L30_ELIJAH_NL_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "remembering"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L30_ELIJAH_NL_OP2"
msgid "Aye, that is correct."
msgstr "Ano, to je správně."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L31_ELIJAH_NL_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L31_ELIJAH_NL_OP2"
msgid "Believe her dreams. I once didn't. Biggest mistake of me life."
msgstr "Věř jejím snům. Já jim jednou neuvěřil. Největší chyba mého života."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L32_ELIJAH_NL_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L32_ELIJAH_NL_OP2"
msgid "I went to a different forest than she told me to."
msgstr "Šel jsem do jiného lesa, než mi řekla."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L33_ELIJAH_NL_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for us" : "poison fire coral = mushroom name
#. \nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trichoderma_cornu-damae "
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L33_ELIJAH_NL_OP2"
msgid "And then this Japanese fella found the poison fire coral and not me?"
msgstr ""
"A pak tu jedovatou houbu zvanou ohnivý korál našel nějaký Japonec místo mě?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L34_ELIJAH_NL_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L34_ELIJAH_NL_OP2"
msgid ""
"Not fair, I'm telling ya. I was in a forest just hour away, day before, "
"like."
msgstr ""
"To není fér, říkám ti. Den předtím jsem byl v lese jen hodinu cesty "
"odtamtud."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L35_ELIJAH_NL_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L35_ELIJAH_NL_OP2"
msgid "Just not fair."
msgstr "Prostě to není fér."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L36_PLAYER_NL_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L36_PLAYER_NL_OP3"
msgid "Patrick Harper."
msgstr "Patrick Harper."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L37_ELIJAH_NL_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L37_ELIJAH_NL_OP3"
msgid "Don't like the fella."
msgstr "Nelíbí se mi ten chlap."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L38_ELIJAH_NL_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L38_ELIJAH_NL_OP3"
msgid "He says he's changed."
msgstr "Říká, že se změnil."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L39_ELIJAH_NL_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L39_ELIJAH_NL_OP3"
msgid "Nobody changes after 60 years on this planet like."
msgstr "Nikdo se po šedesáti letech na této planetě tak nezmění."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L40_ELIJAH_NL_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L40_ELIJAH_NL_OP3"
msgid "Ye don't go from shy and hidden like a morel to a cep overnight."
msgstr "Ze skrytého, nenápadného smrže se přes noc nestane hřib."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L41_PLAYER_NL_0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L41_PLAYER_NL_0"
msgid "Maybe about someone from different reserve..."
msgstr "Možná o někom z jiné rezervace..."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L41_PLAYER_NL_OP4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L41_PLAYER_NL_OP4"
msgid "Juniper Crane."
msgstr "Juniper Crane."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L42_ELIJAH_NL_OP4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L42_ELIJAH_NL_OP4"
msgid "Don't know much about her. She's not long in New Laurentia."
msgstr "Moc o ní nevím. Není dlouho v New Laurentia."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L43_ELIJAH_NL_OP4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L43_ELIJAH_NL_OP4"
msgid "But my friends on the forum say there's something off about her eyes."
msgstr "Ale kamarádi na fóru říkají, že s jejíma očima něco není v pořádku."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L44_ELIJAH_NL_OP4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L44_ELIJAH_NL_OP4"
msgid "Different colours in each eye, same as her dog!"
msgstr "Každé oko má jinou barvu, stejně jako její pes!"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L45_ELIJAH_NL_OP4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L45_ELIJAH_NL_OP4"
msgid "Never seen that in people, have ya?"
msgstr "To jsi u lidí ještě neviděl, co?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L46_ELIJAH_NL_OP4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L46_ELIJAH_NL_OP4"
msgid ""
"She reminds me of this one mushroom, pixie's parasol, have ya heard of it?"
msgstr ""
"Připomíná mi jednu houbu, které se říká skřítkův slunečník. Už jsi o ní "
"slyšel?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L47_ELIJAH_NL_OP4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L47_ELIJAH_NL_OP4"
msgid "It's a fragile wee mushroom with an almost unreal blue cap."
msgstr "Je to křehká malá houba s téměř neskutečným modrým kloboukem."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L48_ELIJAH_NL_OP4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L48_ELIJAH_NL_OP4"
msgid ""
"It doesn't stand out in the forest. Ya have to get down on yer knees and "
"look among the moss."
msgstr "V lese není moc nápadná. Musíš si kleknout a hledat ji v mechu."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L49_ELIJAH_NL_OP4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L49_ELIJAH_NL_OP4"
msgid "Found it a few years ago in Matariki Park. What a feeling that was."
msgstr "Našel jsem ji před pár lety v parku Matariki. To byl ale pocit."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L50_ELIJAH_NL_OP4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L50_ELIJAH_NL_OP4"
msgid "Probably like seeing Juniper."
msgstr "Asi jako vidět Juniper."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L51_PLAYER_NL_OP5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L51_PLAYER_NL_OP5"
msgid "Mikael Anderson."
msgstr "Mikael Anderson."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L52_ELIJAH_NL_OP5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "repeats angrily"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L52_ELIJAH_NL_OP5"
msgid "Mikael Anderson."
msgstr "Mikael Anderson."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L53_ELIJAH_NL_OP5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L53_ELIJAH_NL_OP5"
msgid "Used to be my friend."
msgstr "Býval můj přítel."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L54_ELIJAH_NL_OP5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L54_ELIJAH_NL_OP5"
msgid "Now I don't talk about him."
msgstr "Teď o něm nemluvím."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L55_PLAYER_NL_OP5_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L55_PLAYER_NL_OP5_A"
msgid "I was surprised anyone would call him a friend."
msgstr "Překvapilo mě, že ho někdo nazývá přítelem."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L56_PLAYER_NL_OP5_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L56_PLAYER_NL_OP5_A"
msgid "At least you won't tell me what kind of mushroom he'd be like."
msgstr "Aspoň mi nebudeš říkat, jaká by to byla houba."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L57_ELIJAH_NL_OP5_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L57_ELIJAH_NL_OP5_A"
msgid "Er, I'll tell ya!"
msgstr "Ale já ti to řeknu!"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L58_ELIJAH_NL_OP5_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for us" : "stinkhorn mushroom
#. \nhttps://www.wildlifetrusts.org/wildlife-explorer/fungi/stinkhorn-fungus "
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L58_ELIJAH_NL_OP5_A"
msgid "He'd be a stinkhorn."
msgstr "Byl by to sromotník."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L59_ELIJAH_NL_OP5_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L59_ELIJAH_NL_OP5_A"
msgid "Ya know what it looks like, right? That's what he is to me."
msgstr "Víš, jak taková houba vypadá, že? Přesně to pro mě je."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L60_PLAYER_NL_OP5_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L60_PLAYER_NL_OP5_A"
msgid "What did he do?"
msgstr "Co udělal?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L61_ELIJAH_NL_OP5_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L61_ELIJAH_NL_OP5_A"
msgid "Now, why don't ya ask him, won't ya?"
msgstr "Tak se zeptej jeho, co říkáš?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L62_PLAYER_NL_OP5_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L62_PLAYER_NL_OP5_B"
msgid "Surely you can be friends again, over time?"
msgstr "Určitě můžete být časem zase přátelé?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L63_ELIJAH_NL_OP5_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for us" : "A gobshite is a vulgar slang term for a
#. foolish, annoying, or unpleasant person who talks nonsense or brags too
#. much"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L63_ELIJAH_NL_OP5_B"
msgid "I'll never talk to that gobshite again. Don't try."
msgstr "S tím hajzlem už nikdy nepromluvím. Ani se o to nepokoušej."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L63_ELIJAH_NL_OP5_B_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "alternative take"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L63_ELIJAH_NL_OP5_B_1"
msgid "I've had enough of him. Don't try."
msgstr "Mám ho dost. Ani se o to nepokoušej."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L64_ELIJAH_NL_OP5_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L64_ELIJAH_NL_OP5_B"
msgid "If he was a mushroom he'd be stinkhorn!"
msgstr "Kdyby byl houbou, byl by to sromotník!"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L65_PLAYER_NL_OP5_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L65_PLAYER_NL_OP5_C"
msgid "I'll respect that."
msgstr "Budu to respektovat."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L66_ELIJAH_NL_OP5_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L66_ELIJAH_NL_OP5_C"
msgid "But ya can ask more... if ya want."
msgstr "Ale můžeš se zeptat víc... jestli chceš."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L67_ELIJAH_NL_OP5_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L67_ELIJAH_NL_OP5_C"
msgid "I'll tell ya what kind of mushroom he is, aye."
msgstr "Klidně ti řeknu, jaká by z něj byla houba."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L68_PLAYER_KR_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L68_PLAYER_KR_OP1"
msgid "Malachi Burnett."
msgstr "Malachi Burnett."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L69_ELIJAH_KR_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L69_ELIJAH_KR_OP1"
msgid "Malachi fella?"
msgstr "Myslíš Malachiho?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L70_ELIJAH_KR_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L70_ELIJAH_KR_OP1"
msgid ""
"I tell ya, I thought he was going to change after he became a partner in "
"Panorama Inc."
msgstr ""
"Říkám ti, myslel jsem, že se změní, když se stal společníkem v Panorama Inc."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L71_ELIJAH_KR_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L71_ELIJAH_KR_OP1"
msgid "But he's still the same Malachi, so he is."
msgstr "Ale pořád je to ten samý Malachi."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L72_ELIJAH_KR_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L72_ELIJAH_KR_OP1"
msgid "Ya won't find good people like that no more."
msgstr "Tak dobré lidi už dnes skoro nenajdeš."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L73_ELIJAH_KR_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L73_ELIJAH_KR_OP1"
msgid "I once told him he's like a burn morel."
msgstr "Jednou jsem mu řekl, že je jako smrž ze spáleniště."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L74_ELIJAH_KR_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L74_ELIJAH_KR_OP1"
msgid "He didn't get the joke."
msgstr "Nepochopil vtip."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L75_PLAYER_KR_OP1_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L75_PLAYER_KR_OP1_A"
msgid "There was some joke in that sentence?"
msgstr "Byl v té větě nějaký vtip?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L76_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L76_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_A"
msgid "Aye, a good one."
msgstr "Ano, dobrý."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L77_PLAYER_KR_OP1_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L77_PLAYER_KR_OP1_A"
msgid "Do I have to beg for an explanation?"
msgstr "Musím prosit o vysvětlení?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L78_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L78_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_A"
msgid "I was hoping."
msgstr "Doufal jsem."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L79_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L79_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_A"
msgid "That maybe ya'd get it later, but doesn't seem so."
msgstr "Že ti to třeba dojde později, ale asi ne."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L80_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L80_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_A"
msgid "Some hunters may never find a burn morel. Like Malachi."
msgstr "Někteří lovci možná nikdy nenajdou smrž ze spáleniště. Jako Malachi."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L81_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for us" : "natural = morel that also grows outside
#. of burn sites"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L81_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_A"
msgid "They only grow in burn scars, not where ya'd expect to find a natural."
msgstr "Rostou jen na spáleništích, ne tam, kde bys čekal běžný smrž."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L82_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L82_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_A"
msgid "Burn morels sprout only in the spring following a wildfire."
msgstr "Smrže ze spálenišť vyrůstají jen na jaře po lesním požáru."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L83_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L83_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_A"
msgid "So it's like Malachi... Burn-ett."
msgstr "Takže jako Malachi... Burn-ett. „Burn“ jako požár."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L84_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L84_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_A"
msgid "Ya made me feel really stupid explaining a joke like that!"
msgstr "Při vysvětlování takového vtipu jsem se teď cítil opravdu hloupě!"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L85_PLAYER_KR_OP1_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L85_PLAYER_KR_OP1_B"
msgid "Yeah... I don't get it either."
msgstr "Jo... taky to nechápu."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L86_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L86_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_B"
msgid "The name."
msgstr "To příjmení."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L87_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L87_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_B"
msgid "Burn."
msgstr "Burn. Anglicky „hořet“."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L88_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L88_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_B"
msgid "(...)"
msgstr "(...)"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L89_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "sighs"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L89_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_B"
msgid "Ya really have no idea, do ya?"
msgstr "Opravdu netušíš, že?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L90_PLAYER_KR_OP1_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L90_PLAYER_KR_OP1_C"
msgid "Morel is a mushroom, but explain the burn part."
msgstr "Smrž je houba, ale vysvětli mi to „burn“."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L91_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L91_ELIJAH_KR_OP1_C"
msgid "Aye, sure even a child knows what a morel is."
msgstr "Ano, jistě i dítě ví, co je smrž."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L92_PLAYER_KR_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L92_PLAYER_KR_OP2"
msgid "Damian Underwood."
msgstr "Damian Underwood."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L93_ELIJAH_KR_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L93_ELIJAH_KR_OP2"
msgid "I'm a big fan of Damian!"
msgstr "Jsem velký fanoušek Damiana!"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L94_ELIJAH_KR_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L94_ELIJAH_KR_OP2"
msgid "I used to think he was a bit dodgy."
msgstr "Dřív mi připadal trochu podezřelý."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L95_ELIJAH_KR_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L95_ELIJAH_KR_OP2"
msgid "Have ya seen the candle shooting video?"
msgstr "Viděl jsi to video se střelbou do svíčky?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L96_ELIJAH_KR_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L96_ELIJAH_KR_OP2"
msgid "The tricky shot where he hits a burning candle with an arrow."
msgstr "Ten obtížný výstřel, při kterém trefí hořící svíčku šípem."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L97_ELIJAH_KR_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L97_ELIJAH_KR_OP2"
msgid "Well I've never heard the like!"
msgstr "No nic podobného jsem ještě neslyšel!"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L99_ELIJAH_KR_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO01_L99_ELIJAH_KR_OP2"
msgid "I'm no good with bows and arrows either."
msgstr "Nejsem dobrý ani s luky a šípy."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L01_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L01_PLAYER"
msgid "You said you like mushrooms?"
msgstr "Řekl jsi, že máš rád houby?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L02_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L02_ELIJAH"
msgid "Me liking mushrooms?"
msgstr "Mám rád houby?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L03_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L03_ELIJAH"
msgid "That's like asking if dogs like bones, or..."
msgstr "To je jako ptát se, jestli mají psi rádi kosti, nebo..."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L04_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L04_ELIJAH"
msgid "Irish people liking a pint!"
msgstr "Nebo jestli Irové mají rádi pivo!"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L05_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L05_ELIJAH"
msgid "Aye, I like mushrooms."
msgstr "Ano, mám rád houby."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L06_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L06_ELIJAH"
msgid "Ask me anything about them ya want to."
msgstr "Klidně se mě zeptej na cokoli o houbách."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L07_PLAYER_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L07_PLAYER_OP1"
msgid "Your favourite mushroom?"
msgstr "Tvoje oblíbená houba?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L08_ELIJAH_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L08_ELIJAH_OP1"
msgid "Me favourite mushroom?"
msgstr "Moje oblíbená houba?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L09_ELIJAH_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L09_ELIJAH_OP1"
msgid "I gotta be boring now, but I'd have to choose a cep."
msgstr "Bude to znít obyčejně, ale vybral bych si hřib."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L10_ELIJAH_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L10_ELIJAH_OP1"
msgid "The name comes from French meaning trunk, referring to its fat stem."
msgstr ""
"Francouzsky se mu říká „cèpe“, což znamená kmen. Kvůli jeho silnému třeni."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L11_ELIJAH_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "makes awkward joke"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L11_ELIJAH_OP1"
msgid "Kinda like me, ain't it?"
msgstr "Asi jako já, ne?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L12_ELIJAH_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L12_ELIJAH_OP1"
msgid "Ya can find them everywhere."
msgstr "Najdeš je všude."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L13_ELIJAH_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L13_ELIJAH_OP1"
msgid "They're not special."
msgstr "Nejsou ničím výjimečné."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L14_ELIJAH_OP1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "repated on purpose "
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "laughs awkwardly"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L14_ELIJAH_OP1"
msgid "Kinda like me, ain't it?"
msgstr "Asi jako já, ne?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L15_PLAYER_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L15_PLAYER_OP2"
msgid "Do you happen to know anything about Mushroomers daily?"
msgstr "Víš náhodou něco o Mushroomers daily?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L16_ELIJAH_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "inconspicuously"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L16_ELIJAH_OP2"
msgid "Mushroomers daily?"
msgstr "Mushroomers daily?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L17_ELIJAH_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L17_ELIJAH_OP2"
msgid "The gossip column?"
msgstr "Ta rubrika s drby?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L18_ELIJAH_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "intentional double negative for flavor"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L18_ELIJAH_OP2"
msgid "Don't know nothing about it."
msgstr "Nic o tom nevím."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L19_ELIJAH_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L19_ELIJAH_OP2"
msgid "What do ya think about it?"
msgstr "Co si o tom myslíš?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L20_PLAYER_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L20_PLAYER_OP2"
msgid "Can you remind me where can I read it?"
msgstr "Připomeneš mi, kde si to můžu přečíst?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L21_ELIJAH_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L21_ELIJAH_OP2"
msgid ""
"Well, if you ask me I've heard that Regina Harper in New Laurentia is a fan."
msgstr "No, slyšel jsem, že Regina Harper v New Laurentia je fanynkou."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L22_ELIJAH_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L22_ELIJAH_OP2"
msgid "But I wouldn't know nothing about it."
msgstr "Ale já bych o tom nic nevěděl."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L23_ELIJAH_OP2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "murmuring to himself "
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L23_ELIJAH_OP2"
msgid "Just cos it has mushrooms in name everybody keeps asking..."
msgstr ""
"Jen proto, že to má v názvu houby, se na to všichni pořád vyptávají..."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L24_PLAYER_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L24_PLAYER_OP3"
msgid "What should I avoid when mushroom picking?"
msgstr "Čeho se mám při houbaření vyvarovat?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L25_ELIJAH_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L25_ELIJAH_OP3"
msgid "There's one thing I really hate that people do."
msgstr "Jednu věc, kterou lidi dělají, opravdu nesnáším."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L26_ELIJAH_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L26_ELIJAH_OP3"
msgid "Just don't pick the mushroom if ya don't know what it is, alright?"
msgstr "Prostě nesbírej houbu, když nevíš, co je zač, dobře?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L27_ELIJAH_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L27_ELIJAH_OP3"
msgid "You could poison yourself. Like me granddad."
msgstr "Mohl by ses otrávit. Jako můj dědeček."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L28_ELIJAH_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L28_ELIJAH_OP3"
msgid "He thought he picked a puffball but guess what it was?"
msgstr "Myslel si, že utrhl pýchavku, ale hádej, co to bylo?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L29_PLAYER_OP3_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L29_PLAYER_OP3_A"
msgid "Amanita?"
msgstr "Muchomůrka?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L30_ELIJAH_OP3_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "impressed"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L30_ELIJAH_OP3_A"
msgid "Aye, ya seem to know a thing or two."
msgstr "Jo, koukám, že se trochu vyznáš."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L31_PLAYER_OP3_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L31_PLAYER_OP3_B"
msgid "False morel?"
msgstr "Ucháč?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L32_ELIJAH_OP3_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "intentional missing on the word \"that\""
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "emphasis on second *much*"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L32_ELIJAH_OP3_B"
msgid ""
"No, that doesn't look like a puffbal! Now me grandad was an eejit but not "
"much of an eejit."
msgstr ""
"Ne, ten přece nevypadá jako pýchavka! Dědeček byl trouba, ale zase ne "
"takový."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L33_PLAYER_OP3_C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L33_PLAYER_OP3_C"
msgid "Webcap?"
msgstr "Pavučinec?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L34_ELIJAH_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L34_ELIJAH_OP3"
msgid "It was an amanita egg. Those devilish things."
msgstr "Byla to mladá muchomůrka ještě uzavřená v obalu. Ďábelské potvory."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L35_ELIJAH_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L35_ELIJAH_OP3"
msgid ""
"If ya really want to know if ya got yourself a puffball, ya have to cut it "
"in half."
msgstr ""
"Pokud chceš zjistit, jestli jsi opravdu našel pýchavku, musíš ji rozříznout "
"napůl."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L36_ELIJAH_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L36_ELIJAH_OP3"
msgid "If it looks like boring mozzarella inside, it's good."
msgstr "Pokud je uvnitř jednolitá jako mozzarella, je to v pořádku."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L37_ELIJAH_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L37_ELIJAH_OP3"
msgid ""
"If you cut it and there's another mushroom forming inside, it's the amanita "
"egg."
msgstr ""
"Pokud ji rozřízneš a uvnitř uvidíš zárodek houby, je to mladá muchomůrka v "
"obalu."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L38_ELIJAH_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L38_ELIJAH_OP3"
msgid "And it's just growing to the shape that's the dead giveaway."
msgstr ""
"Ten zárodek postupně získá tvar, podle kterého je hned jasné, co je zač."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L39_ELIJAH_OP3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L39_ELIJAH_OP3"
msgid "I'd say it's the most dangerous mushroom that wants to kill people."
msgstr "Řekl bych, že je to nejnebezpečnější houba, která chce zabíjet lidi."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L40_PLAYER_OP4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L40_PLAYER_OP4"
msgid "Maybe that's enough about mushrooms now."
msgstr "O houbách už snad stačí."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L41_ELIJAH_OP4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO02_L41_ELIJAH_OP4"
msgid "Alright. It's never enough but suit yourself."
msgstr "Dobře. O houbách není nikdy dost, ale jak myslíš."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L01_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L01_PLAYER"
msgid "Can you tell me more about the reserves?"
msgstr "Povíš mi víc o rezervacích?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L02_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L02_ELIJAH"
msgid "Which one?"
msgstr "O které?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L03_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L03_PLAYER"
msgid "Kilimaya Reserve."
msgstr "Rezervace Kilimaya."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L04_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L04_ELIJAH"
msgid "It's hot in there."
msgstr "Je tam horko."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L06_ELIJAH_KR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L06_ELIJAH_KR"
msgid "Irish people aren't built for weather like that."
msgstr "Irové nejsou stavěni na takové počasí."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L07_ELIJAH_KR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L07_ELIJAH_KR"
msgid "But ya won't see animals like those anywhere else."
msgstr "Ale takovou zvěř nikde jinde neuvidíš."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L08_ELIJAH_KR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L08_ELIJAH_KR"
msgid "When a hippo charged me, I thought I was gone."
msgstr "Když na mě vyrazil hroch, myslel jsem, že je se mnou konec."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L09_ELIJAH_KR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L09_ELIJAH_KR"
msgid "Thankfully, Mikael shot it."
msgstr "Naštěstí ho Mikael zastřelil."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L10_ELIJAH_KR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L10_ELIJAH_KR"
msgid "Back when we talked."
msgstr "Když jsme spolu mluvili."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L11_ELIJAH_KR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L11_ELIJAH_KR"
msgid "Anyways, ya have to see the lions!"
msgstr "Každopádně musíš vidět lvy!"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L12_ELIJAH_KR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L12_ELIJAH_KR"
msgid "Crocodiles are not me favourite. They're too sneaky."
msgstr "Krokodýly nemám v oblibě. Jsou příliš záludní."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L13_ELIJAH_KR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L13_ELIJAH_KR"
msgid "I'd still recommend it, even with the weather."
msgstr "I přes to počasí bych ti ji doporučil."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L14_PLAYER_NL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L14_PLAYER_NL"
msgid "New Laurentia."
msgstr "New Laurentia."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L15_ELIJAH_NL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L15_ELIJAH_NL"
msgid "The animals there are grand."
msgstr "Tamní zvěř je úžasná."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L16_ELIJAH_NL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L16_ELIJAH_NL"
msgid ""
"But they're very intelligent. They'll learn from ya and hide in tougher "
"spots."
msgstr ""
"Ale je hodně chytrá. Naučí se tvoje zvyky a bude se schovávat na hůř "
"přístupných místech."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L17_ELIJAH_NL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L17_ELIJAH_NL"
msgid "Mallard hunting in New Laurentia is me favourite."
msgstr "V New Laurentia nejradši lovím kachny divoké."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L18_ELIJAH_NL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L18_ELIJAH_NL"
msgid "Get the caller and the blind, and just spend a day on a lake, ya know?"
msgstr "Vezmi si vábničku a lovecký kryt a prostě strav den u jezera, víš?"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L19_ELIJAH_NL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L19_ELIJAH_NL"
msgid ""
"You'll return with the best meat. And me secret ingredient for preparing "
"mushrooms? Duck fat."
msgstr ""
"Vrátíš se s tím nejlepším masem. A moje tajná přísada na přípravu hub? "
"Kachní tuk."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L20_ELIJAH_NL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L20_ELIJAH_NL"
msgid ""
"White-tails and elk might be more popular with local hunters, but at some "
"point in your life..."
msgstr ""
"Jelenci běloocasí a wapiti možná u místních lovců vedou, ale v určité chvíli"
" života…"

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L21_ELIJAH_NL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L21_ELIJAH_NL"
msgid "Ya just don't want to carry them, I'll leave it to the younger folks."
msgstr "Už je prostě nechceš tahat. To nechám mladším."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L22_ELIJAH_NL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L22_ELIJAH_NL"
msgid "It's ducks for me."
msgstr "Pro mě jsou to kachny."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L23_ELIJAH_NL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes for us" : "\"Acting the maggot\" is an Irish slang
#. phrase. It means someone is fooling around, misbehaving, or causing playful
#. trouble."
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L23_ELIJAH_NL"
msgid "Now I'd just avoid the people there. They're all acting the maggot."
msgstr "Lidem tam bych se ale radši vyhýbal. Všichni dělají samé hlouposti."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L24_PLAYER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_DIALOGUE03_VO03_L24_PLAYER"
msgid "I want to talk about this other topic."
msgstr "Chci mluvit o tomto jiném tématu."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_INTROCUTSCENE_VO01_L01_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "introduction cutscene - in Elijah's chartacter"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_INTROCUTSCENE_VO01_L01_ELIJAH"
msgid "Hello there! This is the The Hearth & Hunt Headquarters."
msgstr "Vítej! Tohle je sídlo společnosti Hearth & Hunt."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_INTROCUTSCENE_VO01_L02_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_INTROCUTSCENE_VO01_L02_ELIJAH"
msgid ""
"This here's your little getaway, right by the Rocky Mountains. After all the"
" running about and hunting across the world, ya can come back here, take a "
"breath, and enjoy a bit of peace and quiet."
msgstr ""
"Tohle je tvoje útočiště přímo u Skalistých hor. Po všech cestách a lovech po"
" světě se sem můžeš vrátit, vydechnout si a užít si trochu klidu a pohody."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_INTROCUTSCENE_VO01_L03_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_INTROCUTSCENE_VO01_L03_ELIJAH"
msgid ""
"Well... peace and quiet, unless ya fancy a bit of hunting while you're here."
" There's plenty of that too."
msgstr ""
"Tedy... klidu a pohody, pokud si tady nebudeš chtít i zalovit. Příležitostí "
"je tu také dost."

#. Key:	KEY_HUB_INTROCUTSCENE_VO01_L04_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_HUB_INTROCUTSCENE_VO01_L04_ELIJAH"
msgid ""
"At the lodge, ya can show off the finest trophies you've picked up along the"
" way. And when ya run out of room for them, well... that's when ya expand "
"the place. Simple as that."
msgstr ""
"V lovecké chatě můžeš vystavit nejlepší trofeje, které jsi získal. A až ti "
"na ně dojde místo, chatu rozšíříš. Jednoduché."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01_CALLTOHUB_VO01_L01_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes VO" : "Elijah calls to a player, when player is in a
#. different level, to inform them about new game feature and level"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_MAP01_CALLTOHUB_VO01_L01_ELIJAH"
msgid "Am I talking to the Hearth & Hunt rep?"
msgstr "Mluvím se zástupcem Hearth & Hunt?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01_CALLTOHUB_VO01_L02_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_MAP01_CALLTOHUB_VO01_L02_ELIJAH"
msgid "I was trying to reach ya."
msgstr "Snažil jsem se ti dovolat."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01_CALLTOHUB_VO01_L03_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_MAP01_CALLTOHUB_VO01_L03_ELIJAH"
msgid ""
"Your lodge is ready for ya. Well... mostly. Ya see, you'll have to invest in"
" a few expansions first."
msgstr ""
"Tvoje lovecká chata je připravená. Tedy skoro. Nejdřív budeš muset "
"investovat do několika rozšíření."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01_CALLTOHUB_VO01_L04_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_MAP01_CALLTOHUB_VO01_L04_ELIJAH"
msgid ""
"But once ya do, ya can display all the trophies you've collected from around"
" the world."
msgstr ""
"Pak si v ní budeš moct vystavit trofeje, které jsi nasbíral po celém světě."

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01_CALLTOHUB_VO01_L05_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_MAP01_CALLTOHUB_VO01_L05_ELIJAH"
msgid "Not the worst deal, aye?"
msgstr "To není špatná nabídka, co?"

#. Key:	KEY_MAP01_CALLTOHUB_VO01_L06_ELIJAH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Hub/ST_HubDialogues.ST_HubDialogues
msgctxt "ST_HubDialogues,KEY_MAP01_CALLTOHUB_VO01_L06_ELIJAH"
msgid "Who am I? Ah, you'll see soon enough. Come and meet me, won't ya?"
msgstr "Kdo jsem? To se brzy dozvíš. Přijď za mnou."
